�脢id�bc68ba31636b�body�ً喷出的二氧化硫和气溶胶进入平流层，遮挡阳光使全球短期降温，如1815年坦博拉喷发造成“无夏之年”。ٰErupted sulfur dioxide and aerosols reach the stratosphere, blocking sunlight and cooling the globe short-term, e.g. the 1815 Tambora eruption caused a 'year without a summer'.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�bdea48dbb48b�body�ٓ古人用一系列水闸、弯道和补给湖泊，把海河、黄河、淮河、长江、钱塘江串起来，靠逐级调水保持通航水位。ٗWith locks, bends and feeder lakes, it chained the Hai, Yellow, Huai, Yangtze and Qiantang rivers, using staged water control to keep navigable levels.�ans��src��?联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《中国大运河》�-UNESCO World Heritage Centre, The Grand Canal��id�bf123acc7511�body��R核心证据包括：希克苏鲁伯撞击坑的年代（约6600万年前）与K-Pg界线重合；全球K-Pg界线上富含铱的薄黏土层（铱在地壳中稀少但富集于陨石）；冲击石英、玻璃陨石和撞击球粒等撞击产物。铱的全球富集量与希克苏鲁伯撞击体的陨石成分相符，而冲击石英只产生于超高速撞击，排除了单纯的火山成因。界线处花粉组合突变以及反映全球野火（烟灰层）和海啸的沉积记录，共同表明撞击引发了全球性大火、遮天蔽日与生态崩溃，形成完整的证据链。��Key evidence includes: the Chicxulub impact crater dated to about 66 million years ago, matching the K-Pg boundary; a thin iridium-rich clay layer at the global boundary (iridium is rare in the crust but abundant in meteorites); and impact products such as shocked quartz, tektites, and impact spherules. The globally estimated iridium inventory matches the meteoritic composition of the Chicxulub impactor, and shocked quartz is produced only by hypervelocity impacts, ruling out a purely volcanic origin. Abrupt pollen changes at the boundary together with soot layers recording global wildfires and deposits recording tsunamis show that the impact triggered worldwide fire, dust-induced darkness, and ecological collapse, completing a coherent chain of evidence.�ans��src��&Science（K-Pg界线与撞击研究）�'Science (K-Pg boundary impact research)��id�bf6f87bb7818�body��沙尘颗粒可作为云凝结核改变云滴数浓度与粒径分布：更多核使云滴更小更密，云反照率增高并可能抑制暖云降水（Twomey 效应）；但在深对流中也可能通过冰核作用改变降水效率，结果因条件而异。�LDust particles serve as cloud condensation nuclei, altering droplet concentration and size: more nuclei yield smaller, denser droplets, raising cloud albedo and possibly suppressing warm-rain precipitation (Twomey effect); in deep convection they may also act as ice nuclei, changing rain efficiency—outcomes vary with conditions.�ans��src�ټKarydis 等,《On the effect of dust particles on global cloud condensation nuclei and cloud droplet number》,Journal of Geophysical Research: Atmospheres,2011 (DOI: 10.1029/2011jd016283)ٽKarydis et al., 'On the effect of dust particles on global cloud condensation nuclei and cloud droplet number', Journal of Geophysical Research: Atmospheres, 2011, DOI: 10.1029/2011jd016283��id�bfdf049a9e69�body��GRACE 双星以微米级精度测量彼此间距变化，反演地球重力场的月度异常。扣除冰川、地表水与大气等已知信号后，剩余陆地重力变化即反映地下水等总水储量的盈亏，可在无监测井地区提供大尺度估算。�AGRACE's twin satellites measure their separation to micron precision, inverting monthly Earth gravity-field anomalies. After removing glaciers, surface water, and atmospheric signals, the residual land gravity change reflects total water storage including groundwater, giving large-scale estimates where wells are absent.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c010c20ea902�body��x硅酸盐风化消耗大气CO₂，例如CaSiO₃ + 2CO₂ + 3H₂O → Ca²⁺ + 2HCO₃⁻ + H₄SiO₄，风化产物经河流入海并与碳酸盐一起把碳封存在海底岩石中。温度升高会加速风化、增强碳吸收，形成负反馈；火山释放CO₂补充碳源，这一机制使地球在数十亿年间保持相对温和的气候。这一负反馈以大陆风化面积与火山碳源为条件：威尔逊旋回中的造山抬升（如喜马拉雅造山带）通过暴露新鲜岩石加速风化，可能触发新生代长期变冷，因此硅酸盐风化被视作维持地球宜居性的关键调控机制。��Silicate weathering consumes atmospheric CO₂—for example CaSiO₃ + 2CO₂ + 3H₂O → Ca²⁺ + 2HCO₃⁻ + H₄SiO₄—and weathering products carried to the ocean, together with carbonates, bury carbon in seafloor rocks. Warmer temperatures accelerate weathering and CO₂ uptake in a negative feedback; volcanic CO₂ emissions resupply carbon, a mechanism that has kept Earth's climate relatively temperate for billions of years. The feedback depends on the extent of continental weathering and on volcanic carbon input: orogeny in the Wilson cycle (such as the Himalaya) exposes fresh rock and accelerates weathering, possibly driving Cenozoic long-term cooling, which is why silicate weathering is regarded as a key regulator of Earth's habitability.�ans��src�ٖBickle,《Metamorphic decarbonation, silicate weathering and the long‐term carbon cycle》,Terra Nova,1996 (DOI: 10.1111/j.1365-3121.1996.tb00756.x)ٔBickle, 'Metamorphic decarbonation, silicate weathering and the long‐term carbon cycle', Terra Nova, 1996, DOI: 10.1111/j.1365-3121.1996.tb00756.x��id�c0221862590c�body��气溶胶既能直接散射或吸收太阳辐射，又能作为云凝结核改变云的反照率与寿命（间接效应），还可改变地表反照率（如黑碳沉降雪面）。这些效应与温度、降水和水循环耦合，形成复杂的气候反馈。�@Aerosols both scatter or absorb solar radiation directly and act as cloud condensation nuclei that alter cloud albedo and lifetime (indirect effect), and they can change surface albedo (e.g., black carbon on snow). These effects couple with temperature, precipitation, and the water cycle into complex climate feedbacks.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�c0e45c6a3a03�body���地震矩震级基于地震矩，即断层面积、平均滑移量与岩石刚度的乘积，能更准确衡量巨大地震的总能量。里氏震级在大震时趋于饱和，因此现代科学改用Mw描述强震。��Moment magnitude is based on seismic moment, the product of fault area, average slip and rock rigidity, giving a more accurate total energy for huge quakes. The Richter scale saturates for large events, so science now uses Mw for major earthquakes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c0ed00d1f985�body�ل它们是冰期内北大西洋的突发性冷跳与暖跳，常由冰盖崩塌或环流突变触发，显示气候可快速翻转。ٍThey are abrupt cold and warm swings in ice ages, often triggered by ice-sheet collapse or circulation shifts, showing climate can flip fast.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c1499395eb0c�body�ُ硼两种同位素在海水中的比例随pH变化，并会被珊瑚和有孔虫壳层记录，据此可反推地质时期的海洋酸碱度。لThe boron isotope ratio in seawater tracks pH and is recorded in coral and foraminifera shells, letting us infer past ocean acidity.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c26d60d1e7eb�body�م大陆坡上的沉积在地震或气体释放时整体滑塌，瞬间排开巨量海水，如1929年大浅滩海啸可达数米高。ٝSediment on continental slopes can collapse in a quake or gas release, displacing huge water volumes, as in the 1929 Grand Banks tsunami several meters high.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c32a11427b48�body�ف原因包括小行星撞击、大规模火山、海洋缺氧与气候剧变，最著名的是终结恐龙的白垩纪末撞击。َCauses include asteroid impact, massive volcanism, anoxia and climate shifts; the famed one is the end-Cretaceous impact that ended dinosaurs.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c3a95a1d8431�body���承压含水层被上下隔水层夹住，内部充满水并承受压力。当井孔穿透上覆隔水层且水位高于地表时，水会自行上涌，成为自流井，如澳大利亚大自流盆地。��A confined aquifer is bounded above and below by aquitards and filled under pressure. When a well pierces the cap and the pressure head rises above ground, water flows up by itself as an artesian well, like Australia's Great Artesian Basin.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c45f007b8c2e�body���平流层空气稳定、几乎无对流天气，且风速（尤其是急流）可被利用以节省燃油。此外它含臭氧吸收紫外线，气温随高度回升，适合平稳高效的高空飞行。��The stratosphere is stable with almost no convective weather, and its winds—especially the jet stream—can be used to save fuel. It also absorbs UV via ozone and warms with altitude, suiting smooth, efficient high-altitude flight.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�c51e134a7884�body���铀-238和铀-235分别以约45亿年和7亿年的半衰期衰变成铅-206和铅-207，两组独立衰变互为校验。锆石晶体在形成时几乎不含铅，却牢固锁住铀，且极耐风化侵蚀，是理想的测年矿物。测出样品中铀铅比并代入衰变方程即可算出结晶年龄；若两组数据不一致，则提示锆石曾发生铅丢失或体系扰动。西澳大利亚杰克山发现的约44亿年锆石就是用这种方法测出的，是目前已知最古老的地球物质。�bUranium-238 and uranium-235 decay to lead-206 and lead-207 with half-lives of about 4.5 and 0.7 billion years, giving two independent clocks that cross-check each other. Zircon crystals incorporate almost no lead when they form yet firmly retain uranium and survive weathering, making them ideal for dating. Measuring the U/Pb ratios and plugging them into the decay equations yields the crystallization age; disagreement between the two systems signals lead loss or disturbance. Zircons from Jack Hills, Western Australia, dated this way at about 4.4 billion years, are among the oldest known Earth materials.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c63d497625ce�body��I斜长岩高地记录月球岩浆洋阶段：约44亿年前月球外部大部分熔融，密度较小的斜长石浮到表面结晶成白色高地，暗色矿物沉入月幔。其后内部放射性生热引发部分熔融，基性岩浆沿撞击盆地裂隙涌出，填充低洼处形成玄武岩月海，其绝对年龄（约39–31亿年前）与撞击盆地的形成时间吻合，为内太阳系晚大轰炸假说提供了时间锚点。两类岩石在成分与分布上的差异是月球岩浆洋假说的直接证据，并由阿波罗与嫦娥任务返回的样本得到验证。��Highland anorthosites record the lunar magma-ocean stage: about 4.4 billion years ago much of the Moon's exterior was molten, and less-dense plagioclase floated to the surface, crystallizing the bright highlands while dense minerals sank into the mantle. Later radiogenic heating caused partial melting; mafic magma erupted along impact-basin fractures and filled lowlands as mare basalts, whose absolute ages (about 3.1–3.9 billion years) match the formation of the basins they fill, anchoring the inner solar system's late heavy bombardment hypothesis. The compositional and distributional differences between the two rock types are direct evidence for the lunar magma-ocean hypothesis, confirmed by samples returned by Apollo and Chang'e missions.�ans��src��*Nature（月球岩浆洋岩石学证据）�$Nature (lunar magma ocean petrology)��id�c657f837c3e4�body��大陆地壳以富硅的花岗质岩石为主，平均厚度约 35–40 公里，密度约 2.7 g/cm³；大洋地壳为玄武质，厚约 7 公里，密度约 3.0 g/cm³。较低密度使大陆长期漂浮于软流圈之上不易俯冲消亡，从而保存了古老的地质记录。�AContinental crust is dominated by silica-rich granitic rocks, averaging 35–40 km thick with a density near 2.7 g/cm³, whereas oceanic crust is basaltic, about 7 km thick and ~3.0 g/cm³. Its lower density lets continents persist atop the asthenosphere without readily subducting, preserving ancient geological records.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�c68f669458d7�body�ٍ向平流层撒反光颗粒可暂时降温，但可能扰乱季风与降水、破坏臭氧，并带来谁来决定与停止的治理难题。ٚReflective particles aloft could cool temporarily but may disrupt monsoons and rainfall, harm ozone and raise hard questions of who controls and stops it.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c6c59e7b82bc�body���砾岩由磨圆砾石胶结而成，砾石大小、磨圆度和分选反映搬运距离与水动力：远源强水动力磨圆好、分选佳，常指示河流或滨浅海环境；棱角状近源砾岩则多为山前冲积扇。�Conglomerate is cemented rounded gravel; clast size, roundness and sorting reflect transport distance and energy. Well-rounded well-sorted far-traveled gravel indicates rivers or shallow marine settings, while angular near-source clasts point to alluvial fans.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c73b8179989b�body��Y金星浓密的CO₂大气（地表气压约为地球的92倍）产生极强的温室效应；其硫酸云反射阳光，但厚云下CO₂强烈截留向外散失的热量，使表面温度达到约465°C。早期金星可能曾有液态水，随太阳光度上升，海洋蒸发加剧温室效应形成失控温室：水汽吸收红外辐射使温度进一步升高，加速海洋蒸发，直至海水全部蒸干。水汽在大气上层被紫外光解，氢逃逸进入太空，金星大气氘/氢比约为地球的120–150倍正是这一大量水分逃逸的记录，留下干燥炽热的金星。��Venus' dense CO₂ atmosphere (surface pressure about 92 times Earth's) drives an extreme greenhouse effect; its sulfuric-acid clouds reflect sunlight, but beneath them CO₂ strongly traps outgoing heat, raising the surface temperature to about 465°C. Early Venus may have had liquid water, but as solar luminosity rose, ocean evaporation amplified the greenhouse into a runaway process: water vapor absorbs infrared radiation, warming the surface further and accelerating evaporation until the oceans boiled dry. Water vapor was photolyzed in the upper atmosphere and hydrogen escaped to space—Venus' D/H ratio about 120–150 times Earth's records this massive water loss—leaving Venus dry and scorching.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c77b78ef66e7�body�ٱ巨大高原夏天像一块巨型“加热器”抬升气流、吸引西南季风深入内陆，冬天又像“冷源”加强偏北风，从而放大了我国的季风强弱。٬The huge plateau acts as a summer heat source that pulls the southwest monsoon inland and a winter cold source that strengthens northerly winds, amplifying China's monsoon.�ans��src��*王斌《亚洲季风》，Springer，2006�+Wang, B., The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2006��id�c936d6b7b582�body��:米兰科维奇旋回包含地球轨道偏心率约10万年的变化、地轴倾角约4万年的摆动，以及岁差约2万年的进动。它们共同调制各纬度接收到的夏季日照量，从而触发或结束冰期。海斯、英布里与沙克尔顿在1976年用深海岩芯首次验证了这一理论。�TThe Milankovitch cycle combines changes in orbital eccentricity on about 100,000-year periods, axial tilt oscillation near 41,000 years, and precession of about 21,000 years. Together they modulate summer insolation by latitude, triggering or ending glaciations. Hays, Imbrie, and Shackleton verified the theory with deep-sea cores in 1976.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cb356790dc9e�body��/砖红壤是热带高温多雨环境下强烈化学风化的产物：可溶的硅和碱金属被大量淋失，相对不溶的铁、铝氧化物富集，使土壤呈红黄色且厚重。由于养分随淋溶流失、又少有有机质积累，这类土壤往往酸性强、肥力低，需谨慎耕作。�vLaterite forms under intense tropical chemical weathering: soluble silica and alkali metals are heavily leached away while relatively insoluble iron and aluminum oxides accumulate, giving the soil a reddish-yellow, hardened character. Because nutrients are washed out and organic matter scarce, such soils are often acidic and low in fertility, requiring careful management.�ans��src�و美国农业部自然资源保护局（USDA NRCS）；Brady & Weil《土壤的性质与特性》（The Nature and Properties of Soils）�pUSDA Natural Resources Conservation Service (NRCS); N.C. Brady & R.R. Weil, 'The Nature and Properties of Soils'��id�cbcf69992596�body���弹性回跳理论由里德提出，解释断层地震机制：岩层在应力下弹性变形积累应变，当超过岩石强度时沿断层突然破裂错动，弹回原状并释放能量。该理论是现代地震成因的基础。�Proposed by Reid, elastic rebound theory explains fault earthquakes: rock elastically deforms and stores strain under stress, then suddenly ruptures and slips along a fault, snapping back and releasing energy. It is the foundation of modern earthquake mechanics.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cd843be9db49�body���复合事件指多个极端（如高温叠加干旱、风暴潮叠加强降雨）在空间或时间上并发或相继，产生非线性放大的影响。传统基于单灾种的预警与防御体系难以覆盖其协同效应，因此风险更高。�(Compound events occur when multiple extremes, such as heatwaves with drought, or storm surge with heavy rain, co-occur or follow one another, producing nonlinearly amplified impacts. Conventional single-hazard early-warning and defense systems poorly capture their combined effects, raising risk.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cde164f83727�body���辐射雾是晴朗无风的夜里地面散热、近地空气变冷凝结，多出现在清晨山谷；平流雾是暖湿空气流过冷地面或冷海面冷却成雾，常伴随风、多见于沿海。��Radiation fog forms on clear calm nights when the ground cools the air above it, common in valleys at dawn. Advection fog forms when warm moist air moves over a cold surface, often with wind along coasts.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d09021e3aa14�body�ٍ震级表示释放能量的大小（如里氏震级），一次地震只有一个；烈度描述某地实际破坏程度，随距离衰减。ِMagnitude measures released energy (e.g. Richter) and is single per quake; intensity describes local shaking damage and decreases with distance.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d3519354a4bd�body���热融喀斯特是富冰冻土融化后的地面变形：地下冰化成水流失，体积缩小，上覆土体失去支撑而不均匀沉降，便成洼坑、热融湖与滑塌坡。积水吸热又加速四周融化，正反馈使它一启动便发展很快，北极近几十年明显增多。它与石灰岩喀斯特只是形似，后者靠水溶蚀碳酸盐，前者靠冰融塌陷；含冰量低的冻土只有浅融沉，受害最重的是富冰区的道路与管线。�Thermokarst is the ground deformation left where ice-rich permafrost thaws: ground ice turns to water and drains off, the volume shrinks, and the overlying soil loses support and settles unevenly, so the surface becomes pits, thaw lakes and slump slopes. Water ponded in the depressions absorbs heat and speeds the thaw around it, a positive feedback that makes the terrain advance quickly once it has started, and it has visibly increased across the Arctic in recent decades. It only resembles limestone karst: there water dissolves carbonate, here melting ice causes the collapse, alike in form but different in cause. Where permafrost holds little ice you get only shallow thaw settlement, not true thermokarst terrain, and it is roads and pipelines built on ice-rich ground that suffer most.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d39dca3e3573�body���某些近源震级标度（如地方性震级ML）在大地震时因地震波周期与台站距离限制，测值不再随真实能量增大而上升，即饱和。因此特大地震须用矩震级Mw表述。��Some local magnitude scales (like ML) stop increasing with true energy for huge quakes due to wave-period and station-distance limits, a saturation. Very large earthquakes must therefore be expressed by moment magnitude Mw.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d39ebda82361�body��板块运动的驱动力主要包括地幔对流（热物质上升、冷物质下沉）、洋脊推挤（ridge push）和板块俯冲时的板片拖曳（slab pull）。多数地球动力学研究认为，高密度冷板片下沉产生的板片拖曳是其中最主要的驱动力。�1Plate motion is driven mainly by mantle convection (rising hot and sinking cold material), ridge push at mid-ocean ridges, and slab pull as dense, cooling plates sink at subduction zones. Most geodynamic studies conclude that slab pull—the downward pull of a sinking dense plate—is the dominant force.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�d3b40b45cf29�body���抽取承压含水层中的水会降低孔隙压力，使含水层骨架压缩并不可逆地固结，地表随之下沉。在华北平原与部分三角洲城市，沉降速率可达每年数厘米，叠加海平面上升加剧内涝与工程风险。�@Pumping from confined aquifers lowers pore pressure, allowing the aquifer skeleton to compact and consolidate irreversibly, so the land surface subsides. In the North China Plain and some delta cities subsidence reaches several centimeters per year, compounding sea-level rise to worsen flooding and infrastructure risk.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d4c0406b7b03�body��2决定性因素是岩浆的挥发分（主要是水和二氧化碳）含量与黏度。玄武质岩浆黏度低、气体易逸出，多形成溢流喷发；流纹质岩浆黏度高、富硅，气体被困后压力骤增，引发爆炸式喷发。岩浆上升速率与围岩约束也会影响喷发样式。�]The decisive factors are the volatile content—mainly water and carbon dioxide—and the viscosity of the magma. Low-viscosity basaltic magma lets gas escape easily, producing effusive eruptions, while high-silica, viscous rhyolitic magma traps gases until pressure builds explosively. Ascent rate and country-rock confinement also shape the style.�ans��src��I《自然·地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 火山喷发动力学研究�-Nature Geoscience, volcanic eruption dynamics��id�d5b4a767ac1d�body���系统利用近海地震台网快速测定震源位置、震级与断层类型，并结合海平面浮标实时检测海啸波，推算到达沿岸的时间与高度。由于海啸波速远低于地震波，可为远处海岸争取宝贵的疏散时间。�6The system uses offshore seismic networks to rapidly determine epicenter, magnitude, and fault type, and sea-level buoys to detect tsunami waves in real time, estimating arrival time and height at coasts. Because tsunami waves travel far slower than seismic waves, distant shores gain valuable evacuation time.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d6406d4e9557�body���板块运动通过多种途径影响气候：造山带抬升加速硅酸盐风化，风化过程消耗大气二氧化碳并把碳埋入海洋，是长时间尺度的降温机制；巴拿马地峡的隆升切断了大西洋与太平洋的赤道洋流，可能促成北半球冰期；青藏高原与喜马拉雅的隆起强化亚洲季风，改变全球大气环流。这些板块尺度变化以千万年计，是驱动地质历史时期冷暖交替的重要因素。�6Plate tectonics alters climate through several paths: mountain building accelerates silicate weathering, which consumes atmospheric CO2 and buries carbon in the ocean—a long-term cooling mechanism; the rise of the Isthmus of Panama cut off equatorial flow between the Atlantic and Pacific and likely helped trigger Northern Hemisphere glaciation; and uplift of the Tibetan Plateau and Himalaya intensified the Asian monsoon, reshaping global circulation. Operating on tens of millions of years, these tectonic changes are major drivers of deep-time climate swings.�ans��src��'Nature（板块构造与气候变化）�+Nature (plate tectonics and climate change)��id�d72b329ec697�body��海洋性冰盖若基底低于海平面，当暖水侵蚀或冰架消失使接地线后退，冰流加速，形成海洋冰盖失稳（MISI）。若冰崖过高还会因重力崩塌产生海洋冰崖失稳（MICI），使冰量在短时间内大量入海，远超单纯融化估算。�KMarine-based ice sheets grounded below sea level can destabilize as warm water or shelf loss retreats the grounding line, speeding ice flow—marine ice-sheet instability (MISI). Very tall ice cliffs may also collapse under gravity, marine ice-cliff instability (MICI), dumping ice to the ocean far faster than melt alone predicts.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�d753ebd036c5�body���夷平面是长期风化、侵蚀把起伏地形削平接近海平面的准平原。它的存在表明该地区曾经历漫长稳定抬升前的剥蚀夷平，是解读构造—地貌演化的重要线索。��A peneplain is a near-sea-level flat surface produced by long weathering and erosion leveling relief. Its presence indicates a region underwent prolonged stripping before uplift, a key clue to tectonic-geomorphic evolution.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d8cf6676c824�body��0火星早期就失去了全球偶极磁场，推测约40亿年前其发电机停转，原因是内核冷却、对流减弱。失去磁屏蔽后，太阳风和高能粒子直接剥离大气（主要是离子逃逸），带走大部分CO₂和水；MAVEN任务证实这一过程至今仍在进行。氩同位素测量显示火星大气中⁴⁰Ar丰度远低于地幔脱气应产生的量，说明早期大气大部分已经逃逸。大气变薄使液态水无法稳定存在，火星最终演变成寒冷荒漠，其气候演化与内部动力学深度耦合。��Mars lost its global dipole field early—the dynamo is thought to have stalled about 4 billion years ago as its core cooled and convection weakened. Without the magnetic shield, the solar wind and energetic particles stripped the atmosphere (mainly ion escape), carrying away most CO₂ and water; the MAVEN mission confirms the process continues today. Argon-isotope measurements show far less ⁴⁰Ar in the Martian atmosphere than mantle degassing should have produced, indicating that most of the early atmosphere is already gone. The thinning atmosphere made liquid water unstable, turning Mars into a cold desert, with its climate evolution tightly coupled to its internal dynamics.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d9dbccd4ace0�body��w温暖海面蒸发的水汽在高空凝结放热，像发动机燃料不断供能，海温低于26℃便难以维持。�TLatent heat from evaporating warm seawater powers the storm; below 26°C it weakens.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�da307599f917�body�ٓ它们最初是露出海面的火山岛，被海浪拍打出平顶；后来板块带着它们远离热点并下沉，平顶就被保留在海底。٪They began as volcanic islands whose tops were planed flat by waves; later the plate carried them away from the hotspot and they sank, preserving the flat top underwater.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�dbb341a29de6�body���1815年印度尼西亚坦博拉火山爆发是历史记录中最大的一次，喷发指数达7级。它向大气注入巨量火山灰与气体，导致1816年北半球出现「无夏之年」，作物大幅减产。��Indonesia's 1815 Mount Tambora eruption was the largest in recorded history, rated VEI 7. It injected huge amounts of ash and gas into the atmosphere, causing the 1816 'Year Without a Summer' and widespread crop failure in the Northern Hemisphere.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�dd59ca5f12bd�body��?硫酸盐气溶胶在平流层滞留1–2年，反射和散射太阳短波辐射，减少到达地面的阳光，造成约1–3年的短暂降温；气溶胶随后随极涡和平流层风带向全球扩散，热带火山喷发的影响范围最广。而火山喷出的CO₂与工业排放相比微不足道，但CO₂在大气中存留数百年至千年，其辐射效应随时间累积。两者的时间尺度与机理完全不同：喷发后最初几年以气溶胶降温为主，长期气候则受温室气体存量控制，单次火山事件无法改变全球碳收支。��Stratospheric sulfate aerosols linger one to two years, reflecting and scattering incoming shortwave radiation and reducing sunlight at the surface, causing brief cooling of roughly one to three years; they then spread globally with the polar vortex and stratospheric winds, tropical eruptions having the widest reach. Volcanic CO₂ is negligible compared with industrial emissions, but CO₂ persists for centuries to millennia and its radiative effect accumulates. The two thus act on entirely different timescales and mechanisms: aerosol cooling dominates the first few years after an eruption, while long-term climate is set by the greenhouse-gas inventory, and no single eruption changes the global carbon budget.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�de3a92172eda�body���有金属光泽的矿物里价电子离域成半满能带，可见光电场一推，这批电子就整体振荡并重新辐射出同频率的光，反射率高、光穿不进多深，于是既明亮又不透明。非金属矿物没有这批自由电子，靠折射与内部散射反光，所以只有玻璃或金刚光泽。别把光泽当成分：黄铁矿、方铅矿乃至石墨都不含金属单质却一样闪亮；而光泽随观察角度与抛光强弱变化，鉴别时条痕往往比反光可靠。��In minerals with a metallic luster the valence electrons are delocalized into half-filled bands, so the electric field of visible light sets this whole population oscillating and they re-radiate light of the same frequency: reflectivity is high and light penetrates only a shallow way in, which makes them both bright and opaque. Non-metallic minerals lack that free-electron population and shine instead by refraction and internal scattering, so they show only a vitreous or adamantine luster. Do not read luster as composition: pyrite, galena and even graphite contain no native metal yet are just as shiny, and luster varies with viewing angle and how well the face is polished, so the streak is usually more reliable than the shine.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�de502a248b63�body���极地涡旋是冬季极地上空平流层和低层大气中的大型冷空气旋涡，被急流环绕并稳定在高纬。当涡旋减弱或分裂，冷空气会向南爆发，造成中纬度寒潮。近年其不稳定性受到气候研究的关注。�WThe polar vortex is a large cyclonic circulation of cold air over the poles in winter, in the stratosphere and lower atmosphere, enclosed by the jet stream and confined to high latitudes. When it weakens or splits, cold air spills southward and causes mid-latitude cold outbreaks. Its instability has drawn climate research attention recently.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�dfa1138b8323�body��温盐环流是由海水的温度和盐度差异驱动的深海环流，常被称为大洋传送带。在高纬度海域，冷水因密度大而下沉，再沿深层缓慢流向低纬度并上升。它把热量和碳在全球海洋中循环，对长期气候有重要影响。�oThe thermohaline circulation is a deep-ocean current driven by differences in seawater temperature and salinity, often called the ocean conveyor belt. In high-latitude regions dense cold water sinks and slowly flows toward lower latitudes at depth before rising again. It cycles heat and carbon through the global ocean and has a major influence on long-term climate.�ans��src��bRahmstorf S., Ocean circulation and climate during the past 120,000 years, Nature, 2002, 419(6903)�nRahmstorf, S. (2002). Ocean circulation and climate during the past 120,000 years. Nature, 419(6903), 207-214.��id�e11328531897�body���多数研究认为“板片拖曳”（slab pull）最重要：俯冲带密度大的板片沉入地幔，像拉窗帘一样把后面整块板块往下拽；其次还有洋中脊的“脊推”和地幔对流的拖带。��Most studies rank slab pull as the top force: the dense subducting slab sinks into the mantle and drags the rest of the plate along, like pulling a curtain; ridge push and mantle drag also contribute.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e1a14a8e2ee3�body��放射性定年法利用某些同位素（如铀-238）以固定半衰期衰变为子同位素（如铅-206）的规律来推算岩石年龄。通过测量母同位素与子同位素的比例，结合已知的衰变常数即可计算样品形成至今的时间。�Radiometric dating uses the fact that certain isotopes, such as uranium-238, decay to daughter isotopes like lead-206 at a fixed half-life. By measuring the parent-to-daughter ratio and applying the known decay constant, scientists calculate how long ago the sample formed.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e272a16b8bc2�body�ٖ江心那道像鱼嘴的石堤把水引向内外两江：外江走洪水、内江进灌区，再靠飞沙堰和宝瓶口调节，自动分水排沙。�Midstream, a fish-mouth-shaped stone levee splits the flow between inner and outer channels - the outer carrying floods, the inner feeding the irrigation district - with the Feishayan spillway and the Baopingkou inlet regulating automatically, apportioning water and discharging sand.�ans��src��E联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《青城山—都江堰》�NUNESCO World Heritage Centre, Mount Qingcheng and Dujiangyan Irrigation System��id�e2d6f503db78�body�ٺ方解石是碳酸钙，遇稀盐酸发生化学反应放出二氧化碳气泡，这是碳酸盐矿物的特征反应。地质工作者常用稀盐酸快速鉴别石灰岩和方解石。��Calcite is calcium carbonate that reacts with dilute hydrochloric acid to release carbon dioxide bubbles, a characteristic of carbonate minerals. Geologists use dilute acid to quickly identify limestone and calcite.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e4f421d103ad�body���风化壳是基岩经长期风化未被搬运而残留的疏松覆盖层，记录了气候、植被和侵蚀历史。不同气候带风化壳厚度和矿物组合不同，可反演古环境。��A weathering mantle is the loose residual cover left when bedrock weathers in place over long time, recording climate, vegetation and erosion history. Its thickness and mineral assemblage vary by climate zone, helping reconstruct paleoenvironments.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e4f433e66027�body��M地球外核由液态铁镍组成，其导电流体在地球自转与热、成分对流驱动下发生大规模环流，切割原有磁场并感应出电流，形成自我维持的「自激发电机」效应。该过程由磁流体动力学方程描述，外核对流能量主要来自内核结晶释放的潜热与轻元素上浮。��Earth's outer core is made of liquid iron-nickel; its electrically conducting fluid circulates on a large scale driven by planetary rotation and thermal or compositional convection, cutting existing magnetic field lines and inducing currents that self-sustain a dynamo. The process is governed by magnetohydrodynamic equations, and its convection is powered mainly by latent heat from inner-core freezing and rising light elements.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�e5b44bba084b�body��,米兰科维奇循环指地球轨道三要素——偏心率、地轴倾角和岁差——的周期性变化，改变了各纬度接收的太阳辐射量。这些变化以数万到十万年左右的周期出现，与过去的冰期旋回高度吻合。它是解释冰期时间尺度的经典理论。�kThe Milankovitch cycles are periodic changes in Earth's three orbital elements, eccentricity, axial tilt, and precession, which alter the amount of solar radiation received at each latitude. They operate on timescales of tens to about one hundred thousand years and match past glacial cycles closely. They are the classic theory explaining the timing of ice ages.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e64f4975eb4b�body���自1900年以来全球平均海平面已上升约20厘米，20世纪以来速率加快。主要贡献来自海水热膨胀和陆地冰（格陵兰、南极与山岳冰川）融化，近年冰盖消融占比持续上升。�$Global mean sea level has risen about 20 cm since 1900, with the rate accelerating through the 20th century. The main contributors are thermal expansion of seawater and loss of land ice from Greenland, Antarctica, and mountain glaciers, with ice-sheet melt making up a growing share recently.�ans��src��?Church & White（2011）《地球物理调查》海平面研究�uChurch, J.A. & White, N.J. (2011), Sea-level rise from the late 19th to the early 21st century, Surveys in Geophysics��id�e6a5359403c9�body��@它们是同质多象变体（多形），各自只在特定的温度—压力区间内稳定：蓝晶石是低温高压相，红柱石是低压相，矽线石是高温相。三种矿物的稳定域在温压图上交汇于一个三重点，因此它们被用作变质指示矿物：地质学家根据岩石中出现的是蓝晶石、红柱石还是矽线石，即可推断岩石经历的温压条件。例如巴罗式区域变质带中，从低绿片岩相到角闪岩相依次出现绿泥石、黑云母、蓝晶石，最后出现矽线石，指示变质级别逐步升高。�]They are polymorphs, each stable only within a specific pressure–temperature field: kyanite is the high-pressure low-temperature phase, andalusite the low-pressure phase, and sillimanite the high-temperature phase. Their stability fields meet at a triple point on the P-T diagram, which is why they serve as metamorphic index minerals: identifying whether kyanite, andalusite, or sillimanite occurs lets geologists infer the P-T conditions the rock experienced. In Barrovian metamorphic zones, for example, the sequence chlorite→biotite→kyanite→sillimanite marks steadily rising metamorphic grade.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�e8066c721c9d�body���气溶胶既能直接散射或吸收阳光（多数散射型让地球变冷），也能作为凝结核改变云的颜色和寿命，间接增强云的反射，产生降温效应；但黑碳等吸光型反而会加热。��Aerosols directly scatter or absorb sunlight—most scattering types cool Earth—and indirectly brighten and lengthen clouds by providing nuclei; but light-absorbing black carbon warms instead.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�e81dd9e53197�body��&在终年高温多雨的热带，强烈的淋溶把硅、碱金属等易溶成分冲走，留下铁铝氧化物富集的红色黏重土壤。这类砖红壤富含氧化铁而贫瘠，且一旦植被破坏极难恢复。布奥尔等人在《土壤发生与分类》中描述了其诊断特征。�]In perennially hot, wet tropics, intense leaching washes out soluble silica and bases, leaving iron and aluminum oxides enriched in a red, heavy soil. Such laterite is rich in iron oxides but infertile, and once vegetation is stripped it is very hard to restore. Buol and colleagues describe its diagnostic traits in Soil Genesis and Classification.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e8c6ad4402b4�body���自由空气异常是实测重力与理想椭球体参考值之差且不扣除地形质量，主要反映地形与深部质量的综合影响，如山区出现正异常可能暗示深部质量补偿不足；布格异常先扣除地形质量，因而主要反映地下密度的横向变化——沉积盆地下方呈负异常，致密基岩和俯冲板片呈正异常。解释时需两者配合：在均衡补偿良好的地区，山区自由空气异常近于零，而布格异常显著为负（地壳厚根）。因此布格异常直接用于刻画莫霍面起伏、盆地充填与俯冲板片等深部结构，这一方法广泛用于找矿和地壳结构研究。�Free-air anomalies are observed gravity minus the ellipsoid reference without terrain correction, capturing the combined effect of topography and deep mass—positive values in mountains may indicate incomplete isostatic compensation; Bouguer anomalies subtract the terrain mass first, so they mainly image lateral density variations—sedimentary basins show negative anomalies, dense basement and subducted slabs positive ones. The two must be interpreted together: where isostatic compensation is complete, mountain free-air anomalies are near zero while Bouguer anomalies are strongly negative over the crustal root. Bouguer anomalies therefore map Moho depth, basin fill, and subducted slabs directly, and both are widely used in mineral exploration and crustal studies.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�earth_19_003�body��L抽水使孔隙水压力下降,上覆载荷转由颗粒骨架承担,有效应力增大驱动黏性土层压密排水;这种固结变形基本上不可逆,人工回灌也只能恢复其中很小的弹性份额。结果就是水位企稳后沉降速率放缓,但已损失的含水层储水能力和地面高程大部分永久丧失。�sPumping lowers pore-water pressure and transfers overburden load onto the grain skeleton; the increased effective stress compacts clay layers essentially irreversibly, and managed recharge recovers only a minor elastic fraction of the deformation. Subsidence rates therefore slow once levels stabilize, yet most of the lost aquifer storage and land elevation remain gone.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_19_006�body���海水中的锶来自两个同位素组成迥异的端元:年轻玄武质洋壳经热液蚀变提供的低比值锶,以及古老大陆硅酸盐岩风化输送的高比值锶;锶在海水中滞留时间远超混合时间,故大洋中比值处处均一。沉积记录里比值的抬升通常指向大陆风化通量增强,从而把喜马拉雅造山等构造事件与晚新生代气候变冷串联起来。��Oceanic strontium arrives from two isotopically distinct reservoirs: unradiogenic Sr leached from young basaltic crust by seafloor hydrothermal circulation, and radiogenic Sr shed by weathering of old continental silicates. Because Sr's ocean residence time far exceeds mixing time, the ratio is uniform worldwide, so rises recorded in marine sediments point to enhanced continental weathering fluxes, linking orogenic events such as the Himalayan uplift to late Cenozoic cooling.�ans��src�ًMcArthur、Howarth 与 Bailey 撰写的 Strontium Isotope Stratigraphy,载于 Gradstein 等主编的 The Geologic Time Scale 2012(Elsevier)ٖMcArthur, J.M., Howarth, R.J. & Bailey, T.R., Strontium Isotope Stratigraphy, in Gradstein, F.M. et al. (eds.), The Geologic Time Scale 2012, Elsevier��id�earth_19_009�body���主流解释围绕三条线索展开:亚稳态橄榄石在过渡带仍暂时保存并发生相变,相变失稳产生的裂纹状缺陷可触发滑动;矿物脱水带来的孔隙压骤升能削弱断层面;细粒化的热塑性剪切带也可能高速失稳。日本海沟下方俯冲板片内观测到的滞留冷物质与深震分布相互印证,但单一机制尚无定论,仍是地球内部物理的前沿问题。��Three candidate mechanisms dominate: metastable olivine surviving into the transition zone, whose transformational faulting nucleates slip; dehydration embrittlement, where released fluids spike pore pressure and weaken faults; and thermal runaway on localized fine-grained shear zones. Seismic imaging of cold slabs beneath Japan matches the depth distribution of deep events, supporting the framework, yet no single mechanism is settled and the problem remains a frontier of deep-Earth physics.�ans��src�ٗGreen 与 Houston,《The Mechanics of Deep Earthquakes》,Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences,1995 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev.ea.23.050195.001125)ٓGreen & Houston, 'The Mechanics of Deep Earthquakes', Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 1995, DOI: 10.1146/annurev.ea.23.050195.001125��id�earth_19_013�body���雷达回波的相位正比于传感器到地面的距离,把同一地区两次成像的相位相减,便得到两次成像期间距离的变化。一个整周期条纹约对应半个波长,C波段约为2.8厘米,经相位解缠后测量精度可推进到毫米级。扣除地形、大气延迟与轨道误差之后,干涉图即可刻画地震、火山活动或地面沉降造成的细微形变场。��The phase of a radar echo scales with the sensor-to-ground distance, so differencing phases from two passes over one scene yields the range change between those epochs. A single fringe cycle spans roughly half a wavelength—about 2.8 cm at C-band—and phase unwrapping pushes precision to the millimeter level. After removing topographic, atmospheric, and orbital terms, the interferogram maps the fine deformation fields produced by earthquakes, volcanic unrest, or subsiding ground.�ans��src��xBürgmann、Rosen 与 Fielding 2000 年发表于《Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences》的干涉测量综述��R. Bürgmann, P. A. Rosen, E. J. Fielding, Synthetic aperture radar interferometry to measure Earth's surface topography and its deformation, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 2000��id�earth_19_016�body��软沉积层的剪切波速远低于基岩,地震波进入盆地后振幅被显著放大,长周期成分尤为突出。盆地的几何形态还会圈闭波动能量并造成多次反射,使强震动持续更久。当建筑的自振周期恰好落在放大的长周期范围内时,共振进一步放大反应——1985年墨西哥城的惨重震害正是这一机制的典型例证。��Soft sediments carry shear waves far more slowly than bedrock, so motions entering a basin are strongly amplified, with their long-period components boosted most. Basin geometry also traps seismic energy through repeated reflections, stretching out the duration of strong shaking. When buildings resonate with the amplified long-period motion, structural response grows still larger—the devastating damage in Mexico City in 1985 is the canonical demonstration.�ans��src�ٓSingh、Mena 与 Castro 1988 年发表于《Bulletin of the Seismological Society of America》关于1985年墨西哥城地震场地放大的研究��S. K. Singh, E. Mena, R. Castro, Some aspects of source characteristics of the 19 September 1985 Michoacan earthquake and ground motion amplification in and near Mexico City, Bulletin of the Seismological Society of America, 1988��id�earth_19_019�body��x雨水渗入土壤与裂隙后缓慢下移补给含水层,含水层再经由泉口和河床持续排泄,构成洪峰过后平缓的基流段。基流退水在半对数图上近似一条直线,其斜率反映含水层的储水与导水能力。据此把响应迅速的直接径流与退水迟缓的地下水源分割开,便能估算每场洪水事件中两类来水的占比。�Infiltrated rain percolates slowly through soil and fractures into aquifers, which then drain steadily through springs and channel beds to form the gentle tail of the hydrograph after the flood peak. Plotted on semi-logarithmic axes, this baseflow recession approaches a straight line whose slope encodes the aquifer's storage and transmissive behavior. Splitting the quick direct runoff from the sluggish groundwater component on that basis lets hydrologists estimate what fraction of each flood event came from each source.�ans��src��LHall 1968 年发表于《Reviews of Geophysics》的基流退水研究综述�HF. R. Hall, Base-flow recessions—a review, Reviews of Geophysics, 1968��id�earth_20_003�body��f天坑是碳酸盐岩巨型洞厅的顶部发生大规模崩塌、直通地表后形成的特大型负地形。暗河沿断层和岩层面强烈溶蚀、侵蚀,不断掏空山体,洞顶一旦失去支撑便逐级向上垮塌直至出露地表。由于崩塌点位受伏流通道控制,天坑多呈串珠状展布,重庆奉节小寨天坑即为典型代表。��A tiankeng forms when the roof of an immense cave chamber in carbonate rock collapses catastrophically through to the land surface. Underground rivers corrode and erode rock along faults and bedding planes, progressively hollowing out the mountain until the unsupported ceiling fails in stages up to the surface. Because the collapse points track the buried river channel, tiankeng characteristically line up like beads on a string, with Xiaozhai Tiankeng in Fengjie, Chongqing as the classic example.�ans��src�٣袁道先等《中国岩溶学》,地质出版社,1994 ; 另见: Zhu, X. & Waltham, T. (2007). Tiankeng: definition and description. Cave and Karst Science, 34(2).٥Zhu, X. & Waltham, T. (2007). Tiankeng: definition and description. Cave and Karst Science, 34(2). ; see also: 袁道先等《中国岩溶学》,地质出版社,1994��id�earth_20_006�body��@多年冻土层储存的有机碳约有1400–1700 Pg,接近现有大气碳储量的两倍。冻土融化后,微生物在有氧条件下分解古土壤碳生成二氧化碳,在饱水厌氧微域则产生甲烷。由此构成变暖—融化—排放的正反馈,IPCC AR6将其列为高置信度的碳循环放大机制。��Northern permafrost soils hold roughly 1,400-1,700 Pg of organic carbon, nearly twice the carbon currently resident in the atmosphere. Once thaw begins, microbes decompose ancient soil organic matter, emitting CO2 under aerobic conditions and methane in waterlogged anaerobic microsites. The result is a thaw-emission-warming positive feedback that IPCC AR6 treats as a high-confidence amplifier of the global carbon cycle.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�earth_20_009�body���赤道上升的空气在向极运动中因角动量守恒不断获得西风分量,到达副热带后辐射冷却并辐合下沉,下沉过程的绝热压缩使相对湿度骤降,持续抑制成云致雨。撒哈拉、阿拉伯半岛与澳大利亚内陆的荒漠正是沿这条动力性晴空带排布。基于卫星观测的多项研究表明,近几十年哈德里环流整体向极扩张,副热带干区随之向中纬度推进,加剧了地中海型气候边缘的水分亏缺。�rAir rising over the equator gains strong westerly momentum as it drifts poleward under angular-momentum conservation, then cools radiatively and converges to sink near 30 degrees latitude; adiabatic compression during descent slashes relative humidity, persistently suppressing cloud formation and rainfall. The Sahara, Arabia and the Australian interior line up along this dynamically cleared belt. Multiple satellite-based analyses show the Hadley cells have expanded poleward in recent decades, pushing subtropical dry zones toward the mid-latitudes and worsening moisture deficits along Mediterranean-type climate margins.�ans��src��kLu & Deutscher,《哈德莱环流极向扩张:1950-1993年》,Geophysical Research Letters,2005年,第32卷قJ. Lu and K. M. P. Deutscher, Poleward expansion of the Hadley circulation: 1950-1993, Geophysical Research Letters, 2005, vol. 32��id�earth_20_013�body��O强震动使斜坡岩体开裂、松动并累积损伤,形成大量震裂斜坡,其完整性远差于震前。震后降雨沿裂隙入渗,孔隙水压力升高、岩体抗剪强度继续衰减,失稳所需雨量阈值明显降低。汶川震区的观测显示,震后约十年内滑坡对降雨的敏感度仍显著高于震前水平。��Strong shaking cracks, loosens, and damages slope-forming rock masses, leaving co-seismically fractured slopes far less intact than before the event. Rainfall then infiltrates along the new fissures, raising pore-water pressures and further degrading shear strength, so the rainfall threshold for failure drops sharply. Observations in the Wenchuan seismic zone show that landslide sensitivity to rain stayed markedly above pre-earthquake levels for roughly a decade.�ans��src�ُ殷跃平《汶川地震地质与滑坡灾害概论》,地质出版社,2009 ; 另见: Huang & Fan, The landslide story, Nature Geoscience, 2013ّHuang & Fan, The landslide story, Nature Geoscience, 2013 ; see also: 殷跃平《汶川地震地质与滑坡灾害概论》,地质出版社,2009��id�earth_20_016�body��22°晕是阳光穿过大气中随机取向的六方柱状冰晶发生折射形成的。光线经过夹角为60°的两个晶面时,能量集中在最小偏向角附近——红光约21.8°,蓝紫光约22.4°,于是围绕太阳出现半径约22°的明亮光环。短波长的光偏向角更大而被排到环的外侧,红光留在内侧,晕因此呈现内红外蓝的色彩顺序。��The 22° halo forms when sunlight refracts through randomly oriented hexagonal columnar ice crystals in the air. Rays crossing two crystal faces that meet at 60° concentrate near the minimum-deviation angle, about 21.8° for red light and 22.4° for violet, so a bright ring of roughly 22° radius encircles the Sun. Shorter wavelengths deviate more strongly and are displaced outward, leaving red on the inside and giving the halo its characteristic colour order.�ans��src��mR. Greenler,《虹、晕与幻日》(Rainbows, Halos, and Glories),Cambridge University Press,1980年,第5章�ZRobert Greenler, Rainbows, Halos, and Glories, Cambridge University Press, 1980, Chapter 5��id�earth_20_019�body���溶洞主要在地下水面附近水流缓慢但溶蚀持续进行的部位发育。当区域地壳抬升、河流下切时,地下水位随之下降,原先的洞道被抬升到潜水面以上而废弃,新的洞穴又在更低的位置重新溶蚀扩展。抬升与下切反复交替,山体内便保留下一层层对应不同时期水文面的洞道,桂林的多层洞穴系统正是这段历史的剖面记录。��Solution caves develop mainly where groundwater flows slowly yet dissolves rock continuously, close to the water table. As the crust uplifts and rivers incise, the water table falls, stranding older passages above the new phreatic zone while fresh cavities enlarge at lower levels. Repeated uplift-and-incision cycles leave behind storeys of passages recording successive water-table positions, so Guilin's multi-level cave systems preserve a cross-section of that history.�ans��src�٘D. C. Ford 与 P. W. Williams,《喀斯特水文地质与地貌学》(Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology),John Wiley & Sons,2007年,洞穴发育章节�Derek C. Ford and Paul W. Williams, Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, John Wiley & Sons, 2007, chapters on cave development��id�earth_21_003�body��Bδ18O单指标无法区分冰量与温度贡献,需引入独立温度计:壳体Mg/Ca比值随钙化温度呈指数变化,可先行定量古水温。将Mg/Ca推算的温度效应从实测δ18O中扣除,剩余项即代表海水δ18O,据此反演大陆冰体积,该联合方法奠定了新生代冰盖演化曲线的基础。��A single δ18O record cannot separate ice-volume from temperature contributions, so an independent thermometer is required: shell Mg/Ca rises exponentially with calcification temperature and quantifies past water temperature first. Subtracting the Mg/Ca-derived effect from measured δ18O leaves the seawater component, from which continental ice volume is inverted—together these metrics underpin the Cenozoic ice-sheet evolution curve.�ans��src��YLear, C. H., Elderfield, H. & Wilson, P. A., 2000, Geochimica et Cosmochimica Acta 64(15)٬Lear, Elderfield & Wilson, 2000, "Cenozoic deep-sea temperatures and global ice volumes from Mg/Ca in benthic foraminiferal calcite", Geochimica et Cosmochimica Acta 64(15)��id�earth_21_006�body���雷暴云内的电荷分离可建立上亿伏的电位差,击穿后先导通道开辟出直径仅几厘米的高导电通路,紧随其后的回击电流峰值通常达20至30千安。如此巨大的电流挤在极小的截面里,靠焦耳热在微秒量级内把稀薄空气加热到约30000 K,通道气压骤增并向外推出冲击波。这道冲击波传到人耳,就是我们听到的雷声。��Charge separation inside a thundercloud builds potential differences of hundreds of megavolts; once breakdown occurs, the leader carves a conductive channel only centimeters wide, and the following return stroke carries peak currents of roughly 20-30 kA. Forcing that current through such a tiny cross section deposits Joule heat fast enough to raise the thin air to about 30,000 K in microseconds, and the sudden pressure rise drives a shock wave outward. That shock is what reaches our ears as thunder.�ans��src��pRakov V. A. 与 Uman M. A.,《Lightning: Physics and Effects》,剑桥大学出版社,2003年,第4章与第11章�iRakov V. A. & Uman M. A., Lightning: Physics and Effects, Cambridge University Press, 2003, Chs. 4 and 11��id�earth_21_009�body��主流解释是冲流带内的自组织正反馈:上冲水流在某处加速汇聚并掏蚀出小凹地,凹地把后续冲流导向两侧,使凹陷加深、两侧滩肩加宽,最终稳定在与波能尺度匹配的间距上;另一种假说则归因于入射波与边缘波的相互作用。野外观测显示滩角间距随冲流爬高和入射波能系统增大,风暴期形成的粗颗粒陡滩上最为发育,涌浪季节又被重塑。因此滩角被视为海滩泥沙对波候变化快速响应的直接记录。��The leading explanation is self-organized positive feedback within the swash zone: where uprush accelerates and converges it scours a small embayment, which deflects later swash toward the flanks, deepening the hollow and widening its horn until a stable spacing emerges that scales with wave energy; a competing hypothesis invokes interaction between incident waves and edge waves. Field surveys show cusp spacing growing systematically with swash run-up and incident wave energy, and cusps develop best on the coarse, steep beaches built by storms before fair-weather waves rebuild the profile. They are read as a direct record of how beach sediment responds rapidly to changing wave climate.�ans��src��tKomar P. D.,《Beach Processes and Sedimentation》第二版,Prentice Hall,1998年,海滩剖面与滩面地形章节فKomar P. D., Beach Processes and Sedimentation, 2nd ed., Prentice Hall, 1998, chapters on beach profiles and foreshore morphology��id�earth_21_016�body���三角洲进积的动力来自河流输沙在河口的快速卸载:粗颗粒先在河口坝堆积构成三角洲前缘相,细粒物质则被搬运至更远的底积层。随着分流河道反复摆动、决口扇不断叠置,前积层持续向盆地推进,形成向上变浅、以倾斜斜层理为标志的进积序列。密西西比河三角洲的鸟足状形态正是多次决口改道导致朵叶体迁移叠合的直接结果。��Delta progradation starts with rapid sediment dumping at the river mouth: coarse grains build mouth-bar deposits of the delta front while fines are carried farther out onto the prodelta. As distributary channels swing repeatedly and crevasse splays stack, foresets keep advancing basinward, producing a shallowing-upward regressive succession marked by inclined clinoforms. The birdfoot outline of the Mississippi Delta records exactly this lobe switching under repeated avulsion.�ans��src��qH. G. Reading 主编《Sedimentary Environments: Processes, Facies and Stratigraphy》第三版,Blackwell Science�mH. G. Reading (ed.), Sedimentary Environments: Processes, Facies and Stratigraphy, 3rd ed., Blackwell Science��id�earth_22_003�body���在长期剪应力作用下，冰晶内发生位错滑移并伴随动态重结晶与晶粒调整，产生持续累积的塑性应变，故冰川表现得像黏度极高的流体。实验与野外资料表明，其稳态应变速率大致与剪应力的三次方成正比，即格伦流动定律（n≈3）。因冰床附近剪应力最大，变形集中于底部；底面若有融水润滑，再叠加上滑动便形成快速冰流。��Under sustained shear stress, ice deforms by dislocation glide together with dynamic recrystallization, accumulating permanent plastic strain, so a glacier moves like an extremely viscous fluid. Experiments show the steady-state strain rate varies roughly as the third power of shear stress — Glen’s flow law (n ≈ 3). Shear stress peaks near the bed, concentrating deformation at the glacier base; where meltwater lubricates the bed, sliding is added on top, producing fast-flowing ice streams.�ans��src��uGlen, J.W.《多晶冰的蠕变》，《皇家学会会刊A辑》228卷1175期，1955年，DOI:10.1098/rspa.1955.0066كGlen, J.W., “The Creep of Polycrystalline Ice”, Proceedings of the Royal Society A, 228(1175), 1955, DOI:10.1098/rspa.1955.0066��id�earth_22_016�body���针叶凋落物分解缓慢，释放的有机酸随下渗水强烈淋溶，使上部土层高度酸化。酸性有机配体螯合铁、铝，把它们从漂洗层（E层）向下搬运；当络合物被吸附、微生物分解或因铝饱和而沉淀时，便形成红棕色的灰化淀积层，其上方残留暗色粗腐殖质。这一螯合淋溶—淀积机制正是灰土诊断特性的核心。�Slowly decomposing conifer litter releases fulvic and other organic acids, and intense leaching strongly acidifies the upper soil. Acidic organic ligands chelate iron and aluminium and carry them down from the bleached eluvial (E) horizon; where the complexes are adsorbed, decomposed by microbes, or precipitated once aluminium saturation is reached, a reddish-brown spodic horizon forms while dark raw humus accumulates above. This chelate-leaching-and-deposition mechanism defines the diagnostic features of Spodosols (Podzols).�ans��src��~Lundström、van Breemen 与 Bain,《The podzolization process. A review》,Geoderma,2000 (DOI: 10.1016/s0016-7061(99)00036-1)�yLundström, van Breemen & Bain, 'The podzolization process. A review', Geoderma, 2000, DOI: 10.1016/s0016-7061(99)00036-1��id�earth_22_019�body���跃动冰川常年缓行，却会周期性暴发式加速数十倍。对阿拉斯加瓦尔加特冰川的观测显示：一旦冰下排水从高效的通道网络转为低效的分布式水系，融水积存、冰下水压骤升，底床有效正应力锐减，滑动与底床变形猛增，冰川整体前冲；其后隧道排水重建、水压回落，跃动随之终止。这种“水文开关”支配着跃动的开始与结束。�;Surge-type glaciers creep along slowly yet periodically lurch forward at many times their normal speed. Observations of Variegated Glacier, Alaska, showed that when subglacial drainage switches from efficient conduit tunnels to an inefficient distributed cavity network, meltwater is stored and basal water pressure climbs; the effective normal stress on the bed collapses, letting sliding and bed deformation accelerate and propel the whole ice mass. Once tunnel drainage is rebuilt and pressure drops, the surge terminates—a hydrologic switch governing onset and end.�ans��src�ٍKamb 等，“Glacier Surge Mechanism: 1982–1983 Surge of Variegated Glacier”，Science 227卷，1985，DOI: 10.1126/science.227.4686.469ًKamb et al., "Glacier Surge Mechanism: 1982-1983 Surge of Variegated Glacier, Alaska", Science 227, 1985, DOI: 10.1126/science.227.4686.469��id�earth_23_003�body���冰期冬季风强盛时，西风带与近地面偏北风把亚洲内陆荒漠粉尘搬至高原堆积成黄土层；间冰期夏季风增强带来降水，地表发育古土壤。成土过程中铁氧化物经历还原—再氧化，生成大量超顺磁性细粒磁铁矿与磁赤铁矿，使古土壤磁化率显著升高。磁化率曲线因此追踪夏季风强弱，可与深海氧同位素阶段直接对比，重建约260万年以来的季风演化史。�`When glacial winter monsoons strengthened, westerlies and northerly near-surface winds carried dust from Central Asian deserts onto the plateau to form loess horizons; intensified interglacial summer monsoons brought rainfall and soil development. During pedogenesis, iron oxides were reduced and reoxidized into abundant ultrafine superparamagnetic magnetite and maghemite, markedly raising paleosol susceptibility. Susceptibility curves therefore track summer-monsoon strength and correlate directly with marine oxygen-isotope stages, reconstructing monsoon history over roughly the past 2.6 million years.�ans��src��}Kukla, G. 等：《以磁化率定年的中国更新世气候》，《地质学》（Geology），1988年，16卷811–814页�xKukla, G., et al., 'Pleistocene climates in China dated by magnetic susceptibility', Geology, 1988, vol. 16, pp. 811-814��id�earth_23_006�body���抽水使含水层孔隙水压力下降，上覆载荷转移给颗粒骨架，有效应力增大。砂层以可恢复的弹性压缩为主；粘土质弱透水层排水缓慢，当有效应力超过历史最大（先期固结）应力后，片状颗粒重新排列，发生不可逆的塑性压密。即便水位回升，地面也难以抬回，含水层储水能力永久受损。美国加州中央谷地累计沉降已近9米。��Pumping lowers pore-water pressure, shifting the overburden onto the granular skeleton and raising effective stress. Sands compress mostly elastically and rebound as water levels recover, but clayey aquitards drain slowly; once effective stress exceeds the preconsolidation stress, platy particles rearrange into permanent plastic compaction. Even recovered levels cannot lift the ground back, and storage capacity is lost for good - California's Central Valley has sunk by nearly nine metres.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_23_009�body���角动量守恒将地球各圈层的自转联系在一起。大气和海洋的扰动能解释季节性日长变化，但十年尺度的起伏主要源自液态外核与地幔之间的角动量交换：核幔边界上的电磁力与地形耦合力矩拖曳地幔，让固体地球时快时慢，体现为毫秒级日长变化。把天文测时序列与地磁记录对比，可以估算耦合力矩，进而约束核幔边界的导电性与流动状态。�4Conservation of angular momentum links the rotation of Earth's layers. Atmospheric and oceanic torques account for seasonal length-of-day changes, but decadal undulations stem mainly from angular-momentum exchange between the fluid outer core and the mantle: electromagnetic and topographic torques at the core-mantle boundary tug on the mantle, alternately spinning the solid planet faster and slower by milliseconds. Comparing astro-geodetic time series with geomagnetic records estimates the coupling torque and constrains conductivity and flow at the boundary.�ans��src�هR. Holme & O. de Viron，《日长十年际变化的特征与意义》，Nature 499卷，2013年，202-204页，DOI:10.1038/nature12282ٜR. Holme & O. de Viron, "Characterization and implications of intradecadal variations in length of day", Nature 499, 202-204 (2013), DOI:10.1038/nature12282��id�earth_23_016�body���大地震的同震位错把构造应力重新分配到邻近断层上：被加载的断层段更接近破裂，被卸载的则趋于平静，这就是库仑应力转移。计算表明，北安纳托利亚断裂自1939年起十余次强震自东向西渐进发生，多数落在先前事件造成的应力增益区内，显示断层间存在系统性相互作用，可用于中长期地震危险性评估。��In a large earthquake, coseismic slip redistributes tectonic stress onto neighbouring faults: loaded segments are driven closer to failure while unloaded ones quiet down — this is Coulomb stress transfer. Calculations show that more than ten strong earthquakes on the North Anatolian Fault since 1939 progressed westward step by step, most falling within stress-increase lobes left by earlier events, revealing systematic fault interaction that informs medium-term seismic hazard assessment.�ans��src���King, Stein & Lin《静态应力变化与地震触发》，Science 265(5174):913-918, 1994, DOI:10.1126/science.265.5174.913；Stein, Barka & Dieterich, Geophysical Journal International 128:594-604, 1997��King, Stein & Lin, "Static Stress Changes and the Triggering of Earthquakes", Science 265(5174):913-918, 1994, DOI:10.1126/science.265.5174.913; Stein, Barka & Dieterich, Geophysical Journal International 128:594-604, 1997��id�earth_23_019�body���黄土高原的风尘堆积主要靠冬季风从北方荒漠搬运：风力越强，能携带并输送到更远处的粗颗粒越多，因此粒度变粗指示冬季风增强。洛川剖面保存约250万年以来的黄土—古土壤互层，冰期黄土层粒度偏粗、间冰期古土壤层偏细，由此可定量重建第四纪冬季风的旋回式演变，并与深海氧同位素记录对比。�Loess dust reaching the Chinese Loess Plateau is transported mainly by the winter monsoon from northern deserts: stronger winds carry coarser particles farther, so coarsening grain size signals a stronger monsoon. The Luochuan section preserves some 2.5 million years of alternating loess and palaeosol layers — coarse-grained loess laid down in glacials, finer palaeosols in interglacials — enabling quantitative reconstruction of cyclic Quaternary winter-monsoon evolution that can be compared with deep-sea oxygen-isotope records.�ans��src��{Porter & An《末次冰期期间北大西洋与中国的气候事件对比》Nature 375:305-308, 1995, DOI:10.1038/375305a0ٜPorter & An, "Correlation between Climate Events in the North Atlantic and China during the Last Glaciation", Nature 375:305-308, 1995, DOI:10.1038/375305a0��id�earth_24_012�body��k答案分高度段。高空几十至几百米处,粗糙的城市地表使风速比平原显著降低,但气流被迫抬升绕行,高层建筑顶部与转角出现加速区——这就是为什么摩天楼门口常设雨棚却仍有人被突袭的阵风吹乱。街谷内部则是另一套逻辑:垂直涡旋在峡谷里滚动,地面行人高度的风速反而可能只有上空的零头;当街道走向与主导风向接近垂直时形成螺旋涡,污染物滞留;平行时则产生狭管效应,局部风速被放大。城市规划用风洞与CFD模拟优化楼群朝向与架空层,正是为了驯服这两种极端。�RIt depends on height. Aloft, rough city surfaces cut wind speeds versus open plains, yet deflected flow accelerates over rooftops and around corners — hence lobbies with canopies still ambush pedestrians with gusts. Street level runs different physics: vortices roll inside canyons, and pedestrian-level wind can be a fraction of rooftop speed; when streets lie near-perpendicular to prevailing winds a helical vortex traps pollutants, while parallel alignment funnels jet-like acceleration. Planners tame both extremes with wind tunnels and CFD, tuning building orientation and podium voids.�ans��src��hBritter 与 Hanna,《Flow and dispersion in urban areas»,Annual Review of Fluid Mechanics 第35卷,2003�lR. E. Britter and S. R. Hanna, Flow and dispersion in urban areas, Annual Review of Fluid Mechanics 35, 2003��id�earth_24_014�body���黄石地下是一个反复苏醒的岩浆系统:浅层储存着以流纹岩浆为主、混入玄武岩补给的晶粥体,约64万年前一次喷发抛出1000立方公里级物质,火山灰远达堪萨斯。如此规模的普林尼式喷发会把二氧化硫注入平流层,气溶胶反射阳光使全球均温下降数度并持续多年,农业减产才是真正的全球风险——1991年皮纳图博仅注入约2000万吨二氧化硫就压低了全球均温0.5度。监测显示黄石头顶目前以抬升与地震群著称但岩浆房大部分仍是可缓慢挤压的晶体糊,近期喷发概率极低;科学界更担心的是无人实时监测的发展中国家活火山。��Yellowstone hosts a repeatedly reawakening magmatic system: a shallow crystal-rich mush of rhyolite fed by basalt, whose caldera-forming eruption 640,000 years ago lofted on the order of a thousand cubic kilometers of material, ash reaching Kansas. A Plinian event at that scale injects sulfur dioxide into the stratosphere; sulfate aerosols reflect sunlight and cool global mean temperature by several degrees for years — agriculture, not lava, is the planetary hazard. Pinatubo alone injected about twenty megatonnes and cooled Earth half a degree. Monitoring shows uplift and earthquake swarms, but the reservoir remains mostly squishable crystal mush with negligible near-term eruption odds; scientists worry more about unmonitored volcanoes in poorer nations.�ans��src�ْSelf,《The effects and consequences of very large explosive volcanic eruptions»,Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society A 第364卷,2006ٍS. Self, The effects and consequences of very large explosive volcanic eruptions, Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society A 364, 2006��id�earth_26_002�body���直答:不是靠隔热层硬挡热量,而是转换传热方式,让路基冬季蓄冷多于夏季吸热。机理:块石路基利用块石间孔隙空气的自然对流,冬季把冷空气引入地基储存冷量,夏季孔隙空气分层稳定、对流受到抑制而少吸热;热棒内的工质在地下端吸热汽化、地面端冷凝放热,单方向把地基热量搬到大气;辅以遮阳板与通风管减弱辐射和对流吸热,最终抬高人为冻土上限,保障路基长期热稳定。�Rather than merely insulating the ground, the design shifts how heat moves so the embankment banks winter cold. Air in the voids of crushed-rock layers convects naturally in winter, drawing chill into the foundation, while summer stratification suppresses that flow. Thermosyphons act one way: working fluid evaporates at the buried end, condenses in the exposed radiator above, and dumps underground heat to the air. Sun sheds and ventilation ducts trim extra gains, raising the artificial permafrost table beneath the track.�ans��src��u程国栋等关于青藏铁路路基主动冷却措施的论文,载于《Cold Regions Science and Technology》(2008)ٍCheng G D et al., Application of the roadbed cooling approach in Qinghai-Tibet Railway engineering, Cold Regions Science and Technology, 2008��id�earth_26_010�body���直答:承压井抽取的主要是弹性储量,表现为水头整体下降而非含水层疏干,压降信号传播远且消退慢。机理:承压含水层储水系数通常仅10⁻⁵至10⁻⁴量级,单位降深释放的水量极小,满足大规模取水必须压降巨大范围,漏斗半径可达数十公里;加之弱透水层越流补给有限、侧向径流缓慢,华北平原深层水漏斗历经数十年方趋稳定。��A confined aquifer gives up mostly elastic storage: pumping lowers hydraulic head rather than draining pores, and the pressure deficit spreads widely and fades slowly. Storativity is tiny, typically 10^-5 to 10^-4, so meeting a large demand requires depressurizing a huge area, letting the cone stretch tens of kilometers. Limited leakage through confining beds and sluggish lateral flow mean recovery trails pumping cuts for decades, as the deep-water funnels of the North China Plain show.�ans��src��LFetter 所著教科书《Applied Hydrogeology》第4版(Waveland Press,2001)�CFetter C W, Applied Hydrogeology, 4th edition, Waveland Press, 2001��id�earth_26_013�body���直答:智利纵贯安第斯俯冲带上斑岩铜矿最有利的地段,兼具矿床生成与保存的双重优势,故拥有世界最大铜矿带。机理:纳斯卡板片俯冲脱水使地幔楔部分熔融,富金属岩浆上升到浅部定位冷凝,晚期岩浆热液把铜沉淀在斑岩体顶部,聚成巨型斑岩铜矿;北部极端干旱剥蚀微弱,矿床得以完好保存,加上百余年规模化开采,使智利铜产量约占全球四分之一。�Chile straddles the most favorable stretch of Andean subduction for porphyry copper, combining ideal ore generation with preservation. Dehydration of the subducting Nazca plate partially melts the mantle wedge; metal-rich magmas rise and crystallize at shallow levels, and late magmatic-hydrothermal fluids deposit copper near the porphyry apices into giant deposits. Extreme aridity in northern Chile limits erosion and preserves them, while a century of scaled-up mining makes the country supply roughly a quarter of world copper.�ans��src��]Sillitoe,《Porphyry Copper Systems》,Economic Geology,2010 (DOI: 10.2113/gsecongeo.105.1.3)�[Sillitoe, 'Porphyry Copper Systems', Economic Geology, 2010, DOI: 10.2113/gsecongeo.105.1.3��id�earth_26_019�body���早前寒武纪海洋溶有大量二价铁而整体缺氧，浅海底栖蓝细菌释放的氧一经产生便把铁氧化，沉淀出铁氧化物与燧石互层的条带状铁建造。约24亿年前的大氧化事件令大气充氧并逐渐波及深海，残余的铁转而被硫化物束缚成黄铁矿，BIF随之断绝了原料来源；直到新元古代雪球地球使海洋长期封冻、底层水重新缺氧，这类矿床才昙花一现地复发。�Early Precambrian oceans carried abundant dissolved ferrous iron under an essentially anoxic atmosphere; whatever oxygen benthic cyanobacteria released in shallow water immediately oxidized that iron, which settled as alternating iron-oxide and chert bands. The Great Oxidation Event around 2.4 billion years ago oxygenated the air and eventually the deep ocean, locking residual iron into pyrite and starving BIF of feedstock; only when Snowball Earth froze the seas and re-created anoxic bottom waters did such ores briefly return.�ans��src���A. Bekker 等,《Iron Formation: The Sedimentary Product of a Complex Interplay among Mantle, Tectonic, Oceanic, and Biospheric Processes》,Economic Geology,2010 (DOI: 10.2113/gsecongeo.105.3.467)��A. Bekker et al., 'Iron Formation: The Sedimentary Product of a Complex Interplay among Mantle, Tectonic, Oceanic, and Biospheric Processes', Economic Geology, 2010, DOI: 10.2113/gsecongeo.105.3.467��id�eb4fc7ab46c8�body�ف冬雪像被子盖住麦苗保温，冻死部分害虫和病菌；化雪又补水，所以来年春田墒情好、收成有望。�zSnow insulates wheat, kills pests and pathogens by freezing, then melts to water the fields—boosting the spring harvest.�ans��src��$中国气象局《农业气象学》�:China Meteorological Administration (CMA), Agrometeorology��id�eb548949130c�body�٦末次盛冰期约在 2.1 万年前，大量水被锁在冰盖里，全球海平面比今天低约 120 米，许多现在的海峡和大陆架当时是干的陆地。ٽThe last glacial maximum was about 21,000 years ago; with water locked in ice sheets, global sea level was roughly 120 meters lower than today, leaving many straits and shelves as dry land.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�eb5f3eb27e1b�body���大气二氧化碳约三成被海洋吸收，溶解后生成碳酸，电离出氢离子使海水pH下降，同时碳酸根浓度降低，这一过程叫海洋酸化。造壳生物和珊瑚靠碳酸钙构筑外壳与骨骼，碳酸根减少使钙化难度增大、甚至开始溶解；实验室与野外研究都显示高CO2环境下的钙化速率下降。工业革命以来海水pH已下降约0.1个单位，相当于酸度升高约30%，对未来海洋生态系统构成长期压力。�hThe ocean absorbs about a third of human CO2 emissions; the gas dissolves and forms carbonic acid, which releases hydrogen ions and lowers pH while consuming carbonate ions—that is ocean acidification. Shell-forming organisms and corals build their shells and skeletons from calcium carbonate; with fewer carbonate ions, calcification becomes harder and existing structures may even dissolve. Lab and field studies both show slower calcification under high CO2. Since the Industrial Revolution, surface pH has fallen by about 0.1 units, roughly a 30% rise in acidity, placing long-term stress on marine ecosystems.�ans��src�ِZachos 等《Rapid acidification》（2005，Science）；McInerney 与 Wing《PETM》（2011，Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences）�YZachos et al., Rapid acidification (2005, Science); McInerney & Wing, PETM (2011, ARA&PS)��id�ebb0ab761af2�body��N冰雪反射大部分入射阳光，使地表吸收的热量减少；当气候变暖使冰雪退缩，暴露出的暗色海岩或土壤吸收更多热量，进一步升温。这一正反馈会放大初始的温度扰动，使冰期和间冰期的变化更剧烈。布迪科在1969年的能量平衡模型最早量化了这一机制。�hSnow and ice reflect most incoming sunlight, so less heat is absorbed; when warming retreats the ice, darker ocean or soil is exposed and absorbs more heat, raising temperatures further. This positive feedback amplifies the initial disturbance, sharpening glacial-interglacial swings. Budyko first quantified the mechanism with an energy-balance model in 1969.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ebc0963d956c�body��地震波给出两条证据：S波不能穿过外核，表明其为液态；而穿过地心的P波（PKIKP）表现出可被固态介质解释的异常，提示内核为固态。丹麦地震学家莱曼（Inge Lehmann）于1936年据此发现了固态内核。�;Seismology provides two lines of evidence: S-waves cannot cross the outer core (hence it is liquid), while P-waves that pass through the center (PKIKP phase) show anomalies consistent with a solid, indicating a solid inner core. Danish seismologist Inge Lehmann inferred the solid inner core from such data in 1936.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�ec8c161a93a1�body�ً冻土是长期温度在0℃以下、含冰的土壤或岩石，主要分布在高纬度和高海拔地区，融化会释放温室气体。ٍPermafrost is soil or rock that stays below 0°C and contains ice, mainly in high latitudes and altitudes; thawing releases greenhouse gases.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ed68f9715f18�body�ِ海水沿裂缝渗入地壳被岩浆加热，携带着硫化物等从喷口喷出，形成“黑烟囱”，滋养不靠阳光的生态系统。ٛSeawater seeps into crust, is heated by magma and rises through vents carrying sulfides, forming 'black smokers' that feed sunlight-independent ecosystems.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�edae21934c6d�body�ِ包括直接空气捕集、生物质能结合碳封存、海洋施肥和植树等，目标是把大气二氧化碳重新移走以抵消排放。ٔApproaches include direct air capture, bioenergy with carbon storage, ocean fertilization and reforestation, aiming to pull CO2 back out of the air.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ef362db3eb25�body���均衡回弹是地壳在冰盖消融卸载后缓慢抬升的过程，如斯堪的纳维亚至今仍以每年约1厘米上升。更新世反复冰进冰退不仅刻蚀出冰蚀湖与鼓丘，还改变了海岸线与河流基准面。�Isostatic rebound is the slow uplift of crust after the weight of an ice sheet is removed, as seen in Scandinavia still rising about 1 cm per year. Repeated Pleistocene glaciations carved glacial lakes and drumlins and shifted coastlines and river base levels.�ans��src��4Press & Siever《理解地球》第6版（Freeman）�CPress, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth (6th ed., W.H. Freeman)��id�eff4afd87f92�body���气候反馈指初始扰动引发的次级变化反过来放大或削弱原扰动的过程。水汽增加和水冰反照率降低属于正反馈，会加速变暖；云和植物吸收可能呈负反馈。反馈强度决定气候对排放的敏感度。�^A climate feedback is a process where an initial disturbance triggers secondary changes that amplify or dampen the original disturbance. More water vapor and lower ice albedo are positive feedbacks that accelerate warming, while some clouds and plant uptake may act as negative feedbacks. Feedback strength sets how sensitive climate is to emissions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f0190782dbe1�body���三角洲由河流带入的泥沙在河口分汊堆积，其层序中进积与退积旋回记录了海平面升降与物源供给的此消彼长，并保存有分流河道、潮汐与风暴沉积。高频层序对比可重建全新世海岸线迁移。�5Deltas build where river-borne sediment splits and deposits at the mouth; their sequences of progradation and retrogradation record the interplay of sea-level change and sediment supply, preserving distributary, tidal, and storm deposits. High-resolution correlation reconstructs Holocene shoreline migration.�ans��src��E《自然-地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 三角洲沉积动力学�.Nature Geoscience (Delta sedimentary dynamics)��id�f08f15130cb8�body��Z因为冰量变化与辐射强迫之间存在强烈的正反馈：冰面反照率反馈、大气CO₂反馈（冰期时深海储碳释放）以及冰面高度—温度耦合（冰面越高越冷、融化越慢，冰面一旦降低融化即加速）。冰消通常由轨道参数组合触发，当北半球高纬夏季太阳辐射达到峰值，冰盖边缘开始融化，上述正反馈便像雪崩一样加速融化。快速融冰还向北大西洋注入大量淡水，进一步扰动气候，使冰消期在数千年内完成，而冰进因反馈方向相反、积累缓慢，往往需要数万年。�␀Because strong positive feedbacks couple ice volume to radiative forcing: the ice-albedo feedback, atmospheric CO₂ feedback (release of deep-ocean carbon stored during glacials), and the height–temperature coupling of ice sheets (higher, colder surfaces melt slowly; once they lower, melting accelerates). Deglaciation is usually triggered by orbital configurations that maximize summer insolation in northern high latitudes; once ice margins start melting, these feedbacks accelerate the melt like an avalanche. Rapid melt also injects large amounts of freshwater into the North Atlantic, further perturbing climate, so deglaciation completes within millennia, whereas ice advance—with feedbacks operating in reverse—accumulates slowly over tens of millennia.�ans��src��*Nature（冰期—间冰期反馈研究）�/Nature (glacial-interglacial feedback research)��id�f1143666b3d9�body��ENSO是热带太平洋海气耦合系统中最重要的年际气候信号，包含暖位的厄尔尼诺和冷位的拉尼娜。南方涛动指赤道太平洋东西两侧海平面气压的反向跷跷板变化。ENSO通过遥相关影响全球许多地区的降水和温度。��ENSO is the most important year-to-year climate signal in the tropical Pacific ocean-atmosphere coupled system, comprising the warm El Nino phase and the cold La Nina phase. The Southern Oscillation refers to the seesaw in sea-level air pressure between the eastern and western equatorial Pacific. Through teleconnections ENSO influences rainfall and temperature in many regions worldwide.�ans��src�ُTimmermann, A. 等，《El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity》，Nature 第559卷535–545页，2018年，DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6وTimmermann, A. et al., El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity, Nature, vol. 559, pp. 535–545, 2018, DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6��id�f16439c1cf8f�body�ٴ海啸是海底突然升降（多由俯冲带地震引起）推动整列海水形成的长周期巨浪。它在深海波高小但速度快，近岸时波高骤增，破坏力强。��A tsunami is a long-period giant wave train generated when the seafloor suddenly rises or drops, usually from a subduction-zone quake, displacing the water column. In deep sea it is low but fast, then surges high near shore with great destructive power.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f1a18e929b41�body���地幔对流是板块运动的重要动力来源：上升流处岩浆涌出形成洋中脊，下沉流（常配合俯冲）带动岩石圈，但板块运动还叠加了板片拖曳等力的作用。ٿMantle convection is a key driver of plate motion: upwelling feeds mid-ocean ridges and downwelling (with subduction) drags the lithosphere, though slab pull and other forces also contribute.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f340e60f099a�body���面波由体波到达地表后激发，比最慢的S波还慢，因而震图上来得最晚、拖尾最长。能量锁在浅表、只朝水平扩散，不像体波在三维摊开，故随距离衰减慢，远震那种悠长晃动多半出自它。形态两种：勒夫波水平剪切、地面左右扭动；瑞利波质点在竖直面内画椭圆、如同滚浪。它振幅大、周期长，是低层房屋破坏的主因；但随深度衰减，深源地震仍以体波为主。�Surface waves are generated where body waves reach the free surface. They travel slower than even the slowest S-wave, so they arrive last on a seismogram and trail the longest. Their energy is trapped near the surface and spreads only horizontally instead of through three dimensions, so they weaken with distance far more slowly; the long rolling shake of a distant quake is mostly theirs. There are two forms: Love waves are horizontal shear, the ground wriggling side to side, while Rayleigh waves make particles trace ellipses in the vertical plane, like rolling surf. Their amplitude is large and their period long, which is what does most damage to low-rise buildings, but they die out with depth, so records of deep earthquakes are still dominated by body waves.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f4c9e6f189ae�body���极地放大效应指北极和南极的变暖速度明显快于全球平均，其中北极尤为突出。这与海冰消融后反射率下降、更多海水吸收热量等反馈机制有关。��Polar amplification means the Arctic and Antarctic warm faster than the global average, with the Arctic especially pronounced. It relates to feedbacks such as reduced reflectivity after sea-ice loss, letting more ocean water absorb heat.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f762b65d99b0�body���水渗进岩石裂隙，结冰时体积膨胀约 9%，把缝壁向外顶；反复穿越冰点，裂口像楔子越凿越深，岩石被剥成棱角分明的碎块。融水带走细粒，石块沿坡面下爬，铺出石海、石河这类冰缘地貌。要紧的是「反复」：常年深冻里水早已冻实，几乎不再做功，作用最强的是冷暖来回过零的地带。它也有别于冰川磨蚀：一个原地敲碎岩石，一个靠移动的冰体切削。��Water seeps into cracks in rock, and freezing expands it by about 9%, pushing the walls apart; repeated cycles through the freezing point drive the wedge deeper and spall the rock into angular fragments. Meltwater washes the fine material away while blocks creep down the slope, laying out block fields and stone streams. What matters is the repetition: ground locked in a permanent deep freeze has already turned its water to ice and does little work, so the action is strongest where temperatures cross the freezing point again and again. It also differs from glacial abrasion—one shatters rock in place, the other cuts with ice that is moving.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f81ad54795dc�body��E南极冬季极夜中，极涡把南极上空与外界隔离，温度降至约-80°C以下，形成极地平流层云；云粒表面发生非均相反应，把惰性的氯储存库（HCl、ClONO₂）转化为活性氯，同时氮被固定在云粒中不再消耗氯。春季阳光回归后，光化学反应迅速消耗臭氧形成臭氧洞；夏季极涡消散，中纬度臭氧向极地输送补充，臭氧洞愈合。极地平流层云需要低于约-78°C才能形成，北极因极涡较弱、温度较高且地形扰动大，通常不会出现如此严重的臭氧损耗。��During Antarctic winter, the polar vortex isolates the region and temperatures fall below about -80°C, forming polar stratospheric clouds; heterogeneous reactions on their particles convert inert chlorine reservoirs (HCl, ClONO₂) into active chlorine while nitrogen is sequestered so it no longer deactivates chlorine. When spring sunlight returns, photochemistry rapidly destroys ozone, producing the hole; in summer the vortex breaks down and mid-latitude ozone is transported poleward, healing the hole. Because polar stratospheric clouds require temperatures below about -78°C, the Arctic—with a weaker vortex, higher temperatures, and stronger planetary-wave disturbance—rarely suffers comparable ozone loss.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�f865843e30ce�body��高温多雨条件下硅酸盐矿物被强烈水解，盐基离子（K、Na、Ca、Mg）和硅被大量淋失，难溶的铁铝氧化物（赤铁矿、三水铝石）相对富集，赤铁矿使土壤呈红色。这类高度风化的砖红壤因盐基被淋失而呈酸性、肥力较低，植被主要依赖表层的有机质与养分循环。深部的铁铝氧化物还能吸附固定磷和重金属，影响养分有效性，同时这些土壤封存着大量稳定的有机质，是理解热带碳库与成土过程的关键。��Under high temperature and rainfall, silicate minerals hydrolyze intensely; base cations (K, Na, Ca, Mg) and silica are largely leached away, while insoluble iron and aluminum oxides (hematite, gibbsite) concentrate, hematite giving the soil its red color. These highly weathered lateritic soils are acidic and low in fertility because bases have been stripped out, so vegetation depends mainly on surface organic matter and nutrient cycling. Deep iron-aluminum oxides also adsorb and fix phosphorus and heavy metals, controlling nutrient availability, while these soils store large amounts of stabilized organic matter—key to understanding tropical carbon pools and pedogenesis.�ans��src��-中国科学院（热带土壤风化研究）�?Chinese Academy of Sciences (tropical soil weathering research)��id�f8e388a4ed33�body��1地球轨道的偏心率（约10万年）、地轴倾角（约4.1万年）和岁差（约2.3万年）周期性改变各纬度的夏季日照量，进而调制北半球冰盖的消长。这些轨道强迫与冰芯和海洋沉积中的同位素记录高度吻合，是第四纪冰期旋回的主控因素。�RPeriodic changes in Earth's orbital eccentricity (about 100 kyr), axial tilt (about 41 kyr), and precession (about 23 kyr) alter summer insolation by latitude and thereby modulate Northern Hemisphere ice sheets. These orbital forcings match isotopic records in ice and ocean sediments and are the main driver of Quaternary glacial cycles.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f95b3ee547df�body���露点是在恒定气压下空气冷却到饱和、开始凝结出水汽所对应的温度，反映空气中实际的水汽含量。露点越高说明空气越潮湿，当气温降至露点以下时常出现雾、露或云。�The dew point is the temperature to which air must cool at constant pressure to become saturated and begin condensing moisture, reflecting its actual water vapor content. A higher dew point means more humid air, and when air temperature drops to the dew point, fog, dew, or clouds form.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�fa0e65b6f632�body�ٙ东风带把撒哈拉富含铁磷的粉尘跨大西洋吹到南美，为亚马孙雨林补给流失的矿物养分，是跨洲生物地球化学联系。ٮTrade winds carry iron- and phosphorus-rich Sahara dust across the Atlantic to South America, replenishing nutrients the Amazon loses—a cross-continent biogeochemical link.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�fa4cbb65199e�body��	eDNA技术从水体和土壤样本中测序生物脱落的DNA以识别物种组成，遥感则提供大尺度栖息地结构（如水温、浊度、植被）。两者融合可在景观尺度上关联物种分布与环境变量，提升生物多样性监测效率。�3eDNA sequencing identifies species from DNA shed into water and soil, while remote sensing supplies large-scale habitat structure such as water temperature, turbidity, and vegetation. Fusing the two links species distributions to environmental variables across landscapes, improving biodiversity monitoring.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�faa74feae866�body���AMOC将表层暖水北送、将深层冷水南返，向高纬度输送大量热量，是西欧气候温和的重要原因。其减弱会改变热量与碳的经向输送，并可能触发区域降温与海平面重新分布。�"The AMOC carries warm surface water northward and returns cold deep water southward, transporting enormous heat to high latitudes and keeping Western Europe mild. Its weakening would alter meridional heat and carbon transport and could trigger regional cooling and sea-level redistribution.�ans��src��bRahmstorf S., Ocean circulation and climate during the past 120,000 years, Nature, 2002, 419(6903)�nRahmstorf, S. (2002). Ocean circulation and climate during the past 120,000 years. Nature, 419(6903), 207-214.��id�fc9811be66f5�body�ِ海水与地幔橄榄岩反应产生富氢流体和甲烷，为早期生命提供能量与有机物，类似深海热液生态的化学基础。ٖSeawater reacting with mantle rock yields hydrogen-rich fluids and methane, supplying energy and organics for early life like hydrothermal ecosystems.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�fd84e09be308�body��'根据碳收支，人为排放的部分 CO₂ 未在已知通量中解释清楚，差额即“遗失的碳汇”。大气反演与清查表明，陆地（植被与土壤）与海洋大致各吸收约四分之一的人为排放，其余留存大气。厘清其分布对预测变暖至关重要。�CIn the carbon budget, some anthropogenic CO₂ is unaccounted for by known fluxes—the missing sink. Atmospheric inversions and inventories show land (vegetation and soils) and ocean each absorb roughly a quarter of emissions, the rest staying in the atmosphere. Resolving its distribution is vital for projecting warming.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�fe66b1685742�body�٩把地球当作反射约 30% 阳光的黑球，仅靠辐射平衡算出的有效温度约 -18°C；而实际因为有温室效应，平均约 15°C，相差约 33 度。��Treating Earth as a blackbody reflecting about 30% of sunlight gives an effective temperature near -18°C; the actual ~15°C average is about 33 degrees warmer because of the greenhouse effect.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�ff1159e6d582�body�ٱ它们都是刚玉（氧化铝），本身无色；只因混入了极少的微量元素——红宝石靠铬显红，蓝宝石靠铁和钛显蓝，所以“同矿不同色”。��Both are corundum (aluminum oxide), colorless by itself; trace elements tint them—chromium makes ruby red, iron and titanium make sapphire blue—so it's the same mineral in different colors.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�ff8fe4911f8a�body��/地震波在温度较低、密度较高的物质中速度更快。通过记录全球地震波的走时异常，层析成像重建地幔三维速度结构：高速异常对应冷的下沉俯冲板片，低速异常对应炽热的上涌地幔柱。这一方法为地幔对流提供了直接成像证据。�CSeismic waves travel faster through cooler, denser material. By measuring travel-time anomalies of global earthquakes, tomography reconstructs the mantle's 3D velocity structure: fast anomalies mark cold descending slabs, slow anomalies mark hot upwelling plumes. This provides direct imaging evidence of mantle convection.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�0296d80e5723�body���逆温指气温随高度升高而增加、与通常递减相反的大气层结。它像一个盖子抑制空气上下交换，使污染物在近地面积聚，易形成雾霾。冬季晴朗静风的夜晚辐射逆温尤为常见。�-A temperature inversion is a layer in which temperature increases with height, opposite to the usual decrease. It acts like a lid that suppresses vertical mixing, letting pollutants accumulate near the ground and fostering haze. Radiation inversions are especially common on clear, calm winter nights.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�1dbbebbd0b07�body���河流基准面是河流下切所能达到的最低侵蚀面，通常以海平面为其终极基准面。局部基准面可以是湖泊或坚硬岩层。基准面下降会加剧下切，上升则促进堆积。�The base level of a river is the lowest erosion surface it can cut down to, with sea level as the ultimate base level. A local base level can be a lake or a resistant rock layer. A falling base level intensifies downcutting, while a rising one promotes deposition.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1e57aed3b412�body��#蓝碳指滨海和海洋生态系统（如红树林、海草床和盐沼）通过光合作用固定并长期埋藏的碳。这些栖息地单位面积固碳效率很高，且碳可封存于沉积物中数百年。保护和恢复蓝碳生态系统被视为应对气候变化的自然方案。�TBlue carbon is the carbon fixed by coastal and marine ecosystems such as mangroves, seagrass beds, and salt marshes through photosynthesis and buried long term. These habitats sequester carbon very efficiently per area, and the carbon can stay in sediments for centuries. Protecting and restoring them is seen as a natural climate solution.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�1f1eb24e174d�body���承压水存在于两个不透水层之间的含水层中，承受静水压力，水位可高于含水层顶板。打井穿透顶板后，水可自流涌出，称为自流井。承压水受污染较慢但一旦污染更难恢复。�0Confined groundwater sits in an aquifer sandwiched between two impermeable layers and is under hydrostatic pressure, so its level can rise above the aquifer's roof. When a well pierces the cap, water may flow out by itself, an artesian well. It is slow to pollute but harder to recover once contaminated.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6e3ece9403c9�body��验潮站通过固定在岸边的标尺、浮筒或压力传感器持续记录相对于陆地的海平面高度。现代验潮站常与 GPS 联用，以扣除陆地升降的影响。长期序列还能揭示海平面趋势、潮汐和风暴增水的变化。�4Tide gauges measure sea level relative to the land using fixed staffs, floats, or pressure sensors that record water height continuously. Modern gauges are often combined with GPS to remove the effect of land uplift or subsidence. Long records also reveal trends as well as changes in tides and storm surges.�ans��src��?Church & White（2011）《地球物理调查》海平面研究�uChurch, J.A. & White, N.J. (2011), Sea-level rise from the late 19th to the early 21st century, Surveys in Geophysics��id�c4a439b781cd�body��疯狗浪指波高明显超过周围波浪、出现概率远低于常规统计预期的孤立巨浪。它可由多个波列叠加、海流与地形作用或风暴中的非线性效应产生。历史上曾造成船只突然断裂，因此是航海安全的重要研究课题。��A rogue wave is an isolated giant wave whose height greatly exceeds the surrounding waves and whose occurrence is far rarer than conventional statistics predict. It can arise from the superposition of several wave trains, the effect of currents and topography, or nonlinear processes during storms. It has historically caused ships to break apart suddenly and is an important topic in maritime safety.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c947def55e9b�body���林线是树木能够生长的最高海拔界线，主要由低温限制决定。气候变暖使适宜温度带向高处移动，树木逐渐上侵、林线抬升。但若伴随干旱或雪被减少，部分地区的林线反而可能下降。�6The tree line is the highest elevation where trees can grow, set mainly by low-temperature limits. Warming shifts the suitable temperature belt upward, so trees gradually invade higher ground and the line rises. But with accompanying drought or reduced snow cover, tree lines in some regions may actually fall.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�d6c48112713c�body���河流袭夺指一条河流因侵蚀更强，切穿分水岭把另一条河的源头或上游夺为己有的现象。被袭夺河的水量骤减，原河道可能留下风口等遗迹。它是构造与侵蚀共同塑造水系格局的典型过程。�;River capture is when one stream, by eroding more vigorously, cuts through a divide and diverts the headwaters or upper course of another river into itself. The captured river loses flow abruptly and may leave relics such as a wind gap. It is a classic process where tectonics and erosion reshape drainage patterns.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e38b04995a88�body���温盐环流由海水的温度（热）和盐度（盐）差异造成密度差驱动：北大西洋冷水下沉，沿深海流向全球，再缓慢上升，完成一圈往往要上千年，像一条在海洋里循环几千年的传送带。�Thermohaline circulation is driven by density differences from temperature and salinity: cold dense water sinks in the North Atlantic, flows through the deep ocean worldwide, and slowly rises again, taking over a thousand years per loop—hence the 'global conveyor belt'.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_26_006�body���直答:因为地下冰常以厚层纯冰形式富集,一旦暴露便触发自增强的热侵蚀,塌陷地形又会持续蓄水聚热。机理:高含冰量地层融化后体积亏空,地表塌成积水洼地;湖水吸热远多于冻土且向下传导更快,湖底融区逐年加深加宽,岸坡不断再塌落;即使气温趋稳,重塑后的湖盆已改变地温场,重新冻结需数百年以上。��Massive ground ice makes thaw self-reinforcing. Ice-rich layers lose volume as they melt, collapsing into water-filled hollows; ponded water absorbs far more heat than frozen soil and passes it downward efficiently, so the thaw bulb under a lake deepens and widens while shorelines keep slumping. Even once air temperatures stabilize, the reshaped basin holds heat, and refreezing would take centuries.�ans��src�قWalter Anthony 等发表于《Nature Communications》的论文,关于湖下突变融化加速二十一世纪冻土碳排放(2018)ّWalter Anthony K M et al., 21st-century modeled permafrost carbon emissions accelerated by abrupt thaw beneath lakes, Nature Communications, 2018��id�f709c3ffc6fc�body��海洋因温度、盐度差异在垂直方向上分成表层混合层、温跃层和深层水，称为海洋分层。温跃层是温度随深度急剧下降的薄层，像盖子一样阻碍上下层交换。分层强弱影响营养盐供给和碳的垂直输送。�iThe ocean is vertically divided by temperature and salinity into a surface mixed layer, a thermocline, and deep water, a structure called stratification. The thermocline is a thin layer where temperature drops sharply with depth and acts like a lid limiting exchange between layers. Stratification strength affects nutrient supply and vertical carbon transport.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�f8b74ce34907�body�ي三片在效率和稳定之间最划算：太多会增加重量和阻力，太少则转得不稳、噪音大，三片既省力又安静。ٍThree blades balance efficiency and stability: more add weight and drag, fewer spin unsteadily and noisily, so three is economical and quiet.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7014681825a0�body���黄石位于美国西北部，是一座巨大的火山口（破火山口），曾在历史上发生过数次超级喷发。虽然目前以间歇泉和地热活动为主，科学家仍持续监测其下方岩浆系统的变化。��Yellowstone in the northwestern United States is a huge caldera that has produced several supereruptions in the past. Though now known for geysers and geothermal activity, scientists keep monitoring changes in the magma system beneath it.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�72d30fe8902e�body�َ铀-235原子核裂变释放巨大热能，把水烧开成蒸汽，蒸汽推动涡轮发电。关键在于用控制棒调节裂变的快慢。ّUranium-235 nuclei split and release huge heat that boils water into steam to spin turbines. Control rods regulate how fast the fission proceeds.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a971fe1edd8c�body���树木每年形成一圈年轮，其宽窄反映当年的水热条件：温暖湿润年轮宽，寒冷干旱则窄。通过年轮定年与序列比对，可重建数百年甚至上千年的区域气候史。�Trees add one ring per year, and its width reflects that year's temperature and moisture: warm, wet years yield wide rings, cold or dry years narrow ones. By dating and matching ring sequences, scientists reconstruct regional climate histories of centuries to millennia.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ea351a2af389�body�٢页岩气是藏在致密页岩缝隙里的天然气。因为岩石太密、气体跑不出，要把水混砂高压压入岩层造出裂缝，气体才能流出。ٮShale gas is natural gas trapped in tight shale. The rock is too dense for gas to escape, so water mixed with sand is pumped in at high pressure to crack it and free the gas.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_26_017�body���主控因子是西太平洋副热带高压：主雨带始终位于副高西北侧边缘，即暖湿夏季风气流与北方冷空气交绥的锋区。随季节推进，副高先后发生两次突然北跳：六月中旬一跳把雨带从华南推至江淮形成梅雨，七月中旬又一跳将其送入华北。副高跳跃与东亚高空西风急流的两次北撤同步，属环流场整体调整中的突变，故雨带呈台阶状而非连续北移。�The controlling factor is the western Pacific subtropical high: the main rainband hugs its northwestern flank, where moist monsoon flow converges against cooler continental air. As the season progresses the high makes two abrupt northward jumps — in mid-June shifting the band from South China to the Yangtze valley as Meiyu, and in mid-July pushing it into North China. Both jumps coincide with stepwise retreat of the East Asian westerly jet, so the rainband climbs like a staircase rather than sliding smoothly.�ans��src�ٍ陶诗言、陈隆勋,A Review of Recent Research on the East Asian Summer Monsoon in China,载Monsoon Meteorology,牛津大学出版社,1987ِS. Tao and L. Chen, A Review of Recent Research on the East Asian Summer Monsoon in China, in Monsoon Meteorology, Oxford University Press, 1987��id�01618e4576d9�body�٥它用两种菱形就能铺满平面却绝不出现周期性重复，且具有五重旋转对称。这种‘准晶体’结构后来在真实材料中得到印证。ٸIt tiles the plane with just two rhombus shapes yet never repeats periodically, and shows fivefold rotational symmetry. Such 'quasicrystal' structure was later found in real materials.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�0278dcaddc61�body�١把abc写成abcabc，等于abc×1001，而1001=7×11×13。所以无论想什么三位数，重复后都能被这三个数整除，魔术师据此猜出原数。٧Writing abc as abcabc equals abc×1001, and 1001=7×11×13. So whatever 3-digit number you pick, the repeat is divisible by all three, letting the magician recover it.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�050bc5d99e1b�body�ل不会，大数定律只保证长期平均收敛，短期波动仍可能很大。样本越多，比例才越稳定地贴近真值。ٕNo; it only guarantees long-run convergence of the average. Short-term fluctuations can still be large, and stability improves only with more trials.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�064376e7c687�body�٠1642年法国数学家帕斯卡为帮父亲算税，造出能加减的齿轮式计算器帕斯卡计算器。它开启了用机器代替手工计算的浪潮。٣In 1642 the French mathematician Pascal built a geared adding-subtracting machine to help his tax-collector father. It launched the wave of mechanical calculation.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�07262531f2f8�body�٨答案是圆。平面上给定周长的所有闭曲线中，圆围成面积最大；反之给定面积时圆周长最短。它可用变分法或对称化严格证明。��The answer is the circle: among all closed curves with fixed perimeter, the circle encloses the maximum area, and conversely it minimizes perimeter for fixed area. Proved via calculus of variations or symmetrization.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�07a3d81c4928�body��h微积分围绕两个互逆的核心问题：求瞬时变化率（导数）与求曲线下面积/累积量（积分）。牛顿从物理学运动问题出发，莱布尼茨独立发明并确立了至今仍在使用的积分号 ∫ 与微分记号。两人各自的发现引发了优先权之争，但微积分后来成为现代科学与工程的通用语言。��Calculus centers on two inverse problems: finding instantaneous rates of change (derivatives) and finding areas/cumulative quantities under curves (integrals). Newton approached it from motion in physics, while Leibniz independently invented it and introduced the integral sign ∫ and differential notation still used today. Their separate discoveries triggered a priority dispute, but calculus became the universal language of modern science and engineering.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�07cb4d1833ff�body�٥它忽略长度、角度、面积等度量，只保留连通性、孔洞、边界等连续形变下不变的性质。三角形可被拉成圆，二者拓扑等价。��It ignores lengths, angles, and areas, keeping only properties like connectivity, holes, and boundaries that survive continuous deformation. A triangle can be stretched into a circle — topologically they match.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�099cf9e4f920�body���问题是能否不重复地走遍七座桥。欧拉把陆地化为点、桥化为线，发现若存在这样的走法，每个点必须经偶数次桥；而七桥图中奇点数为4，故不可能。这开创了图论。�The question was whether one could cross all seven bridges without repeating any. Euler reduced land to vertices and bridges to edges, noting a required walk needs every vertex of even degree; the graph had four odd vertices, so impossible. This founded graph theory.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�0bf9ae1d0762�body�ـ任意三角形的三个内角之和总是 180 度。例如等边三角形的每个角都是 60 度，加起来正好 180 度。ٯThe three interior angles of any triangle always add up to 180 degrees. For example, each angle of an equilateral triangle is 60 degrees, and together they sum to 180 degrees.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�0e7d235adf30�body�٫视网膜上对应的视锥细胞因持续刺激而疲劳，看白纸时疲劳通道反应减弱、互补通道相对增强，于是出现互补色（红对绿）后像。ٯThe stimulated cones fatigue; on a white surface the tired channel responds less while its complementary channel dominates, producing a complementary (red→green) afterimage.�ans��src��=Wandell, K. A.，《Foundations of Vision》，Sinauer，1995�4Wandell, K. A., Foundations of Vision, Sinauer, 1995��id�1138ab41aa37�body�ٮ从一个实心三角形开始，挖掉中央倒三角，再对剩下的三个小三角重复同样操作，无限做下去就得到处处有洞的谢尔宾斯基三角形。ٶStart with a solid triangle, remove the central upside-down one, then repeat on the three remaining smaller triangles; infinite repetition yields the hole-filled Sierpinski triangle.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�13aa7a8c4358�body��M中位数是把数据按大小排序后位于正中间的那个数，而平均数是所有数的和除以个数。当数据中存在极大或极小的异常值时，中位数比平均数更能代表“典型”水平。例如收入数据中少数富豪会大幅拉高平均收入，此时中位数更贴近多数人的实际情况。�[The median is the middle value when the data are sorted from smallest to largest, while the mean is the sum divided by the count. When extreme outliers exist, the median represents the typical level better than the mean. For instance, a few very wealthy people can inflate average income, so the median is closer to what most people actually earn.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�15bb2e06fa25�body�ٙ标准骰子把1对6、2对5、3对4，这样无论怎么放，六面之和都平衡，滚动更公平也更对称。这是一种巧妙的对称设计。ٞA standard die pairs 1–6, 2–5, 3–4, so opposite faces sum to 7; this balances the six sides for fairer, more symmetric rolling. A neat symmetric design.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�16e55a062e5a�body�ّ拓扑只关心连续形变下的不变性质，杯身加把手可连续捏成环面，二者都有一个洞（亏格1）。所以它们同胚。ٵTopology cares only about properties preserved under continuous deformation; a mug with a handle can be squished into a torus, both having one hole (genus 1). They are homeomorphic.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�186996f8f688�body�ً100元降50%剩50元，再涨50%只是75元，因为基数变了。涨跌百分比不对称，这是复利与相对变化的基本陷阱。٦100 down 50% leaves 50; up 50% then is only 75, because the base changed. Percentage gains and losses are asymmetric, a basic trap in compounding and relative change.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�18feff1d61f5�body��#折线图把数据点按某种顺序（通常是时间）用线段依次连接，用来展示数值随时间变化的趋势。它适合表现增长、下降或周期性波动，例如气温变化或股价走势。与散点图不同，折线图强调“顺序和变化”而非两两关系。�A line chart connects data points in sequence, usually over time, with line segments to show how a value trends. It suits growth, decline, or periodic fluctuation, such as temperature or stock prices. Unlike a scatter plot, it emphasizes order and change rather than pairwise relations.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�1e40ebe8e5b5�body��故事说第 1 格放 1 粒、第 2 格 2 粒、每格翻倍，到第 64 格就是 2⁶³ 粒，全部合计约 2⁶⁴−1 ≈ 1.8×10¹⁹ 粒，超过全球年产量。它用国际象棋 64 格讲清了“指数增长”的威力，是数学文化里最经典的指数爆炸例子。�.The tale places 1 grain on square 1, 2 on square 2, doubling each time; square 64 alone holds 2⁶³ grains, and the total is about 2⁶⁴−1 ≈ 1.8×10¹⁹—more than world annual output. Using the chessboard's 64 squares, it shows the power of exponential growth, a classic math-culture example.�ans��src��BKraitchik, M., 《数学趣题》(Mathematical Recreations), Dover�0Kraitchik, M., 'Mathematical Recreations', Dover��id�1eb0deb93bee�body�ٔ它猜想每个大于2的偶数都能写成两个素数之和。已对极大范围被计算机验证，但仍未被证明，是著名未解难题。٥It conjectures every even number greater than 2 is the sum of two primes. Verified computationally for enormous ranges, but still unproven — a famous open problem.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2af159f23b51�body��I欧几里得在《几何原本》第九卷中用反证法证明了素数无穷多：假设只有有限个素数，把它们全部相乘再加 1，所得的新数要么本身是新的素数，要么含有不在原列表中的素因子，从而与假设矛盾。这个简洁的证明至今仍是数学中最优美的论证之一。�YEuclid proved in Book IX of the Elements by contradiction that primes are infinite: if you assume finitely many primes, multiply them all and add 1, the result is either itself a new prime or has a prime factor not in the original list, contradicting the assumption. This elegant argument remains one of the most beautiful proofs in mathematics.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2b0eea912739�body�٦二维码内置里德-所罗门纠错码，把数据编码成可冗余恢复的形式。即使部分模块污损，解码器也能靠冗余信息还原原始数据。ٰQR codes embed Reed-Solomon error correction, encoding data redundantly. Even if some modules are damaged, the decoder reconstructs the original from the redundant information.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�2c1533832b95�body��]质数（素数）是大于1且只能被1和自身整除的自然数，例如2、3、5、7。�qA prime number is a natural number greater than 1 whose only positive divisors are 1 and itself, e.g. 2, 3, 5, 7.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2db4be3116c8�body���黄金比例 φ ≈ 1.618 是方程 φ = 1 + 1/φ 的正解，即把一条线段分成大小两段，使整段与长段之比等于长段与短段之比。它确实出现在正五边形、斐波那契数列的极限比以及一些自然生长模式中，但许多关于它在艺术和人体中「普遍存在」的说法被过度渲染。它更多地是一个优美而真实的数论与几何常数。��The golden ratio φ ≈ 1.618 is the positive solution of φ = 1 + 1/φ, dividing a segment so the whole-to-large equals large-to-small. It genuinely appears in regular pentagons, the limiting ratio of Fibonacci numbers, and some natural growth patterns, but many claims of its ubiquity in art and the human body are exaggerated. It is best seen as an elegant, real constant of number theory and geometry.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�348dd57dd493�body�ٽ它画出一个前端有三个圆柱、后端却只有两个圆柱的物体，靠局部合理的透视拼接出全局矛盾。大脑按二维线索强行解读，于是产生不可能感。��It depicts an object with three cylindrical prongs at one end but only two at the other, built from locally consistent perspectives that conflict globally. The brain forces a reading and senses the impossibility.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�383610ec355a�body�ي百分数（%）表示一个数占另一个数的百分之几，也就是分母为 100 的分数。例如 50% 等于 50/100，即一半。ٚA percentage (%) expresses a number as a fraction of 100, that is, a fraction whose denominator is 100. For example, 50% equals 50/100, which is one half.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�383b48b0293b�body�٥两个图形如果形状相同但大小可以不同，就称为相似，对应角相等、对应边成比例。例如地图上的图形与实地图形通常相似。��Two figures are called similar if they have the same shape but may differ in size, with equal corresponding angles and proportional corresponding sides. For example, a map and the real terrain it represents are usually similar.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�38a4265b391a�body�ٖ不一定。地湿可能是下雨，也可能是洒水、泼水等原因。不能由结果反推唯一原因（这是“肯定后件”的谬误）。�sNot necessarily; wet ground could come from sprinklers or spills, not only rain (affirming the consequent fallacy).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�3c17322bf359�body�ه是的。硬币没有记忆，每次抛掷相互独立，之前的结果不影响下一次。觉得该出反面了，是赌徒谬误。َYes. A coin has no memory; each toss is independent, so past results do not affect the next. Thinking tails is 'due' is the gambler's fallacy.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�3f306fd348b5�body�٫质数（素数）是大于 1、且除了 1 和它本身以外没有其他正因数的自然数，如 2、3、5、7。2 是唯一的偶质数，其余质数都是奇数。ٶA prime number is a natural number greater than 1 that has no positive divisors other than 1 and itself, such as 2, 3, 5, and 7. Two is the only even prime; all other primes are odd.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�40a580546db0�body�ِ乘法是把相同数加起来的简便运算，例如 3 × 4 表示 4 个 3 相加，结果是 12。它满足交换律，即 3 × 4 = 4 × 3。ٵMultiplication is a shortcut for repeated addition of the same number, for example 3 × 4 means adding 3 four times, giving 12. It satisfies the commutative law, so 3 × 4 = 4 × 3.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�436eb7c2baaf�body���百分数表示“每一百中有多少”，是分母为 100 的比例写法。比如 25% 就是 25/100，也就是四分之一。它方便我们比较不同基数的比例，例如比较两个班级及格率时不用关心总人数。�A percentage shows how many per hundred, writing a ratio with denominator 100. For example, 25% is 25/100, or one quarter. It makes comparing proportions with different bases easy, such as comparing pass rates of two classes without caring about their sizes.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�452cd5a0c187�body�و体积是三维物体所占空间的大小，常用立方单位（如立方米）度量。例如棱长为 a 的正方体体积是 a³。٧Volume is the amount of space a three-dimensional object occupies, measured in cubic units such as cubic meters. For example, a cube with edge length a has volume a³.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�45cdb1fa3512�body�ق他把首尾配对：(1+100)+(2+99)+… 共50对，每对都是101，所以 50×101=5050。这就是等差数列求和的雏形。نHe paired ends: (1+100)+(2+99)+… makes 50 pairs each summing to 101, so 50×101=5050. It is the seed of arithmetic-series summation.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4b84a34f817c�body��~零的概念最早在古巴比伦和玛雅文明中以占位符号出现，但作为可运算的数字「0」由印度数学家在公元 5 世纪左右系统确立，并随阿拉伯学者（如花拉子米）的著作传入伊斯兰世界与欧洲，故称「阿拉伯数字」。它使位值制计数法与代数运算成为可能，被誉为人类最重要的数学发明之一。��The concept of zero appeared as a placeholder in Babylonian and Mayan civilizations, but the digit '0' as an operable number was systematically established by Indian mathematicians around the 5th century CE, then transmitted to the Islamic world and Europe via scholars like al-Khwarizmi—hence 'Arabic numerals.' It enabled place-value notation and algebra, among the most important mathematical inventions.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�4bc48de32de1�body�٨它用一段重复的关键词逐位平移，打破了单字母频率。但可用卡西斯基测试或重合指数找出周期，再对各分组做频率分析破解。��It shifts each letter by a repeating keyword, breaking simple letter frequencies. Yet Kasiski examination or index of coincidence reveals the period, after which each group is frequency-analyzed.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�4c3f8741b614�body�٥它是把莫比乌斯带的边界再接回自身的不可定向闭曲面，在三维空间里必须自相交才能画出来。在四维中它无边界、无内外。ٴIt is a non-orientable closed surface made by gluing a Möbius strip's boundary to itself; in 3D it must self-intersect. In 4D it has no boundary and no distinct inside or outside.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4e8b86b6436b�body�ټ角度是由两条有公共端点的射线所夹的部分，用来衡量两条线之间的张开程度，单位是度（°）或弧度。一个直角是 90 度，一个平角是 180 度。��An angle is the figure formed by two rays sharing a common endpoint, measuring how much the two lines open up; its unit is the degree or the radian. A right angle is 90 degrees and a straight angle is 180 degrees.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�4f1279a1c00c�body���π 是圆的周长与直径的比值，对任何大小的圆都相同，约等于 3.14159。它是一个无理数，小数无限不循环。π 不仅出现在几何里，也出现在概率、物理和许多看似无关的公式当中。�π is the ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter, the same for every circle, approximately 3.14159. It is irrational with a non-repeating infinite decimal. π appears not only in geometry but also in probability, physics, and many seemingly unrelated formulas.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�4fde8469a8ea�body��a圆周率π是圆周长与直径的比值，约等于3.14159，日常计算常用3.14来近似。�XPi is the ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter, about 3.14159 (often 3.14).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�507498abc467�body��i买东西时用数学算总价、比较单价、找零和折扣。例如打八折就是原价乘以0.8。�dShopping uses math for totals, unit prices, change and discounts; a 20%-off sale means price × 0.8.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�50e4be252a41�body���芝诺提出：跑得快的阿基里斯要追上前方落后的乌龟，必须先到达乌龟的起点，而此时乌龟又前进了一点，如此无限细分似乎永远追不上。这个悖论的根源在于混淆了「无限多个步骤」与「无限长的时间」——这些步骤所用时间构成一个收敛的无穷级数，其总和是有限的。它成为早期对无穷与极限的深刻思辨。�~Zeno argued that swift Achilles, to catch a tortoise ahead, must first reach its starting point, by which time the tortoise has advanced, and so on ad infinitum, seemingly never catching up. The paradox confuses 'infinitely many steps' with 'infinite time'—the times form a convergent infinite series with a finite total. It is an early profound meditation on infinity and limits.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�50fee359d351�body�٪阿基米德螺线满足极径与极角成正比（r=aθ），相邻圈间距恒定，常用于卷尺与凸轮。等角螺线r=a^θ的圈间距则按几何级数增长。٦The Archimedean spiral has r=aθ, so successive turns are evenly spaced — used in roll tapes and cams. The logarithmic spiral r=a^θ spaces its turns geometrically.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�552522f251aa�body���对称指一个图形或物体经过某种变换（如翻转、旋转）后，看起来和原来一样。常见的对称包括左右镜像对称和绕中心旋转对称。对称的图形往往让人感到和谐美观，也常见于自然界和艺术中。�Symmetry means a shape or object looks the same after some transformation, such as flipping or rotating. Common types include left-right mirror symmetry and rotation about a center. Symmetric forms often feel harmonious and appear frequently in nature and art.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�59b38d8737c0�body�ٓ曲线下的面积表示函数在一段区间上累积的总量，可用积分来求。例如匀速运动的路程就是速度曲线下的面积。٘The area under a curve is the accumulated total of a function over an interval, found by integration; distance traveled is the area under a speed curve.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�5af9a6c6597f�body�ٟ它们在二维投影里自洽，但三维中无法存在，因为边的前后关系互相矛盾。这是视觉把平面线索误读为立体的几何错觉。٬They are consistent in 2D projection but impossible in 3D because edge front-back relations contradict. It is a geometric illusion where vision misreads flat cues as solid.�ans��src��ZPenrose,《On the Cohomology of Impossible Figures》,Leonardo,1992 (DOI: 10.2307/1575844)�XPenrose, 'On the Cohomology of Impossible Figures', Leonardo, 1992, DOI: 10.2307/1575844��id�5c39344625f9�body�٥他用平移、旋转、反射做平面镶嵌（如变形的鸟与鱼），并用非欧几何与不可能图形制造错觉，把群论与拓扑思想变成艺术。��He used translation, rotation and reflection for tessellations (of morphing birds and fish) and non-Euclidean geometry with impossible figures to create illusions, turning group theory and topology into art.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5f026c6ee5fb�body�ٌ可以。十进制的10在二进制写作1010，因为 1×8+0×4+1×2+0×1=10。二进制只用0和1，靠位置（2的幂）表达大小。ِYes. Decimal 10 is written 1010 in binary since 1×8+0×4+1×2+0×1=10. Binary uses only 0 and 1, conveying magnitude by position (powers of 2).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�5fa4a19a10be�body��M说谎者悖论是一句自称虚假的命题：若它为真则它假，若它为假则它真，陷入循环矛盾。它揭示了自然语言中「自指」与「真值」概念结合会产生不一致，促使逻辑学家发展分层语言、修正语义等理论来规避。它是自指悖论家族最古老、最典型的代表。��The liar paradox is a statement that asserts its own falsity: if true it is false, if false it is true—a circular contradiction. It shows that self-reference combined with the concept of truth in natural language yields inconsistency, pushing logicians toward stratified languages and revised semantics. It is the oldest and most typical representative of self-referential paradoxes.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6086cc2b84ad�body��全等图形指形状和大小完全相同、能够完全重合的两个图形，可以通过平移、旋转、反射等刚体变换相互得到。全等不关心位置，只关心几何本质一致。判定三角形全等有边角边的若干标准方法。�JCongruent figures are two shapes that are exactly the same in form and size and can coincide completely, obtainable from each other by rigid motions like translation, rotation, and reflection. Congruence ignores position and cares only about identical geometry. Triangles have standard congruence criteria such as side-angle-side.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�61ef63224a49�body�ٱ维恩图用互相重叠的圆来表示集合及其交、并、补等关系，便于直观理解集合运算。例如两个圆的重叠部分表示两个集合的公共元素。��A Venn diagram uses overlapping circles to represent sets and their intersections, unions, and complements, making set operations easy to visualize. For example, the overlap of two circles shows the common elements of the two sets.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�63ec9bf8135c�body�ٛ十进制是我们最常用的记数法，每一位上的数字代表该位的“权”是 10 的幂。例如 345 表示 3 个百、4 个十和 5 个一。٫The decimal (base-ten) system is the number notation we use most, where each digit's place represents a power of 10. For example, 345 means 3 hundreds, 4 tens, and 5 ones.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�66d12a9b3cf9�body�و平均数是把所有数值相加再除以个数，反映一组数据的集中水平。例如 2、4、6 的平均数是 (2+4+6)/3 = 4。�CThe mean sums values and divides by count; for 2,4,6 the mean is 4.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�674caaaac338�body�ٖ平行四边形是两组对边分别平行的四边形，它的对边相等、对角相等。常见的矩形和菱形都是特殊的平行四边形。��A parallelogram is a quadrilateral whose opposite sides are parallel in pairs; its opposite sides are equal and its opposite angles are equal. Familiar rectangles and rhombuses are special kinds of parallelograms.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�679ba4478b1c�body��P正态分布是呈钟形的对称连续分布，由均值和标准差两个参数决定。它常见的原因在于中心极限定理：许多独立微小随机因素叠加的结果往往趋近钟形。从人的身高到测量误差，大量现象都大致服从它，因此高斯分布成为统计建模与质量控制的基本假设。��The normal distribution is a symmetric bell-shaped continuous distribution determined by just its mean and standard deviation. Its ubiquity follows from the Central Limit Theorem: sums of many independent tiny random factors tend toward a bell shape. From human heights to measurement errors, countless phenomena are approximately normal, making it the default assumption in statistics and quality control.�ans��src��YFeller,《An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications》第3版,Wiley,1968�[W. Feller, An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1968��id�67df998abd04�body�٥斐波那契数列 1,1,2,3,5,8,… 相邻两项之比会趋近于 φ=(1+√5)/2≈1.618，即黄金比。许多植物生长（花瓣、松果）都近似遵循它。٫The Fibonacci sequence 1,1,2,3,5,8,… has consecutive ratios converging to φ=(1+√5)/2≈1.618, the golden ratio. Many plant growths (petals, pinecones) approximate it.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7234e4b9c55b�body�ٵ单利只在本金上算利息，呈直线增长；复利在‘本金+已生利息’上再计息，呈指数增长。时间一长，二者的差距会被放大到惊人的程度。ٵSimple interest earns only on principal, growing linearly; compound interest earns on principal plus accumulated interest, growing exponentially. Over time the gap becomes enormous.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�737dabec9a89�body�ٮ从正方形不断挖去中央九分之一的小方块，每步保留8/9面积。无限迭代后剩余面积趋于0，但点集仍无限稠密，维数为log8/log3≈1.893。��Starting from a square, repeatedly remove the central ninth; each step keeps 8/9 of the area. After infinitely many steps the remaining area tends to 0 while the set stays infinite, with dimension log8/log3≈1.893.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�78250411479d�body���两人各自在17世纪末独立创立微积分：牛顿从物理运动的“流数”出发，莱布尼茨发展了更系统的记号（如 ∫ 与 d）。优先权之争曾长期困扰学界，如今公认两人共享功劳。٬Newton and Leibniz each invented calculus independently in the late 1600s—Newton from fluxions of motion, Leibniz with systematic notation (∫, d). Credit is now shared.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�78350cd0e686�body��x不会，每次抛掷独立，正面概率仍是1/2。赌徒谬误是把长期会平衡错误地当成短期会补偿。ٖNo; each toss is independent and still has probability 1/2 for heads. The gambler's fallacy wrongly treats long-run balance as short-run compensation.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�79a7f8bb121d�body�٘完全平方数是某个整数的平方，例如 1、4、9、16、25。判断一个数是否为完全平方数，可看它的平方根是否为整数。�jA perfect square is an integer square (1,4,9,16,25…); a number is one iff its square root is an integer.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7c70b110d639�body��K总价除以数量得到单价：15 ÷ 3 = 5 元。所以每支笔 5 元。�iDividing the total cost by the quantity gives the unit price: 15 ÷ 3 = 5 yuan. So each pen costs 5 yuan.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�7d3a1632b2d4�body��孪生素数指相差 2 的一对素数，如 (3,5)、(11,13)。孪生素数猜想认为这样的素数对有无穷多对，但至今未被证明。2013 年张益唐在弱形式上取得突破，证明存在间隔有限的无穷多素数对，引发广泛关注。�.Twin primes are pairs of primes differing by 2, like (3,5) and (11,13). The twin prime conjecture says there are infinitely many such pairs, but it remains unproven. In 2013 Yitang Zhang made a breakthrough on a weaker form, proving infinitely many prime pairs with bounded gap, drawing wide attention.�ans��src��[张益唐《Bounded Gaps Between Primes》，Annals of Mathematics 179(3):1121–1176, 2014�WY. Zhang, 'Bounded Gaps Between Primes', Annals of Mathematics 179(3):1121–1176, 2014��id�7d61fe874f5a�body��p一个数的倒数是与它相乘得1的数。例如 3 的倒数是 1/3，因为 3 × 1/3 = 1。0没有倒数。�BThe reciprocal of x is 1/x, since x·(1/x)=1; 0 has no reciprocal.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7dba7c38b7aa�body�٨拓扑只关心连续变形（拉伸、弯曲）而不关心距离。咖啡杯可连续捏成环面，和甜甜圈同属‘带一个洞’的曲面，拓扑上等价。��Topology cares only about continuous deformation (stretch, bend), not distances. A mug can be continuously molded into a torus, both being 'one-hole' surfaces, so they are topologically equivalent.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7e1ff5ccb5e7�body�٢六边形在等周长下围出的面积最大（最省蜡），且能无缝密铺。蜜蜂用最少材料得到最多空间，是优化与镶嵌的自然范例。ٺAmong equal perimeters the hexagon encloses the most area (saving wax) and tiles seamlessly. Bees get the most space for the least material, a natural example of optimization and tiling.�ans��src��EFejes Tóth, L., 《平面与空间中的密铺与堆积》, Springer�OFejes Tóth, L., 'Lagerungen in der Ebene, auf der Kugel und im Raum', Springer��id�8077b96906c7�body�ٜ100 米被分成 10 段，由于两端都要种树，所以棵数 = 段数 + 1 = 11 棵。这是典型的“植树问题”，要注意端点是否计入。��The 100 meters is divided into 10 segments, and since trees are planted at both ends, the count is segments + 1 = 11 trees. This is a classic planting problem where you must consider whether endpoints are included.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�80b49bbae4e9�body�٪公平硬币只有正反两面且机会均等，所以正面朝上的概率是 1/2，也就是 50%。这意味着长期来看，大约一半的投掷结果会是正面。٪A fair coin has only two equally likely outcomes, so the probability of heads is 1/2, or 50%. This means that in the long run, about half of the flips will come up heads.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�80eec2afe4ff�body��庞加莱猜想问：任何看起来像三维球面的封闭三维空间，是否本质上就是一个三维球面？它属于拓扑学，是千禧年七大难题之一。2003 年前后，佩雷尔曼用几何分析的方法给出了证明，并拒绝了菲尔兹奖。�The Poincaré conjecture asks whether any closed three-dimensional space that looks like a 3-sphere is essentially a 3-sphere. Belonging to topology, it is one of the seven Millennium problems. Around 2003 Perelman proved it using geometric analysis and declined the Fields Medal.�ans��src��0Clay Mathematics Institute 庞加莱猜想专题�/Clay Mathematics Institute Poincaré conjecture��id�81b9db536614�body���平均数是把一组数的所有数值相加，再除以数值的个数。它反映这组数据的整体集中水平，但容易被极端值拉高或拉低。例如三个数 2、3、10 的平均数是 5，但中位数只有 3。�The mean is found by adding up all the values in a set and then dividing by how many values there are. It describes the central tendency of the data, but it can be pulled upward or downward by extreme values. For example, the mean of 2, 3, and 10 is 5, while the median is only 3.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�82a4bab80f88�body���旋转对称指图形绕某个中心点转动一定角度后，仍和原来的样子重合。转动一周所需的最小角度能整除 360 度的图形具有旋转对称，例如风车叶片。圆形则无论转多少度都看起来一样。��Rotational symmetry means a figure coincides with itself after turning by some angle around a center. A figure whose smallest such angle divides 360 degrees has rotational symmetry, like windmill blades. A circle looks the same at any angle.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�83145a04a8f0�body�ِ只可能是0、1、4、5、6、9，绝不可能是2、3、7、8。这由模10的平方剩余直接决定，可用来快速排除非平方数。ىOnly 0, 1, 4, 5, 6, 9 are possible; never 2, 3, 7, 8. This follows from quadratic residues mod 10 and helps quickly rule out non-squares.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8588214ae6fa�body���等距变换（刚性运动）保持任意两点间距离不变，如平移、旋转、反射。它不改变图形的形状和大小，只改变位置或朝向，是几何对称的基础概念。ٗAn isometry (rigid motion) preserves all distances—translations, rotations, reflections. It keeps shape and size, only changing position/orientation.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8833092464d3�body�ٜ数独是一个9×9的拉丁方：每行、每列和每个九宫格都恰好含1到9各一次。它属于组合设计里的拉丁方与约束满足问题。ٮSudoku is a 9×9 Latin square where each row, column and box contains 1–9 exactly once. It belongs to combinatorics as a Latin square and a constraint-satisfaction problem.�ans��src��《组合数学》Brualdi�-Introductory Combinatorics by Richard Brualdi��id�8a1e50ed0b84�body���中心性衡量节点在网络中的重要程度。度数中心性看连接数，介数中心性看经过它的最短路径多少，特征向量中心性（如 PageRank）还考虑邻居的重要性。٭Centrality measures node importance: degree counts links, betweenness counts shortest paths through it, eigenvector centrality (like PageRank) weights influential neighbors.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8ab9b3e096e0�body�٥少数极大的值会拉高平均数（如贫富差距），使它远高于多数人的真实情况。看收入、房价时，中位数往往更能代表普通人。ٹA few huge values pull the average up (e.g. wealth gaps), making it far above most people's reality. For incomes or house prices the median usually represents the typical person better.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8afcfbaecb73�body���分数表示把一个整体平均分成若干份后取其中几份，写作分子/分母。例如 3/4 表示四份中取三份。分数和除法、小数、百分数本质上都是同一种“比例”的不同写法。�␀A fraction represents taking some of the equal parts of a whole, written as numerator/denominator. For example, 3/4 means three of four equal parts. Fractions, division, decimals, and percentages are essentially different notations for the same proportion.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8d9248e0fbe0�body��古埃及人使用十进制但非位值制，用不同的象形符号表示 1、10、100、1000 等，通过重复累加来表达数目。例如数字 23 就写成两个 10 的符号加三个 1 的符号。他们没有表示“零”的独立符号，运算也主要靠分数表。�1Ancient Egyptians used a decimal but non-positional system, with distinct hieroglyphs for 1, 10, 100, 1000, etc., repeated and added to express quantities. For example, 23 was two 10 symbols plus three 1 symbols. They had no separate symbol for zero, and calculation relied heavily on tables of fractions.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�8dc9ad84c29c�body�ٹ黄金比约1.618出现在一些自然与艺术比例中，但最美观多为后人附会。它确实在斐波那契数列、五角星里自然出现，美感更多来自和谐分割。��Phi about 1.618 appears in some natural and artistic proportions, but claims of universal beauty are often overstated. It does arise naturally in Fibonacci numbers and pentagrams; the appeal is more about harmonious division.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（连分数章）�>What Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on continued fractions��id�8e535c0657de�body�١当免疫人群比例超过 1−1/R0 时，病毒难以找到易感者持续传播。R0=3 时需约 67% 免疫。这是用基本再生数直接估算的阈值。٥When the immune fraction exceeds 1−1/R0, the virus struggles to find susceptibles to sustain spread. For R0=3 about 67% must be immune. A direct threshold from R0.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�94065a876e1e�body��r极差是一组数据中最大值减最小值，反映数据的跨度。例如 3、7、9 的极差是 9−3 = 6。�SThe range is the max minus the min, showing spread; for 3,7,9 the range is 9−3=6.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�98ccdf5a840b�body�ٜ大多不是。普通程序用确定性算法生成伪随机数，序列由种子决定、可复现；真正随机需借助物理噪声（如热噪声）。٫Usually not. Most programs use deterministic algorithms producing pseudorandom numbers seeded and reproducible; true randomness needs physical noise such as thermal noise.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�98eb65fe5ea2�body���极差是一组数据中最大值减去最小值得到的差距，用来粗略描述数据的跨度。它计算简单，但只依赖两个极端值，容易受离群值影响。要了解整体分布，通常还要配合平均数、标准差等指标。�CThe range is the difference between the maximum and minimum values in a dataset, giving a rough sense of its spread. It is simple to compute but depends only on the two extremes, so it is sensitive to outliers. To understand the full distribution, it is usually paired with the mean, standard deviation, and other measures.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�99426030733b�body��`把 24 平均分成 6 份，用除法：24 ÷ 6 = 4。所以每个小朋友得到 4 个苹果。�WDividing 24 into 6 equal parts uses division: 24 ÷ 6 = 4. So each child gets 4 apples.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�995a32dbdfcb�body�ٷ对每个人单独看，无论对方怎么选，背叛都是更优的；结果两人都背叛，得到比合作更差的结局。这揭示了个人理性可能导致集体非理性。��For each person alone, betraying is the better move regardless of the other's choice; both then betray and end up worse than if they had cooperated. Individual rationality can yield collective irrationality.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�99d37e8af2cc�body��)零的概念在多个古文明中独立出现，但作为真正可参与运算的数字符号，主要由古印度数学家在公元 5 世纪左右完善，后经阿拉伯世界传入欧洲。玛雅文明也独立发展出零的符号。零的引入让位值记数法和现代算术成为可能。�tThe concept of zero appeared independently in several ancient civilizations, but as a true numerical symbol usable in calculation it was mainly perfected by Indian mathematicians around the 5th century CE and later transmitted to Europe via the Arab world. The Maya also developed a zero symbol independently. Zero made place-value notation and modern arithmetic possible.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�9c0ec5a6806f�body���整数包括正整数、负整数和零，如 …−3、−2、−1、0、1、2、3…。在自然数基础上加入负数，我们就能表示欠债、下降等“相反方向”的量。整数的加减乘结果仍是整数，但除法一般不是。�Integers include positive numbers, negative numbers, and zero, like ...−3, −2, −1, 0, 1, 2, 3... Adding negatives to the naturals lets us represent opposite directions such as debt or drop. The sum, difference, and product of integers are integers, but division generally is not.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�9c862d6dd59a�body��能被 2 整除的整数是偶数（如 0、2、4），除以 2 余 1 的是奇数（如 1、3、5）。偶数加偶数仍是偶数，奇数加奇数是偶数，奇偶规律在整除和密码学中很有用。判断一个数奇偶只需看它个位（十进制下）是奇是偶。��Integers divisible by 2 are even (0, 2, 4), and those leaving remainder 1 are odd (1, 3, 5). Even plus even is even, odd plus odd is even; parity rules are useful in divisibility and cryptography. In decimal, you only need the last digit to tell parity.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a05a38602cac�body�٥在给定周长下，六边形能以最少蜡壁围出最大面积，且能无空隙铺满平面。这是等周与密铺共同优化的结果，高效又省材料。ٺAmong tilings, hexagons enclose the most area per wall length and tile the plane without gaps. It is the joint optimum of isoperimetry and tessellation — efficient and material-saving.�ans��src��EFejes Tóth, L., 《平面与空间中的密铺与堆积》, Springer�OFejes Tóth, L., 'Lagerungen in der Ebene, auf der Kugel und im Raum', Springer��id�a10b8ebda2d9�body�٠自然语言字母出现频率稳定（英文e最常见），单表替换保留频率模式。统计密文字母频次并对照语言特征即可逐字还原。��Natural languages have stable letter frequencies (e in English is most common), and simple substitution preserves that pattern. Counting ciphertext frequencies against language stats recovers letters.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�a2568e827489�body���小数是用十进制表示的数，小数点右边依次是十分位、百分位、千分位……例如 0.25 表示 25/100。有限小数可以化成分数，而像 1/3=0.333… 这样无限循环的小数也能化成分数。��A decimal is a number in base ten, with places to the right of the point being tenths, hundredths, thousandths, and so on; for example, 0.25 means 25/100. Terminating decimals convert to fractions, and repeating ones like 1/3 = 0.333... also do.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a46e6a5bbe27�body�٪地球公转约365.2422天，四年加一天仍略多，于是整百年不闰、四百年再闰一次来修正。这是用有理数逼近无理年的巧妙历法设计。ٿA year is about 365.2422 days; adding a day every four overshoots, so century years skip and every 400th keeps it, correcting the error. A clever rational approximation of an irrational year.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（连分数章）�>What Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on continued fractions��id�a5e5ccb0c49c�body���维度描述一个空间或物体自由运动的方向数，点是 0 维、线是 1 维、平面是 2 维、立体是 3 维。更高维度虽然难以直观想象，但在数学和物理中很有用。��Dimension describes the number of independent directions in which one can move in a space or object: a point is 0D, a line is 1D, a plane is 2D, and a solid is 3D. Higher dimensions, though hard to picture, are useful in mathematics and physics.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a66cd4451563�body�٤因为每过固定时间剩余量减半，比例是恒定的，这正是指数衰减：N(t)=N0×(1/2)^(t/T)。线性衰减不会保持固定的‘减半周期’。٩Because a fixed time always halves the remainder, a constant ratio, which is exponential decay: N(t)=N0×(1/2)^(t/T). Linear decay would not keep a fixed halving period.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�a7bc0d6aade2�body�ه一样。无论顺序如何，每个人在抽签前的中奖概率都等于奖品占比，这正是无放回随机抽样的公平性。١They are equal. Under sampling without replacement, everyone's win probability before drawing equals the share of prizes — that is the fairness of the lottery.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�aaf6de0e2371�body��算盘是一种古老的手动计算工具，用珠子在杆上表示数字，在中国、日本、中东等地独立演化出不同形制。它通过位值制和心算配合，能快速完成加减乘除。在电子计算器普及前，算盘是商人和账房的主力工具。�dThe abacus is an ancient manual calculating tool using beads on rods to represent numbers, evolving independently in China, Japan, the Middle East, and elsewhere. With place value and mental arithmetic it performs addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division quickly. Before electronic calculators, it was the main tool of merchants and accountants.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�aafc4ca51246�body�٤概率表示某件事情发生的可能性大小，取值范围从 0（不可能）到 1（必然）。例如掷一枚公平硬币，正面朝上的概率是 1/2。٫Probability measures how likely an event is to happen, ranging from 0 (impossible) to 1 (certain). For example, when flipping a fair coin, the probability of heads is 1/2.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�ab2fa7aec4fa�body�ٔ偶数是能被 2 整除的整数，例如 2、4、6、0。判断一个数是否为偶数，只需看它的个位数字是 0、2、4、6 还是 8。ٚAn even number is an integer divisible by 2, such as 2, 4, 6, and 0. You can tell a number is even by checking whether its last digit is 0, 2, 4, 6, or 8.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�ac843627aabc�body�ٮ逻辑是研究推理是否正确的规律和方法，帮助我们由已知前提得出可靠的结论。它既是数学的基础，也用于日常思考和计算机科学。��Logic is the study of the principles and methods of correct reasoning, helping us draw reliable conclusions from given premises. It is a foundation of mathematics and is also used in everyday thinking and computer science.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b30e8ed8eb66�body���《几何原本》是公元前300年左右欧几里得编写的巨著，用公理与逻辑推理组织几何与数论，是历史上影响最久的教科书。它确立了“公理化”这一科学范式。ٰEuclid's Elements (c. 300 BCE) organized geometry and number theory from axioms by strict logic—the most influential textbook in history. It established the axiomatic method.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�b3285a60339d�body��g斜率是直线上“竖直变化 ÷ 水平变化”的比值，表示直线的倾斜程度和方向。�aSlope is the ratio of vertical to horizontal change, indicating a line's steepness and direction.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�b847be22aa44�body�ٱ当高对比度格栅平移一点点，大脑用相邻相位解释成连续运动，产生漂动错觉（如周边漂移）。这与视觉系统对运动的边缘检测有关。��When a high-contrast grid shifts slightly, the brain interprets adjacent phases as continuous motion, producing a shimmer (e.g., peripheral drift). It relates to motion edge-detection in vision.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bb203159d8ec�body�٥烹饪要用分数和比例来缩放食谱，用单位换算称量食材，用温度和时间控制火候。例如把4人份翻倍成8人份，所有材料乘以2。ّCooking uses fractions and ratios to scale recipes, units to weigh ingredients, and time/temperature to control doneness; double a recipe by ×2.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bb413d2e71f7�body���负数用来表示与正数相反方向的量，比如欠钱、温度低于零、海平面以下高度。引入负数后，减法不再受限，方程也更容易求解。它在记账、物理和坐标系统中都不可或缺。�%Negative numbers represent quantities opposite in direction to positives, such as debt, temperatures below zero, or heights below sea level. With negatives, subtraction is unrestricted and equations become easier to solve. They are indispensable in accounting, physics, and coordinate systems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�bb93f9b1e96d�body�ٓ周长是一个平面图形边界的总长度，也就是绕图形一圈的距离。例如正方形的周长是四条边相加，即 4 倍边长。��The perimeter is the total length of the boundary of a flat figure, that is, the distance around it. For example, the perimeter of a square is the sum of its four sides, or four times the side length.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�bbd9d2b93b44�body��_距离等于速度乘以时间，即 60 × 5 = 300 米。所以小明 5 分钟能走 300 米。�nDistance equals speed multiplied by time, so 60 × 5 = 300 meters. Xiao Ming can walk 300 meters in 5 minutes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bea22b111b42�body�٫它衡量一个随机来源的平均‘不确定性’或信息量，H=−Σ pᵢ log₂ pᵢ（比特）。越均匀的分布熵越大，越可预测的分布熵越小。��It measures the average 'uncertainty' or information content of a random source: H=−Σ pᵢ log₂ pᵢ (in bits). More uniform distributions have higher entropy; more predictable ones have lower.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�c1e05d107f4c�body��d约0.197%，大约1/509。计算为4乘以从13张同花色选5张，再除以总组合数C(52,5)。�NAbout 0.197% (roughly 1 in 509). It equals 4 times C(13,5) divided by C(52,5).�ans��src��LGrinstead, C. M. 与 Snell, J. L., 《概率导论》, 美国数学会 (AMS)�]Grinstead, C. M. & Snell, J. L., 'Introduction to Probability', American Mathematical Society��id�c2ce1a35a57c�body�ٽ圆是平面上到一个固定点（圆心）距离相等的所有点组成的集合，这个固定距离叫做半径。圆是最基本的曲线图形之一，常见于车轮、钟表等。��A circle is the set of all points in a plane that are at the same fixed distance from a given point (the center); that fixed distance is called the radius. The circle is one of the most basic curved shapes, seen in wheels and clocks.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�c5738d61b9fd�body�ٚ二进制是一种只用 0 和 1 两个数码表示数的记数系统，是计算机内部数据的基础。例如二进制的 101 等于十进制的 5。ٞBinary is a number system using only the digits 0 and 1, and it is the basis of data inside computers. For example, the binary number 101 equals 5 in decimal.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�c71a71caa825�body�ٙ每个比特有0/1两种状态，8个比特的组合数是 2⁸=256。这就是二进制位数的指数表达力：n 位能区分 2ⁿ 种不同情况。يEach bit has two states 0/1, so 8 bits give 2⁸=256 combinations. That is the exponential power of binary: n bits distinguish 2ⁿ cases.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�c79d68da7117�body��/坐标系是一套用数字或数组来标定点的位置的规则，最常见的平面坐标系用两个数（横、纵坐标）确定一个点。它把几何问题转化为代数计算，使画图、导航和建模成为可能。除了直角坐标，还有极坐标、三维坐标等多种坐标系。�KA coordinate system is a set of rules using numbers or arrays to locate points; the commonest planar one uses two numbers (horizontal and vertical coordinates) to fix a point. It turns geometric problems into algebra, enabling drawing, navigation, and modeling. Besides Cartesian, there are polar, 3D, and other coordinate systems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c7f3b2d348cc�body�٭这是同色错觉：B被圆柱体阴影盖住，大脑根据处在阴影中自动提亮补偿，于是觉得它比旁边的A浅。用取色器量二者灰度完全一致。��This is the checker-shadow illusion: B lies in the cylinder's shadow, so the brain brightens it to compensate, making it look lighter than A. A color picker shows both have identical gray values.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ca3404479977�body��{加法交换律指两个数相加时，交换位置后和不变，即 a + b = b + a。例如 3 + 5 与 5 + 3 都等于 8。ٷThe commutative law of addition states that changing the order of two numbers being added does not change their sum, that is, a + b = b + a. For example, both 3 + 5 and 5 + 3 equal 8.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�ced5a032d618�body�ٖ正方形是四条边相等且四个角都是直角的四边形，既是矩形也是菱形。正方形的面积等于边长乘边长，即 边长²。��A square is a quadrilateral with four equal sides and four right angles; it is both a rectangle and a rhombus. The area of a square equals its side length multiplied by itself, that is, side squared.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�cf55c80d5d55�body���曼德博集由迭代 z → z² + c 的复数 c 组成，使得从 z=0 出发的轨道不发散。它的边界无限精细、放大后不断出现相似结构，是复动力系统与分形的象征。٫The Mandelbrot set is the set of complex c for which iterating z→z²+c from 0 stays bounded; its boundary is infinitely detailed and self-similar—a symbol of fractals.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�cfaca2c50a13�body�ٸ一年一次复利得 100×1.10=110 元；按月复利得 100×(1+0.10/12)^12≈110.47 元。复利次数越多，最终金额略高，极限是连续复利 100×e^0.10≈110.52 元。پAnnual compounding gives 100×1.10=110. Monthly gives 100×(1+0.10/12)^12≈110.47. More frequent compounding yields slightly more, converging to continuous compounding 100×e^0.10≈110.52.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�d15117125023�body�ٱ柱状图用长短不同的矩形条来表示各类别数据的大小，便于比较不同类别之间的数量。条形通常分开排列，与连在一起的直方图不同。��A bar chart uses rectangular bars of different lengths to show the size of data in different categories, making it easy to compare quantities. The bars are usually separated, unlike the connected bins of a histogram.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�d435b7b11bb3�body���旋转对称可连续实现（如风车），镜像对称需要翻面；有些物体（如螺旋贝壳）有旋转对称却无镜像对称（手性），左右手便是不可重合的镜像。��Rotational symmetry is continuous (like a pinwheel); mirror symmetry needs flipping. Some objects (like a spiral shell) have rotational but no mirror symmetry (chirality); left and right hands are unmatchable mirrors.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（对称与群）�3What Is Mathematics? (Courant), symmetry and groups��id�db72018d8768�body���自然数通常指用来计数的数：1、2、3、4……（有时也把 0 包括在内）。它们是最基本的数系，是算术和整个数学的起点。自然数可以进行加减乘，但除法不一定得到自然数。�Natural numbers are the counting numbers 1, 2, 3, 4, ... (sometimes including 0). They are the most basic number system and the starting point of arithmetic and all of mathematics. They support addition, subtraction, and multiplication, but division need not yield a natural number.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�dca97c7b9d20�body�ٖ把纸条拧半圈再粘起来，沿表面一直画会回到起点而经过整条带子，找不到正反的分界。它只有一个面、一条边。٫Twist a strip half a turn and glue it; drawing along the surface returns to start having covered the whole band, with no front/back boundary. It has one side and one edge.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e04e6dc50c81�body�ٜ欧拉把陆地化为顶点、桥化为边，证明一笔画要求最多两个奇度顶点，而四块陆地都是奇数度。这开创了图论与拓扑。ٿEuler modeled land as vertices and bridges as edges, showing an Eulerian path needs at most two odd-degree vertices, but all four lands had odd degree. This founded graph theory and topology.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e1af20078dde�body�ْ负数是小于零的数，通常前面带一个负号“−”，例如 −3。负数常用来表示欠款、零下温度或方向相反的量。��A negative number is a number less than zero, usually written with a minus sign, such as −3. Negative numbers are often used to represent debt, temperatures below freezing, or quantities in the opposite direction.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�e7217f767f68�body��E幻方把1到n平方排成方阵，使行、列、对角线和相同（为n(n平方+1)/2），魔数即1到n平方总和除以n。如洛书：4 9 2 / 3 5 7 / 8 1 6；造奇数阶可用楼梯法：从顶行中位出发，依次右上斜移、越界回绕，遇已占位则下移一格。古代既作趣味也作神秘符号。�^A magic square arranges 1 to n^2 so every row, column and diagonal sums equally (n(n^2+1)/2), the constant being the total 1..n^2 divided by n. The Luoshu: 4 9 2 / 3 5 7 / 8 1 6; for odd n the staircase method builds one: start top-middle, step up-right with wraparound, drop one row when a cell is taken. It was both a pastime and a mystical symbol.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�ec4bc3248f70�body���算筹是汉代以前普遍使用的小竹棍，用纵式横式表示不同数位，所谓一纵十横、百立千僵，通过摆弄筹棍完成加减乘除与开方。它是世界上最早的十进位值制记数工具之一。��Counting rods were thin bamboo sticks used in ancient China: vertical and horizontal placements encoded digits in a decimal place-value system, enabling addition, subtraction, multiplication, division and root extraction by rearranging the rods.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�ec6a9e3d1b37�body�٨把相同花纹绕中心转一定角度仍重合，画面既庄重又平衡。旋转对称是分形与镶嵌之外，人类常用来表达秩序之美的方式之一。��Repeating the same motif around a center by a fixed angle keeps the image balanced and solemn. Rotational symmetry is, beside fractals and tessellation, one of the ways humans commonly use to express orderly beauty.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（对称与群）�3What Is Mathematics? (Courant), symmetry and groups��id�ed60c345429b�body�ٗ三个缺角的黑色Pac-Man形会触发大脑补全轮廓，于是一个亮白三角形凭空出现。这是格式塔封闭性原则的典型例子。٩Three pac-man-like notched disks prompt the brain to complete contours, making a bright white triangle appear from nothing. It is a classic Gestalt principle of closure.�ans��src��cKanizsa,《Subjective Contours》,Scientific American,1976 (DOI: 10.1038/scientificamerican0476-48)�aKanizsa, 'Subjective Contours', Scientific American, 1976, DOI: 10.1038/scientificamerican0476-48��id�ee0b9ee2c322�body�٤许多任务（查找、去重、合并、中位数）都先排序会更快；而比较排序的理论下界是 O(n log n)，是算法课的第一个重要结论。٨Many tasks (search, dedupe, merge, median) get faster after sorting; the theoretical lower bound for comparison sorting is O(n log n), a first key result in algorithms.�ans��src��《算法导论》Cormen 等�?Introduction to Algorithms by Cormen Leiserson Rivest and Stein��id�f0ccdcae06ff�body���罗马数字用字母 I、V、X、L、C、D、M 表示 1、5、10、50、100、500、1000，通过加减组合成其他数，例如 IV 是 4、IX 是 9。它不使用位值制和零，做乘除很不方便，现代主要用于钟表、序号和装饰。�Roman numerals use letters I, V, X, L, C, D, M for 1, 5, 10, 50, 100, 500, 1000, combined by addition and subtraction, e.g., IV is 4 and IX is 9. Without place value or zero, multiplication and division are awkward; today they appear mainly on clocks, outlines, and decorations.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�f1867dc85787�body�ٻ赌徒谬误是误以为独立随机序列会“自我纠正”：连出多次红后觉得黑更可能。其实每次抛硬币独立，过去结果不影响未来，概率始终是 1/2。٭The gambler's fallacy wrongly expects independent random events to 'balance out'—after many reds, black seems due. But each fair coin flip stays 1/2 regardless of history.�ans��src��YFeller,《An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications》第3版,Wiley,1968�[W. Feller, An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1968��id�f226e594e1ef�body�ٟ以双色球为例，头奖概率约为一千七百七十二万分之一。这比被雷击中的概率还小得多，买彩票更应看作娱乐而非投资。ٴIn a typical 6/49-style game the jackpot odds are about 1 in 17.7 million. That is far rarer than being struck by lightning, so treat lottery play as entertainment, not investment.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�f33cb022f81e�body�ٙ把纸条一端扭转180度再粘成环，用笔画线沿中线一直画，会回到起点并涂满整条带子，说明它只有一个面、一条边。٭Twist a strip 180° and tape it into a loop, then draw a center line all the way around; it returns to start having covered the whole surface, proving one side and one edge.�ans��src��,《什么是数学》(柯朗)（拓扑章）�3What Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on topology��id�f573fbe4f31d�body�ٮ交错排列的明暗方块在交界处产生对比加强，使视网膜对边界位置产生偏移感知。大脑把这种局部错位连成波浪，其实线都是直的。ٲAlternating light/dark bricks enhance contrast at boundaries, shifting perceived edge positions. The brain stitches these local offsets into waves, though the lines are straight.�ans��src��eMcCourt,《Brightness Induction and the Café Wall Illusion》,Perception,1983 (DOI: 10.1068/p120131)�cMcCourt, 'Brightness Induction and the Café Wall Illusion', Perception, 1983, DOI: 10.1068/p120131��id�f6293f0961cf�body�٪等号“=”表示它两边的数量或表达式相等，是数学中表达平衡与等价关系的基本符号。等式可以传递：若 a = b 且 b = c，则 a = c。��The equals sign = indicates that the quantities or expressions on its two sides are equal, a basic symbol for balance and equivalence in mathematics. Equality is transitive: if a = b and b = c, then a = c.�ans��src��EEnderton, H. B., 《逻辑的数学导引》(第2版), Academic Press�QEnderton, H. B., 'A Mathematical Introduction to Logic' (2nd ed.), Academic Press��id�f80c634b423c�body�٢不会。若硬币公平且各次独立，第六次正面的概率仍是1/2。‘该出反面了’是赌徒谬误；过去结果不影响未来的独立事件。ٶNo. If the coin is fair and tosses independent, the sixth toss is still 1/2 heads. 'It's due for tails' is the gambler's fallacy; past results don't affect independent future events.�ans��src��YFeller,《An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications》第3版,Wiley,1968�[W. Feller, An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1968��id�f9627f796c75�body���假设素数只有有限个，把它们全乘起来再加1，得到的新数不能被其中任何一个整除，于是要么是新素数、要么含新素因子，矛盾。所以素数无穷。��Suppose finitely many primes exist; multiply them all and add 1. The result is not divisible by any of them, so it is either a new prime or has a new prime factor—contradiction. Hence infinitely many primes.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�ffef0772c41c�body�ٰ在23人中，两人生日相同的概率已超过50%。因为要比较的是‘两两组合’约253对，而非与某特定人比较，所以冲突来得比直觉快得多。٬In a group of 23, the chance two share a birthday exceeds 50%. We compare ~253 pairs, not against one fixed person, so collisions arrive far faster than intuition suggests.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�math_24_001�body���1736年欧拉把陆地缩成点、桥画成线,发现能否一次走完只取决于每个点连出的线条数(度数):要想一笔不重复地走完,中途经过的点必须成进成出即度数为偶,只有起点和终点允许奇数。哥尼斯堡四块陆地全是奇度(3、3、3、5),一个奇点都不将就,所以任何路线必然重复某座桥。这项分析诞生了图论与拓扑学的思想雏形——问题的答案藏在连接方式里,与桥的长短宽窄毫无关系。��In 1736 Euler shrank each landmass to a point and each bridge to a line, showing that a single non-repeating tour depends only on how many lines meet at each point (its degree): every intermediate stop needs an even degree, with only start and end allowed odd. All four Konigsberg landmasses had odd degrees (3, 3, 3, 5), so some bridge must be repeated. That argument launched graph theory and prefigured topology — connectivity alone decides, lengths and widths are irrelevant.�ans��src��=Wilson,《Introduction to Graph Theory》第4版,Longman,1996�BR. J. Wilson, Introduction to Graph Theory, 4th ed., Longman, 1996��id�math_24_005�body���计算机用二进制存小数,而十进制的 0.1 是 1/10,化成二进制是无限循环小数 0.000110011…,存储时必须在有限位处截断,产生微小误差;0.2 同理。两者相加得到一个略偏离 0.3 二进制表示的数,显示出来便是 0.30000000000000004。这不是 bug,而是 IEEE 754 浮点标准用有限二进制位逼近实数的固有代价;工程上的对策是比较时允许误差范围、金额计算改用整数分单位或十进制库。��Computers store fractions in binary, but decimal 0.1 equals binary 0.000110011..., repeating forever, so storage must truncate somewhere, introducing a tiny error; likewise 0.2. Their sum lands next to, not exactly on, the binary representation of 0.3 — printed as 0.30000000000000004. This is not a bug but the intrinsic cost of approximating real numbers with finite binary digits under the IEEE 754 standard; engineers compare within tolerance and compute money in integer cents or decimal libraries.�ans��src��|Goldberg,《What Every Computer Scientist Should Know About Floating-Point Arithmetic》,ACM Computing Surveys 第23卷,1991�vD. Goldberg, What Every Computer Scientist Should Know About Floating-Point Arithmetic, ACM Computing Surveys 23, 1991��id�math_24_008�body���因为凸函数的图像处处向上弯,任意两点之间的弦都落在函数图形上方。假如某点只是局部最小而别处另有更低点,那么连结这两点的弦在中段必然低于局部点的取值,而弦的中段又可以无限接近该局部点,这与它是局部最小矛盾。所以局部最优就是全局最优,梯度下降等迭代法不会被困在伪最优解上,这正是线性回归、支持向量机等凸模型可靠好解的原因。�A convex function curves upward everywhere, so the chord joining any two of its points never dips below the function. If a point were merely a local minimum while a strictly lower value existed elsewhere, the chord to that better point would sit below the local value over its middle stretch, and those middle points lie arbitrarily close to the supposed minimum — contradiction. Hence local optimality implies global optimality, which is why descent methods solve convex models like linear regression and support vector machines reliably.�ans��src��TS. Boyd 与 L. Vandenberghe《Convex Optimization》,Cambridge University Press,2004�PS. Boyd & L. Vandenberghe, Convex Optimization, Cambridge University Press, 2004��id�math_24_011�body��3难点在组合爆炸:10个城市的可能路线约18万条,100个城市的选择数超过可观测宇宙的原子总数。暴力枚举注定失败,于是运筹学兵分三路:精确算法(分支定界、动态规划)在小规模下保证最优;启发式(最近邻、2-opt局部改进)秒级给出可用解;现代求解器融合两者,已能对数万城市规模找到与最优解差距不到百分之一的路线。TSP 的价值远超快递——电路板钻孔、基因测序排序、天车调度都是它的变体,它也是 P 与 NP 问题的标志性成员。�rCombinatorial explosion is the enemy: ten cities offer about 180,000 tours, while a hundred cities exceed the atom count of the observable universe. Brute force dies fast, so operations research splits forces — exact algorithms (branch-and-bound, dynamic programming) guarantee optimality at small scale; heuristics (nearest-neighbor, 2-opt local search) return usable routes in seconds; modern solvers blend both, closing within one percent of optimal for tens of thousands of stops. TSP matters far beyond couriers — PCB drilling, genome ordering, crane scheduling are variants, and it stars in the P versus NP question.�ans��src��iApplegate、Bixby、Chvatal 与 Cook,《The Traveling Salesman Problem》,Princeton University Press,2006�XD. L. Applegate et al., The Traveling Salesman Problem, Princeton University Press, 2006��id�math_24_018�body���直觉错在把问题当成有人和我同天生日(那确实需要253人);实际问的是任意两人配对,23人共有253对,每对撞日的独立概率约1/365,全部错开的概率连乘后只剩一半以下。这就是著名的生日悖论——并非逻辑矛盾,而是直觉对组合爆炸的低估。它的现实版本威力惊人:密码学中哈希碰撞攻击正基于同一原理,n位指纹只需约2的n/2次方次尝试就能找到碰撞,因此安全系统被迫使用更长的摘要。�IIntuition misfires by reading the question as someone sharing YOUR birthday (needing 253 people); really any pair may collide, and twenty-three people form 253 pairs, each matching at about 1/365 independently — multiplying no-collision chances drops below half. The birthday paradox is thus no logical contradiction but intuition underestimating combinatorial explosion. Its practical twin bites cryptography: hash-collision attacks exploit the same math, needing only about two to the n-over-2 tries against n-bit fingerprints — which is why secure systems demand longer digests.�ans��src��YFeller,《An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications》第3版,Wiley,1968�[W. Feller, An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1968��id�math_26_001�body���把每个国家看成一个点,两国接壤就连一条边,地图立刻化为一幅平面图;相邻国家不同色,恰好等价于相邻顶点不同色。转化之后,边界的歪斜形状、飞地之类的几何细节全部消失,只剩下纯粹的连接关系,还能借助欧拉公式推出平面图必有度数不超过5的顶点这样的利器。四色问题的全部现代研究,正是在这张对偶图上展开的。��Turn every country into a dot and join two dots whenever the countries share a border: the map becomes a planar graph, and requiring neighboring countries to differ in color is exactly requiring adjacent vertices to differ. After the translation, crooked borders and enclaves vanish, leaving pure connectivity, and tools such as Euler's formula apply — for instance, that every planar graph has a vertex of degree at most five. All modern work on the four-color problem unfolds on this dual graph.�ans��src��=R. Diestel,《Graph Theory》第5版,Springer GTM 173,2016年�:R. Diestel, Graph Theory, 5th ed., Springer GTM 173 (2016)��id�math_26_003�body���「客满」只意味着没有空房,并不代表住不下更多人。让每位客人从n号房搬到n+1号,1号房立刻腾出;要接待无穷多位新客,只需请老客人一律搬进自己的双号房2n,全部单号房便一次性空出。原因是可数无穷集合挪动、配对之后仍是同一个基数:它与自身的一部分一样大——这恰是无穷集合与有限集合最反直觉的分界线。��Full house means no room is empty, not that nobody else fits. Move every guest from room n to room n+1 and room 1 opens at once; to host infinitely many newcomers, send each current guest to their own even-numbered room 2n, vacating every odd-numbered room in one stroke. A countably infinite set keeps the same cardinality after shifting or pairing: it is as large as a part of itself — the sharpest dividing line between infinite and finite sets.�ans��src��=G. Gamow,《One Two Three... Infinity》,Viking Press,1947年�8G. Gamow, One Two Three... Infinity, Viking Press (1947)��id�math_26_008�body���因为样本全是幸存者：飞机能返航，本身就说明其弹孔部位并不致命，所以机翼与机身布满弹孔；发动机附近几乎看不到弹孔，不是炮火打不准，而是中弹的飞机大多坠毁了。瓦尔德主张反向推断：返航机上没有弹孔的部位才是真正的致命处。这就是幸存者偏差——只用「活下来」的数据做判断，结论会被系统性扭曲，基金业绩榜与成功学案例中也屡见不鲜。��Because the sample contains only survivors. A plane that made it back proves its hit locations were survivable, so wings and fuselage show dense hole patterns; engines look almost untouched not because gunfire missed, but because engine hits usually brought the plane down. Wald argued in reverse: the clean areas on returning aircraft are the truly lethal weak points. This is survivorship bias — judging from data that lived on distorts conclusions, and it recurs in fund rankings and success stories alike.�ans��src�ُWald, A.，《A Method of Estimating Plane Vulnerability Based on Damage of Survivors》，Statistical Research Group, Columbia University,1944هA. Wald, A Method of Estimating Plane Vulnerability Based on Damage of Survivors, Statistical Research Group, Columbia University, 1944��id�math_26_009�body��r因为10除以9余1，所以10的任何次幂除以9都余1。把整数写成各位数字乘10的幂之和，取模9时每个幂都退化为1，剩下的恰好是数字之和——例如347与3+4+7=14模9同余。由此得到古老的「弃九法」：若一次运算的两边模9结果不同，则计算必有错误。它是同余算术最经典的日常应用之一。��Because ten leaves remainder one when divided by nine, and so does every power of ten. Write an integer as digits times powers of ten; modulo nine each power collapses to one, leaving exactly the digit sum — 347, for instance, agrees with 14, the total of its digits. Hence the old check called casting out nines: if the two sides of a computation disagree modulo nine, an error certainly occurred. It remains a most classic everyday application of modular arithmetic.�ans��src��ZHardy与Wright,《An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers》,Oxford University Press,1938�bG. H. Hardy, E. M. Wright, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers, Oxford University Press, 1938��id�math_26_012�body���会不断变大，而且维数确实不是整数。海岸线自相似：湾中有湾、岬外有岬，任何尺度下都不显平滑；用长度L的尺子丈量，总长约等于段数N乘L，而N随L缩小按幂律上升，故测得长度没有上限。曼德博据此给出海岸线的分数维数，不列颠西岸约1.25，介于直线与曲面之间，并以连续变化的维数刻画粗糙程度，开创了分形几何。�It keeps growing, and yes, the dimension is genuinely non-integer. A coastline is self-similar: bays within bays, capes beyond capes, smooth at no scale. Measured with a ruler of length L, the total is roughly the segment count N times L, and N rises by a power law as L shrinks, so no measurement ever settles. Mandelbrot thereby assigned coasts a fractional dimension — about 1.25 for Britain's western shore, between line and surface — turning continuously varying dimension into a measure of roughness and founding fractal geometry.�ans��src��}曼德博,《How Long Is the Coast of Britain? Statistical Self-Similarity and Fractional Dimension》,Science 第156卷,1967�xB. Mandelbrot, How Long Is the Coast of Britain? Statistical Self-Similarity and Fractional Dimension, Science 156, 1967��id�math_26_013�body���它叫孔多塞悖论，也叫投票循环。设三人偏好依次为A优于B优于C、B优于C优于A、C优于A优于B，则两两对决时A以二比一胜B，B以二比一胜C，C再以二比一胜A，群体偏好绕成闭环，选不出众望所归的赢家。这表明多数决无法把个人排序整合成一致的集体排序，而且议程安排权足以操纵胜负——控制先比哪一组，就能定制最后的赢家。�	It is the Condorcet paradox, also called the voting cycle. Let the three voters rank A over B over C, B over C over A, and C over A over B. In head-to-head contests A beats B two to one, B beats C the same way, then C beats A, looping the collective preference into a closed ring with no consensus winner. Majority rule thus cannot weld individual rankings into one consistent social ordering, and agenda control becomes power itself: fix the order of the pairwise duels and you can manufacture whichever winner you want.�ans��src�ل孔多塞,《Essai sur l'application de l'analyse à la probabilité des décisions rendues à la pluralité des voix》,巴黎,1785نN. de Condorcet, Essai sur l'application de l'analyse à la probabilité des décisions rendues à la pluralité des voix, Paris, 1785��id�math_26_018�body���因为信息量度量的正是不确定性的消除：概率为p的事件，其自信息定义为−log₂p，概率越小、发生越意外，信息量就越大；掷均匀硬币这类二选一恰好对应1比特，单位由此得名。对整个信源取平均便得到香农熵H=−Σp log₂p，它刻画平均意外程度，而信源编码定理进一步证明：熵就是无损压缩长度的下限，数据越接近均匀随机，越难再压短。�YBecause information quantifies the removal of uncertainty: an event with probability p carries self-information −log₂p, so the smaller the probability, the greater the surprise and the more information the occurrence delivers. A fair coin flip, the archetypal binary choice, maps to exactly one bit, whence the unit takes its name. Averaging over the source gives Shannon's entropy H = −Σp log₂p, the mean surprise per message, and the source coding theorem adds that entropy is the lower bound of lossless compression: the closer data approach pure randomness, the harder they are to shrink.�ans��src��_香农,《A Mathematical Theory of Communication》,Bell System Technical Journal 第27卷,1948�]C. E. Shannon, A Mathematical Theory of Communication, Bell System Technical Journal 27, 1948��id�0d0caee466ff�body���若方阵 A 有完备的特征向量基，则可写成 A = PDP⁻¹，其中 D 是对角阵、P 由特征向量组成。对角化让高次幂 Aⁿ = PDⁿP⁻¹ 与求解微分方程变得简单。مIf A has a full eigenbasis, A=PDP⁻¹ with diagonal D; then Aⁿ=PDⁿP⁻¹, greatly simplifying powers and differential equations.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�31ab00c0f357�body�ٷ对称群 S_n 是由 n 个元素的全部 n! 个置换组成的群，群运算为置换的复合。它是最基本也最丰富的有限群，几乎所有有限群都能嵌入其中。٧The symmetric group S_n consists of all n! permutations of n objects under composition; it is the prototypical finite group, and every finite group embeds in some S_n.�ans��src��\Dummit 与 Foote《Abstract Algebra》；Rotman《An Introduction to the Theory of Groups》�QDummit & Foote, Abstract Algebra; Rotman, An Introduction to the Theory of Groups��id�50bab8d7ad59�body�ټTSP 要在访问每个城市一次后回到起点，使总路程最短。它是经典的 NP 难组合优化问题，近似算法与启发式（如分支定界）广泛用于物流调度。�yTSP seeks the shortest tour visiting every city once; a classic NP-hard problem with algorithms widely used in logistics.�ans��src��iApplegate、Bixby、Chvatal 与 Cook,《The Traveling Salesman Problem》,Princeton University Press,2006�XD. L. Applegate et al., The Traveling Salesman Problem, Princeton University Press, 2006��id�76371f938f69�body�ٷ无标度网络的节点度数服从幂律分布：极少数“枢纽”节点连接极多，多数节点连接很少。这使它对抗随机故障强、但对针对性攻击脆弱。ٗScale-free networks follow a power-law degree distribution with few hubs and many tiny nodes; robust to random failure but fragile to targeted attacks.�ans��src��sBarabási 与 Albert,《Emergence of Scaling in Random Networks》,Science,1999 (DOI: 10.1126/science.286.5439.509)�zBarabási, A.-L. & Albert, R., 'Emergence of Scaling in Random Networks', Science, 1999, DOI: 10.1126/science.286.5439.509��id�9dc607589a99�body���小世界网络兼具“高聚集”与“短平均距离”：多数朋友彼此认识，但少数长程连接让任意两人平均只需几步可达（六度分隔）。它是社交与神经网络的特征。ُSmall-world networks have high clustering yet short average path lengths (six degrees of separation); a hallmark of social and neural networks.�ans��src��:Milgram, S. (1967), 《小世界问题》, 今日心理学�=Milgram, S. (1967), The Small World Problem, Psychology Today��id�cbaab885459a�body���洛伦兹吸引子是简化气象模型产生的混沌轨迹，在三维空间中呈现双涡旋“蝴蝶”形状。它在有限区域内永不重复却始终被吸引在其中，是混沌的标志性图像。٧The Lorenz attractor is the chaotic trajectory of a simplified weather model, a butterfly-shaped double spiral that never repeats yet stays bounded—an icon of chaos.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�d02ca8aaf3ff�body�ٽ正交投影把向量“垂直地”投到某个子空间上，使误差向量与子空间垂直。最小二乘拟合本质上就是求数据点在“模型子空间”上的正交投影。ٜAn orthogonal projection maps a vector perpendicularly onto a subspace so the error is orthogonal to it; least-squares fitting is exactly such a projection.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�ebe9ed2e3d87�body�پ分形维数衡量图形“填充空间”的方式，可以不是整数。科赫雪花周长无限却面积有限，豪斯多夫维数约 1.26；谢尔宾斯基三角垫的维数约 1.58。٢Fractal (Hausdorff) dimension measures how a shape fills space and can be non-integer; the Koch snowflake has dimension ≈1.26, the Sierpiński triangle ≈1.58.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�f45eb47f7580�body�ٰSIR 把人群分为易感(S)、感染(I)、康复(R)三类，用微分方程描述传播。其基本再生数 R₀ 判断是否会出现大流行：R₀>1 时疫情会扩散。َThe SIR model splits a population into Susceptible, Infected, Recovered; its basic reproduction number R₀>1 signals an epidemic will spread.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�25608a167851�body��)z-score 把一个数值减去均值再除以标准差：z = (x−μ)/σ，表示它离平均水平多少个“标准差”。这样摄氏温度、身高等不同单位的数据都能变成同一尺度，便于比较、画正态图，也是很多机器学习算法（如 PCA）的预处理步骤。�/A z-score subtracts the mean and divides by the standard deviation: z = (x−μ)/σ, telling how many standard deviations a value lies from the average. It puts data in different units (temperature, height) onto one scale, aiding comparison and plots, and is standard preprocessing for methods like PCA.�ans��src��.Wasserman, L., 《全部统计学》, Springer�,Wasserman, L., 'All of Statistics', Springer��id�42f9cd9b4ceb�body��+鸽巢原理说，若把多于n个物体放进n个盒子，必有某个盒子含至少两个物体。它看似平凡，却能证明如任意367人中必有同生日者，或抽屉里袜子配对的日常结论。格雷厄姆与格里马尔迪的离散数学教材都以其为题引入组合推理。�4The pigeonhole principle says that if more than n objects are placed into n boxes, some box holds at least two objects. Trivial as it sounds, it proves things like two people sharing a birthday among any 367, or finding a matching pair of socks. Graham and Grimaldi introduce combinatorial reasoning with it.�ans��src��iGraham、Rothschild 与 Spencer《Ramsey Theory》；Grimaldi《Discrete and Combinatorial Mathematics》�]Graham, Rothschild & Spencer, Ramsey Theory; Grimaldi, Discrete and Combinatorial Mathematics��id�447c09f8b35d�body�ُ集合是把一些确定的、互不相同的对象放在一起组成的整体，这些对象称为元素。例如 {1, 2, 3} 是一个集合。�VA set is a collection of distinct, well-defined objects called elements, e.g. {1,2,3}.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�5be971a21d3b�body��y空集是不含任何元素的集合，记作 ∅。它是唯一不含元素的集合，并且是任何集合的子集。�IThe empty set ∅ has no elements; it's unique and a subset of every set.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7d5fd7d5d16c�body��混杂变量是同时影响自变量和因变量的“第三方因素”，会制造虚假关联：例如冰淇淋销量与溺水人数都随气温上升，二者相关却无因果。随机实验或回归中控制混杂变量，才能把真正的因果效应从相关中剥离出来。�BA confounder is a third factor that influences both variables and manufactures a spurious association—ice-cream sales and drownings both rise with temperature, yet neither causes the other. Randomized experiments or regression that controls for confounders is needed to separate true causal effect from mere correlation.�ans��src��TPearl, J. 与 Mackenzie, D., 《为什么之书：因果的新科学》, Basic Books�^Pearl, J. & Mackenzie, D., 'The Book of Why: The New Science of Cause and Effect', Basic Books��id�95f72cdf1d33�body���在向量形式下，它说 |u·v| ≤ |u||v|，等号当且仅当两向量共线。几何上它表示两向量夹角的余弦绝对值不超过 1，是许多不等式与机器学习理论的根基。٨In vector form |u·v| ≤ |u||v|, with equality iff the vectors are collinear; geometrically the cosine of their angle lies in [−1,1]. It underpins many inequalities.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b37827196e54�body��贝叶斯定理用先验概率乘以似然再除以证据的总概率，得到后验概率，从而把新观察纳入判断。它是在条件概率框架下把信念随数据修正的核心公式。贝叶斯1763年的论文与杰恩斯的书是经典出处。�JBayes' theorem multiplies a prior probability by the likelihood and divides by the total probability of the evidence to yield the posterior, incorporating new observation into judgment. It is the core formula for revising belief with data under conditional probability. Bayes's 1763 essay and Jaynes's book are classic references.�ans��src��nBayes《An Essay towards solving a problem》（1763）；Jaynes《Probability Theory: The Logic of Science》�bBayes, An Essay towards solving a problem (1763); Jaynes, Probability Theory: The Logic of Science��id�c4e6eae91e74�body��“肯定前件”：若 P→Q 且 P 成立，则 Q 成立；“否定后件”：若 P→Q 且 Q 不成立，则 P 不成立。二者是命题逻辑里最基本的有效推理规则，保证从真前提必然得到真结论，区别于“肯定后件”这种常见的无效推理。�Modus ponens: from P→Q and P, infer Q. Modus tollens: from P→Q and not-Q, infer not-P. These are the fundamental valid inference rules of propositional logic, guaranteeing true conclusions from true premises—unlike the fallacious 'affirming the consequent.'�ans��src��EEnderton, H. B., 《逻辑的数学导引》(第2版), Academic Press�QEnderton, H. B., 'A Mathematical Introduction to Logic' (2nd ed.), Academic Press��id�d5c92698122c�body���秩-零度定理说：线性变换的秩（像的维数）与其零度（核的维数）之和等于定义域维数，即 rank + nullity = n。它揭示了“信息保留”与“信息丢失”的此消彼长。ْRank–nullity: rank (dimension of image) plus nullity (dimension of kernel) equals the domain dimension n; it balances information kept vs. lost.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�fecf2c2fff0a�body�ف若集合 A 的所有元素都在集合 B 中，则称 A 是 B 的子集，记作 A ⊆ B。例如 {1,2} 是 {1,2,3} 的子集。�VA is a subset of B if every element of A is in B, written A⊆B; e.g. {1,2}⊆{1,2,3}.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�002dd2e1fb73�body�ٓ用数字记时间能让全世界的钟表说同一种“语言”，约时间不会乱。数字把流动的时间切成了能比较的小格子。ٟWriting time as numbers lets clocks everywhere speak the same language, so meetings do not get mixed up. Numbers cut flowing time into comparable little boxes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�07f431172780�body�٤十进制因为十个手指最自然，但电脑喜欢用二进制（只用0和1）。不同的进制只是换一种数数的包装，东西的多少其实没变。ٯBase ten feels natural because of ten fingers, but computers like base two (only 0 and 1). Different bases are just different wrappers for counting; the amount stays the same.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�08e3dec280cf�body��-平均速度是“总路程÷总时间”，反映一段过程的快慢；瞬时速度是把这段时间缩到极短（趋于 0）时平均速度的极限，也就是那一瞬间的快慢。正是这个“取极限”的想法，让导数能表示瞬时变化率，是微积分处理运动的核心。�8Average speed is total distance over total time, describing a whole interval; instantaneous speed is the limit of that average as the interval shrinks to zero—the speed at that exact moment. This 'take the limit' idea lets the derivative represent an instantaneous rate and is the heart of calculus for motion.�ans��src��.Stewart, J., 《微积分》(第8版), Cengage�*Stewart, J., 'Calculus' (8th ed.), Cengage��id�09c6d4d09493�body��~地球绕太阳一圈其实要365天多一点点。每四年把少算的大约一天补回来，加在二月，就是闰年。ٍEarth's trip around the Sun actually takes a bit more than 365 days. Every four years we add the missing day to February, making a leap year.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�1b755ac47f11�body�ٺ球面三角学研究球面上由大圆弧构成的三角形。由于在球面上“直线”是大圆，其内角和大于 180°，常用球面余弦定理计算航海与天文距离。�"Spherical trigonometry studies triangles on a sphere bounded by arcs of great circles; since straight lines on a sphere are represented by great circles, their angle sum exceeds 180 degrees, and the spherical law of cosines is commonly used to compute distances in navigation and astronomy.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�28a86d16c80c�body�ل最大公约数是两个或多个整数共有约数中最大的一个。例如12和18的公约数有1、2、3、6，最大的是6。�pThe greatest common divisor (GCD) is the largest positive integer dividing all given numbers; e.g. GCD(12,18)=6.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2ba251b37ebc�body�ٙ镶嵌是用一种形状不重叠、不露缝地把平面铺满，像地砖。三角形、正方形和六边形都能漂亮地镶嵌，圆形却不行。٩Tessellation is covering a flat surface with one shape, no overlaps and no gaps, like floor tiles. Triangles, squares and hexagons tessellate nicely, but circles cannot.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2c2059539794�body�ٗ对很远的路，我们用更大的单位，比如公里，等于1000米。卫星还能用光或信号来回的时间算出地球到月亮有多远。٬For far roads we use bigger units like the kilometer, equal to 1000 meters. Satellites can even use the travel time of light or signals to measure the distance to the Moon.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3c738e70586e�body�ك电脑用二进制，只认0和1，就像回答“是”或“否”。把很多个对错叠起来，就能算出复杂的问题。ٍComputers use binary, recognizing only 0 and 1, like answering yes or no. Stacking many right-or-wrong answers lets them solve hard problems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4fb08d91b471�body�ٱ质数只能被1和它自己整除，比如2、3、5、7。除了1和它自己，不能再被别的整数整除，所以质数被称为构成所有整数的“基本构件”。٨A prime number can only be divided evenly by 1 and itself, like 2, 3, 5, 7. No other whole number divides it cleanly, which makes primes the building blocks of numbers.�ans��src��RNiven, I., Zuckerman, H. S., Montgomery, H. L.，《数论导引》(第5版),Wiley�kNiven, I., Zuckerman, H. S., Montgomery, H. L., 'An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers' (5th ed.), Wiley��id�65c9f4e1fe4b�body�ٜ已经发生、无法收回的钱（如看了一半的烂片票）不该左右未来选择。理性决策只看边际成本与收益，也就是往前看。ٷMoney already spent and unrecoverable (like a half-watched bad movie ticket) should not sway future choices. Rational decisions look only at marginal costs and benefits, i.e. forward.�ans��src�ِArkes 与 Blumer,《The psychology of sunk cost》,Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes,1985 (DOI: 10.1016/0749-5978(85)90049-4)ٌArkes & Blumer, 'The psychology of sunk cost', Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes, 1985, DOI: 10.1016/0749-5978(85)90049-4��id�68957b2cc84c�body�ي平均数把一堆数加起来再均分成几份，代表一个“中间水平”。但它会盖住特别大或特别小的个别情况。َAn average adds a bunch of numbers and splits them evenly, standing for a middle level. But it hides especially big or small individual cases.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�6d7466ac025a�body���我们只看到活下来的样本（如返航战机上没中弹的部位），忽略了被淘汰的（被击落的），于是得出错误结论。二战统计学家瓦尔德据此建议加固无弹孔处。��We only see survivors (e.g. returning planes' intact spots) and ignore the eliminated (shot-down planes), leading to wrong conclusions. Statistician Wald thus advised reinforcing the unhit areas.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7919eff0b760�body�ي分数像把一个披萨切成几块后拿走其中几块，比如1/2就是一半。它帮我们说出不完整、却很真实的数量。يA fraction is like cutting a pizza into pieces and taking some, such as 1/2 for half. It lets us name amounts that are real but not whole.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7b0f2ad10e3c�body��1两只骰子各有 6 面，共 36 种等可能结果；和为 2 只有 (1,1) 一种，概率 1/36，而和为 7 有 (1,6)(2,5)(3,4)(4,3)(5,2)(6,1) 六种，概率 6/36 = 1/6。组合数越多越可能，这正是两颗骰子点数之和呈现“中间高、两端低”的对称三角形分布的原因。�)Two dice give 36 equally likely outcomes; sum 2 occurs only as (1,1), probability 1/36, while sum 7 occurs as six pairs (1,6)…(6,1), probability 6/36 = 1/6. More combinations mean higher probability—the sum of two fair dice follows a symmetric triangular distribution that peaks in the middle.�ans��src��LGrinstead, C. M. 与 Snell, J. L., 《概率导论》, 美国数学会 (AMS)�]Grinstead, C. M. & Snell, J. L., 'Introduction to Probability', American Mathematical Society��id�7b83df535165�body�ف对称图形沿着一条中线对折后，两边能完全重合，像雪花和人脸。数学里对称是一种重要的规律。ٛA symmetrical figure folds along a center line so both halves match exactly, like a snowflake or a face. In math, symmetry is an important kind of pattern.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�7df7757bff09�body�ٖ在拓扑学里只看“连续变形”，甜甜圈（环面）和带一个把手的杯子都能慢慢变成对方，所以被视为同一类形状。�mIn topology, a donut (torus) and a one-handled mug can be deformed into each other, so they're the same type.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�9aead511d875�body�٨负数是比零还小的数，用来表示欠债或零下温度这样的“缺少”。古人用钱和温度时发现，光有正数不够用，于是创造了负数。��Negative numbers are smaller than zero and show a shortage, like debt or below-freezing temperature. People found that positive numbers alone were not enough for money and weather, so negatives were created.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�9e95193950f3�body�ي三角形的侧面能把重量稳稳传向底边，不容易塌。古人发现这种形状又结实又省料，就用来建大金字塔。٦Triangular sides carry weight safely down to the base and resist collapse. Ancient builders found this shape strong and efficient, so they used it for great pyramids.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�9e97d424ee4d�body�ٜ平面图形只有长和宽，像画在纸上的圆；立体图形还有高，像能拿在手里的球。立体图形占了真实的空间，能装东西。٭Flat shapes have only length and width, like a circle drawn on paper. Solid shapes also have height, like a ball you can hold. Solids take up real space and can hold things.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a87495d069f4�body�ٵ贝祖等式说：对任意整数 a,b，存在整数 x,y 使 a·x + b·y = gcd(a,b)。它既说明最大公约数是 a,b 的线性组合，也是欧几里得算法的理论依据。ٝBézout's identity: for integers a,b there exist x,y with a·x+b·y=gcd(a,b); it shows the gcd is a linear combination and underlies the Euclidean algorithm.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c8c2a1643d5b�body�ٙ用同样长的边围地，圆能圈出最大的面积，所以罐头做成圆的最省铁皮。方形的角会“浪费”一点边能圈到的空间。ٟWith the same length of edge, a circle encloses the most area, so round cans save the most metal. Square corners waste a bit of the space the edge could cover.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d6eac0d9e104�body�٢三条边长度定下来，三角形的样子就完全固定，不会再变形。四边形边长固定还能被压成菱形，所以三角形常被用来加固。��Once a triangle's three side lengths are set, its shape is locked and cannot change. A four-sided shape with fixed sides can still be squashed into a rhombus, so triangles are used to brace things.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�df1230a02ff7�body���中奖组合只有一种，但差一个数字的组合有成千上万种，所以几乎每次开奖都有大量差一点的票；这并不说明你运气好，只是零事件附近的近邻很多。��There is only one winning combination, but millions of combinations are off by a single number, so nearly every draw produces many near-misses. That does not mean you were lucky; near-misses are just numerous.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e1bb3cabc15f�body�٘在数字里，零占着一个位置却表示没有，这让我们能分清21和201。没有零占位，我们就很难写出又大又清楚的数字。ٙIn a number, zero holds a place while meaning nothing, so we can tell 21 from 201. Without zero holding places, big clear numbers would be hard to write.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e1e26d14d9d1�body�ي斐波那契数列从0、1开始，后面每项等于前两项之和：0,1,1,2,3,5,8,13…。它常出现在花瓣数和螺旋排列中。فThe Fibonacci sequence starts 0,1 and each term is the sum of the previous two (0,1,1,2,3,5,8,13…), seen in petals and spirals.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�e401f9f460ee�body�٥印度人（约5到6世纪）首次把0当作可以参与运算的数，而不只是空位，使进位制和代数成为可能，是现代记数与计算的基石。��Around the 5th-6th centuries, Indians first treated zero as a number that could be operated on, not merely a placeholder, enabling place-value notation and algebra, the foundation of modern calculation.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�e52cb2026ce9�body�ٍ大脑喜欢能预测的东西，重复的图案让眼睛知道下一步看到什么。所以整齐的花纹常让人觉得安心、好看。ٖBrains like things they can predict, and repeating patterns let the eye know what comes next. That is why neat designs often feel soothing and pretty.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f560c93e3a2f�body�ُ质数只能被1和自己整除，像2、3、5、7。今天电脑用很大的质数来给秘密信息上锁，保护我们的聊天和付款。ٛPrime numbers divide only by 1 and themselves, like 2, 3, 5, 7. Today computers use huge primes to lock secret messages and protect our chats and payments.�ans��src��dK. H. Rosen《Elementary Number Theory and Its Applications》（第6版），Pearson，2011，§6.2�YK. H. Rosen, Elementary Number Theory and Its Applications, 6th ed., Pearson, 2011, §6.2��id�02c451f74ed3�body��r两条直线相遇的地方叫角。比直角尖、张得小的叫锐角；比直角宽、张得大的叫钝角。يAn angle is where two lines meet. A sharp, narrow one smaller than a right angle is acute; a wide one bigger than a right angle is obtuse.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�083fbafe4a6b�body�ٗ把边长为a+b的大正方形分成四块：a²、b²和两个ab的长方形，加起来就是a²+2ab+b²。图形一摆，公式就自己出来了。ِA big square of side a+b splits into a², b² and two rectangles ab, totaling a²+2ab+b². Lay out the pieces and the formula appears by itself.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�0a385b186566�body�ټ洛书九宫格是中国上古传说中的三阶幻方，每行每列和两条对角线数字和都等于15，后来经印度、阿拉伯传入欧洲，并与占星、装饰艺术结合。ٯThe Luoshu is a Chinese 3x3 magic square where every row, column and diagonal sums to 15; it later spread via India and Arabia to Europe, blending with astrology and ornament.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0f7b405352f7�body�ٙ它们身上的条纹和斑点也是一种规律图案，帮动物藏在草丛或树林里。对数学来说，这是大自然重复排列的好例子。ٔStripes and spots are pattern designs that help animals hide in grass or trees. To math, they are great examples of nature's repeating arrangements.�ans��src��GGrünbaum, B. 与 Shephard, G. C., 《镶嵌与图案》, W. H. Freeman�FGrünbaum, B. & Shephard, G. C., 'Tilings and Patterns', W. H. Freeman��id�0ff5c367b6c9�body�٫是的，0到9的十进制位值制记数法由古印度人发明（包含0的概念），经阿拉伯学者如花拉子米传入欧洲，所以被称为阿拉伯数字。��Yes: the decimal place-value system 0-9 was invented in ancient India (including the concept of zero) and transmitted to Europe via Arab scholars such as al-Khwarizmi, hence the name Arabic numerals.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�123932713dbf�body�٨12能被2、3、4、6整除，分起东西来比10更方便，所以一小时分12刻、一打是12个沿用至今。算盘上珠以一代五，也暗合这种分法。ٟ12 divides by 2,3,4,6, making sharing easier than 10, so an hour has 12 parts and a dozen is 12. The abacus upper bead standing for five also fits this scheme.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�13f413c08e32�body�ل三种出法互相克制，谁也没有永远赢的办法，所以大致公平。它靠的是随机出拳，而不是力气大小。يThe three moves beat each other in a loop, so no choice always wins, making it roughly fair. It relies on random choices, not on strength.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�14a266ad26fa�body�ٓ数据是用数字或符号记录下来的事实与观察，例如温度、人数、得分。把数据整理好，就能发现规律和做决定。�yData are recorded facts and observations like temperatures or scores; organized well, they reveal patterns for decisions.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�19b70d4b6250�body�ي二十进制可能源于用手指加脚趾共二十个计数单位。玛雅人还用点横表示数字，并早早使用了零的符号。ٟBase 20 likely came from counting all fingers and toes, twenty in total. The Maya wrote numbers with dots and bars and used a symbol for zero remarkably early.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�1c09d395e9cb�body��\众数是一组数据中出现次数最多的数值。例如 1、2、2、3 的众数是 2。�JThe mode is the most frequently occurring value; in 1,2,2,3 the mode is 2.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�1efccd22a26b�body�ٜ买一送一相当于花一份钱得两件，即五折；第二件半价是两件共花一点五份钱，相当于七五折。所以买一送一更划算。٠Buy-one-get-one-free means paying one price for two items, a 50% discount; the second at half price costs 1.5 prices for two, a 25% discount. So BOGO is better.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�2565b4ba2021�body�ٴ无穷大像一个永远走不到头的数字队伍，表示“没有尽头”。它不是一个普通的数字，而是一个想法，告诉我们有些东西可以一直继续。ْInfinity is like a line of numbers that never ends; it means “no limit.” It is not a normal number but an idea that some things go on forever.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2784de5a245a�body�٫两个完全相同的三角形可以拼成一个平行四边形，平行四边形面积是底乘高，所以一个三角形就取其一半。剪拼一下就能看明白。ًTwo identical triangles form a parallelogram whose area is base times height, so one triangle is half of that. Cut and rearrange to see it.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�285e52372c3c�body�٦看规律：2的3、2、1次方是8、4、2，每降一次除以2，那么2的0次方自然是1，规律才连续。也可由a^m÷a^m=1且等于a^(m−m)=a^0推出。يLook at the pattern: 2^3,2^2,2^1 are 8,4,2, halving each step, so 2^0 must be 1 to keep it continuous. Or a^m÷a^m=1 equals a^(m−m)=a^0.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�2a03fecd36f4�body�ٍ天气受很多因素影响，没法百分之百确定。科学家算出一个可能性，比如60%会下雨，帮我们决定带不带伞。ٚWeather depends on many factors and cannot be 100% certain. Scientists work out a likelihood, like a 60% chance of rain, to help us decide on an umbrella.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2b763cd67d30�body�٘除以一个数就是乘以它的倒数，分数也不例外。比如÷1/2等于×2，相当于问这个数里包含几个二分之一，自然翻倍。ٯDividing by a number means multiplying by its reciprocal, and fractions are no exception. Dividing by 1/2 equals times 2, asking how many halves fit, which doubles the amount.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�31ec406af71f�body�ً没有最大的数。无论你说出多大的数，只要在它后面加一个1，就会变得更大。所以数字可以一直数下去。مThere is no biggest number. No matter how big a number you name, you can always add 1 to make a bigger one, so numbers go on forever.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�3377629282f5�body�٢如果两种出法出现机会一样、互相克制，游戏就公平。每种手势都能赢一种、输一种、平一种，所以没有永远不败的招数。�kIf each move is equally likely and beats one/loses to one/ties one, the game is fair—no move always wins.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�338a3d9b4367�body��把 1/2 看成“一半”，则 (1/2)×(1/3) 是“一半的三分之一”，即整体分成 2×3=6 份取 1 份，得 1/6。代数上 a/b · c/d = (ac)/(bd) 正是“把两块各均分后再交叉拼成 b×d 格”的结果，所以分子分母分别相乘。�See 1/2 as 'half'; then (1/2)×(1/3) is 'a third of a half'—the whole split into 2×3=6 equal parts, taking 1, gives 1/6. Algebraically a/b·c/d=(ac)/(bd) is exactly what you get by cross-combining the b and d equal divisions, so numerators and denominators multiply separately.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�3ac198cb6cd1�body�ټ不同地方的人曾经用不同的符号写数字，比如罗马数字Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ。后来大家发现我们现在用的阿拉伯数字0到9最方便，就慢慢传遍了全世界。٨People in different places once used different symbols, like Roman numerals I, II, III. Later everyone found our 0–9 digits easiest, and they spread around the world.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�46190eab8168�body��乘法是“重复相加”，任何数加 0 次仍是 0，所以 a×0=0。但除法是乘法的逆：若 x = a÷0，则应满足 x×0 = a；可任何数乘 0 都得 0，无法等于非零的 a，而若 a=0 又会有无穷多解，所以除以 0 没有确定答案，被禁止。�Multiplication is repeated addition, and adding anything zero times gives 0, so a×0=0. Division is the inverse: x = a÷0 would require x×0 = a, but anything times 0 is 0—never a nonzero a—and if a=0 every x works, so division by 0 has no definite answer and is forbidden.�ans��src��HStewart, I. 与 Tall, D., 《数学的基础》, Oxford University Press�QStewart, I. & Tall, D., 'The Foundations of Mathematics', Oxford University Press��id�5743a593b2cf�body���范数把一个向量“长度化”为一个非负实数，满足非负性、齐次性和三角不等式。常见如 L1（绝对值和）、L2（欧几里得长度）、L∞（最大分量）。ٕA norm assigns each vector a nonnegative 'length' satisfying positivity, homogeneity and the triangle inequality; examples are L1, L2 and L∞ norms.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�59ab4f11f80a�body�ي中奖的号码只是很多可能里的一个，抽中的机会很小。大多数时候抽到的是别的号码，所以不中很正常。ٙThe winning number is just one of many possibilities, so the chance of hitting it is small. Most times another number is drawn, so not winning is normal.�ans��src��LGrinstead, C. M. 与 Snell, J. L., 《概率导论》, 美国数学会 (AMS)�]Grinstead, C. M. & Snell, J. L., 'Introduction to Probability', American Mathematical Society��id�60a03709fad9�body��_可能性表示某件事发生的机会大小，介于0（不可能）和1（必然）之间。�XProbability measures how likely an event is, ranging from 0 (impossible) to 1 (certain).�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�63d8ddfd9852�body��o统计图表（如条形图、折线图、饼图）把数据变成图形，便于比较大小和发现规律。�OStatistical charts (bar, line, pie) turn data into visuals for easy comparison.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6456a8618cbd�body��l图由一些点（顶点）和连接点的线（边）组成，用来表示关系，例如朋友关系网。�eA graph has dots (vertices) joined by lines (edges) to show relationships, like a friendship network.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�69fbf98e93a2�body�ق古时候人们看月亮圆缺大约12次，刚好接近地球绕太阳一圈的时间。于是就把一年分成12个月来记。وLong ago people saw the Moon grow full about 12 times, close to one trip of Earth around the Sun. So they split the year into 12 months.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6f845976fbc8�body�ٟ算盘是算筹记数的便携化：用珠子代替筹棍，按档定位。它更快、更省空间、便于商业计算，自元明以后逐渐取代算筹。ٶThe abacus made rod arithmetic portable: beads replaced rods on positioned columns. Faster and more compact for commerce, it gradually replaced rods from the Yuan-Ming period onward.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�74237490e882�body�٘松果上的鳞片常排成两组旋转的螺旋，一组往左转，一组往右转。数一数，螺旋的圈数常常是斐波那契数，像5和8。٣A pinecone's scales often form two sets of spirals, one turning left and one right. Count them and the numbers of spirals are often Fibonacci numbers like 5 and 8.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�74bbf364446f�body��-方程两边同减3，得到 x = 5−3 = 2。�0Subtract 3 from both sides to get x = 5−3 = 2.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7521307eaebc�body�ٍ球是圆的，每一点离中心都一样远，所以朝哪边推它都能顺利转。方盒子只有边能碰地，就没法顺畅滚动。٩A ball is round, with every point equally far from the center, so it turns smoothly in any direction. A box only touches the ground on its edges, so it cannot roll well.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7bb3c7837b0e�body�ٍ骰子每一面朝上的机会一样，所以谁也猜不准会掷出几。这种“公平的不确定”让游戏变得又紧张又好玩。نEach face of a die has the same chance to land up, so no one can guess the number. This fair uncertainty makes games exciting and fun.�ans��src��LGrinstead, C. M. 与 Snell, J. L., 《概率导论》, 美国数学会 (AMS)�]Grinstead, C. M. & Snell, J. L., 'Introduction to Probability', American Mathematical Society��id�80041dd10537�body�ٺ亲和数是一对正整数，其中每个数等于另一个数的真因数（不含自身）之和。最小的一对是 (220, 284)：220 的真因数之和为 284，284 的则为 220。�vAmicable numbers are a pair where each equals the sum of the other's proper divisors; the smallest pair is (220, 284).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�850eb0e7663d�body�ف镜子其实是把前后反过来，不是左右。因为我们习惯用“左右”来说话，看起来就像左右对换了。نA mirror actually flips front and back, not left and right. Because we describe things as left-right, it looks like our sides swapped.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8f2a7d1fa98a�body�ق数量是真实的东西有多少，比如桌上的三个苹果。数字是我们用来代表这个多少的符号，像“3”。ـAn amount is how many real things there are, like three apples on a table. A number is the symbol we use for that, like “3.”�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8fb480ecb6e1�body�ي镶嵌图案是用同样的形状一块块拼满地面，中间不空也不叠，像浴室地砖。正方形和三角形都很会镶嵌。يA tiling pattern fills the floor with the same shapes, no gaps and no overlaps, like bathroom tiles. Squares and triangles tile very well.�ans��src��GGrünbaum, B. 与 Shephard, G. C., 《镶嵌与图案》, W. H. Freeman�FGrünbaum, B. & Shephard, G. C., 'Tilings and Patterns', W. H. Freeman��id�934567687759�body��b帕斯卡三角（中国称杨辉三角，南宋杨辉 1261 年记载）的每一行是二项式展开系数，且左右对称。它同时隐藏着斐波那契数列（斜向求和）、各行的和是 2 的幂、以及「曲棍球杆」恒等式等无数规律。它连接了组合数学、概率与代数，是数学中模式最丰富的结构之一。�{Pascal's triangle (Yanghui's triangle in China, recorded by Yang Hui in 1261) gives binomial expansion coefficients, symmetric across each row. It also hides the Fibonacci numbers (diagonal sums), row sums that are powers of 2, and countless other patterns like the hockey-stick identity. It links combinatorics, probability, and algebra as one of math's richest pattern sources.�ans��src��M杨辉《详解九章算法》（1261）；大英百科全书（Britannica）�CYang Hui, Xiangjie Jiuzhang Suanfa (1261); Encyclopaedia Britannica��id�abc973f5f0bf�body�ى古巴比伦人喜欢用60这个数，因为它能被很多数整除，分起来方便。这个习惯一直留到了今天的钟表上。ْAncient Babylonians liked the number 60 because it divides evenly by many numbers, making splits easy. The habit stayed on our clocks to this day.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�ae2065acbbe3�body�ٹ幻方是把数字排成方阵，使每行、每列及两条对角线的和都相等。最著名的是洛书（三阶幻方）：每行每列和为15。它兼具数学与游戏之美。مA magic square arranges numbers so every row, column and diagonal sums equally; the classic 3×3 Lo Shu square sums to 15 throughout.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�aed6aacb459f�body�ي分类分组是把具有共同特征的事物归到一起，例如把水果按颜色分组，这正是集合思想在日常中的体现。�`Grouping sorts items sharing a feature—e.g. fruits by color—an everyday use of the set idea.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b2d7cd73e573�body���克莱因瓶是一个没有内外之分、只有一个面的“瓶子”，在三维中必须自我穿透才能画出，但在四维空间里可以真正不相交地存在。它是单侧曲面的有趣例子。٪A Klein bottle has no inside or outside and only one surface; in 3D it must intersect itself, but in 4D it exists without self-crossing. It is a famous one-sided surface.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b7eaa8f9fa27�body�ٓ我们拿一个固定的小单位，比如厘米或一把尺，沿着东西比一比。数出有多少个这样的单位，就知道它有多长。يWe take a fixed small unit, like a centimeter or a ruler, and compare it along the thing. Counting how many units fit tells us its length.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b9c9573cd49a�body�ٍ日历把日子、月份和年份排成一张大表，帮我们记住节日和约会。没有日历，就很容易忘记重要的那一天。ٛA calendar lays out days, months and years in one big table, helping us remember holidays and meetings. Without it, we would easily forget important dates.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c00522bb72fd�body�ٍ只有正三角形、正方形和正六边形三种，因为它们的内角能整除360度。正五边形不行，会在拼缝处留空隙。ٓOnly the equilateral triangle, square and regular hexagon work alone, because their interior angles divide 360°. The regular pentagon leaves gaps.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c0273bdb1467�body��j均匀硬币只有正反两面且机会相等，所以正面朝上的概率是 1/2（也就是一半）。�JA fair coin has two equally likely outcomes, so heads has probability 1/2.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�c102b9d5bf8a�body�ه把各位数字相加，若和是3的倍数，原数就能被3整除。例如 123：1+2+3=6，是3的倍数，所以123能被3整除。�lSum the digits; if that sum is divisible by 3, so is the number. For 123, 1+2+3=6, so 123 is divisible by 3.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c5cb7dcec4f1�body��x长方形（矩形）有四条边、四个直角，对边长度相等。正方形是四边都相等的特殊长方形。�rA rectangle has four right angles with opposite sides equal; a square is a special rectangle with all sides equal.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c8db3520763e�body�ٙ闭环是首尾相连、没有端点的一条线，像画一个圆圈。在拓扑里，能不能把闭环不断缩小成一点，能区分不同形状。�wA closed loop is a line with no ends, like a circle; whether it can shrink to a point tells shapes apart topologically.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�cf5800f56617�body���早期用空位表示零（算筹留空），后来在书写中用圆圈○表示空缺的数位。虽然没有独立的零符号参与运算，但十进位值制已经隐含了零的作用。��Early on, an empty space among the rods stood for zero; later a circle symbol marked the empty place. There was no independent operational zero at first, but the decimal place-value system already implied its role.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�cfa6e79fbd26�body�ٙ很多古老的文化都数到7就停，因为能看见的“会动的天体”有7个：太阳、月亮和五颗亮星星。于是定下一星期7天。ٜMany old cultures stopped at 7 because they saw seven moving lights in the sky: the Sun, the Moon and five bright planets. That is how the 7-day week began.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d99a95192562�body�ٚ从1、1开始，后面每个数都是前面两个数相加：1、1、2、3、5、8、13。像兔子繁殖的故事里，这个数串会自然冒出来。ٖStart with 1, 1, and each next number adds the two before: 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13. This string appears naturally, even in a story about rabbit families.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e4190ebc63a1�body�َ因为圆周率π约等于3.14，美国写法3/14正好对应3月14日。这一天常用来庆祝数学，也有人吃派（pie）玩谐音。ـPi is about 3.14, and in the US date format 3/14 means March 14. It is celebrated as a math holiday, often with pie for the pun.�ans��src��`Fiori,《PI DAY: An Irrational Holiday》,Math Horizons,2016 (DOI: 10.4169/mathhorizons.23.3.16)�^Fiori, 'PI DAY: An Irrational Holiday', Math Horizons, 2016, DOI: 10.4169/mathhorizons.23.3.16��id�e764f8713761�body��f能被2整除的整数是偶数（如2、4、6），除以2余1的整数是奇数（如1、3、5）。�cEven integers are divisible by 2 (2,4,6); odd integers leave remainder 1 when divided by 2 (1,3,5).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e9c08fa6e7ab�body�ل数轴是一条画了刻度的直线，用点表示数：右边的数总比左边的大。它是理解加减和大小的好工具。ـA number line is a straight line with marks; each point is a number, right means greater. It helps visualize addition and order.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�f6df26947ef6�body�ٟ通分是把不同分母的分数换成相同的分母，好让它们分母一样、只比分子。本质是找公倍数作统一刻度，才能相加相减。ٻFinding a common denominator rewrites fractions with the same bottom number so you compare numerators only. It uses a common multiple as a shared scale, enabling addition and subtraction.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�f708c2184880�body�ٖ假设全是鸡则有70只脚，多出24只脚，每只兔比鸡多2脚，所以兔有12只，鸡有23只。这是用假设法解二元一次问题。ٯIf all were chickens there would be 70 feet; the extra 24 feet mean 12 rabbits (each has 2 more feet), leaving 23 chickens. It is a guess-and-check way to solve two equations.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�fbbda411ebe5�body��o圆是平面上到一个固定点（圆心）距离相等的所有点连成的闭合曲线，像车轮的边。�kA circle is the set of points in a plane at a fixed distance from a center point, like the edge of a wheel.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�fd42c2e90435�body��x正方体的六个面都是一样大的正方形，平平的能稳稳叠在一起。圆球会到处滚，就不好堆。�xA cube has six equal square faces that sit flat, so boxes stack steadily. Round balls roll away and are hard to pile up.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�feddcd17be43�body���正多面体要求每个面是全等的相同正多边形，且每个顶点汇聚相同数量的面。由于多边形内角必须使若干个能拼成小于 360° 的立体角，几何上只允许三角形、正方形和五边形这三种面，并仅能组合出正四面体、立方体、正八面体、正十二面体和正二十面体五种。柏拉图曾把它们与地水火风及宇宙第五元素相对应。��A regular solid requires identical regular polygons as faces meeting equally at each vertex. Because the polygon angles must sum to less than 360° to form a solid corner, only triangles, squares, and pentagons work, yielding exactly five: tetrahedron, cube, octahedron, dodecahedron, and icosahedron. Plato associated them with earth, water, fire, air, and the cosmos's fifth element.�ans��src��O欧几里得《几何原本》第十三卷；大英百科全书（Britannica）�4Euclid, Elements Book XIII; Encyclopaedia Britannica��id�math_25_006�body��
把数字想成温度计:0度往上正数爬升,往下负数钻探,可以一直钻到零下十度、零下一百度……数轴两头都是无限的,0只是中间的起点。负数不是不存在的数,而是比0更少的意思——欠一块钱就是负一块钱。��Think thermometer: zero is the middle start, positives climb, negatives drill below to minus ten or minus one hundred — endless both ways. Negatives are real numbers meaning less than nothing-owned: owing one yuan is minus one.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�00f2e8531161�body���这是指数增长的特征：早期基数小，翻倍所需时间固定，所以绝对增量起初不明显；一旦基数变大，每单位时间新增的人会越来越多，曲线变得陡峭。��This is the signature of exponential growth: the doubling time is constant, so absolute daily additions stay small at first; once the base is large, each doubling adds far more cases and the curve steepens sharply.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�08b03b724c1f�body�ل因为我们大多数人有一双手，一共十个手指。古人用手指帮忙数数，慢慢就习惯了一逢十就进一位。فMost people have two hands with ten fingers total. Long ago people counted on their fingers, so they got used to grouping by ten.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�13348a482f08�body�٫杨辉三角是把数字排成三角形，每个数是它上方两数之和。它出现在组合数、二项式展开和概率中，是中国古代数学的重要成果。ٶPascal's triangle arranges numbers so each is the sum of the two above. It appears in combinations, binomial expansions and probability—an ancient Chinese mathematical achievement.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�1a087080f445�body��{地球自己转一圈，朝着太阳的一面是白天，背对太阳的一面是黑夜。转完一圈大约就是一天。�xEarth spins once, and the side facing the Sun has day while the opposite side has night. One full spin is about one day.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�2636a7dd744e�body�ٖ圆圆的轮子转起来时，车离地面的高度一直一样，所以坐车不会一颠一颠。方轮子转起来会上下跳，坐着很难受。ُA round wheel stays the same distance from the ground as it turns, so the ride is smooth. A square wheel would bump up and down and feel awful.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�28413e328c67�body�ف规律就是按一定顺序一直重复的东西，比如红蓝红蓝。发现了规律，我们就能猜出下一个是什么。كA pattern is something that repeats in an order, like red, blue, red, blue. Once we spot the pattern, we can guess what comes next.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�2c98f2ce9db8�body��零度以下就是负数，比如零下5度写作−5℃，表示比0度还冷5度。负数在这里就是零以下的距离。�tBelow zero is negative; minus 5°C means 5 degrees colder than zero. Here negatives are simply distances below zero.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�373890a80f33�body�ٍ把两点拉一根绷紧的绳子，它自然成直线，因为任何弯路都比直着走要长。这是几何里最直观的一条真理。ًPull a taut string between two points and it forms a straight line, since any detour is longer. It is the most intuitive truth in geometry.�ans��src��PGreenberg《Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries》；Euclid《几何原本》�CGreenberg, Euclidean and Non-Euclidean Geometries; Euclid, Elements��id�3cdd19c17566�body��U是的。红球比蓝球多，所以摸到红球的可能性更大，概率是 2/3。�DYes—more red balls means red is more likely, with probability 2/3.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�42b9bd76421b�body�ّ哈希把‘键’直接变成存放位置，理想情况下一步到位，平均 O(1)；而逐个查找要 O(n)。代价是需要处理碰撞。ٛA hash turns the key directly into a storage location, ideally in one step at average O(1), versus O(n) for linear search. The cost is handling collisions.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�4ada6a43f136�body�ٓ棋盘小、状态有限，先手用中心开局并对称防守即可保证不败。它是完全信息博弈中最优策略存在的最简例子。��The board is tiny with finite states; the first player opening in the center and defending symmetrically cannot lose. It is the simplest example of an optimal strategy in a perfect-information game.�ans��src��dBerlekamp, J. H., Conway, J. H. & Guy, R. K.《Winning Ways for Your Mathematical Plays》,MIT Press�aBerlekamp, J. H., Conway, J. H. & Guy, R. K., Winning Ways for Your Mathematical Plays, MIT Press��id�51ff6500f66a�body�ٓ“一定”是肯定会发生，比如太阳会升起。“可能”是也许会，“不可能”是绝对不会，比如太阳从西边出来。٦“Certain” means it will surely happen, like the Sun rising. “Maybe” means it might, and “impossible” means it never will, like the Sun rising in the west.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�63ba13d525de�body�ل1、2、3是最少的几个数，最容易用手指比出来。学会了小的，再一点点往上加，就能数到更大的数。�1, 2, 3 are the smallest counts and easiest to show on fingers. After small numbers, we add one at a time to reach bigger ones.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�647414c28c84�body�٥没有固定必胜招：若双方都随机出，每种手势胜率都是1/3，这是零和对称博弈的纳什均衡。想赢只能利用对手的非随机习惯。ٵNo fixed winning move: if both play randomly each throw wins 1/3 of the time—a symmetric zero-sum Nash equilibrium. You can only win by exploiting an opponent's non-random habits.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�679f69fa84d3�body�ٔ小数看的是几分之几：0.5是二分之一，0.25是四分之一。半个比四分之一个当然大，数字位数多少和大小没关系。وDecimals are fractions: 0.5 is one half, 0.25 is one quarter. Half is more than a quarter, so the number of digits does not decide size.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�6ebc786e24c2�body��;三角形有3条边和3个角，是最简单的多边形。�?A triangle has 3 sides and 3 angles; it's the simplest polygon.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�71535461bf00�body�ٴ抛两枚有正正、正反、反正、反反四种等可能结果。一正一反包含正反和反正两种，所以概率1/2，比正正的1/4更可能；顺序会误导直觉。ٜTwo coins give HH, HT, TH, TT, all equally likely. One head one tail covers HT and TH, so its chance is 1/2, more than HH's 1/4; order tricks our intuition.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7b610bf702a8�body��/正方形有4条一样长的边和4个直角。�.A square has 4 equal sides and 4 right angles.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�83a8dcaf6951�body��&六边形能像正方形、三角形一样严丝合缝地铺满平面（密铺），但在同样周长下围成的面积最大、也最省筑巢的蜡。大自然用“最省材料”的形状，于是蜂巢成了六边形——这既是数学里的平面密铺，也是动物智慧的例子。�A hexagon tiles the plane without gaps like squares or triangles, but encloses the most area for a given perimeter, saving wax. Nature picks the most material-efficient shape, so honeycomb is hexagonal—both a planar tiling in math and an example of animal ingenuity.�ans��src��EFejes Tóth, L., 《平面与空间中的密铺与堆积》, Springer�OFejes Tóth, L., 'Lagerungen in der Ebene, auf der Kugel und im Raum', Springer��id�86f665f8db24�body�ل硬币两面差不多重，抛起来落哪面全看运气。所以正反面都有机会出现，谁也不能保证一定是哪面。ىA coin's two sides weigh about the same, so which way it lands is luck. Both sides have a chance, and no one can be sure which will show.�ans��src��LGrinstead, C. M. 与 Snell, J. L., 《概率导论》, 美国数学会 (AMS)�]Grinstead, C. M. & Snell, J. L., 'Introduction to Probability', American Mathematical Society��id�97a776137039�body�ي地球绕着太阳转，同时身子有点歪。歪着转让不同时候照到的阳光不一样多，就出现了春、夏、秋、冬。ّEarth orbits the Sun while tilted a bit. The tilt makes sunlight stronger or weaker through the year, creating spring, summer, autumn and winter.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9861e6b0f631�body�ِ钟表告诉我们现在是第几天里的什么时间，好安排吃饭、睡觉和玩耍。没有钟，大家就很难约好一起做事情。ٖA clock tells us what time of day it is, so we can plan eating, sleeping and playing. Without clocks, it would be hard to meet and do things together.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9962000b4b19�body�ٌ零表示“什么都没有”，但它让我们可以写出更大的数，比如10和100。没有零，我们的记数会变得很麻烦。قZero means “nothing,” but it lets us write bigger numbers like 10 and 100. Without zero, writing numbers would be much harder.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a24509812020�body�٢向日葵小花的排列常跟着斐波那契数列：1、1、2、3、5、8……每个数是前两个加起来。这样排队能让种子排得又紧又整齐。٩A sunflower's tiny flowers often follow the Fibonacci sequence: 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8… each number is the sum of the two before. This packing lets seeds sit tight and neat.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�a76861d0e6fe�body�٨莫比乌斯带是把纸条一端扭转180度再粘成环的曲面，它只有一个面、一条边。你沿着它一直画，会走完整条带子而不跨越边界。ٷA Möbius strip is made by twisting a paper strip 180° before joining the ends; it has only one side and one edge. Drawing along it covers the whole surface without crossing an edge.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�aa3b9151ac94�body��标准骰子把 1 对 6、2 对 5、3 对 4 摆成相对面，每组都正好是 7。这样无论哪一面朝上，六面平均仍是 3.5，转动起来更“公平”也更对称好看；这是几个世纪流传下来的约定，不是数学定理，却是普遍的制作习惯。�A standard die places 1 opposite 6, 2 opposite 5, 3 opposite 4—each pair sums to 7. Then whichever face is up, the average of all faces stays 3.5, and the layout looks balanced; it is a centuries-old convention, not a theorem, but a near-universal manufacturing habit.�ans��src��]Diaconis, P. 与 Keller, J. B., 《公平骰子》, American Mathematical Monthly 96(4), 1989�TDiaconis, P. & Keller, J. B., 'Fair Dice', American Mathematical Monthly 96(4), 1989��id�afdd06d484b9�body�ه数数帮我们搞清楚有多少东西，比如有几块饼干、几只小鸟。没有数字，我们就没法准确分享和比较。ْCounting helps us find out how many things there are, like how many cookies or birds. Without numbers we could not share or compare things fairly.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b0ea70f23e8b�body���彭罗斯三角形把三个直角棱柱以看似合理的方式连接，局部每段都成立，但整体在三维中无法存在。它利用二维画面的视觉错觉制造“永不可能”的闭环。ٚThe Penrose triangle joins three bars so each local part looks fine but the whole cannot exist in 3D—an impossible loop created by a 2D visual illusion.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�b6287d59d91c�body��l正方形四条边一样长，长方形只是对面两边一样长。长方形更像被拉长的正方形。�uA square has four equal sides; a rectangle just has equal opposite sides. A rectangle is like a stretched-out square.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b88d2a5d1ecb�body�ي能两个两个成对、没有剩下的就是偶数，比如2、4、6。会多出一个、没法成对的就叫奇数，比如1、3、5。�tNumbers that pair up with none left over are even, like 2, 4, 6. Numbers that leave one extra are odd, like 1, 3, 5.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�ca679d59775d�body�ٖ汉字一二三用横画计数，和算盘上拨珠数数一样直观。算盘的每一档对应一个数位，正好配合中文的十进位说法。ٰChinese characters for one, two, three use stroke counts, as intuitive as beads on an abacus. Each abacus column is a place value, matching the Chinese decimal way of speaking.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�d303c58eb459�body��~两堆东西一个对一个，谁也不多谁也不少，就是一样多。比一比多少，是我们最早学会的数学。هWhen two piles match one-to-one with none left over, they are the same amount. Comparing more or less is among the first math we learn.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d7f2fbc5ac9a�body�ٌ水的冰晶是六方晶格，水分子以约60度角结合，生长时沿六个方向均匀延伸，所以天然呈现六重旋转对称。٤Water ice forms a hexagonal lattice; molecules bond at about 60 degrees and grow evenly along six directions, giving snowflakes natural sixfold rotational symmetry.�ans��src�٭Nakamura, Cartwright,《Why Eastern snowflakes are six-sided while Western snowflakes are unique - a history of ice and snow - part 4》,Weather,2017 (DOI: 10.1002/wea.3059)٫Nakamura, Cartwright, 'Why Eastern snowflakes are six-sided while Western snowflakes are unique - a history of ice and snow - part 4', Weather, 2017, DOI: 10.1002/wea.3059��id�d8d118d5e849�body��{方积木能稳稳叠高，圆积木会滚来滚去。不同形状有不同的本事，所以玩具盒里常两种都有。�~Square blocks stack steady, while round ones roll away. Different shapes have different talents, so toy boxes often have both.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e23157ba5db4�body��r因为谁输谁赢全靠随机出拳，不是力气大就赢。大家机会一样，所以输了也只是运气。�zWinning or losing depends on random choices, not on who is stronger. Everyone has the same chance, so losing is just luck.�ans��src�٨J. Li, F. Qi 与 Y. Ma《Influences of Previous Outcomes and the Players' Skill on the Behavior in the Iterated Rock-Paper-Scissors Game》, PLOS ONE 9(8):e105293, 2014٤J. Li, F. Qi & Y. Ma, 'Influences of Previous Outcomes and the Players' Skill on the Behavior in the Iterated Rock-Paper-Scissors Game', PLOS ONE 9(8):e105293, 2014��id�e827e88ea858�body��u角是由两条有公共端点的射线组成的图形，常用度数表示大小，直角是90°，平角是180°。�_An angle is formed by two rays sharing an endpoint, measured in degrees; a right angle is 90°.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�f48c3268664b�body�١两者数学上都是 75 折，也就是便宜 25%，但第二件半价用锚定与赠予感制造划算错觉，说明营销利用的是心理而非纯算术。��Mathematically both come to 75% of the price, that is a 25% discount, but 'second half price' uses anchoring and a gift feeling to seem like a better deal, showing marketing exploits psychology, not just arithmetic.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�math_25_001�body���五加五等于十!很久很久以前,人类就是掰着手指数数的,十进制就是十个手指教我们的。现在你也能用手指学加法:左手出三根,右手出四根,合在一起数一数,一共七根!ٵFive plus five makes ten! Long ago people counted on fingers, which taught us base ten. Try adding with hands now: three fingers here, four there, count them all together — seven.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�math_25_002�body��圆非常特别:边上每个点到中心的距离都一样远,所以轮子转起来不颠簸,披萨切出来每块都公平。月亮那么大,引力把它拉成圆球,所以也是圆的。在家玩寻宝游戏:找出十个圆形宝贝,圆就是形状世界冠军!�+The circle is special: every edge point sits equally far from the center, so wheels roll smoothly and pizza slices come out fair. The moon is so big that gravity pulls it into a round ball, so it is round too. Play a treasure hunt at home: find ten round things and crown circles the world champion.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�math_25_003�body���一人两块!分东西的秘密是「一样多」:先每人发一块,再把剩下的两块一人一块。如果剩单数块怎么办?可以掰成两半呀。学会平均分,你就是小小公平使者。��Two cookies each! The secret of fair shares is same-for-everyone: hand out one each, then one more each. Odd number left? Break one in half. Master equal sharing and become a little fairness ambassador.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�math_25_005�body���贴墙站直,从头到脚才是一条直线,量得才准。尺子上的数字是「长度密码」:相邻两个数字间隔一样长,是一厘米或一寸。数字越大越长——明年再量,你又长高几格!�␀Standing straight against the wall measures one true line head to toe. Ruler numbers are length codes: gaps between neighbors are all equal — one centimeter or inch. Bigger numbers mean longer. Measure again next year and you will climb a few more marks.�ans��src��F《数学花园漫游记》,马希文,中国少年儿童出版社,2004�CMa Xiwen, Adventures in the Math Garden, China Children Press, 2004��id�0175ee69bab3�body�ٌ直接打八折更便宜。先涨后降实际是（原价×1.1）×0.8=0.88倍原价，而直接八折是0.8倍原价，前者多付约8%。٨The straight 20% off is cheaper. Mark-up-then-discount gives (price×1.1)×0.8=0.88 of the original, while a direct 20% off gives 0.8, so the trick costs about 8% more.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�029885f9cad5�body��梯度下降沿损失函数负梯度方向迭代更新参数 $w\leftarrow w-\eta\nabla L$，以逐步降低训练误差。它是训练神经网络的核心优化算法，配合反向传播计算梯度，学习率 $\eta$ 控制步长，是深度学习的引擎。�WGradient descent iteratively updates parameters along the negative gradient $w\leftarrow w-\eta\nabla L$ to reduce training error. It is the core optimization algorithm for training neural networks, combined with backpropagation to compute gradients, where the learning rate $\eta$ controls step size and serves as the engine of deep learning.�ans��src��3《深度学习》Goodfellow、Bengio 与 Courville�0Deep Learning by Goodfellow Bengio and Courville��id�02a5fb6e5844�body��素数（质数）是大于 1 且只能被 1 和自身整除的自然数，如 2、3、5、7。1 不是素数，2 是唯一的偶素数。算术基本定理说每个大于 1 的整数都能唯一分解为素数的乘积，因此素数被称为“数字的原子”。�A prime is a natural number greater than 1 divisible only by 1 and itself, such as 2, 3, 5, 7. One is not prime, and 2 is the only even prime. The fundamental theorem of arithmetic says every integer above 1 factors uniquely into primes, so primes are called the atoms of numbers.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�03aecea71914�body��向量是同时带有大小和方向的量，如力、速度和位移，常用带箭头的线段表示。向量可以相加、数乘，并能描述平移和许多物理规律。它是物理学、计算机图形和机器学习中表示“多重信息”的基本工具。�RA vector is a quantity with both magnitude and direction, such as force, velocity, and displacement, often drawn as an arrow. Vectors can be added and scaled, and they describe translations and many physical laws. They are the basic tool in physics, computer graphics, and machine learning for representing multiple pieces of information.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�04386d266233�body�ٟ对个人而言，不管对方怎么选，背叛都更安全；但两人都背叛的结局比都合作更差。这揭示个体理性与集体利益的冲突。��Individually, betraying is safer no matter what the other does; but both betraying yields a worse outcome than both cooperating. It reveals the conflict between individual rationality and collective interest.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�04454533aef7�body��有理数可以写成两个整数的比（分数），而实数还包括无法这样表示的无理数，如 √2 和 π。从几何上看，实数填满了整条数轴，没有任何空隙。实数系是连续、完备的，是微积分得以成立的基础。�4Rational numbers can be written as a ratio of two integers (a fraction), while real numbers also include irrationals that cannot, such as √2 and π. Geometrically, the reals fill the entire number line with no gaps. The real number system is continuous and complete, the foundation on which calculus rests.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�06b1c0ae9832�body��=法国天才伽罗瓦在 19 世纪创立群论，用“对称结构”来判断多项式方程能否用根式求解。他证明了五次及以上的一般方程没有通用的根式解法，把代数方程问题转化为对群的研究。他的思想深刻影响了现代代数，却因决斗早逝，年仅 20 岁。�sThe French prodigy Galois founded group theory in the 19th century, using symmetry structures to decide whether polynomial equations can be solved by radicals. He proved that general equations of degree five or higher have no general radical solution, turning the problem into the study of groups. His ideas deeply shaped modern algebra, yet he died in a duel at only 20.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�06c32fec394e�body�ٿ比较的是任意两人的配对，而不是某人和你。23人共有253对，配对数量增长极快，所以概率很快超过一半。这就是生日悖论：直觉低估了配对数。��It compares any pair among the group, not you versus others. With 23 people there are 253 pairs, so the probability of a match climbs past half quickly. The birthday paradox shows intuition underestimates pairings.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�081b09c94fde�body�ٻ多项式是由变量和常数通过加法、减法和乘法（非负整数次幂）组合而成的代数式，例如 3x² + 2x − 5。多项式的次数由最高次项的指数决定。�A polynomial is an algebraic expression made of variables and constants combined by addition, subtraction, and multiplication with non-negative integer exponents, such as 3x² + 2x − 5. The degree of a polynomial is given by the highest exponent appearing in it.�ans��src��wAxler,《Linear Algebra Done Right》第3版,Springer,2015;中译《线性代数应该这样学》人民邮电出版社�IS. Axler, Linear Algebra Done Right, 3rd ed., Springer, 2015; Chinese ed.��id�08c70e4fc1f1�body�ٽ海螺按固定比例持续生长，每圈放大相同倍数，形成等角螺线；当放大比接近黄金比时就接近黄金螺旋。这种自相似让它不论大小都形状一致。��A shell grows at a fixed ratio, scaling each turn by the same factor, forming a logarithmic spiral; near the golden ratio it approaches a golden spiral. Self-similarity keeps its shape at any size.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�091857ba86c8�body�ٿ对于一元二次方程 ax² + bx + c = 0（a≠0），其解可由公式 x = (−b ± √(b²−4ac)) / (2a) 给出。根号里的 b²−4ac 称为判别式，决定方程有几个实根。�␀For a quadratic equation ax² + bx + c = 0 with a not equal to 0, its solutions are given by x = (−b ± √(b²−4ac)) / (2a). The expression b²−4ac under the square root is called the discriminant and determines how many real roots the equation has.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�0947d9748857�body��S在约束 g(x,y)=0 下最大化 f(x,y) 时，最优点处 f 的等高线必须与约束曲线相切，否则沿约束移动还能继续增大 f。相切意味着两条曲线的法向 ∇f 与 ∇g 平行，即 ∇f=λ∇g。引入乘数 λ 后，约束极值问题就化为可解的无约束方程组，并且可以推广到多个约束。��To maximize f(x,y) subject to g(x,y)=0, at the optimum the contour of f must be tangent to the constraint curve; otherwise moving along the constraint would further increase f. Tangency means the normals ∇f and ∇g are parallel, i.e., ∇f=λ∇g. Introducing the multiplier λ converts the constrained problem into a solvable unconstrained system, generalizable to multiple constraints.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�0b45a58fa579�body��#相似变换由等距变换（平移、旋转、反射）再叠加一个均匀缩放组成，保持图形形状不变而只改变大小。变换前后的图形称为相似形，对应角相等、对应边成比例。它是“缩放变换”的更一般说法，包含位置和方向调整。�@A similarity transformation is an isometry (translation, rotation, reflection) followed by a uniform scaling, preserving shape while changing only size. The resulting figures are similar, with equal angles and proportional sides. It is the more general term for scaling that also allows position and orientation changes.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�0c794bce5760�body���在起伏的山地里，你站上最近的小山顶（局部最优）却未必是整座山脉的最高峰（全局最优）。很多优化算法容易被困在局部，需要随机重启或全局搜索。��In hilly terrain you may stand on the nearest small peak (local optimum) yet not the highest of the whole range (global). Many optimizers get stuck locally, needing random restarts or global search.�ans��src��LJ. Nocedal 与 S. J. Wright《Numerical Optimization》第2版,Springer,2006�JJ. Nocedal & S. J. Wright, Numerical Optimization, 2nd ed., Springer, 2006��id�0d0b666a8f7e�body�ٷ在比例代表制下，小党得票累积可获席位并影响政策；即便在单选区，弃保效应和关键少数也让小党有杠杆。这是投票数学与制度的互动。��Under proportional representation, a small party's cumulative votes win seats and shape policy; even in single-seat districts, coordination effects and swing minorities give small parties leverage. It is the interplay of voting math and institutions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0d255689e579�body���有理数是能写成两个整数之比 a/b（b≠0）的数，包括整数、有限小数和无限循环小数。它们在数轴上处处稠密，任意两个有理数之间还有别的有理数。有理数加上无理数才构成完整的实数系。�Rational numbers are those writable as a ratio a/b of two integers (b≠0), including integers, terminating decimals, and repeating decimals. They are dense on the number line, with more rationals between any two. The reals are completed only by adding irrationals to the rationals.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�0eea298d0032�body�ٮ镜子其实没有左右颠倒，它沿前后方向反转。因为我们习惯转身面对面，把前后反转误读成了左右互换；上下轴没有被这样重映射。��The mirror does not flip left-right; it reverses front-back. We imagine turning to face the reflection, misreading that as a left-right swap, while the vertical axis is not remapped the same way.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�0f36fcdf984a�body��`会，误差会传播。加减运算里绝对误差相加：比如两个各带 ±0.1 厘米的长度相加，结果误差约 ±0.2 厘米。乘除运算里则是相对误差（误差除以数值）相加：10±0.1 乘 20±0.2，相对误差约 1% 加 1%，共约 2%。理解这一点，实验和工程里才不会被“看似精确”的数字骗到。��Yes — errors propagate. In addition or subtraction, absolute errors add: two lengths each off by ±0.1 cm give a sum accurate to about ±0.2 cm. In multiplication or division, relative errors (error divided by value) add: 10±0.1 times 20±0.2 carries a relative error of about 1% plus 1%, roughly 2%. Knowing this keeps experiments and engineering from being fooled by seemingly precise numbers.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�0f9767c1d1da�body��泊松过程具有独立增量与平稳增量，且区间计数服从参数为 $\lambda t$ 的泊松分布，满足 $P(N(t)=k)=e^{-\lambda t}(\lambda t)^k/k!$。在事件发生率低且相互独立时，二项分布极限正好导出泊松分布，故它是稀有事件的自然模型。�<The Poisson process has independent and stationary increments, and counts in an interval follow a Poisson distribution with parameter $\lambda t$, $P(N(t)=k)=e^{-\lambda t}(\lambda t)^k/k!$. When events are rare and independent, the binomial limit yields the Poisson law, making it the natural model for rare events.�ans��src��,美国数学会(AMS)《随机过程导论》�IAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Introduction to Stochastic Processes��id�109b54ed53ad�body��"切比雪夫不等式指出：无论数据分布形状如何，落在均值 k 个标准差之外的概率不超过 1/k²。它不需要假设正态分布，因此是一个很通用的“安全网”界限。例如至少 75% 的数据落在均值两个标准差内，与具体分布无关。�qChebyshev's inequality says that, regardless of the data's distribution shape, the probability of lying more than k standard deviations from the mean is at most 1/k². It needs no normal-distribution assumption, making it a very general safety-net bound. For example, at least 75% of data lie within two standard deviations of the mean, independent of the distribution.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�11223a002e63�body���无理数是不能写成两个整数之比的实数，其小数展开既不终止也不循环。经典例子有 √2（正方形对角线长）和圆周率 π。古希腊人发现 √2 无理，曾颠覆了“一切数皆可比”的信念。�8Irrational numbers are real numbers that cannot be written as a ratio of two integers; their decimal expansions neither terminate nor repeat. Classic examples are √2 (the diagonal of a unit square) and π. The Greeks' discovery that √2 is irrational overturned the belief that all numbers were commensurable.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�11fcb37006ee�body�ٺ若存在连续的双向逆映射（同胚），二者拓扑相同。用不变量（如连通分支数、亏格、基本群）可区分不同形状，这些量在形变下保持不变。��Two shapes are topologically the same if a continuous bijection with continuous inverse (homeomorphism) exists. Invariants like number of components, genus, or fundamental group stay fixed under deformation and help tell shapes apart.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�147feb9af685�body�ً一个数 x 的平方根是一个数 y，使得 y 的平方等于 x，即 y² = x。例如 9 的平方根是 3 和 −3，因为 3² = 9。ٟThe square root of a number x is a number y such that y squared equals x, that is, y² = x. For example, the square roots of 9 are 3 and −3, because 3² = 9.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�15c95d7d6160�body�٩罗马数字没有位值制和零，加减靠符号拼接、乘法几乎要硬算。直到印度-阿拉伯数字带进位和零传入欧洲，日常计算才变容易。��Roman numerals lack place value and zero, so addition is symbol-shuffling and multiplication is near brute force. Arithmetic only eased after positional Hindu-Arabic digits with zero arrived in Europe.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�1990660a1e3e�body��所有满足 a²+b²=c² 且两两互素的基本勾股数都能由欧几里得公式得到：取互素且一奇一偶的 m>n，令 a=m²−n²、b=2mn、c=m²+n²。例如 m=2,n=1 得到 3,4,5；m=3,n=2 得到 5,12,13。每个基本三元组恰好这样出现一次，不会有遗漏。�0Every primitive triple with a²+b²=c² and pairwise coprime entries comes from Euclid's formula: take coprime m>n of opposite parity, then a=m²−n², b=2mn, c=m²+n². For example m=2,n=1 gives 3,4,5, and m=3,n=2 gives 5,12,13. Each primitive triple arises exactly once in this way, with no omissions.�ans��src��,《什么是数学》(柯朗)（数论章）�5What Is Mathematics? (Courant), number theory chapter��id�1aee08e31513�body��散点图用平面上的一个个点表示两个变量的成对观测值，横轴一个变量、纵轴另一个。通过观察点的分布走向，可以直观判断两变量之间是否存在相关关系及其强弱。它是探索性数据分析中最常用的图形之一。�=A scatter plot places points on a plane for paired observations of two variables, one on the horizontal axis and one on the vertical. By looking at the spread and trend of the points, you can judge whether and how strongly the two variables are related. It is among the most common plots in exploratory data analysis.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�1b50061ce515�body��Y环境承载力有限，人口增长常用逻辑斯蒂方程 dP/dt = rP(1−P/K) 描述：人口远小于承载力 K 时近似指数增长，接近 K 时增长率趋于 0。方程的解是一条 S 形曲线，P(t) 随 t 增大而趋向 K。这个简单的微分方程把“有限资源”写进了模型，是生态学和种群研究的基础。�~Because environments have limited carrying capacity, growth is modeled by the logistic equation dP/dt = rP(1−P/K): nearly exponential when the population is far below K, slowing to zero as P approaches K. The solution is an S-shaped curve with P(t) tending to K as t grows. This simple differential equation encodes finite resources and is a basic model in ecology and demography.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�1c0866fad1aa�body�٢细胞内的DNA在复制、重组时常被打结或套环，酶（拓扑异构酶）负责剪切再接以解开纽结。拓扑工具可量化DNA的缠绕状态。٫During replication and recombination, DNA becomes knotted or catenated, and enzymes (topoisomerases) cut and rejoin to untangle it. Topology quantifies DNA's entanglement.�ans��src��7Adams《The Knot Book》；Rolfsen《Knots and Links》�.Adams, The Knot Book; Rolfsen, Knots and Links��id�1c36ee50dbbd�body�ٴ中心极限定理说：大量独立微小的随机误差相加，其和的分布趋近正态，与个别误差形状无关。所以测量误差、身高、考试分常呈钟形。��The central limit theorem says sums of many independent tiny random errors tend to a normal distribution, regardless of individual shapes. Hence measurement errors, heights and exam scores often look bell-shaped.�ans��src��YFeller,《An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications》第3版,Wiley,1968�[W. Feller, An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1968��id�1cc840b91eae�body���内容相同：每行数字是上一行相邻两数之和，用来展开二项式系数。杨辉在1261年《详解九章算法》中记载此图，比帕斯卡早约400年，所以中国称杨辉三角。��They are the same object: each entry is the sum of the two above it, giving binomial coefficients. Yang Hui documented it in 1261, about 400 years before Pascal, so in China it is called Yanghui's triangle.�ans��src��杨辉《详解九章算法》�Yang Hui's book��id�1d6df04a036b�body�٨若赌注占你全部资产很大比例，一次失败就破产，这叫破产风险。凯利公式告诉我们应按比例下注，而非只要期望为正就全押。ٳIf the stake is a large fraction of your wealth, one loss ruins you, called ruin risk. Kelly's formula says bet a proportion, not everything, just because expectation is positive.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1e10dd95420f�body�ٖ纵轴截断会放大差距的视觉比例，让小幅变化看起来很剧烈。诚实的数据新闻通常从零开始，或用标注说明截断。ٛTruncating the vertical axis exaggerates differences, making small changes look dramatic. Honest data journalism starts at zero or clearly marks the break.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1e43b19d4f1f�body��9正态分布又称高斯分布，是一条中间高、两边对称下降的钟形曲线，由均值和标准差两个参数决定。许多自然现象（如身高、测量误差）近似服从正态分布。它的重要性质是约 68% 的数据落在均值一个标准差内，约 95% 落在两个标准差内。��The normal distribution, also called the Gaussian distribution, is a bell-shaped curve that is high in the middle and falls off symmetrically on both sides, defined by its mean and standard deviation. Many natural phenomena, such as heights and measurement errors, are approximately normal. A key property is that about 68% of data lie within one standard deviation of the mean, and about 95% within two.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�1ebd018a82bf�body���它成书于汉代，系统收集了246个应用题，涵盖方田、粟米、衰分、少广、商功、均输、盈不足、方程、勾股九类，奠定了中国算法化、重实用的数学传统。��Compiled in the Han dynasty, it collects 246 applied problems in nine categories (fields, grain, proportions, engineering, taxation, excess-deficit, equations, and the Gougu theorem), establishing China's algorithmic and practical mathematical tradition.�ans��src��《九章算术》�The Nine Chapters��id�2224a56be5e4�body��S17 世纪末，英国的牛顿与德国的莱布尼茨各自独立发明了微积分，却因“谁先发明”爆发了激烈的优先权之争。两人记号体系不同：牛顿用点表示导数，莱布尼茨用 dx/dy，后者沿用至今。这场争论一度分裂了英欧数学界，但两人都被承认为微积分的奠基人。�zIn the late 17th century, Britain's Newton and Germany's Leibniz each independently invented calculus, but a fierce priority dispute erupted over who was first. Their notations differed: Newton used dots for derivatives, Leibniz used dx/dy, the latter surviving today. The feud split British and continental mathematics for a time, yet both are credited as founders of calculus.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�24c75ec2e670�body�ٮ能。卫星太阳能电池板、太空望远镜镜头用折纸展开结构：发射时折叠节省空间，入轨后按预定折痕展开，是折纸数学的工程应用。��Yes. Satellite solar panels and telescope lenses use origami deployable structures: folded to save space at launch, then unfolded along preset creases in orbit, an engineering use of origami math.�ans��src���NATORI, SAKAMOTO, KATSUMATA, YAMAKAWA,《Conceptual model study using origami for membrane space structures - a perspective of origami-based engineering》,Mechanical Engineering Reviews,2015 (DOI: 10.1299/mer.14-00368)��NATORI, SAKAMOTO, KATSUMATA, YAMAKAWA, 'Conceptual model study using origami for membrane space structures - a perspective of origami-based engineering', Mechanical Engineering Reviews, 2015, DOI: 10.1299/mer.14-00368��id�2684c50267fe�body�ٷ她为巴贝奇的分析机写了算法（计算伯努利数的步骤），并预见到机器不止能算数、还能处理符号与音乐，被视为史上第一个计算机程序。ٺShe wrote an algorithm (for Bernoulli numbers) for Babbage's Analytical Engine and foresaw machines handling symbols and music, not just numbers—regarded as the first computer program.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�26b9785442b9�body��j现代“秒”由铯原子跃迁定义（原子时，极稳），而“一天”来自地球自转（天文时，受潮汐摩擦缓慢变长）。两者累积差，国际地球自转服务（IERS）便在 6 月或 12 月末尾插入一闰秒，让协调世界时（UTC）不偏离太阳时太多。它是人类用纯数学计时对抗不规则自然的产物。�UThe modern second is defined by a cesium transition (atomic time, ultra-stable), while a 'day' comes from Earth's rotation (astronomical time, slowly lengthening via tidal friction). The gap accumulates, so the IERS inserts a leap second at June/December ends to keep UTC near solar time—humanity using pure math to fight irregular nature.�ans��src��I国际地球自转与参考系服务 (IERS), 《闰秒公告》, iers.org�jIERS, 'Bulletin C (Leap Second Announcements)', International Earth Rotation and Reference Systems Service��id�270508ff2b07�body�ٓ在球面上两点间最短路径是过球心的大圆的一段，而不是平面地图上的直线。地图投影会把大圆画成弯曲的弧。ٷOn a sphere the shortest path between two points is an arc of the great circle through the center, not the straight line on a flat map. Map projections bend great circles into curves.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�28c2742a32ce�body���不等式是用大于（>）、小于（<）等符号表示两个量不相等关系的式子，例如 x > 3。解不等式是找出使不等式成立的所有可能取值，注意乘以负数时要改变不等号方向。�An inequality is a statement that two quantities are not equal, written with symbols such as greater-than or less-than, for example x > 3. Solving an inequality means finding all values that make it true, and one must reverse the inequality sign when multiplying by a negative number.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�2abbf0727ca7�body�ٺ因为保险买的是避免破产风险，而不是平均划算。小额保费换走大额灾难损失，对风险厌恶者是正向效用，体现的是期望效用而非期望金额。ٽInsurance buys protection from ruin, not average savings. A small premium offloads a huge loss, positive utility for the risk-averse, reflecting expected utility rather than expected money.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2f55656b6ccb�body���流形是局部同胚于欧氏空间的拓扑空间，每点附近可用坐标卡描述。地球表面在局部（足够小的区域）近似平面，可用经纬度坐标，但整体不可展平，因此是二维流形而非二维欧氏空间。�HA manifold is a topological space locally homeomorphic to Euclidean space, described near each point by coordinate charts. Earth's surface looks flat locally (over small regions) and can be given latitude-longitude coordinates, yet cannot be flattened globally, so it is a two-dimensional manifold rather than Euclidean 2-space.�ans��src��'《微分拓扑》Guillemin 与 Pollack�.Differential Topology by Guillemin and Pollack��id�2fb98756027b�body���无阻尼谐波振子方程为 $x''+\omega^2 x=0$。其特征方程 $r^2+\omega^2=0$ 有纯虚根 $\pm i\omega$，故通解为 $x(t)=A\cos(\omega t)+B\sin(\omega t)$，即两种相位不同的简谐振动的线性组合，参数 A、B 由初值决定。�7The undamped harmonic oscillator obeys $x''+\omega^2 x=0$. Its characteristic equation $r^2+\omega^2=0$ has purely imaginary roots $\pm i\omega$, so the general solution is $x(t)=A\cos(\omega t)+B\sin(\omega t)$, a linear combination of two phase-shifted simple harmonics with A and B set by initial conditions.�ans��src��《常微分方程》Arnold�-Ordinary Differential Equations by V I Arnold��id�310bdc47d88f�body��斐波那契数列从 0、1 开始，每一项等于前两项之和：0,1,1,2,3,5,8…。它出现在许多自然现象中，如花瓣数和松果螺旋，相邻两项之比会趋近于黄金分割比。该数列由斐波那契在介绍印度-阿拉伯算术的书中引入西方。�=The Fibonacci sequence starts 0, 1 and each term is the sum of the previous two: 0,1,1,2,3,5,8... It appears in many natural phenomena, such as petal counts and pinecone spirals, and the ratio of neighboring terms approaches the golden ratio. Fibonacci introduced it to the West in a book on Indian-Arabic arithmetic.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�34ec0b60896e�body��k把产量设为变量，利润写成这些变量的线性表达式，机器工时、原料等限制写成不等式，问题就变成“在线性约束下最大化线性目标”。这类问题叫线性规划：可行方案构成一个多边形区域，最优解总出现在区域的顶点上，单纯形算法就是沿着边从一个顶点走到更好的顶点。��Set output levels as variables, write profit as a linear expression in them, and turn limits like machine hours and raw materials into inequalities — the problem becomes maximizing a linear objective subject to linear constraints. These are linear programs: feasible plans form a polygonal region, the optimum always sits at a vertex, and the simplex algorithm walks from vertex to vertex along edges, always improving.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�350e0bf08c73�body�ٴ在球面上，‘直’（最短）的线是经线大圆，它们本不平行，必在两极汇合。这是球面几何与平面的根本区别：这里没有真正的平行线。ٽOn a sphere the 'straight' (shortest) lines are meridian great circles, which are not parallel and must meet at the poles. A key difference from the plane: here true parallels do not exist.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�38152f7549f1�body�٢少数人收入极高会拉高平均数，而中位数更能代表普通人的水平。当分布很不均匀时，平均数往往大于一半人的实际收入。ٯA few very high earners pull the mean up, while the median better reflects a typical person. With skewed income, the mean exceeds what more than half the people actually earn.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�382ba584b323�body�ٱ他用平移、旋转、反射等对称把平面无缝铺满（密铺），常借助群论中的壁纸群描述重复模式。人与飞鸟可互为背景地填满整个平面。��He used translations, rotations, and reflections to tile the plane seamlessly (tessellation), often described by wallpaper groups in group theory. Figures and background interlock to fill the plane.�ans��src��GGrünbaum, B. 与 Shephard, G. C., 《镶嵌与图案》, W. H. Freeman�FGrünbaum, B. & Shephard, G. C., 'Tilings and Patterns', W. H. Freeman��id�3924f3c805f6�body��K对平面上每个点 c，从 z=0 开始反复计算 z←z²+c。如果迭代序列一直不逃到无穷远，c 就属于曼德博集；如果它很快飞走，就按“逃逸的速度”涂上不同颜色。集合内部是一张“心形”加一圈圆泡，边界极其复杂——无论放大多少倍，仍然有无穷细节。�fFor each point c in the plane, start at z=0 and repeatedly compute z←z²+c. If the iteration never escapes to infinity, c belongs to the Mandelbrot set; if it flies away, points are colored by how fast they escape. The set's body is a cardioid with bulbs, and its boundary is staggeringly intricate — zoom in as far as you like and detail never runs out.�ans��src��AB. B. Mandelbrot《The Fractal Geometry of Nature》, Wiley, 1982�=B. B. Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature, Wiley, 1982��id�398e3f39d979�body��)∞ 表示“没有尽头、可以任意大”的概念，常用于极限、区间和无尽过程的描述，而不是一个普通的数。在扩展实数系中它可以参与某些运算，但要遵守特殊规则（如 ∞+1 仍记 ∞）。它帮助我们简洁地谈论趋向无穷的趋势。�/∞ represents the idea of endless, arbitrarily large, used in limits, intervals, and unending processes rather than as an ordinary number. In the extended real line it can enter some operations under special rules (e.g., ∞+1 is still ∞). It lets us speak concisely about tendencies toward infinity.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�3b63c7898feb�body�ٺ恩尼格玛用可转动的转子对字母做复杂替换，每天更换接线设置。盟军利用已知明文片段（如天气报告）和机电炸弹机穷举转子位置而破译。��Enigma used rotors for complex substitution with daily key settings. The Allies exploited known plaintext fragments (e.g., weather reports) and electromechanical bombes to brute-force rotor positions.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�3ca8189b6a34�body�ٯ每次划分把数组大致对半分，需约 log n 层，每层总计扫描 O(n) 个元素，故平均 O(n log n)。最坏（已排序且总选端点）会退化到 O(n²)。��Each partition splits the array roughly in half, needing about log n levels, and each level scans O(n) elements total, giving average O(n log n). The worst case (sorted input, bad pivot) degrades to O(n²).�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�3db96be37f8a�body�ٳ方程是含有等号、并且包含未知数的数学陈述，表示两边的值相等。解方程是找出使等式成立的未知数的值，例如 x + 2 = 5 的解是 x = 3。�An equation is a mathematical statement containing an equals sign and one or more unknowns, asserting that two expressions have the same value. Solving an equation means finding the value of the unknown that makes the statement true, for example x + 2 = 5 gives x = 3.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�3dc276054664�body�٪把一年分成 n 段复利，极限 n→∞ 时 (1+r/n)^{nt}→e^{rt}，于是本金 P 在利率 r、时间 t 后变为 Pe^{rt}。这是 e 在金融中的自然登场。ٶSplitting a year into n compounding periods, as n→∞ we get (1+r/n)^{nt}→e^{rt}, so principal P becomes Pe^{rt} at rate r over time t. This is e's natural entrance into finance.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�3e5c7a067dbf�body�٢他用不可能图形把局部合理的阶梯首尾相接成闭环，每处看着向下、整体却回到起点。这是拓扑与视错觉结合的趣味艺术。ٮHe links locally sensible staircases into a closed loop where each part looks downhill yet the whole returns to start. It is playful art mixing topology with visual illusion.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�3e87ce18e269�body���logistic 方程为 $dx/dt=rx(1-x/K)$，其中 r 是内禀增长率、K 是环境容纳量。当 x 远小于 K 时近似指数增长，随 x 接近 K 增长放缓并趋于平衡；它刻画了资源受限下种群从爆发到饱和的 S 形曲线。�The logistic equation is $dx/dt=rx(1-x/K)$, with intrinsic growth rate r and carrying capacity K. When x is far below K growth is nearly exponential, then slows as x approaches K and settles at equilibrium, capturing the S-shaped saturation of a resource-limited population.�ans��src��《数学生物学》Murray�"Mathematical Biology by J D Murray��id�3edc5c87c58a�body�١欧拉证明柯尼斯堡七桥无法一笔画走完，条件是图中奇度顶点数为0或2。他用抽象的顶点与边取代地图，由此诞生了图论。��Euler proved the Konigsberg seven bridges cannot be traversed in one stroke; the condition is that a graph has 0 or 2 odd-degree vertices. Abstracting the map into vertices and edges birthed graph theory.�ans��src��XEuler《Solutio problematis ad geometriam situs》（1736）；Diestel《Graph Theory》�LEuler, Solutio problematis ad geometriam situs (1736); Diestel, Graph Theory��id�3f7b423b2ec1�body�٠前17位分别乘以固定权重后求和，再对11取模，余数对应一个校验字符（0到9和X）。这样能立刻发现输错或漏一位的错误。ٵThe first 17 digits are weighted, summed, then taken modulo 11, mapping the remainder to a check character (0–9 or X). This instantly catches single-digit or missing-digit errors.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�41ae2b2ae258�body�ٯ相对多数（ plurality）是得票最多即可，哪怕未过半；绝对多数要求超过一半，否则可能进入第二轮。两者会影响少数派是否被代表。ٽA relative majority (plurality) wins with the most votes even under 50%; an absolute majority requires over half, often triggering a runoff. The rule affects how minorities are represented.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�43121fcfa49b�body�پ几个整数的公倍数中最小的正整数称为它们的最小公倍数（LCM）。例如 4 和 6 的最小公倍数是 12，因为 12 是同时能被 4 和 6 整除的最小正整数。��The least common multiple (LCM) of several integers is the smallest positive integer that is divisible by all of them. For example, the LCM of 4 and 6 is 12, since 12 is the smallest positive number divisible by both 4 and 6.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�4390911209e2�body�٣形如2^p−1（p为素数）的素数叫梅森素数。目前人类发现的最大素数几乎都是梅森素数，得益于专门的分布式搜索（GIMPS）。ٕA Mersenne prime has the form 2^p-1 with p prime. The largest known primes are almost all Mersenne primes, found via distributed projects like GIMPS.�ans��src��dK. H. Rosen《Elementary Number Theory and Its Applications》（第6版），Pearson，2011，§6.2�YK. H. Rosen, Elementary Number Theory and Its Applications, 6th ed., Pearson, 2011, §6.2��id�44a229456ba6�body�٢未还清部分按日利率（约万分之五）从消费当天起全额计息，且下月利滚利。长期只还最低额，实际年化成本可能超过18%。٪The unpaid balance accrues daily interest (about 0.05%) from the purchase date and compounds monthly. Paying only the minimum can mean an effective annual cost above 18%.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�45155ae2c4ef�body��\希尔伯特在 1900 年巴黎国际数学家大会上提出 23 个重大问题，像一份“待办清单”，指明了 20 世纪数学的研究方向。一个世纪里它们被逐个攻克：第 7 题（2^√2 的超越性）1934 年解决，第 10 题被证明不可判定，第 1 题（连续统假设）被证明独立于现有公理体系。�pAt the 1900 International Congress of Mathematicians in Paris, Hilbert listed 23 deep problems as a to-do list that steered twentieth-century research. Over the century they fell one by one: problem 7 (transcendence of 2^√2) was solved in 1934, problem 10 was shown undecidable, and problem 1 (the continuum hypothesis) was proved independent of the standard axioms.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�45ea7a75c44b�body�٫若密钥和明文等长、真正随机且只用一次，密文与任意明文等长且统计无关，攻击者无法区分。它要求密钥绝对保密且绝不重用。��With a key as long as the message, truly random and used only once, the ciphertext is statistically independent of any plaintext, so the attacker cannot tell them apart. The key must stay secret and never be reused.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�46eaf920b984�body��t直觉上分数应该多得多，但康托尔证明了有理数能和整数一一配对。把分数按分子分母之和从小到大排成一张可以“走对角线”的表，就能给每个分数一个唯一的编号，一个也不会漏。能与正整数配对的集合叫可数集，整数、偶数、有理数都是可数集，它们都有“同样多”的元素。��Intuitively fractions seem far more numerous, yet Cantor proved rationals can be paired one-to-one with integers. Arrange fractions in a table ordered by sum of numerator and denominator and walk through it along diagonals; every fraction gets a unique label with none missing. Sets pairable with the positive integers are countable — integers, evens, and rationals all have “just as many” elements.�ans��src��9《什么是数学》(柯朗)（第8章：无穷集合）�6What Is Mathematics? (Courant), ch. 8 on infinite sets��id�48e9d2bd9a66�body��一个拓扑空间是连通的，当且仅当它不能表示为两个非空、互不相交的开集的并。直观上，连通空间是「一整块」，无法被分割成两个分离的开部分。实数轴 $\mathbb R$ 是连通的，而 $\{0\}\cup\{1\}$ 不连通。�A topological space is connected iff it cannot be written as the union of two nonempty disjoint open sets. Intuitively a connected space is all in one piece, with no separation into two open parts. The real line $\mathbb R$ is connected, while $\{0\}\cup\{1\}$ is not.�ans��src��)美国数学会(AMS)《点集拓扑学》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Point Set Topology��id�49aaadd5b2ef�body��w布劳威尔不动点定理说：把一个圆盘（或实心球）连续地映到自身，必有一点被映回原处。搅动咖啡时，液面上每个点的移动构成这样一个连续映射，所以总有一点不动。这个结论看似常识，严格证明却需要代数拓扑的工具；它也是经济学一般均衡、博弈论中许多存在性证明的核心。��Brouwer's fixed point theorem states that any continuous map of a disk (or solid ball) into itself has a fixed point. Stirring coffee defines such a continuous map of the surface to itself, so some point must return to its original position. Obvious as it sounds, a rigorous proof needs algebraic topology; it is the engine behind existence proofs in general equilibrium economics and game theory.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�49e675fcf91a�body�ّ里德-所罗门等纠错码在编码时加入冗余，划伤丢失的部分可由剩余信息数学重建，是有限域与编码论的成果。٩Codes like Reed-Solomon add redundancy at encoding; scratched, missing parts are mathematically reconstructed from the rest, a result of finite fields and coding theory.�ans��src��VMenezes、van Oorschot、Vanstone《Handbook of Applied Cryptography》（CRC Press）�LMenezes, van Oorschot, Vanstone, Handbook of Applied Cryptography, CRC Press��id�49f5053fd8b7�body��p设宽为 x，则长为 x+3；周长 2(x + x+3) = 26，解得 x = 5。所以宽是 5 厘米、长是 8 厘米。�Let the width be x, so the length is x+3; perimeter 2(x + x+3) = 26 gives x = 5. Thus the width is 5 cm and the length is 8 cm.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�4c7f400d17e0�body��L不一定，这正是贝叶斯定理的用武之地。10000 人里约 100 个病人，其中约 99 个测出阳性；而约 9900 个健康人里有约 99 个被误报为阳性。阳性者共约 198 人，真病人只占一半，所以得病概率约 50%，远不是 99%。先验概率极小的时候，假阳性会淹没真阳性。��Not necessarily — this is exactly what Bayes' theorem handles. Among 10,000 people, about 100 are sick and ~99 of them test positive; among ~9,900 healthy people, ~99 also test positive falsely. Of ~198 positives only about half are actually sick, so the probability of disease given a positive is roughly 50%, far from 99%. When the base rate is tiny, false positives swamp true ones.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�4d7ed2e22abc�body��直角坐标系用（x, y）表示点到两条垂直轴的距离，而极坐标用（r, θ）表示点到原点的距离和方向与水平轴的夹角。极坐标特别适合描述圆形、螺旋和旋转对称图形。同一曲线在不同坐标系下方程形式可能大不相同。�IThe Cartesian system uses (x, y) as distances to two perpendicular axes, while polar coordinates use (r, θ) as the distance from the origin and the angle from the horizontal axis. Polar coordinates suit circles, spirals, and rotationally symmetric figures. The same curve can look very different in equation form across systems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4dc181df022e�body�ٵ每次把线段三等分并在中间凸出一小三角，长度变4/3倍、尺度变1/3，故维数 d=log4/log3≈1.26。它是一条比线粗、比面瘦的‘分数维’曲线。٭Each step replaces a segment by 4 pieces scaled by 1/3, so dimension d=log4/log3≈1.26. It is a 'fractional-dimensional' curve thicker than a line but thinner than an area.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�4ff903d411f8�body�٨分形具有自相似性：局部放大后与整体相似，所以嵌套细节无穷。曼德博集合、科赫雪花都是用简单迭代规则生成的视觉奇观。ٰFractals are self-similar: zoomed-in parts resemble the whole, so detail nests infinitely. The Mandelbrot set and Koch snowflake are visual wonders from simple iteration rules.�ans��src��AB. B. Mandelbrot《The Fractal Geometry of Nature》, Wiley, 1982�=B. B. Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature, Wiley, 1982��id�4ffe84da0a76�body��`RSA 用两个很大且保密的质数 p、q 相乘得到 n=pq，公开 n 和加密指数 e 作为公钥，任何人用它把消息加密成密文；而只有知道 p、q 的人才能算出私钥 d 把密文解回原文。攻击者想破解就必须把 n 分解成 p、q，而分解超大合数目前没有快速算法，这正是 RSA 安全的根基。��RSA multiplies two large secret primes p, q to get n=pq. The public key, consisting of n and an exponent e, lets anyone encrypt a message into ciphertext, while only someone who knows p and q can derive the private key d and decrypt. An attacker must factor n back into p and q to break it, and no fast factoring algorithm for huge composites is known — that difficulty is the root of RSA's security.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�50b34f2c9a2b�body�ٚ无损压缩利用统计冗余，例如把哈哈哈记为哈乘3，用更短编码表示高频模式。信息论（香农熵）给出了压缩的极限。��Lossless compression exploits statistical redundancy, e.g. writing hahaha as ha x3, using shorter codes for frequent patterns. Information theory (Shannon entropy) gives the compression limit.�ans��src��%《信息论基础》Cover 与 Thomas�2Elements of Information Theory by Cover and Thomas��id�54502a910317�body�٘7世纪印度数学家婆罗摩笈多首次给出0的运算法则和二次方程求根公式，并系统研究了负数，深刻影响了后世代数。٫In the 7th century, Brahmagupta gave the first rules for operating with zero, the quadratic formula, and a systematic treatment of negative numbers, shaping later algebra.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�54e0d35f32dd�body�ٮ它的两个主曲率方向相反（一正一负），形成‘抗弯’的双向刚度，不易弯折只能断裂，所以口感脆。这是负高斯曲率结构的妙用。��Its two principal curvatures point opposite ways (one positive, one negative), creating two-way stiffness that resists bending and tends to fracture, giving a crisp snap. A neat use of negative Gaussian curvature.�ans��src�ٖdo Carmo《Differential Geometry of Curves and Surfaces》，Prentice-Hall，1976，第 4-3 节（Theorema Egregium）与第 4-5 节（Gauss-Bonnet）ّManfredo P. do Carmo, Differential Geometry of Curves and Surfaces, Prentice-Hall, 1976, Sec. 4-3 (Theorema Egregium) and Sec. 4-5 (Gauss-Bonnet)��id�54f28f5a7516�body��零作为数字与占位符由古印度数学家在公元 5 世纪前后系统使用，最早见于婆罗摩笈多的著作，规定了零的运算规则。经阿拉伯学者（如花拉子米）中转，零的符号与十进制位值制传入欧洲，奠定了现代算术基础。�NZero as both a number and a placeholder was systematically used by Indian mathematicians around the 5th century CE, first treated with operational rules in Brahmagupta's works. Transmitted through Arab scholars such as al-Khwarizmi, the symbol and decimal place-value system reached Europe, laying the foundation of modern arithmetic.�ans��src��《数字通史》Ifrah�1The Universal History of Numbers by Georges Ifrah��id�55a8e5656bb5�body�ٟ是的。你初选正确的概率是1/3；主持人揭开一只空门后，剩下那扇门正确的概率变成2/3，所以换门把胜率从1/3提高到2/3。ٺYes. Your first pick is right only 1/3 of the time; after the host reveals an empty door, the remaining door is right 2/3 of the time, so switching doubles your win rate from 1/3 to 2/3.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�567ff88a52a9�body��d打八折表示按原价的 80% 出售，即 200 × 0.8 = 160 元。所以折后价格是 160 元。نA 20% discount means selling at 80% of the original price, that is, 200 × 0.8 = 160 yuan. The discounted price is therefore 160 yuan.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�56f549743d57�body�ْ用72除以年化利率百分数，就约等于本金翻一倍所需的年数。例如年利8%，大约9年翻倍。它是复利的对数近似。ٵDivide 72 by the annual interest rate in percent to approximate the years needed to double your money. At 8% that is about 9 years. It is a logarithmic approximation of compounding.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�59186a389408�body���平稳分布 $\pi$ 是一个概率向量，满足 $\pi P=\pi$，其中 $P$ 为一步转移矩阵。若链不可约且正常返，则存在唯一平稳分布，且从任意初态出发的长期分布都收敛到它。�A stationary distribution $\pi$ is a probability vector satisfying $\pi P=\pi$, where $P$ is the one-step transition matrix. If the chain is irreducible and positive recurrent, a unique stationary distribution exists, and the long-run distribution from any initial state converges to it.�ans��src��,美国数学会(AMS)《随机过程导论》�IAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Introduction to Stochastic Processes��id�593cf4ca3331�body�ٲ这是排队论：平均等待随服务台数增加而非线性下降，利用率越高时边际改善越大。所以从1个窗口加到2个，常比从5个加到6个更明显。ٸThis is queueing theory: average wait drops nonlinearly as servers increase, and the gain is largest at high utilization. Going from 1 to 2 lanes often helps far more than from 5 to 6.�ans��src��$《运筹学》Hillier 与 Lieberman�<Introduction to Operations Research by Hillier and Lieberman��id�5b7aa5616840�body��k把矩阵作用在向量上，就是把平面或空间按某个规则重新摆布：比如旋转矩阵把每个向量转过一个角度，对角矩阵沿坐标轴伸缩，反射矩阵把图形翻到另一侧。这些操作都是线性的——直线保持为直线，原点保持不动。矩阵的行列式还告诉你变换把面积或体积放大了多少倍。�{Applying a matrix to a vector rearranges the plane or space by a fixed rule: a rotation matrix turns every vector through an angle, a diagonal matrix stretches along axes, and a reflection flips figures to the other side. All are linear — straight lines stay straight and the origin stays put. The determinant even tells you how much the transformation scales areas or volumes.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�5db1329c1380�body�ً设鸡 x 只、兔 y 只，则 x + y = 35，2x + 4y = 94。解得鸡 23 只、兔 12 只。这类问题训练用方程建模现实情境。٤Let x be chickens and y rabbits: x + y = 35 and 2x + 4y = 94. Solving gives 23 chickens and 12 rabbits. Such problems train modeling real situations with equations.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5efed5290b7b�body�ٙ冰的晶体由水分子按六方晶格排列，氢键决定了六重对称。每片雪花在六条对称轴上生长分枝，所以天然是六角形。ٯIce crystals arrange water molecules in a hexagonal lattice; hydrogen bonds fix sixfold symmetry. Each flake grows branches along those six axes, so it is naturally hexagonal.�ans��src�ف《国际晶体学表》A卷：空间群对称性，M. I. Aroyo主编，第6版，国际晶体学联合会（IUCr），2016年。ُInternational Tables for Crystallography, Vol. A: Space-Group Symmetry, ed. M. I. Aroyo, 6th ed., International Union of Crystallography, 2016.��id�6126117c4c08�body��)直方图用来展示连续数值数据的分布，横轴是按区间划分的数值，柱子之间通常没有间隙。条形图则用来比较不同类别的数量，横轴是离散的类别，柱子之间有空隙。简言之，直方图看“分布形状”，条形图看“各类对比”。�AA histogram shows the distribution of continuous numerical data, with the horizontal axis divided into numeric intervals and bars usually touching. A bar chart compares counts across discrete categories, with gaps between bars. In short, a histogram shows distribution shape, while a bar chart shows category comparisons.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�61b57a172d74�body���若存在连续的双射且其逆也连续，则两空间同胚，可视作「拓扑上相同」：它们共享所有拓扑性质（连通性、紧性、分离性等）。例如咖啡杯与甜甜圈表面同胚，都同胚于环面。�A homeomorphism is a continuous bijection with continuous inverse; two spaces related this way are topologically the same and share all topological properties (connectedness, compactness, separation). For example a coffee mug and a doughnut surface are homeomorphic, both to a torus.�ans��src��)美国数学会(AMS)《点集拓扑学》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Point Set Topology��id�63321693d6fd�body��.里德-所罗门码是基于有限域上多项式的纠错码，把数据视为多项式系数，在多余点上采样作为冗余。它能纠正成块突发错误（整段字节丢失），在 CD/DVD、二维码与旅行者号深空链路中表现优异，因为突发错误比随机位错更常见。�JReed-Solomon codes are error-correcting codes over finite fields that treat data as polynomial coefficients and sample at extra points for redundancy. They correct burst errors (whole byte blocks lost), performing excellently in CDs/DVDs, QR codes, and Voyager deep-space links, where bursts are more common than random bit flips.�ans��src��+《纠错码理论》MacWilliams 与 Sloane�>The Theory of Error-Correcting Codes by MacWilliams and Sloane��id�63671c4f44aa�body�ٴ不可能图形在局部都合理、整体却自相矛盾，如彭罗斯楼梯、不可能叉子。大脑按三维物体的先验解读局部线索，于是误以为整体成立。��Impossible figures are locally plausible but globally contradictory, like the Penrose stairs or impossible trident. The brain reads local cues as 3D objects and infers a coherent whole that cannot exist.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�63fbf1acbddb�body��?弧度把“弧长等于半径的圆心角”定为 1，使弧长公式变成简单的 s=rθ。更关键的是，只有用弧度才有 lim(sin x/x)=1 和 d(sin x)/dx=cos x；用角度就会出现 (π/180) 的常数因子。弧度让微积分的公式保持最简洁，是一种自然的、不带单位的角度度量。�)A radian is the angle whose arc length equals the radius, giving the clean arc formula s=rθ. Crucially, only in radians do we get lim(sin x/x)=1 and d(sin x)/dx=cos x; degrees would introduce a (π/180) factor. Radians keep calculus formulas simplest—a natural, unit-free way to measure angles.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�64b77f9d9dcf�body��环要求加法成群且乘法满足结合律与分配律，但不要求乘法可逆；域在此基础上还要求非零元素乘法成群。有理数中每个非零数都有乘法逆元，故构成域；整数中如 2 没有整数逆元，因此只是环而非域。�`A ring requires addition to form a group and multiplication to be associative and distributive, but not invertible; a field additionally requires nonzero elements to form a multiplicative group. Every nonzero rational has a multiplicative inverse, so the rationals are a field, whereas integers like 2 lack an integer inverse, so they form only a ring.�ans��src��*《代数学引论》聂灵沼、丁石孙�Algebra by Serge Lang��id�6545e8014662�body�٢同样路程，慢的那段占用更多时间，所以要用调和平均2ab/(a+b)才正确。平均速度看的是总路程除以总时间，而非算术平均。٫The slower leg takes more time over the same distance, so the harmonic mean 2ab/(a+b) is correct. Average speed is total distance over total time, not the arithmetic mean.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�67d7b81d2573�body�ٮ算盘每档满十进一，是十进制进位；二进制则是满二进一。两者都是位值制下的进位规则，只是基数不同，体现了进制的统一逻辑。٦An abacus carries at ten per rod, decimal; binary carries at two. Both are place-value carry rules with different bases, showing the unified logic of numeral systems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�67f292bf6119�body��|甲每天完成 1/10，乙每天完成 1/15，合作每天完成 1/10 + 1/15 = 1/6。所以两人合作需要 6 天完成。ٖA completes 1/10 per day and B completes 1/15 per day, so together they finish 1/10 + 1/15 = 1/6 per day. Working together they need 6 days to finish.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�6803c60e954f�body��反射变换把图形关于一条直线（镜面）翻转，使每一点落到另一侧等距的位置。它保持图形的形状和大小不变，但会改变“手性”（左右对调）。反射是等距变换的一种，常用于研究对称图形和晶体结构。�"A reflection flips a figure across a line (the mirror), sending each point to an equidistant position on the other side. It preserves shape and size but reverses handedness (left and right swap). Reflection is an isometry and is useful for studying symmetric figures and crystal structures.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6874f3bcc93d�body��b发送方先用哈希函数把消息压缩成固定长度的“指纹”，再用自己的私钥加密这段指纹得到签名。验证方用公钥解密，并和自己算出的哈希比对：消息任何改动都会改变指纹，使签名失效。因为只有持有私钥的人能生成有效签名，所以身份可确认，签名者也无法抵赖。��The sender hashes the message into a fixed-length fingerprint, then encrypts that fingerprint with their private key to form the signature. The verifier decrypts with the public key and compares against a freshly computed hash: any alteration changes the fingerprint and breaks the signature. Since only the private-key holder can produce a valid signature, authenticity is assured and repudiation is impossible.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�692c00c64b7d�body�٦它对同胚于球面的凸多面体成立；一旦有多个洞（如环面，结果为0）或自交、非连通，公式需改成 V−E+F=2−2g，否则不成立。٠It holds for sphere-like convex polyhedra; with holes (a torus gives 0) or self-intersections/disconnected parts, it becomes V−E+F=2−2g and otherwise fails.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�694862c733f1�body�ٮ若绳子两端未固定或首尾可相接，许多看似的结能通过连续移动解开；拓扑区分的是闭曲线能否变回圆。判断真正打结需要不变量。پIf the rope ends are free or can join, many apparent knots undo by continuous moves; topology distinguishes whether a closed curve can become a circle. Real knots need invariants to confirm.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�69552da66f11�body��直角三角形两直角边边长的平方和等于斜边边长的平方，即 a²+b²=c²。它既能用来求未知边长，也揭示了平面几何中距离的本质。该定理在世界多地独立被发现，是中国古代“勾三股四弦五”的推广。�'In a right triangle, the sum of the squares of the two legs equals the square of the hypotenuse: a²+b²=c². It finds unknown side lengths and reveals the nature of distance in plane geometry. Discovered independently in many regions, it generalizes the ancient Chinese 3-4-5 triangle relation.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�6c32b91e5aee�body�ٱ循环赛让每两队都交手，偶然性小、更能反映真实实力，但场次多；淘汰赛场次少却容易被一次失误淘汰。两者是公平与效率的权衡。��Round-robin has every pair play, reducing luck and reflecting true strength but needing many games; knockout is efficient yet one bad day eliminates you. It is a trade-off of fairness versus efficiency.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6c67029b8925�body�ٺ公司用大数定律把众多投保人的小额保费汇聚起来，赔付只是其中一部分，并预留利润与安全边际。只要事故概率估计准确，就能稳定盈利。ٿBy the law of large numbers, many small premiums pool into a fund where payouts are only a fraction, with profit and safety margins reserved. Accurate risk estimates make the business steady.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�6f48da9b476c�body��n只要样本是随机抽取的，统计上就能用样本推算总体，但要附上误差范围。通常报告“置信区间”：比如 95% 置信区间是 52%±3%，意思是如果反复重新抽样，约 95% 的区间会覆盖真实比例。误差主要来自抽样随机性，而非样本大小本身，因此关键是抽样是否随机、样本是否足够。��As long as the sample is drawn randomly, statistics lets you estimate the population from it — but with a margin of error attached. Usually a confidence interval is reported: a 95% confidence interval of 52%±3% means that if sampling were repeated, about 95% of such intervals would cover the true proportion. Error comes mostly from sampling randomness, so what matters is random selection and adequate size, not just bigness.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6ffee14d27be�body�ٔ它保证每个大于1的整数都能唯一分解为素数乘积（不计顺序）。这是整除、最大公约数和整个数论大厦的基石。ٜIt guarantees every integer greater than 1 factors uniquely into primes (up to order). It is the foundation of divisibility, gcd, and much of number theory.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�707399d0ed5f�body��P欧几里得的第五公设说只有一条，但两千年来没人能证明它。19 世纪数学家发现：否定它并不会导致矛盾，而是得到全新的几何。在双曲几何里，过直线外一点可以有无数条平行线，三角形内角和小于 180°，空间像马鞍一样“每处都往里弯”（负曲率）。��Euclid's fifth postulate asserts exactly one parallel, yet for two millennia no one could prove it. In the 19th century mathematicians discovered that denying it creates no contradiction — only a new geometry. In hyperbolic geometry, infinitely many parallels pass through a point off a line, triangles have angle sums under 180°, and space curves inward like a saddle (negative curvature).�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（非欧几何）�6What Is Mathematics? (Courant), non-Euclidean geometry��id�728a97a246f3�body�ٴ每颗卫星给出到它的距离（一个球面），3个球面交于一点定位；但还需要第4颗来校正接收机时钟误差（时间乘光速），所以实际用4颗。ٱEach satellite gives a distance (a sphere); three spheres intersect at a point. A fourth corrects the receiver's clock error (time times light speed), so four are actually used.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�73bb614bc8c1�body�ٺ人编出的数字序列常有规律（避免过长连号），算法随机数多为伪随机（决定性公式），真正随机需要物理噪声。这也是密码学关心的话题。��Human-made sequences show patterns (avoiding long runs) and algorithmic randoms are usually pseudorandom (deterministic formulas); true randomness needs physical noise. That is why cryptography cares.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�782af3b608fc�body�م进水效率为 1/6，出水效率为 1/8，同时开净效率为 1/6 − 1/8 = 1/24。因此同时开两管需要 24 小时注满。٥The inlet rate is 1/6 and the outlet rate is 1/8, so the net rate with both open is 1/6 − 1/8 = 1/24. Thus it takes 24 hours to fill the pool with both pipes open.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�787128aa0fe1�body�٢左右对称意味着身体结构完整、健康，进化让我们把对称当作可靠信号。数学上它对应反射对称，规律本身也带来舒适感。ٱBilateral symmetry signals physical integrity and health, so evolution made us read it as trustworthy. Mathematically it is reflection symmetry, and order itself feels pleasing.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�795bb95a8aaf�body���尺规作图只能从已知数出发通过加减乘除和开平方构造新数，所以能作的点都在由有理数反复开平方扩出的域中。三等分 60° 角等价于解三次方程 4x³−3x=1/2（令 x=cos 20°），而这个方程没有“平方根式”的解，因此不可能。它与“化圆为方”“倍立方”并称古希腊三大作图难题，直到 19 世纪才借助域论被彻底解决。�+Straightedge-and-compass constructions can build new numbers only via addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, and square roots, so constructible points lie in fields obtained from the rationals by repeated square roots. Trisecting 60° is equivalent to solving the cubic 4x³−3x=1/2 (with x=cos 20°), which has no solution built from square roots—hence it is impossible. Along with squaring the circle and doubling the cube, it is one of the three ancient Greek construction problems, fully settled only in the 19th century via field theory.�ans��src��5《什么是数学》(柯朗)（代数与几何章）�<What Is Mathematics? (Courant), algebra and geometry chapter��id�7a1b1a31df1a�body�ٲ平面上的周期图案只有17种基本的壁纸群，穷尽了旋转、平移、反射、滑移反射的所有组合。看似千变万化的花纹，其实逃不出这17种。��Periodic plane patterns fall into just 17 wallpaper groups, exhausting all combinations of rotation, translation, reflection and glide reflection. Endless-looking designs are confined to these 17.�ans��src��GGrünbaum, B. 与 Shephard, G. C., 《镶嵌与图案》, W. H. Freeman�FGrünbaum, B. & Shephard, G. C., 'Tilings and Patterns', W. H. Freeman��id�7a1d092dd0fa�body���在零和博弈中，所有参与者的收益之和恒为零（一方所得正是他方所失）。国际象棋、扑克等属此类。冯·诺依曼的极小极大定理证明，此类博弈在混合策略下存在价值确定的均衡。��In a zero-sum game the sum of all players' payoffs is always zero (one's gain is another's loss), as in chess or poker. Von Neumann's minimax theorem shows such games have a well-defined equilibrium value under mixed strategies.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�7aa927c876ea�body��方差衡量数据偏离平均值的平方的平均距离，而标准差是方差的正平方根。标准差和原始数据使用相同的单位，因此比方差更容易直观理解。两者都描述数据的离散程度，数值越大说明数据越分散。�SVariance measures the average of the squared distances from the mean, while standard deviation is the positive square root of the variance. Because standard deviation uses the same units as the original data, it is more intuitively interpretable than variance. Both describe how spread out the data are; larger values mean more dispersion.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�7ae00906d978�body��1这不是随意规定，而是为了保持递推一致：n! = n·(n−1)!，代入 n=1 得 1! = 1·0!，所以 0! 必须等于 1。它也让组合数公式 C(n,0)=n!/(0!·n!)=1、排列计数和泰勒展开在边界情形自然成立——例如“从 n 个东西里选 0 个”恰好只有一种做法。�0This is not arbitrary but keeps the recurrence consistent: n! = n·(n−1)!, and plugging n=1 gives 1! = 1·0!, forcing 0! = 1. It also makes the binomial formula C(n,0)=n!/(0!·n!)=1, permutation counts, and Taylor series work naturally at boundary cases—choosing 0 items out of n has exactly one way.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�7b002c651a06�body�ٙ神经网络是层层矩阵乘法加非线性函数，训练即用梯度下降最小化损失函数。所谓学习，其实是求解高维优化问题。��A neural network is layered matrix multiplication plus nonlinear functions; training minimizes a loss function by gradient descent. Learning is really solving a high-dimensional optimization problem.�ans��src��3《深度学习》Goodfellow、Bengio 与 Courville�0Deep Learning by Goodfellow Bengio and Courville��id�7b1311171d1a�body�١条形码用宽窄条表示0和1的二进制，并带一位奇偶校验位来发现扫描错误。它把商品编号编码成机器能快速读取的数字串。٣A barcode encodes binary 0/1 with bar widths and includes a parity check digit to catch scan errors. It turns a product code into a machine-readable number string.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�7c0b5aad70c9�body�ٮ这类题利用公共知识与我看到什么的推理链：每个人根据他人行为反推自己帽子颜色，常需约定策略，如前几人牺牲传递奇偶信息。��These puzzles use common knowledge and the chain of what each person sees; players infer their own hat from others' actions, often needing an agreed strategy like early players sacrificing to signal parity.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�7c1a91f8b1e8�body�ٔ异或的一个妙处是自身异或可逆：A⊕K再⊕K回到A。它与随机密钥异或可打乱比特，且计算极快、便于硬件实现。مXOR is self-inverse: (A⊕K)⊕K=A. XORing with a random key scrambles bits, is extremely fast, and is easy to implement in hardware.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�7d2fa33fcef0�body�٦递归思想：移n盘等于先把n-1盘移到中转柱(2^(n-1)-1步)，移最大盘(1步)，再把n-1盘移过去(2^(n-1)-1步)，合计2^n-1，指数增长极快。٬Recursively: moving n disks means moving n-1 to a spare (2^(n-1)-1 steps), moving the largest (1), then n-1 again (2^(n-1)-1), totaling 2^n - 1, growing exponentially fast.�ans��src��\R. L. Graham, D. E. Knuth, O. Patashnik, Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994�\R. L. Graham, D. E. Knuth, O. Patashnik, Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�7d2fd7499499�body�ٜ一个经典办法是：一人切、另一人先选，切的人会尽量切平均以免自己拿到小的。这就是博弈论里的无嫉妒分配思路。ٮA classic method: one person cuts, the other chooses first, so the cutter splits evenly to avoid the smaller piece. This is the envy-free idea from fair-division game theory.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7df58d1d3770�body���平移是把图形沿某个方向移动固定距离，图形的每个点都移动相同的向量。平移不改变图形的形状、大小和方向，只改变位置。它是向量加法在几何中的直观体现。��A translation slides a figure by a fixed distance in a direction, moving every point by the same vector. It changes only the position, not the shape, size, or orientation. It is the geometric picture of vector addition.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7dfada55798a�body��v单利利息 = 本金 × 利率 × 时间 = 1000 × 0.05 × 1 = 50 元。一年后本息合计 1000 + 50 = 1050 元。�}Simple interest = principal × rate × time = 1000 × 0.05 × 1 = 50 yuan. After one year the total is 1000 + 50 = 1050 yuan.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8106a101416a�body�ٓ不是。30%表示在类似天气条件下，约三成会下雨。小概率事件照样可能发生，一次结果不能判定概率预报对错。٦No. A 30% chance means rain occurs in about 3 of 10 similar situations. Low-probability events still happen, and a single outcome does not invalidate the probability.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�8142b4bf7774�body�٥一个朔望月约29.53天，12个月约354天，比回归年少约11天。通过19年7闰使历法与季节同步，背后是分数近似与同余思想的运用。��A lunar month is about 29.53 days, so 12 months miss the solar year by about 11 days. Inserting 7 leap months every 19 years keeps the calendar aligned, an application of fractional approximation and congruences.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�83d55e761e50�body�ٴ以顶点为圆心画弧交两边，再分别以两交点为圆心画等半径弧交于一点，连接顶点与该点即得角平分线。这是尺规作图的经典基本操作。��From the vertex draw an arc crossing both sides, then equal arcs from those crossings meet at a point; the line from vertex to that point bisects the angle. A classic straightedge-and-compass construction.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�84a543af4f15�body���平移对称指图形沿某个方向平移一定距离后与原图重合，就像无限延伸的条纹或瓷砖图案。把图形不断平铺就会得到周期性的重复结构。平移对称是晶体和装饰图案中最常见的对称类型之一。�Translational symmetry means a figure coincides with itself after sliding a certain distance in a direction, like an infinitely repeating stripe or tiled pattern. Repeating the slide yields a periodic structure. It is among the most common symmetries in crystals and decorative patterns.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�86548b6515ac�body��标准差告诉我们一组数据围绕平均值波动的“典型幅度”。标准差小，说明大家的水平很接近；标准差大，说明个体差异明显。例如两个班级数学平均分都是 80，但一个班标准差 5、另一个 15，后者成绩更参差不齐。�RStandard deviation tells us the typical amount by which data fluctuate around the mean. A small standard deviation means values are close together; a large one means individuals differ greatly. For example, two classes may both average 80 in math, but one with standard deviation 5 and another with 15 shows the latter is far more uneven.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�86b03e3224a5�body��/用样本去估计总体方差时，如果除以样本量 n，会系统性地低估真实方差，这称为偏差。除以 n−1（即自由度）可以对这种低估进行修正，得到无偏估计，这一做法被称为贝塞尔校正。当样本量很大时，除以 n 还是 n−1 差别很小。�jWhen using a sample to estimate the population variance, dividing by n systematically underestimates the true variance; this is called bias. Dividing by n−1 (the degrees of freedom) corrects for this underestimation and yields an unbiased estimate, known as Bessel's correction. When the sample is large, the difference between using n and n−1 is negligible.�ans��src��CCasella, G. 与 Berger, R. L., 《统计推断》(第2版), Duxbury�GCasella, G. & Berger, R. L., 'Statistical Inference' (2nd ed.), Duxbury��id�8742ec93804a�body�ٲ任取一个四位不全相同的数，把数字按降序和升序各排一次相减，重复下去，最多七步必得到6174，之后不再变。这是卡普雷卡尔常数。��Take any 4-digit number with not all equal digits, form the descending and ascending numbers, subtract, and repeat. Within seven steps you always reach 6174, the Kaprekar constant, which then stays fixed.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�89d8081b14c9�body�ٱ重差术是刘徽在《海岛算经》中发展的测量术，利用两次观测的相似三角形之差来推算高远距离，是早期三角测量与比例几何的应用。��Chongcha, developed by Liu Hui in the Sea Island Mathematical Manual, uses the difference of two similar triangles from two observations to find heights and distances, an early form of trigonometric surveying.�ans��src��刘徽《海岛算经》�Sea Island Manual��id�89fc5885e87e�body�٩它用大量随机抽样来逼近积分、概率或复杂系统的期望，样本越多结果越稳（误差约 1/√N）。常用于难以解析求解的高维问题。��It uses massive random sampling to approximate integrals, probabilities or system expectations; more samples give steadier results (error ~1/√N). It shines in high-dimensional problems lacking analytic solutions.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�8aabce399c91�body�ٳ为了易读，制图者舍弃真实地理，只用水平和45度线段表示走向，站距也均匀化。这是用图论抽象保留连接关系、牺牲几何精度的典范。ټFor readability, mapmakers drop real geography and use only horizontal and 45° segments with even spacing. It is graph theory abstracting connections while sacrificing geometric accuracy.�ans��src��,《什么是数学》(柯朗)（拓扑章）�3What Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on topology��id�8c6dafe4aad3�body��l图灵机把“算法”精确化：任何能用有限条规则描述、能得出确定结果的计算，都可以在一台理想化的图灵机上完成。丘奇-图灵论题断言“可计算”就等于“图灵可计算”。它把计算的概念从具体机器中抽象出来，成为理论计算机科学的基石，也揭示了不可计算问题的存在。��The Turing machine formalizes the notion of algorithm: any computation describable by finitely many rules with a definite outcome can be carried out on an idealized Turing machine. The Church–Turing thesis asserts that “computable” means “Turing-computable”. This abstracts computation away from any physical machine, founding theoretical computer science and exposing the existence of non-computable problems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8c6e7fbf2fa0�body�ٮ排列关注“顺序重要”的选取方式，组合关注“顺序无关”的选取方式。例如从 3 人中选 2 人排队是排列，选 2 人组成小组是组合。��Permutations count selections where order matters, while combinations count selections where order does not matter. For example, choosing 2 of 3 people and lining them up is a permutation, whereas choosing 2 to form a group is a combination.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�8de53664d432�body�٩模运算（“时钟算术”）只关心两个整数相除的余数，记作 a ≡ b (mod n)。它在密码学、计算机科学和校验码设计中被广泛使用。��Modular arithmetic, or clock arithmetic, cares only about the remainder when two integers are divided, written a ≡ b (mod n). It is widely used in cryptography, computer science, and checksum design.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8ecc22d3128d�body�ٱ伊斯兰艺术受禁止具象的影响，发展出以星状多边形为基础的复杂镶嵌（如8角、12角星），用直尺圆规与对称群构造无限延伸的装饰。��Influenced by the avoidance of figural imagery, Islamic art developed complex star-polygon tessellations (8- and 12-point stars) built with compass-straightedge and symmetry groups for infinitely extending ornament.�ans��src��GGrünbaum, B. 与 Shephard, G. C., 《镶嵌与图案》, W. H. Freeman�FGrünbaum, B. & Shephard, G. C., 'Tilings and Patterns', W. H. Freeman��id�8ed222609a77�body��旋转变换需要三个要素：旋转中心、旋转角度和旋转方向（顺时针或逆时针）。图形绕中心转动后，形状和大小不变，只是位置改变。旋转对称图形能在转动某个角度后仍与原图重合，例如正方形转 90 度不变。�2A rotation needs three elements: a center, an angle, and a direction (clockwise or counterclockwise). After turning around the center, the figure keeps its shape and size but changes position. A rotationally symmetric figure coincides with itself after some angle, such as a square unchanged by 90 degrees.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�905a4df9237c�body�ٽ你可以把前一段经历当作样本建立标准，之后遇到达标选项就行动，而不是无限观望。代价是可能错过更优者，但能避免永远等待的机会成本。��You can treat early options as a sample to set a standard, then act once a meeting option appears, rather than waiting forever. The cost is possibly missing a better one, but it avoids infinite opportunity cost.�ans��src��RFerguson, T. S., 《谁解开了秘书问题？》, Statistical Science 4(3), 1989�TFerguson, T. S., 'Who Solved the Secretary Problem?', Statistical Science 4(3), 1989��id�91a0780a56a4�body�٣常用二倍均值法：每次在0到剩余人均两倍之间随机，保证先抢不会必多、后抢也有机会。它利用了均匀分布与期望值控制。��A common method is the double-mean rule: each draw is uniform between 0 and twice the remaining average, so early grabbers are not guaranteed more. It uses uniform distribution with controlled expectation.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�91a080ba9a55�body�ٮ真实随机要靠物理噪声，成本高；电脑用确定性的种子加算法生成看似随机的序列，叫伪随机。它可复现、够用，但严格说可预测。��True randomness needs physical noise and is costly; computers use a deterministic seed and algorithm to generate seemingly random sequences, called pseudo-random. Reproducible and good enough, but in principle predictable.�ans��src��VMenezes、van Oorschot、Vanstone《Handbook of Applied Cryptography》（CRC Press）�LMenezes, van Oorschot, Vanstone, Handbook of Applied Cryptography, CRC Press��id�92b83eafecf0�body��#幸存者偏差指我们只观察到“幸存”下来的样本，而忽略了已经消失的样本，从而得出错误结论。例如二战时统计返航飞机弹孔位置来加固装甲，却忽略了被击落飞机才是关键。正确做法要考虑那些“没被看到”的数据。�RSurvivorship bias means we only observe the samples that survived while ignoring those that disappeared, leading to wrong conclusions. For example, during WWII, plotting bullet holes on returning aircraft to add armor missed the fact that downed planes were the crucial evidence. The correct approach accounts for the data you cannot see.�ans��src��Wald 战时统计研究�Wald's wartime statistics��id�93932cca004a�body��!相关系数（常用皮尔逊 r）衡量两个变量之间线性关系的强弱和方向，取值范围在 −1 到 1 之间。r 接近 1 表示强正相关，接近 −1 表示强负相关，接近 0 表示几乎没有线性关系。它只衡量线性关联，无法捕捉曲线关系。�`The correlation coefficient, commonly Pearson's r, measures the strength and direction of the linear relationship between two variables, ranging from −1 to 1. An r near 1 indicates strong positive correlation, near −1 strong negative correlation, and near 0 little linear relationship. It captures only linear association, not curved relationships.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�9492ff4c61d6�body�ٺ每个区块含上一块的哈希，改动任一区块会使后续所有哈希失效，需要重算全网，成本极高，从而保证不可篡改，是密码学与分布式的结合。��Each block contains the previous block's hash; altering any block invalidates all subsequent hashes, forcing a costly full recompute, thus ensuring immutability, a blend of cryptography and distributed systems.�ans��src��C中本聪《Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System》, 2008�CS. Nakamoto, 'Bitcoin: A Peer-to-Peer Electronic Cash System', 2008��id�96a68096d7b3�body���中国南北朝数学家祖冲之在 5 世纪把圆周率精确计算到 3.1415926 与 3.1415927 之间，并提出约率 22/7 和密率 355/113。在当时的计算条件下，这一精度领先世界近千年。密率 355/113 是极好的分数近似。�FThe Chinese mathematician Zu Chongzhi, in the 5th century, computed pi to between 3.1415926 and 3.1415927 and proposed the rough ratio 22/7 and the precise ratio 355/113. Under the computational limits of his time, this accuracy led the world by nearly a millennium. The ratio 355/113 is an excellent fractional approximation.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�97d49301632d�body�٭它给出一组两两互素的模数下同时满足多个同余式x≡a_i (mod m_i)的解，且解在乘积模下唯一。可用于日历换算、密码学与并行计算。��It finds a number x satisfying several congruences x≡a_i (mod m_i) with pairwise coprime moduli, unique modulo their product. It applies to calendars, cryptography, and parallel computation.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�986c9eed7321�body�٥期望值是每种结果乘以其概率后加总，代表长期的平均收益。理性选择通常挑期望效用最高者，但人对风险的态度会修正它。ټExpected value weights each outcome by its probability and sums them, the long-run average gain. Rational choice usually maximizes expected utility, though attitudes toward risk adjust it.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�9c698e16e02e�body��箱线图用一个小箱子展示数据的中位数、上下四分位数，并用须线标出大致范围，还能直观显示异常值。它能在一张图里比较多个组的分布形状和离散程度。相比只看平均数，箱线图更能暴露数据的偏斜和离群点。�1A box plot uses a box to show the median and the upper and lower quartiles, with whiskers marking the rough range and outliers often shown individually. It lets you compare the shape and spread of several groups in one picture. Compared with looking only at means, it better reveals skewness and outliers.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�9d9582f40bf9�body��'法国数学家笛卡尔提出用一对数（x, y）表示平面上的点，从而把几何图形变成代数方程，把方程变成图形。这一“坐标几何”让曲线可以用公式研究，也为微积分和解析几何奠定基础。它至今是所有科学和工程绘图的语言。�aThe French mathematician Descartes proposed representing plane points by a pair (x, y), turning geometric figures into algebraic equations and equations into figures. This coordinate geometry lets curves be studied by formulas and laid the groundwork for calculus and analytic geometry. It remains the language of all scientific and engineering drawing.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�9df49fa65489�body�ٟ人均是把总量除以人数，掩盖了内部的贫富差距。一个少数富人拉高人均、多数人并不富裕的地区，人均数字就失真了。ٵPer-capita divides totals by population and hides internal inequality. Where a few rich people inflate the average, most residents may be far less well off than the figure suggests.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9ec0dc6b7a7b�body��展开 (a+b)ⁿ 相当于从 n 个因子中每一个都选 a 或 b。要得到 aᵏb^(n−k)，只需在 n 个位置里挑出 k 个放 a，共有 C(n,k) 种选择，所以系数是组合数。这也解释了杨辉三角的递推 C(n,k)=C(n−1,k−1)+C(n−1,k)。�-Expanding (a+b)ⁿ means choosing a or b from each of the n factors. To form the term aᵏb^(n−k) you must pick k of the n positions for a, giving exactly C(n,k) choices—so the coefficient is a binomial coefficient. This also explains Pascal's triangle recurrence C(n,k)=C(n−1,k−1)+C(n−1,k).�ans��src��,《什么是数学》(柯朗)（组合章）�8What Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on combinatorics��id�a1cd928ac029�body���对任意与 $n$ 互素的 $a$，欧拉定理给出 $a^{\varphi(n)}\equiv 1\pmod n$，其中 $\varphi(n)$ 为欧拉函数（不超过 $n$ 且与 $n$ 互素的正整数个数）。当 $n$ 为素数时 $\varphi(n)=n-1$，即退化为费马小定理。��For any $a$ coprime to $n$, Euler's theorem gives $a^{\varphi(n)}\equiv 1\pmod n$, where $\varphi(n)$ counts integers up to $n$ coprime to $n$. When $n$ is prime, $\varphi(n)=n-1$, recovering Fermat's little theorem.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《初等数论》�=American Mathematical Society (AMS), Elementary Number Theory��id�a241708c719f�body�٫因为人看重确定性和损失厌恶：损失带来的痛苦大于同等收益的快乐，所以同样期望下多选择稳妥方案，这催生了期望效用理论。ٹPeople value certainty and are loss-averse: a loss hurts more than an equal gain pleases, so with equal expectations they prefer the safe option, giving rise to expected utility theory.�ans��src�ّTom、Fox、Trepel 与 Poldrack,《The Neural Basis of Loss Aversion in Decision-Making Under Risk》,Science,2007 (DOI: 10.1126/science.1134239)ًTom, Fox, Trepel & Poldrack, 'The Neural Basis of Loss Aversion in Decision-Making Under Risk', Science, 2007, DOI: 10.1126/science.1134239��id�a2474e00d829�body�ٓRSA等公钥加密基于大数易乘难分解：两个质数相乘很快，反过来分解极慢。质数的乘法单向性保证了通信安全。��Public-key encryption like RSA rests on easy-to-multiply-hard-to-factor: multiplying two primes is fast, factoring back is extremely slow. The one-way nature of prime multiplication secures communication.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�a342688b1e0c�body���整数规划要求部分或全部变量取整数值。相比连续线性规划，整数约束使可行域变成分立点集，问题通常 NP 难。它用于排班、选址等必须取离散决策的场景，常通过分支定界求解。�QInteger programming requires some or all variables to take integer values. Unlike continuous linear programming, the integer constraints make the feasible region a set of discrete points, usually rendering the problem NP-hard. It models scheduling and facility location where decisions must be discrete, often solved by branch-and-bound.�ans��src��$《运筹学》Hillier 与 Lieberman�<Introduction to Operations Research by Hillier and Lieberman��id�a371d3cdb7b5�body���农业赋税、度量衡和历法都需要精确分割，所以《九章算术》开篇就系统讲分数四则（合分、减分、乘分、经分），比欧洲早千年建立了完整分数算法。��Taxation, weights and calendars all needed precise division, so the Nine Chapters opens with a full treatment of fraction arithmetic (addition, subtraction, multiplication, division), a complete system a millennium ahead of Europe.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�a438c037304d�body�١若每个位置有约62种字符，n位密码有62的n次方种组合，长度加一组合就乘62。指数增长让长密码在暴力破解面前极其安全。��With about 62 possible characters per position, an n-character password has 62^n combinations; one more character multiplies that by 62. Exponential growth makes long passwords very safe against brute force.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�a77f0e14e6fb�body��取复参数 $c$，从 $z_0=0$ 迭代 $z_{n+1}=z_n^2+c$。曼德博集由所有使轨道 $\{z_n\}$ 不趋于无穷的 $c$ 组成（等价地 $|z_n|$ 始终有界）。其边界具有无限精细的自相似结构，是复动力系统与混沌可视化的标志。�(For a complex parameter $c$, iterate $z_{n+1}=z_n^2+c$ from $z_0=0$. The Mandelbrot set consists of all $c$ for which the orbit $\{z_n\}$ stays bounded (does not escape to infinity). Its boundary has infinitely detailed self-similar structure, an icon of complex dynamics and chaos visualization.�ans��src��AMandelbrot《The Fractal Geometry of Nature》（W. H. Freeman）�9Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature, W. H. Freeman��id�a923f2f12e8e�body��#阿基米德是古希腊（公元前 3 世纪）的数学家与工程师，发现了浮力原理和杠杆原理，并近似计算出圆周率。他用“穷竭法”求面积和体积，是积分思想的先驱。传说他在浴缸中悟出浮力，惊呼“尤里卡”（我发现了）。�CArchimedes was a Greek mathematician and engineer of the 3rd century BCE who discovered the principle of buoyancy and the law of the lever and approximated pi. Using the method of exhaustion for areas and volumes, he anticipated integral calculus. Legend says he discovered buoyancy in a bath and cried Eureka (I found it).�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�a998273466e4�body��自相似指分形的局部在放大后与整体具有相同的形状结构。例如谢尔宾斯基三角形由三个自身一半大小的副本组成。严格自相似的分形其维数可由相似维公式 $d=\log N/\log(1/r)$ 直接计算（$N$ 为副本数，$r$ 为缩放比）。�Self-similarity means a fractal's local parts, when magnified, have the same shape as the whole—e.g. the Sierpinski triangle is made of three half-size copies of itself. For exactly self-similar fractals the dimension follows $d=\log N/\log(1/r)$ ($N$ copies, scale ratio $r$).�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�a9a4183a35ab�body���假设素数只有有限个 $p_1,\dots,p_n$，考虑 $N=p_1p_2\cdots p_n+1$。$N$ 不被任一 $p_i$ 整除，故 $N$ 有新的素因子或自身为素数，与假设矛盾，因此素数无穷多。��Suppose primes are finitely many $p_1,\dots,p_n$, and form $N=p_1p_2\cdots p_n+1$. None of the $p_i$ divides $N$, so $N$ has a new prime factor or is itself prime, contradicting finiteness; hence there are infinitely many primes.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《初等数论》�=American Mathematical Society (AMS), Elementary Number Theory��id�a9b130bdca25�body��\形如 2ᵖ−1 的素数叫梅森素数。若 2ⁿ−1 是素数则 n 必为素数；更重要的是，卢卡斯-莱默检验能以极快的速度判定这类数的素性，比通用检验快得多，特别适合大规模搜索。GIMPS 项目 2024 年 10 月发现的第 52 个梅森素数 2^136279841−1，创下了已知最大素数的纪录。�eA Mersenne prime is a prime of the form 2ᵖ−1. If 2ⁿ−1 is prime then n itself must be prime; crucially, the Lucas–Lehmer test decides primality of these numbers far faster than general tests, making large-scale searching feasible. The 52nd Mersenne prime, 2^136279841−1, found by GIMPS in October 2024, set the record for the largest known prime.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a9cf92283886�body�ٱ闪电、河流支流、雪花、蕨类叶片、肺部支气管和罗马花椰菜都呈现自相似的层级结构。它们不是严格数学分形，但尺度上高度相似。��Lightning, river tributaries, snowflakes, fern fronds, lung bronchi, and Romanesco broccoli show self-similar hierarchical structure. They are not exact mathematical fractals but resemble them across scales.�ans��src��AB. B. Mandelbrot《The Fractal Geometry of Nature》, Wiley, 1982�=B. B. Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature, Wiley, 1982��id�ad2fd8ebcad5�body��_等边三角形有 6 个对称操作：绕中心旋转 0°、120°、240° 三种，加上沿三条对称轴（每条轴过顶点和对边中点）的镜像翻折三种。把任意两个操作接连执行，结果仍是这 6 个之一，它们构成一个群，叫二面体群 D3。旋转和翻折合在一起，能完全刻画三角形的对称性。��An equilateral triangle has 6 symmetries: three rotations about its center by 0°, 120°, and 240°, plus three reflections across axes through a vertex and the midpoint of the opposite side. Composing any two of these always yields another of the six, and they form a group called the dihedral group D3. Together, rotations and reflections capture the triangle's symmetry completely.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（对称与群）�3What Is Mathematics? (Courant), symmetry and groups��id�adae9aa6f946�body�ٮ最小割告诉我们：只要存在一条把系统切断的薄弱链路集合，系统就会瘫痪。增加平行路径能提高最小割的容量，从而提升鲁棒性。٠The min-cut shows that a small set of links can disconnect the system. Adding parallel paths raises the min-cut capacity, improving robustness against failures.�ans��src��}Ahuja、Magnanti 与 Orlin《Network Flows》第 6 章,Cormen 等《Introduction to Algorithms》第 26 章亦有完整证明ـAhuja, Magnanti and Orlin, Network Flows, Chapter 6; also Cormen et al., Introduction to Algorithms, Chapter 26 for a full proof��id�addc1c331551�body�٦巴比伦人崇拜七大天体，定下一星期七天；他们的六十进制方便分割（60能被2、3、4、5、6整除），于是沿用到了分秒和角度。ٝBabylonians honored seven celestial bodies, giving the 7-day week; their base 60 divides neatly by 2,3,4,5,6, so it survived in minutes, seconds and degrees.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�ae81943ceff7�body���说谎者悖论是指像“这句话是假的”这样自相矛盾的话：如果它为真，则它为假；如果它为假，则它为真。它揭示了语言和逻辑系统中自我指涉可能带来的难题。��The liar paradox is a self-contradictory statement such as 'this sentence is false': if it is true then it is false, and if it is false then it is true. It reveals the difficulties that self-reference can create in language and logical systems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�aea10bc1a9ab�body���中心对称指图形绕一个中心点旋转 180 度后与原图完全重合。平行四边形、圆和正六边形都具有中心对称性。和轴对称不同，中心对称关注的是“绕点翻转”而非“沿轴折叠”。�Central symmetry means a figure coincides with itself after a 180-degree rotation about a central point. Parallelograms, circles, and regular hexagons are centrally symmetric. Unlike axial symmetry, it is about turning around a point rather than folding across a line.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�afcd48a2ac81�body�ٙ算筹用纵横两式的小棍摆出数字，靠位置表示个十百千，已是十进位值制。它比算盘更早，是当时先进的计算工具。��Counting rods laid small sticks in two alternating patterns, using position for units, tens, hundreds, a decimal place-value system. Predating the abacus, they were an advanced tool of their era.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�b050ef20c11d�body���百分位数把排序后的数据分成 100 等份，第 p 百分位数表示有 p% 的数据小于或等于它。例如第 90 百分位数意味着你比 90% 的人高（或成绩更好）。常见的“中位数”其实就是第 50 百分位数。�A percentile divides sorted data into 100 equal parts; the p-th percentile is the value below which p% of the data fall. For example, the 90th percentile means you are above 90% of people in height or score. The familiar median is simply the 50th percentile.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�b17fcf074ae8�body��M平均数对每个数据一视同仁，少数极高的收入会把它拉得很高，掩盖大多数人的水平。中位数只关心排序后正中间的值，对极端值不敏感，因此更稳健。所以公布收入、房价这类偏斜分布的数据时，往往同时报告两者；两者差距越大，说明分布越偏斜。�]The mean treats every value equally, so a few extremely high incomes drag it upward and mask what most people earn. The median depends only on the middle value after sorting and is insensitive to outliers—more robust. That is why skewed data such as income or housing prices usually report both; a wider gap between them signals stronger skewness.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�b273b1d19546�body�ِ多个弱模型在不同样本上训练，投票平均可抵消各自误差（降低方差），是统计集成与自助采样思想的体现。٥Many weak models trained on different samples vote or average, canceling individual errors (reducing variance). It reflects statistical ensemble and bootstrap ideas.�ans��src��ZEfron, B. 与 Hastie, T., 《计算机时代的统计推断》, Cambridge University Press�XEfron, B. & Hastie, T., 'Computer Age Statistical Inference', Cambridge University Press��id�b616a79a0afe�body�ٴ命题是可以判断真假的陈述句，例如“雪是白的”为真，“2 + 2 = 5”为假。命题逻辑研究命题之间如何通过“与”“或”“非”等连接。��A proposition is a declarative sentence that is either true or false, for example 'snow is white' is true and '2 + 2 = 5' is false. Propositional logic studies how propositions combine through connectives like 'and', 'or', and 'not'.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b728979b6c97�body��)电子电路最容易可靠地区分两种稳定状态（如高低电平），用二进制最抗干扰。一位 bit 有 2 个取值，n 位能表示 2ⁿ 种不同信息，文字、图片、声音都能编码成 0/1 串。香农同时证明，信息量本质上就是以比特为单位度量的。�EElectronic circuits most reliably distinguish two stable states (e.g., high and low voltage), so binary representation resists noise best. One bit has 2 values; n bits encode 2ⁿ distinct messages, and text, images, and sound all reduce to 0/1 strings. Shannon also showed that information is fundamentally measured in bits.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�b76c5b5491c5�body��纳什均衡是一组策略，使得在给定他人策略不变时，没有任何单个参与者能通过单方面改变自己的策略而获益。它是非合作博弈中最核心的稳定性概念，例如在囚徒困境中「都坦白」即为一纳什均衡。�A Nash equilibrium is a strategy profile where no player can benefit by unilaterally changing their own strategy given others' strategies are fixed. It is the central stability concept in noncooperative games; in the prisoner's dilemma both confess is a Nash equilibrium.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�b81da83ab3c2�body�ٝ比例表示两个比值相等的关系，如 a/b = c/d，常用于按相同倍数缩放数量。例如地图比例尺就是把实际距离按比例缩小。��A proportion states that two ratios are equal, such as a/b = c/d, and is often used to scale quantities by the same factor. For example, a map's scale shrinks real distances by a fixed proportion.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�b8d7b76b2e3e�body���从初值 $x_0$ 出发，按迭代 $x_{n+1}=x_n-\frac{f(x_n)}{f'(x_n)}$ 逐步逼近 $f(x)=0$ 的根。在根附近且导数不为零时，它具有二次收敛速度，但初值离根太远或导数接近零时可能发散。��Starting from $x_0$, iterate $x_{n+1}=x_n-\frac{f(x_n)}{f'(x_n)}$ to approach a root of $f(x)=0$. Near a simple root it converges quadratically, but it may diverge if the start is far or the derivative near zero.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�b8fbb380c3a9�body��0会，虽然慢得惊人。把项分成 1 + 1/2 + (1/3+1/4) + (1/5+…+1/8) + …，每一组都至少是 1/2，所以前 2^k 项之和至少是 1+k/2，可以超过任意大的数。调和级数发散是 14 世纪的奥雷姆证明的，它的缓慢发散也让“条件收敛”的概念变得重要。�HYes, though surprisingly slowly. Group the terms as 1 + 1/2 + (1/3+1/4) + (1/5+…+1/8) + …; each block is at least 1/2, so the sum of the first 2^k terms is at least 1+k/2, which passes any bound. Oresme proved this divergence in the 14th century, and the series' slowness makes the idea of conditional convergence important.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（无穷级数）�/What Is Mathematics? (Courant), infinite series��id�b9826da64d62�body�٩它在一行里把五个最基本的数（e、i、π、1、0）和加法、乘法、指数联系起来，把指数函数与三角函数统一为 e^{iθ}=cosθ+i sinθ。پIn one line it links five fundamental constants (e, i, π, 1, 0) with addition, multiplication and exponentiation, unifying exponential and trigonometric functions via e^{iθ}=cosθ+i sinθ.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�ba0b7835a521�body��凸优化是在凸集上极小化凸函数的问题。凸函数的任意局部极小也是全局极小：因连接任意两点的线段上的函数值不超过端点连线，故不存在欺骗性的局部谷底，梯度类与内点法都能可靠收敛到全局解。�8Convex optimization minimizes a convex function over a convex set. Any local minimum of a convex function is also global: the function value on the segment between two points lies below the chord, so there are no deceptive local valleys, and gradient or interior-point methods reliably reach the global solution.�ans��src��$《凸优化》Boyd 与 Vandenberghe�,Convex Optimization by Boyd and Vandenberghe��id�ba2778c0a87f�body�ٺ拓扑维数不靠坐标而靠邻域结构定义；有些分形集的整数维与外观不符，而佩亚诺曲线能用一条线填满二维方块，挑战‘线是一维’的直觉。��Topological dimension comes from neighborhood structure, not coordinates; some fractal sets have integer dimensions at odds with looks, and Peano curves fill a 2D square with one line, challenging 'a line is 1D'.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�bd33ffbf7646�body�٨人眼和相机把三维点沿视线投影到像平面，平行但不在视线方向的线会在无限远处汇聚到‘灭点’。这是射影几何的核心现象。��Eyes and cameras project 3D points along sight lines onto an image plane; parallels not along the sight direction converge to a 'vanishing point' at infinity. This is central to projective geometry.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�bf9694f01bba�body��给定 $n+1$ 个互异节点 $(x_i,y_i)$，拉格朗日插值多项式为 $P(x)=\sum_{i=0}^n y_i\ell_i(x)$，其中基函数 $\ell_i(x)=\prod_{j\neq i}\frac{x-x_j}{x_i-x_j}$。它在每个节点上满足 $P(x_i)=y_i$，且是次数不超过 $n$ 的唯一插值多项式。��Given $n+1$ distinct nodes $(x_i,y_i)$, the Lagrange interpolant is $P(x)=\sum_{i=0}^n y_i\ell_i(x)$ with basis $\ell_i(x)=\prod_{j\neq i}\frac{x-x_j}{x_i-x_j}$. It satisfies $P(x_i)=y_i$ and is the unique polynomial of degree at most $n$ doing so.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�c10fdba28240�body��"a 在模 m 下的逆元是满足 ax≡1 (mod m) 的数 x。它存在当且仅当 a 与 m 互素，即最大公约数为 1。例如模 7 下 3 的逆元是 5，因为 3×5=15≡1 (mod 7)。模逆元是解同余方程、设计密码系统的常用工具，求法用扩展欧几里得算法。�gThe inverse of a modulo m is a number x with ax≡1 (mod m). It exists if and only if a and m are coprime, i.e., their greatest common divisor is 1. For example, modulo 7 the inverse of 3 is 5, since 3×5=15≡1 (mod 7). Modular inverses are essential for solving congruences and building cryptographic systems, computed with the extended Euclidean algorithm.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c19903e10b74�body�٫二维码用了里德–所罗门等纠错码，把数据编码得能容忍一定比例的污损或遮挡而不丢失信息。这也是光盘划痕仍能读出的原理。٦QR codes use Reed–Solomon error-correcting codes so data survives a certain fraction of dirt or occlusion without loss. The same idea lets scratched CDs still play.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c25745f47a69�body�ٔ它把字母表整体平移固定位数（如A→D）。因为只有25种可能的位移，穷举或按字母频率分析都能迅速还原明文。ٞIt shifts the alphabet by a fixed amount (e.g., A→D). With only 25 possible shifts, brute force or letter-frequency analysis recovers the plaintext quickly.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�c55a6fc41d2f�body�ٮ在随机波动中总有一部分基金某年表现佳，若只宣传幸存者会误导。长期看多数主动基金跑不赢指数，这是统计与选择偏差的结果。��Random fluctuation always produces some funds that shine in a given year; advertising only survivors misleads. Long run, most active funds underperform the index, a result of statistics and selection bias.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c578f65bfff5�body��莱昂哈德·欧拉是 18 世纪瑞士数学家，著作数量和影响力都极其惊人。他系统化了微积分、图论和数论，并留下了著名的欧拉公式 e^{iπ}+1=0。今天许多数学符号（如 π、e、i、f(x)）都源自他的工作。�Leonhard Euler was an 18th-century Swiss mathematician of astonishing output and influence. He systematized calculus, graph theory, and number theory and gave the famous Euler formula e^{iπ}+1=0. Many symbols we use today (π, e, i, f(x)) come from his work.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�c59f9eece93b�body�ٷ可以。斐波那契查找用黄金比分割有序数组，每次按斐波那契数比例切分，避免二分查找的乘法，更适合某些硬件。这是数列的工程妙用。��Yes. Fibonacci search splits a sorted array by golden-ratio-like Fibonacci proportions, avoiding the multiplication of binary search and suiting some hardware. A neat engineering use of the sequence.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c61986a4b1cc�body��L群是“一个集合 + 一种运算”的代数结构，要满足四条规则：运算封闭、满足结合律、有单位元、每个元素有逆元。比如整数在加法下成群，单位元是 0。对称操作的集合也成群——先做哪个对称再哪个，顺序不同结果可能不同，但四个条件依然成立。�UA group is an algebraic structure: a set together with an operation obeying four rules — closure, associativity, an identity element, and an inverse for every element. The integers under addition form a group with identity 0. Sets of symmetry operations form groups too: order of composition may matter, but all four conditions still hold.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（变换与群）�:What Is Mathematics? (Courant), transformations and groups��id�c66317732a7b�body���若模数 $m_1,\dots,m_k$ 两两互素，则对任意余数 $a_i$，方程组 $x\equiv a_i\pmod{m_i}$ 在模 $M=m_1\cdots m_k$ 下有唯一解。它把大模数运算拆解为若干小模数，广泛用于 CRT 加速与秘密分享。��If the moduli $m_1,\dots,m_k$ are pairwise coprime, the system $x\equiv a_i\pmod{m_i}$ has a unique solution modulo $M=m_1\cdots m_k$ for any remainders $a_i$. It splits computations into smaller moduli, used in CRT speedups and secret sharing.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《初等数论》�=American Mathematical Society (AMS), Elementary Number Theory��id�c6d485d52f31�body�ٽ对每个人而言，无论对方怎么做，背叛都是占优策略；但各自的最优选择叠加后却得到帕累托更差的结局。它揭示个体理性与集体理性的冲突。ٻFor each person, defecting dominates regardless of the other's choice, yet the combination yields a Pareto-worse outcome. It shows the clash between individual and collective rationality.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�c7cdac329214�body���自相似指一个整体对象的局部在放大后与整体形状相同，常见于海岸线、山脉和某些数学曲线。它意味着图形在不同尺度上重复出现相同的结构。自相似是分形和许多自然形态的重要特征。�Self-similarity means a part of an object, when enlarged, has the same shape as the whole, seen in coastlines, mountains, and certain mathematical curves. It means the same structure repeats across scales. Self-similarity is a key feature of fractals and many natural forms.�ans��src��AB. B. Mandelbrot《The Fractal Geometry of Nature》, Wiley, 1982�=B. B. Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature, Wiley, 1982��id�c8758d3ced1e�body���一个结果若在不使任何人境况变差的前提下无法让任何参与者变得更好，便是帕累托最优（有效）。纳什均衡未必帕累托最优——囚徒困境的均衡就不是，而合作结果才是帕累托更优的。�An outcome is Pareto optimal (efficient) if no participant can be made better off without making someone else worse off. A Nash equilibrium need not be Pareto optimal—the prisoner's dilemma equilibrium is not, while the cooperative outcome is Pareto superior.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�c97e22f0ea84�body��Z约定 i²=−1 并不产生矛盾，而是把数系从实数扩充到复数 z=a+bi，加减乘除都定义齐全。复数给了方程 x²+1=0 以根，更关键的是把旋转几何化——乘以 i 就是逆时针旋转 90°。傅里叶变换、交流电路和量子力学都离不开复数，量子态的叠加本质上就是复系数组合。��Postulating i²=−1 causes no contradiction; it extends the real numbers to the complex numbers z=a+bi with full arithmetic. Complex numbers give x²+1=0 a root and, crucially, encode rotation geometrically—multiplying by i rotates by 90° counterclockwise. Fourier transforms, AC circuits, and quantum mechanics all depend on them; superposition of quantum states is literally complex-linear combination.�ans��src��,《什么是数学》(柯朗)（复数章）�:What Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on complex numbers��id�c9f4b381b0d4�body��S因为拓扑学研究的是“能揉捏、拉伸却不断裂、不粘连”之后仍然不变的性质。甜甜圈有一个洞，咖啡杯的把手也是一个洞；只要变形得足够温柔，一个就能变成另一个。而甜甜圈变不成没有洞的苹果。一个物体有多少个“洞”，是拓扑学最核心的量之一。�DTopology studies properties that survive gentle stretching and bending without tearing or gluing. A donut has one hole and a cup's handle makes one hole, so with patient deformation one becomes the other. A donut can never become a solid apple, which has no hole. Counting holes is one of the central invariants of topology.�ans��src��,《什么是数学》(柯朗)（拓扑章）�(What Is Mathematics? (Courant), topology��id�cb4455b181af�body�َ它猜想：每个大于2的偶数都可写成两个素数之和，如 8=3+5。已被计算机验证到极大范围，但仍无一般证明。ٝIt conjectures every even number greater than 2 is the sum of two primes, e.g. 8=3+5. Verified by computers to enormous ranges, yet still unproven generally.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�cb5632ae8681�body��由贝叶斯公式 $P(\theta\mid D)=\frac{P(D\mid\theta)P(\theta)}{P(D)}$，先验 $P(\theta)$ 与似然 $P(D\mid\theta)$ 结合得到后验 $P(\theta\mid D)$。后验随数据更新，可作为进一步推断与决策的基础；分母 $P(D)$ 仅作归一化常数。�"By Bayes' rule $P(\theta\mid D)=\frac{P(D\mid\theta)P(\theta)}{P(D)}$, the prior $P(\theta)$ and likelihood $P(D\mid\theta)$ combine into the posterior $P(\theta\mid D)$. The posterior updates with data and underlies further inference and decisions; $P(D)$ is merely a normalizing constant.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数理统计》�<American Mathematical Society (AMS), Mathematical Statistics��id�cbbb92194632�body�ٷ随机抽样是从总体中按随机方式抽取样本，使每个个体有同等机会被选中。它能减少偏差，使样本更能代表总体，是统计调查的基础方法。��Random sampling is selecting individuals from a population by chance so that every member has an equal chance of being chosen. It reduces bias and makes the sample more representative of the whole, forming the basis of statistical surveys.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�cc5b50dcf0dd�body�ٛ不断去掉等边三角形中心的小倒三角，留下三个自相似子三角形。其豪斯多夫维数为log3/log2≈1.585，介于线与面之间。٨Repeatedly remove the central upside-down triangle, leaving three self-similar subtriangles. Its Hausdorff dimension is log3/log2≈1.585, between a line and a surface.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�cd54eafdb0d5�body�ٴ每步把线段中间三分之一换成凸起的小三角，周长变为原来的4/3倍，无限迭代后周长发散；但每次新增面积递减，总面积收敛到有限值。��Each step replaces the middle third of every segment with a bump, making perimeter 4/3 times longer; after infinitely many steps the perimeter diverges, while added areas shrink so total area converges.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�cddc801306a5�body���希尔伯特设想一个有可数无限个房间且全满的旅馆；新来一位客人时，让1号去2号、2号去3号……腾出1号。这说明无限集合很反直觉：一部分能和集合本身一样大。��Hilbert imagined a fully occupied hotel with countably infinite rooms; a new guest is housed by moving room n to n+1, freeing room 1. It shows infinite sets are counterintuitive: a part can be as large as the whole.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�cfb27edd03ce�body�٫在高维中，单位体积里的大部分‘质量’都靠近边界，两点间距离趋于彼此接近，使聚类、采样和最近邻都失效或需要海量样本。��In high dimensions most of a unit volume's mass sits near the boundary and pairwise distances become nearly equal, breaking clustering, sampling and nearest-neighbor methods without huge data.�ans��src��SGoodfellow, I., Bengio, Y. & Courville, A.，《Deep Learning》，MIT Press，2016�JGoodfellow, I., Bengio, Y. & Courville, A., Deep Learning, MIT Press, 2016��id�cffbb35541ee�body��q建模分几步：先做假设、挑出关键量，比如易感人数、传染率；再把它们的关系写成方程，比如差分或微分方程；然后求解、用真实数据校验，最后根据结果修正模型。模型永远是对现实的简化，它的价值在于“预测与比较”，而建立模型的每一步都建立在严谨的数学推理之上。��Modeling proceeds in stages: make assumptions and identify key quantities such as susceptible individuals and infection rate; write their relations as equations, e.g., difference or differential equations; solve them, validate against real data, then refine. A model is always a simplification of reality; its value lies in prediction and comparison, and each step rests on rigorous mathematical reasoning.�ans��src��4NCTM（美国数学教师理事会，数学建模）�INCTM (National Council of Teachers of Mathematics), mathematical modeling��id�d042ade458ef�body���每一步把线段中间三分之一外凸成小三角，周长每次乘4/3不断变长，趋于无穷；而新增面积几何级数收敛，总面积有上限。它是分形的经典例子。��Each step replaces a third of every segment with a bump, multiplying perimeter by 4/3 toward infinity, while added area forms a convergent geometric series with a finite limit. A classic fractal.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�d25e26e4693b�body��6每次抛掷独立且各有 1/2 概率，但大数定律说的是“比例”趋稳，不是“次数”扯平：抛 1 万次里正面比例通常离 0.5 很近，而偏差的绝对值反而可能更大。这个定律保证长期统计的稳定性，是保险公司和赌场“稳赚不赔”的数学依据。�WEach toss is independent with a 1/2 chance, but the law of large numbers stabilizes the proportion, not the count: over 10,000 tosses the head proportion is typically very close to 0.5, even while the absolute deviation can grow. This stability of long-run averages is the mathematics behind why insurers and casinos can count on the long run.�ans��src��LGrinstead, C. M. 与 Snell, J. L., 《概率导论》, 美国数学会 (AMS)�]Grinstead, C. M. & Snell, J. L., 'Introduction to Probability', American Mathematical Society��id�d2843668e7ef�body��;四色定理称任何平面图可用四种颜色给区域着色使相邻区域不同色。阿佩尔与哈肯 1976 年的证明把问题归约为近 2000 个可约构型并交由计算机穷举验证，因人类无法逐行核对全部计算而引发「何为证明」的哲学争论，直至后来被独立重现。�_The four-color theorem asserts any planar map can be colored with four colors so adjacent regions differ. Appel and Haken's 1976 proof reduced the problem to about 2000 reducible configurations verified by computer, sparking debate over what counts as proof since humans could not check every computation by hand, until later independently reproduced.�ans��src��《图论》Diestel� Graph Theory by Reinhard Diestel��id�d4695c2d3e64�body�٨这类魔术多用强迫选牌、预先叠放和错位收牌等手法，配合观众注意力的转移。数学上靠排列组合的确定性，而非真的变出牌。ٹSuch tricks rely on force selections, pre-stacked orders and false shuffles plus misdirection. Mathematically they use the determinism of permutations, not real multiplication of cards.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d4ec6491dd19�body��!会的，但永远不会断。素数定理说，不超过 x 的质数个数 π(x) 约等于 x/ln(x)：质数在 1 到 100 里有 25 个，而在 100 万以内只占约 7.8%。比例越来越小，但质数依然无穷无尽——两个事实同时为真，这正是数论的奇妙之处。�PYes, they thin out, but they never stop. The prime number theorem says the count π(x) of primes up to x is approximately x/ln(x): there are 25 primes below 100, but within a million they make up only about 7.8%. The share shrinks while the primes still go on forever — both facts hold at once, which is part of number theory's charm.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d58a55435af0�body��n度量空间把“距离”抽象成一个满足四条公理的函数：非负性、零距离当且仅当两点相同、对称性、三角不等式。欧氏平面当然是例子，但还有出租车度量、离散度量以及函数空间等。许多分析定理只依赖这四条性质，所以可以在度量空间中统一地证明，这正是它的威力所在。��A metric space abstracts “distance” into a function satisfying four axioms: non-negativity, zero if and only if the points coincide, symmetry, and the triangle inequality. The Euclidean plane is one example, but so are the taxicab metric, the discrete metric, and function spaces. Since many analytic theorems rely only on these four axioms, they can be proved uniformly in metric spaces—that is the source of its power.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d657fd417ccb�body��/卡尔·弗里德里希·高斯是 19 世纪德国数学家，在数论、统计学、天文学和电磁学等领域都有奠基性贡献。他年仅 19 岁就证明了二次互反律并构造了正十七边形尺规作图。其著作严谨深刻，被誉为数学史上影响力最大的人物之一。�hCarl Friedrich Gauss was a 19th-century German mathematician who made foundational contributions to number theory, statistics, astronomy, and electromagnetism. At 19 he proved the law of quadratic reciprocity and constructed the regular 17-gon by straightedge and compass. Renowned for rigor and depth, he is among the most influential figures in math history.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�d6cbfb6de522�body��离群值是明显偏离其余数据的数据点，可能来自测量错误、罕见事件或真实但极端的情形。它会影响平均数和标准差，却对中位数影响较小。处理时要先判断其来源，再决定保留、修正还是剔除。�+An outlier is a data point that lies markedly far from the rest, possibly from measurement error, a rare event, or a genuine but extreme case. It strongly affects the mean and standard deviation but hardly the median. One should first judge its source before deciding to keep, correct, or remove it.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�d75e17b8a371�body�ه正好凑到300元时，实付250元，相当于约八三折。但如果为了凑单多买了不需要的东西，实际并不省钱。يAt exactly 300 yuan you pay 250, about an 83% (8.3-fold) discount. But buying extras just to qualify often means you do not actually save.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�d7795b1ff1cc�body�ٮ当个体判断独立且误差各异时，平均能抵消误差（准）；若大家互相模仿或受权威引导，就会集体犯错（荒唐）。关键在于独立性。��When individual judgments are independent with varied errors, averaging cancels them out (wise); if people imitate each other or follow authority, the crowd errs together (foolish). Independence is the key.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d882561b44cb�body��今天通用的 0、1、2…9 其实起源于印度，经阿拉伯学者翻译和传播后传入欧洲，因此欧洲人称之为“阿拉伯数字”。它采用位值制和零符号，极大简化了计算和记录。这一体系取代罗马数字成为现代世界的标准。�BThe 0,1,2...9 we use today actually originated in India and reached Europe through Arab scholars who translated and spread them, so Europeans called them Arabic numerals. Using place value and a zero symbol, they greatly simplified calculation and record-keeping. This system replaced Roman numerals as the world standard.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�d98488db29b5�body���95% 置信区间的含义是：在重复抽样下，这样构造的区间约有 95% 会覆盖真实参数；它并非「参数有 95% 概率落在此区间内」。参数本身是固定常数，区间才是随机的，这是最常见的误解。�A 95% confidence interval means that under repeated sampling about 95% of such intervals would cover the true parameter; it is not that the parameter has a 95% probability of lying in this interval. The parameter is fixed and the interval is random—a common misinterpretation.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数理统计》�<American Mathematical Society (AMS), Mathematical Statistics��id�dae41565340b�body�ٮ双方都不退让会两败俱伤，但一方退让另一方就全胜；存在两个不对称纳什均衡。它解释了军备竞赛与对峙中‘谁先眨眼’的张力。٪If neither yields, both lose; if one yields, the other wins—with two asymmetric Nash equilibria. It explains brinkmanship in arms races and standoffs: who blinks first.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�db540ea35930�body�٧他写的《还原与对消》提出al-jabr（还原）思想，书名演化为algebra（代数），系统求解一次与二次方程，把解题变成通用方法。٤His book on restoration and balancing introduced al-jabr, the root of the word algebra, and systematically solved linear and quadratic equations as general methods.�ans��src��花拉子米《代数学》�al-Kitab al-mukhtasar��id�db7578052340�body�١把一个数奇数位数字之和减去偶数位数字之和，若差是11的倍数（含0），原数就能被11整除。它来自10≡−1 (mod 11)的性质。��Subtract the sum of digits in even positions from the sum in odd positions; if the difference is a multiple of 11 (including 0), the number is divisible by 11. It follows from 10≡−1 (mod 11).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�dc20d3cc1183�body��X问题要求：不重复地走过七座桥，一次回到起点。欧拉 1736 年把它抽象成“图”：陆地是顶点，桥是边。他证明，要一笔走完所有边且回到起点，必须每个顶点都有偶数条边与之相连；而柯尼斯堡四块陆地连接的桥数分别是 3、3、3、5，全是奇数，所以不可能。�eThe task was to cross all seven bridges exactly once and return to the start. In 1736 Euler abstracted it into a graph: land masses as vertices, bridges as edges. He proved that to traverse every edge once and return, every vertex must have even degree — while Königsberg's four land masses had bridge counts of 3, 3, 3, and 5, all odd. Hence impossible.�ans��src��A《什么是数学》(柯朗)（拓扑章：柯尼斯堡七桥）�>What Is Mathematics? (Courant), topology (Königsberg bridges)��id�dc8113a00ea5�body�٥模n把数按除以n的余数分类，超过n就绕回，正如12点之后回到1点。它把无限整数压缩成有限个剩余类，便于处理周期与整除。��Modulo n groups numbers by remainder after division by n, wrapping around like a clock past 12. It compresses the integers into finitely many residue classes, handy for cycles and divisibility.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�de27911bcf5d�body�ٽ他用自己发明的微积分和万有引力定律，把开普勒椭圆轨道解释为受中心力作用的微分方程解，从而把天上与地上的运动统一在同一数学之下。��He used his calculus and the law of gravitation to derive Kepler's elliptical orbits as solutions of central-force differential equations, unifying celestial and terrestrial motion under one mathematics.�ans��src��E牛顿《自然哲学的数学原理》（Principia）第一卷, 1687�HIsaac Newton, Philosophiæ Naturalis Principia Mathematica, Book I, 1687��id�e129ceb8e18e�body��H泊松分布描述相互独立的稀有事件在固定时间（或空间）内发生的次数，例如每小时打进客服的电话数、放射性衰变的计数。若平均发生 λ 次，则 P(X=k)=λᵏe^(−λ)/k!，且它的期望和方差都等于 λ。当二项分布的 n 很大、p 很小时，它也常作为近似。�9The Poisson distribution counts independent rare events in a fixed interval of time or space—such as calls per hour to a service center or radioactive decay counts. With mean λ, P(X=k)=λᵏe^(−λ)/k!, and both its mean and variance equal λ. It also approximates the binomial when n is large and p is small.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�e25095fb1991�body���埃拉托斯特尼筛法是一种找出一定范围内所有质数的古老算法：从小到大依次划去每个质数的倍数，剩下的就是质数。它简单高效，适合教学和小范围筛选。��The Sieve of Eratosthenes is an ancient algorithm for finding all primes up to a limit: repeatedly cross out the multiples of each prime in order, and what remains are primes. It is simple and efficient for teaching and small ranges.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�e3031184eb1f�body�٤布尔代数是研究真（1）与假（0）以及“与”“或”“非”运算的代数系统。它是数字电路和计算机逻辑门设计的数学基础。��Boolean algebra is the algebraic system dealing with true (1) and false (0) together with the operations 'and', 'or', and 'not'. It is the mathematical foundation of digital circuits and computer logic gates.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e3ff013466d6�body���盈不足是《九章算术》一章，先假设两个数值代入，根据多余（盈）与欠缺（不足）的比例反推真值，相当于线性插值法，能解许多难以整除的应用题。��A chapter of the Nine Chapters, it assumes two trial values and uses the excess and deficit to interpolate the true answer, effectively linear interpolation for problems hard to solve by direct division.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�e40c9c63d062�body�ٷ用大量随机撒点，落在目标区域内的比例乘以总面积约等于积分值，样本越多越准。它把确定性问题转为概率估计，适合高维与复杂形状。��By scattering many random points, the fraction landing inside a region times the total area approximates the integral, more accurate with more samples. It turns a deterministic problem into a probabilistic estimate, great for high dimensions.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�e4ae21df3af0�body�٨克莱因瓶没有内外之分、只有一个面，但在三维空间里没法不自我相交地实现，只能‘穿过去’画出来；在四维中可无交实现。��A Klein bottle has no inside/outside and a single surface, but in 3D it cannot be realized without self-intersection, so drawings show it passing through itself; in 4D it can be done without crossing.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�e52d471f70f9�body��黄金分割比 φ≈1.618，定义为把一条线段分成两部分，使整体与长段之比等于长段与短段之比。它出现在五角星、贝壳螺旋和许多建筑比例中。许多人觉得含 φ 的比例和谐悦目，但它“无处不在”的说法常被夸大。�#The golden ratio φ≈1.618 is defined by dividing a segment so the whole-to-long part equals the long-to-short part. It appears in pentagrams, shell spirals, and many architectural proportions. Many find φ-based ratios harmonious, though claims that it is everywhere are often exaggerated.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�e704bf4a7a66�body��B这不是悖论，而是概率直觉的反差。先算反面：所有人都不相同。第 2 人避开第 1 人的概率是 364/365，第 3 人避开前两人的概率是 363/365，依此类推，23 个人乘起来的积约 0.49，所以“至少两人相同”约 51%。人数越多越逼近 1，60 人时已超过 99%。�QThis is not a paradox but a clash with intuition. Compute the complement: all birthdays distinct. Person 2 avoids person 1 with probability 364/365, person 3 avoids the first two with 363/365, and so on; the product over 23 people is about 0.49, so a match has probability roughly 51%. It climbs toward 1 quickly—over 99% by 60 people.�ans��src��LGrinstead, C. M. 与 Snell, J. L., 《概率导论》, 美国数学会 (AMS)�]Grinstead, C. M. & Snell, J. L., 'Introduction to Probability', American Mathematical Society��id�e773fa9424ae�body�٫它利用透视把三根直角的杆在图上首尾相接成三角，但这是视觉错位的把戏。在真实三维空间里，这种同时正交的连接无法存在。ٳIt uses perspective to join three right-angled bars into a triangle on paper, but that is a visual trick. In real 3D space such simultaneously orthogonal connections cannot exist.�ans��src�ٙPENROSE, PENROSE,《IMPOSSIBLE OBJECTS: A SPECIAL TYPE OF VISUAL ILLUSION》,British Journal of Psychology,1958 (DOI: 10.1111/j.2044-8295.1958.tb00634.x)ٗPENROSE, PENROSE, 'IMPOSSIBLE OBJECTS: A SPECIAL TYPE OF VISUAL ILLUSION', British Journal of Psychology, 1958, DOI: 10.1111/j.2044-8295.1958.tb00634.x��id�e8133a500eff�body�٨密码的熵随可能字符数与长度指数增长：n 个字符、长度 L，则约 n^L 种组合。长度翻倍比加几种字符更能提升抗暴力破解能力。ٴA password's entropy grows exponentially with character set size and length: roughly n^L combinations. Doubling length beats adding a few character types for resisting brute force.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�e8468a907118�body���刘维尔定理指出：在整个复平面上解析且有界的函数必为常数。据此可简洁证明代数基本定理——非常数多项式必有根，因为任何无根的多项式倒数将是整且有界。�Liouville's theorem states that a function entire and bounded on the whole plane must be constant. It yields a neat proof of the fundamental theorem of algebra: a nonconstant polynomial must have a root, since otherwise its reciprocal would be entire and bounded.�ans��src��IStein 与 Shakarchi《Complex Analysis》（Princeton University Press）�AStein and Shakarchi, Complex Analysis, Princeton University Press��id�e8c525772313�body�ٮ朝鲜数学主要受中国《算学启蒙》《杨辉算法》影响，并发展出本国算书如《九一集》，重视实用算术与算板训练，注重教育普及。��Korean mathematics absorbed Chinese works like the Mathematical Primer and Yang Hui's methods, producing native texts such as the Gu-il-jip, emphasizing practical arithmetic, calculating boards, and educational spread.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e9c12f26df7d�body�٫向外的箭头让人联想到远的角，向内的箭头像近的角，大脑按深度经验补偿长度。其实两线等长，只是箭头朝向触发了距离误判。ٰOutward arrows suggest a receding corner, inward arrows a near corner, so the brain compensates for depth. The lines are equal; arrow direction triggers a distance misjudgment.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ed978a6e311a�body���在给定模型下，选择使观测数据出现概率（似然）最大的参数值作为参数估计，即求解 $\hat\theta=\arg\max_\theta L(\theta;D)$。它直观、渐近有效，且在多数正则条件下具有相合性与渐近正态性。�Under a given model, choose the parameter value that maximizes the probability (likelihood) of the observed data, i.e. $\hat\theta=\arg\max_\theta L(\theta;D)$. It is intuitive, asymptotically efficient, and under regularity conditions is consistent and asymptotically normal.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数理统计》�<American Mathematical Society (AMS), Mathematical Statistics��id�f09da1aaf3b0�body�ٮ指定某10次序列的概率是(1/2)^10约千分之一，极罕见；但抛很多次后，几乎必然会出现某一段10连。这是指定事件与存在事件的区别。��A specified 10-toss sequence has probability about 1/1024, very rare; but after many tosses some 10-streak is almost certain to appear. That is the difference between a specified and an existing event.�ans��src��>W. Feller《概率论导论及其应用》第1卷, Wiley, 1950�ZW. Feller, An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications, Vol. 1, Wiley, 1950��id�f8c499328377�body��18 世纪柯尼斯堡有七座桥横跨两条河的分支，居民好奇能否不重复地走遍每座桥。欧拉把陆地抽象为点、桥抽象为线，证明这样的走法不可能，从而开创了图论。这是把现实问题转化为数学结构分析的经典范例。�UIn the 18th century Königsberg had seven bridges over branches of a river, and townsfolk wondered if one could cross each bridge exactly once. Euler abstracted land as points and bridges as lines, proved it impossible, and thereby founded graph theory. It is a classic example of turning a real problem into mathematical structure analysis.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�f970d57668f6�body�ٙ如果整数 a 能被整数 b 整除（没有余数），那么 b 是 a 的因数，a 是 b 的倍数。例如 3 是 12 的因数，12 是 3 的倍数。ٶIf integer a is divisible by integer b with no remainder, then b is a factor (or divisor) of a, and a is a multiple of b. For example, 3 is a factor of 12, and 12 is a multiple of 3.�ans��src��ABeckmann, S., 《中小学数学教师数学》(第4版), Pearson�FBeckmann, S., 'Mathematics for Elementary Teachers' (4th ed.), Pearson��id�f97a9b73470e�body��h欧几里得在《几何原本》里首创这种方法：先列出少数不加证明的出发点——公设与公理，再只凭逻辑规则一步步推出所有定理。它的威力在于，只要前提被接受，结论就完全确定，不需要依赖实验或直觉。现代数学的每个分支都按这套方式组织，包括实数系统与概率论。��Euclid pioneered it in the Elements: state a few unproved starting points — postulates and axioms — then derive every theorem by logical rules alone. Its power is that once the premises are accepted, the conclusions are fully determined, with no appeal to experiment or intuition. Every modern branch of mathematics, including the real numbers and probability, is organized this way.�ans��src��;《什么是数学》(柯朗)（数学的哲学与方法）�DWhat Is Mathematics? (Courant), philosophy and method of mathematics��id�f9c13cad4550�body�ٛ不一定。在球面（正曲率）上内角和大于180度；在双曲面（负曲率）上小于180度。 Euclid 的平行公设在这里被替换了。٪Not necessarily. On a sphere (positive curvature) it exceeds 180°; on a hyperbolic surface (negative curvature) it is less. Euclid's parallel postulate is replaced here.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�f9f49544d811�body�ٞ电路只有开和关两种稳定状态，正好对应0和1，用二进制做逻辑与运算最简单可靠。显示时再转换回我们熟悉的十进制。ٯCircuits have two stable states, on and off, mapping naturally to 0 and 1, making binary logic simplest and most reliable. The result is converted back to decimal for display.�ans��src�ْLeibniz, G. W.《Explication de l'Arithmétique Binaire》(论只用0与1的二进制算术),1703;及与白晋(Joachim Bouvet)1701—1703年通信�wG. W. Leibniz, 'Explication de l'Arithmétique Binaire' (1703); with the 1701–1703 correspondence with Joachim Bouvet��id�f9f4aeeecac4�body�ٸ完全数是等于自身所有真因子之和的数，如 6=1+2+3、28=1+2+4+7+14。欧几里得发现：当 2^p−1 是素数（梅森素数）时，2^(p−1)(2^p−1) 是完全数。ٮA perfect number equals the sum of its proper divisors, e.g. 6=1+2+3, 28=1+2+4+7+14. Euclid showed 2^(p−1)(2^p−1) is perfect whenever 2^p−1 is prime (a Mersenne prime).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�fb7990b4fb7f�body���测地线是曲面上局部长度最短的曲线，等价于「直线」的推广。球面上的测地线是大圆（过球心的平面与球面的交线）的弧段，因此地球上两点间的最短航线沿大圆而非恒定经线。�WA geodesic is a curve on a surface that is locally length-minimizing, generalizing the notion of a straight line. On a sphere the geodesics are arcs of great circles (intersections of the sphere with planes through its center), so the shortest flight between two points on Earth follows a great circle rather than a line of constant longitude.�ans��src��《微分几何》do Carmo�8Differential Geometry of Curves and Surfaces by do Carmo��id�fbd7443d73c2�body��D因为每个囚徒都担心对方背叛：如果对方沉默，自己背叛能减刑；如果对方背叛，自己背叛能少受罚。无论对方怎么选，背叛都是对自己更好的选择，于是双方都背叛。这种“谁也不愿单方面改变”的状态就叫纳什均衡，即使它并不对整体最优。�\Each prisoner fears the other's betrayal: if the other stays silent, defecting shortens one's own sentence, and if the other defects, defecting limits the damage. Whatever the other does, defection looks better, so both defect. This outcome, where nobody wants to change alone, is a Nash equilibrium — even though it is not optimal for the group.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�fbdbc03f47ba�body��$平面图是能画在平面上且边不相交的图。库拉托夫斯基定理给出判定：一个图是平面图当且仅当它不含与 $K_5$（五顶点完全图）或 $K_{3,3}$（完全二分图）同胚（即细分）的子图，从而把拓扑可平面性转化为组合禁止子式。�dA planar graph can be drawn on the plane with no crossing edges. Kuratowski's theorem characterizes this: a graph is planar iff it contains no subgraph homeomorphic (a subdivision) of $K_5$ (the complete graph on five vertices) or $K_{3,3}$ (the complete bipartite graph), turning topological planarity into a combinatorial forbidden-subdivision condition.�ans��src��《图论》Diestel� Graph Theory by Reinhard Diestel��id�fc213a2185c8�body�٫植物按相似规则在不同尺度重复分叉，以最小材料获取最多光照与空间，形成自相似结构。这种递归生长正是分形的生物学体现。ٺPlants repeat similar branching rules at different scales to capture light and space with minimal material, forming self-similar structures. This recursive growth is fractals in biology.�ans��src��AB. B. Mandelbrot《The Fractal Geometry of Nature》, Wiley, 1982�=B. B. Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature, Wiley, 1982��id�fce0626c6df9�body�ٜ关键是让直线超出九点的正方形边界。把线画到外面再折回，就能用四条线一笔连完，它常用来说明要打破思维框框。ٵThe trick is to let the lines extend beyond the implied square of dots. Going outside and back lets you cover all nine with four lines, a classic lesson in thinking outside the box.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�fed220fadb37�body�٧算盘每根杆代表一个数位，靠拨珠表示0到9，数位向左延伸就能表示任意大的整数。小数则约定某根杆为小数点位，规则相同。٩Each rod is a place value with beads for 0–9, so moving left extends to arbitrarily large integers. Decimals just fix one rod as the decimal point with the same rules.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�math_19_002�body���把直线代入抛物线得到 x²=0,x=0 处出现二重根。代数几何里交点重数定义为局部环对理想商的维数:k[x,y]/(y-x²,y) ≅ k[x]/(x²),作为 k-向量空间是 2 维,故重数为 2。�␀Substituting the line into the parabola gives x²=0, a double root at x=0. In algebraic geometry the multiplicity is the dimension of the local quotient by the ideal: k[x,y]/(y-x²,y) ≅ k[x]/(x²), which is 2-dimensional over k, so the multiplicity is 2.�ans��src��wKaren Smith 等《An Invitation to Algebraic Geometry》(Birkhäuser,1968)中关于相交重数与维数的相关章节كKaren E. Smith et al., An Invitation to Algebraic Geometry (Birkhäuser, 1968), chapters on intersection multiplicity and dimension��id�math_19_005�body��D无论对方选什么,单个参与者背叛的收益都严格更高,故(背叛,背叛)是唯一均衡;但双方合作收益更大,均衡帕累托劣于合作结果。当博弈无限次重复且参与人有足够耐心时,无名氏定理表明通过以牙还牙等触发策略,合作可成为子博弈精炼均衡的结果。��Each player's payoff is strictly higher by defecting regardless of the opponent's action, so (defect, defect) is the unique equilibrium, yet both players would be better off cooperating — the equilibrium is Pareto dominated. When the game repeats indefinitely and players are sufficiently patient, the folk theorem shows cooperation can be sustained as a subgame-perfect outcome via trigger strategies such as tit-for-tat.�ans��src�ٖFudenberg 与 Maskin 1986 年 Econometrica 论文“The Folk Theorem in Repeated Games with Discounting”,以及 Myerson《Game Theory》相关章节ٞFudenberg and Maskin, "The Folk Theorem in Repeated Games with Discounting", Econometrica 54 (1986); see also Myerson, Game Theory, on equilibrium refinements��id�math_19_008�body��\强大数定律给出几乎必然层面的定性结论:(S_n−nμ)/n → 0;中心极限定理进一步定量刻画波动规模:S_n 围绕均值的涨落按 σ√n 的尺度增长,且 √n(S̄_n−μ) 依分布趋于 N(0,σ²)。前者只说偏差消失,后者给出偏差的分布形状,是对涨落的一阶精确逼近,两者互补而非蕴含。��The strong law gives a qualitative almost-sure statement: (S_n−nμ)/n → 0. The central limit theorem quantifies the fluctuation scale: √n(S̄_n−μ) converges in distribution to a normal law. The former only says deviations vanish; the latter pins down their distributional shape, providing first-order accurate approximation of fluctuations — complementary results, neither implying the other.�ans��src��`Durrett《Probability: Theory and Examples》第 2 章大数定律与第 3 章中心极限定理�VRick Durrett, Probability: Theory and Examples, Chapter 2 on SLLN and Chapter 3 on CLT��id�math_19_012�body��显式欧拉法是一阶方法，整体截断误差大致与步长成正比，步长减半误差约减半，但所需的函数求值次数随之翻倍。收敛阶只刻画误差随步长的渐近速率，实际代价还取决于每步开销、稳定性约束和问题的刚性程度。�IExplicit Euler is first-order: its global truncation error is roughly proportional to the step size, so halving h halves the error but doubles the number of function evaluations. Convergence order only describes asymptotic accuracy versus step size; real cost also depends on per-step work, stability restrictions, and stiffness.�ans��src�قHairer, E., Nørsett, S. P., & Wanner, G. (2005). Solving Ordinary Differential Equations I: Nonstiff Problems (2nd ed.). SpringerقHairer, E., Nørsett, S. P., & Wanner, G. (2005). Solving Ordinary Differential Equations I: Nonstiff Problems (2nd ed.). Springer��id�math_19_015�body��,诺特定理指出，若拉格朗日量在某个连续变换下不变，则由该变换生成的量沿运动方程守恒。例如拉格朗日量不显含时间对应能量守恒，不显含某个广义坐标（平移对称）则对应的广义动量守恒，这正是动量守恒的对称性根源。��Noether's theorem states that if the Lagrangian is invariant under a continuous transformation, then the quantity generated by that transformation is conserved along the equations of motion. For instance, a Lagrangian with no explicit time dependence yields energy conservation; independence from a generalized coordinate (translation symmetry) conserves the conjugate momentum—the symmetry origin of momentum conservation.�ans��src�٣Noether, E. (1918). Invariante Variationsprobleme. Nachrichten von der Gesellschaft der Wissenschaften zu Göttingen, Mathematisch-Physikalische Klasse, 235–257.٣Noether, E. (1918). Invariante Variationsprobleme. Nachrichten von der Gesellschaft der Wissenschaften zu Göttingen, Mathematisch-Physikalische Klasse, 235–257.��id�math_19_018�body��D仿射簇是仿射空间中一组多项式公共零点构成的集合。希尔伯特零点定理建立了反变的双向对应：簇对应其消去理想的根理想，而代数闭域上每个根理想都恰是某簇的理想；于是关于零点集的几何问题原则上都可化为交换代数中理想的运算问题。��An affine variety is the set of common zeros of a collection of polynomials in affine space. Hilbert's Nullstellensatz sets up an antitone correspondence: a variety corresponds to the radical ideal of polynomials vanishing on it, and every radical ideal over an algebraically closed field arises this way—so geometric questions about zero sets translate, in principle, into ideal computations in commutative algebra.�ans��src��fFulton, W. (1969). Algebraic Curves: An Introduction to Algebraic Geometry. W. A. Benjamin, Chapter 1.�fFulton, W. (1969). Algebraic Curves: An Introduction to Algebraic Geometry. W. A. Benjamin, Chapter 1.��id�math_19_020�body��s机器浮点数的有效位数固定，两个相近数相减后高位信息互相抵消，结果中相对误差被急剧放大，这称为灾难性抵消。Kahan 补偿求和用一个额外的变量记录每步被舍入丢掉的低位残差并在下一步加回，使 n 个数求和的误差从 O(n·u) 降到与 n 无关的 O(u)，显著改善长序列累加的精度。��Floating-point numbers have fixed precision, so subtracting nearly equal quantities cancels leading digits and amplifies relative error dramatically—catastrophic cancellation. Kahan's compensated summation keeps an extra variable holding the low-order bits lost to rounding each step and adds them back next round, reducing the error of summing n numbers from O(n·u) to a constant O(u), greatly improving long accumulations.�ans��src��BBurden 与 Faires,《Numerical Analysis》第9版,Brooks/Cole,2011�KR. L. Burden & J. D. Faires, Numerical Analysis, 9th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2011��id�math_20_002�body��先假设 [0,1] 中所有实数能排成一列 x1, x2, x3,…。然后构造新数 y:让 y 的第 n 位小数与 xn 的第 n 位小数不同,同时避开数字 0 和 9,以免落入两种小数表示的歧义。这样 y 与名单上每个数至少有一位相异,却不在名单之中,与假设矛盾。所以 [0,1] 是不可数集合,其基数严格大于自然数的基数 ℵ₀。��Assume first that all reals in [0,1] can be listed as a sequence x1, x2, x3, … Now build a new number y whose n-th decimal digit differs from the n-th digit of xn, avoiding the digits 0 and 9 to dodge ambiguous dual expansions. Then y differs from every listed number in at least one digit yet appears nowhere on the list—a contradiction. Hence [0,1] is uncountable, with cardinality strictly greater than the natural numbers’ ℵ₀.�ans��src�ىCantor, G.(1891). Über eine elementare Frage der Mannigfaltigkeitslehre, Jahresbericht der Deutschen Mathematiker-Vereinigung 1, S.75-78ٌCantor, G. (1891). Über eine elementare Frage der Mannigfaltigkeitslehre, Jahresbericht der Deutschen Mathematiker-Vereinigung 1, pp. 75-78��id�math_20_005�body��␀线性目标函数若在多面体可行域上取到最优,必有某个极点(顶点)同样最优:目标的等值面是超平面,只要当前点不是顶点,就能沿改善目标的方向继续滑行,直到撞上边界顶点。于是单纯形法从一个顶点出发,反复转移到使目标值不减的相邻顶点,直到无邻点可改进即宣告最优。Klee 与 Minty 构造的实例迫使它遍历指数多个顶点,但实际运行通常很快;椭球法与内点法补上了多项式时间的理论保证。�dWhenever a linear objective attains an optimum over a polytope, some extreme point (vertex) is also optimal: level sets are hyperplanes, so from any non-vertex point you can keep sliding in an improving direction until you hit a boundary vertex. The simplex method exploits this by hopping from vertex to adjacent vertex, never letting the objective drop, and stops once no neighboring vertex improves it. Klee and Minty exhibited instances that force exponentially many vertices to be visited, yet the method runs fast in practice; the ellipsoid and interior-point methods supply the polynomial-time guarantees.�ans��src���Dantzig, G. B.(1951). Maximization of a linear function of variables subject to linear inequalities, 载于 Koopmans (ed.), Activity Analysis of Production and Allocation, Wiley, pp.339-347;Klee & Minty (1972)�0Dantzig, G. B. (1951). Maximization of a linear function of variables subject to linear inequalities, in Koopmans (ed.), Activity Analysis of Production and Allocation, Wiley, pp. 339-347; Klee, V. and Minty, G. J. (1972). How good is the simplex algorithm?, Inequalities III, Academic Press, pp. 159-175��id�math_20_012�body��给 7 个位置写下 1 到 7 的二进制编号后,三个校验方程分别看管索引某一位为 1 的那些位置:第 1 位覆盖全部奇数位置,第 2 位覆盖 2、3、6、7,第 4 位覆盖 4 到 7。收方重算三个奇偶得到的 3 比特伴随式,其数值本身就是出错位置的二进制编号,000 则代表无错。从计数角度看,纠单错必须区分 8 种情形——7 个可能位置加上无错,而 3 个校验位恰好提供 2^3=8 种状态,一种不浪费,这也是它被称为完备码的原因。��Write the seven positions numbered 1 through 7 in binary and let each of the three parity equations watch exactly those indices with a 1 in one bit: bit one covers all odd indices, bit two covers 2, 3, 6 and 7, and bit four covers 4 through 7. On reception the receiver recomputes three parities, and the resulting 3-bit syndrome numerically equals the binary index of the flipped bit, with 000 signaling no error at all. Counted information-theoretically, single-error correction must distinguish 8 outcomes — 7 possible locations plus no error — and 3 check bits supply exactly 2^3=8 states with none squandered, which is why the scheme is called a perfect code.�ans��src��{R. W. Hamming, Error Detecting and Error Correcting Codes, Bell System Technical Journal, vol. 29, no. 2, pp. 147-160, 1950�jR. W. Hamming, Error Detecting and Error Correcting Codes, Bell System Technical Journal 29 (1950) 147-160��id�math_20_015�body��?p 值的定义是:在假定原假设成立的前提下,出现与手头数据同等极端或更极端结果的概率,即 P(数据至少这么极端 | H0 为真),它谈论数据而非假设本身。把它误读成 P(H0 为假 | 数据) 颠倒了条件化的方向,并悄悄掺入了两个假设各自的先验可信度,这正是所谓检察官谬误的统计版本。同一个 p=0.03 在不同先验与不同样本量之下对应的可信结论可以相去甚远,美国统计学会 2016 年的正式声明因此明确禁止将 p 值解释为原假设为真或为假的概率。��By definition, a p-value is the probability, calculated assuming the null hypothesis holds, of obtaining results at least as extreme as those observed: P(data this extreme | H0 true) — a statement about the data, never about the hypothesis. Misreading it as P(H0 false | data) reverses the direction of conditioning and silently imports the prior plausibility of the competing hypotheses, the statistical face of the prosecutor's fallacy. One and the same p = 0.03 supports wildly different conclusions under different priors and sample sizes, and the American Statistical Association's 2016 formal statement accordingly forbids interpreting a p-value as the probability that the null hypothesis is true or false.�ans��src��CCasella, G. 与 Berger, R. L., 《统计推断》(第2版), Duxbury�GCasella, G. & Berger, R. L., 'Statistical Inference' (2nd ed.), Duxbury��id�math_21_005�body���Black-Scholes 的核心是无套利原则下的动态对冲:通过连续买卖标的股票构造瞬时风险为零的组合,其收益必须恰好等于无风险利率,否则套利者会立刻抹平偏差。这一复制论证把期权价格约束成一条抛物型偏微分方程,解出的闭式表达式即为欧式看涨期权的定价公式。模型假定股价服从波动率恒定的几何布朗运动,Merton 与 Scholes 也因此获得 1997 年诺贝尔经济学奖。�)The heart of Black-Scholes is dynamic hedging under the no-arbitrage principle: continuously trading the underlying stock builds a portfolio that is instantaneously riskless, so its return must equal the risk-free rate or arbitragers immediately erase the gap. This replication argument pins the option price down through a parabolic PDE whose closed-form solution prices a European call. The model assumes geometric Brownian motion with constant volatility, and Merton and Scholes were awarded the 1997 Nobel Memorial Prize in Economic Sciences for it.�ans��src�٪F. Black 与 M. Scholes《期权定价与公司负债》,Journal of Political Economy,1973 年;同期 R. C. Merton《理性期权定价理论》,Bell Journal of Economics��F. Black & M. Scholes, "The Pricing of Options and Corporate Liabilities," Journal of Political Economy, 1973; companion R. C. Merton, "Theory of Rational Option Pricing," Bell Journal of Economics, 1973��id�math_21_008�body���纽结理论研究圆周在三维空间中的嵌入：若存在保持外围空间的整体同胚把一条曲线映到另一条，二者就是同一个纽结。区分纽结依赖不变量，如亚历山大多项式、纽结群和琼斯多项式；三叶结的琼斯多项式既不同于无结圆圈的常数1，也不同于其镜像所对应的多项式，因此它是真正的纽结并具有手征性。这些不变量后来还在统计力学与量子场论中找到了意想不到的联系。�'Knot theory studies embeddings of the circle into three-dimensional space: two knots are identical when an ambient homeomorphism carries one onto the other. Distinguishing them relies on invariants such as the Alexander polynomial, the knot group, and the Jones polynomial; the trefoil's Jones polynomial differs both from the constant 1 of the unknotted circle and from that of its mirror image, so it is genuinely knotted and chiral. These invariants later turned out to have unexpected connections to statistical mechanics and quantum field theory.�ans��src�ْ沃恩·琼斯《经由冯·诺依曼代数得到的纽结多项式不变量》，Bulletin of the American Mathematical Society 第12卷（1985）ُVaughan F. R. Jones, 'A polynomial invariant for knots via von Neumann algebras', Bulletin of the American Mathematical Society, vol. 12 (1985)��id�math_21_012�body��V方程的解为P(t)=K/(1+Ae^(−rt))，其中A=(K−P₀)/P₀=(500−100)/100=4。代入P=250得1+4e^(−0.04t)=2，解出t=ln4/0.04≈34.7，即约35年后达到250万。这里r=0.04是资源不受限制时的内禀人均增长率，K=500万是由食物、住房与环境承载能力决定的容纳量，且人口恰在K/2处增长最快。��The solution is P(t) = K/(1 + Ae^(−rt)) with A = (K − P₀)/P₀ = (500 − 100)/100 = 4. Substituting P = 250 gives 1 + 4e^(−0.04t) = 2, so t = ln4/0.04 ≈ 34.7, roughly 35 years. Here r = 0.04 is the intrinsic per-capita growth rate under unlimited resources, while K = 5 million is the carrying capacity set by food, housing and environmental limits; growth is fastest exactly at K/2.�ans��src�ٳPearl, R. 与 Reed, L. J.《On the Rate of Growth of the Population of the United States since 1790 and Its Mathematical Representation》, PNAS, 1920年第6卷第6期, 275-288页��R. Pearl and L. J. Reed, 'On the Rate of Growth of the Population of the United States since 1790 and its Mathematical Representation', Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences, vol. 6, no. 6, pp. 275-288, 1920.��id�math_21_020�body���SIR 模型把人群分成易感者 S、感染者 I 与移出者 R 三类,满足 dS/dt=-bSI/N、dI/dt=bSI/N-gI、dR/dt=gI,其中 b 为人均传染率,g 为恢复率。基本再生数 R0=b/g 衡量一名感染者在全易感人群中平均引发的继发感染人数:R0 大于 1 时感染规模初期呈指数增长,R0 小于 1 时疫情自行消退。同一阈值还给出达到群体免疫所需的最低免疫比例 1-1/R0。�?The SIR model divides the population into susceptible S, infective I, and removed R classes obeying dS/dt = -bSI/N, dI/dt = bSI/N - gI, dR/dt = gI, where b is the per-capita transmission rate and g the recovery rate. The basic reproduction number R0 = b/g measures how many secondary infections one infective causes on average in a wholly susceptible population: when R0 exceeds 1 the infected count grows exponentially at first, while R0 below 1 lets the outbreak die out on its own. The same threshold yields the minimum immune fraction 1 - 1/R0 required for herd immunity.�ans��src�ًW. O. Kermack 与 A. G. McKendrick《A Contribution to the Mathematical Theory of Epidemics》,Proceedings of the Royal Society A 115, 1927�~W. O. Kermack & A. G. McKendrick, "A Contribution to the Mathematical Theory of Epidemics", Proc. Roy. Soc. London A 115, 1927��id�math_22_002�body��Q把复指数定义为幂级数 e^z=Σ z^n/n! 并代入 z=iθ。偶数次幂因 i²=-1 而符号交替，恰好拼成 cos θ 的级数；奇数次幂提出因子 i 后拼成 sin θ 的级数，逐项比较即得公式。它把指数与圆周运动联系起来：e^(iθ) 是单位圆上转角为 θ 的点，令 θ=π 立得 e^(iπ)+1=0。��Define the complex exponential by its power series e^z=Σ z^n/n! and substitute z=iθ. On even powers, i²=-1 creates alternating signs that assemble into the series of cos θ; odd powers carry a leftover factor i, and what remains assembles into sin θ. Comparing term by term yields the formula. It ties exponentials to circular motion: e^(iθ) is the point of the unit circle at angle θ, and setting θ=π instantly gives e^(iπ)+1=0.�ans��src��^L. V. Ahlfors，《Complex Analysis》（复分析），第3版，McGraw-Hill，1979，第2章�FL. V. Ahlfors, Complex Analysis, 3rd ed., McGraw-Hill, 1979, Chapter 2��id�math_22_005�body���区间显然连通：任取两点，夹在其间的所有点仍在集合内，故无法拆成两个不相交的非空相对开集。反之，若子集 S 缺少某点 c 且两侧都有点，则 S∩(-∞,c) 与 S∩(c,+∞) 构成分离，S 不连通。于是连通集必须填满任意两点间的整段——这正是区间的本质特征，也是把介值型论证推广到一般空间的基础。�
Intervals are plainly connected: between any two of their points everything in between still lies in the set, so no partition into two disjoint nonempty relatively open pieces exists. Conversely, if a subset S misses some point c while keeping points on both sides, then S∩(-∞,c) and S∩(c,+∞) form a separation, so S is disconnected. A connected set must fill the whole stretch between any two of its points - exactly the hallmark of an interval - and this underlies intermediate-value arguments in general spaces.�ans��src��bJ. R. Munkres，《Topology》（拓扑学），第2版，Prentice Hall，2000，§24 连通空间�VJames R. Munkres, Topology, 2nd ed., Prentice Hall, 2000, Section 24, Connected Spaces��id�math_22_008�body���在普通平面上，“两条直线要么相交、要么平行”迫使一切涉及直线的命题分类讨论。射影平面为每个方向补上一个无穷远点，让平行线在那里相遇，于是任意两条不同直线恰有唯一交点，命题无条件成立。例外消失后，中心投影不再制造新类型的特殊情形，相交关系在投影下保持不变。绘画中的灭点正是它的直观形象：画面上的铁轨汇聚于一点。�On the ordinary plane, “two lines either meet or are parallel” forces every line-related statement to split into cases. The projective plane appends one point at infinity for each direction, where the parallels meet, so any two distinct lines now share exactly one point, unconditionally. With exceptions gone, central projection creates no new kinds of special cases and incidence relations survive projection unchanged. The vanishing point in perspective painting is its everyday image: rails in the picture converge to a single spot.�ans��src��GH. S. M. Coxeter《Projective Geometry》，第 2 版，Springer，1987�>H. S. M. Coxeter, Projective Geometry, 2nd ed., Springer, 1987��id�math_22_012�body���诀窍是主动加入冗余。发送端把长串消息编成大码块；噪声虽会翻转部分比特，但只要速率低于容量 C 且码块足够长，码字之间就被安排得足够远，少量翻转无法让一个码字冒充另一个，接收端照样认出原块——这就是有噪信道编码定理。反之速率超过 C，则显著差错不可避免。该定理给出可靠通信的速度上限及其达成路径，是数字通信的基石。�:The trick is deliberate redundancy. The sender packs long message strings into large code blocks before they enter the channel; noise flips some bits, yet as long as the rate stays below the capacity C and blocks are long enough, codewords are spaced so far apart that a few flips cannot make one block impersonate another, and the receiver still recognizes the original — this is the noisy-channel coding theorem. Above C, by contrast, no encoding escapes a significant error rate. The theorem sets the speed limit of reliable communication and shows how to reach it.�ans��src��fT. M. Cover 与 J. A. Thomas《Elements of Information Theory》（第2版），Wiley，2006，第7章�[T. M. Cover & J. A. Thomas, Elements of Information Theory, 2nd ed., Wiley, 2006, Chapter 7��id�math_22_015�body���稠密只保证缝隙旁都有有理数，却不保证极限留在原地。看逼近 √2 的数列 1, 1.4, 1.41, …：各项越来越接近（柯西列），但极限 √2 不在 ℚ 中，这列数在 ℚ 内没有终点，微积分依赖的极限运算随之失灵。完备性公理（如确界原理）封住缺口：实数中每个柯西列都收敛，单调有界数列必收敛，介值定理和极值定理由此奠基。�Density guarantees only that a rational stands beside every gap, not that limits stay put. Watch the rationals 1, 1.4, 1.41, … creeping toward √2: the terms grow ever closer (a Cauchy sequence), yet the limit √2 lies outside ℚ, so the sequence lands nowhere in the rational world and the limit operation on which calculus rests breaks down. Completeness seals the gap: in the reals every Cauchy sequence converges and every bounded monotone sequence converges, laying the foundation of the intermediate and extreme value theorems.�ans��src��]W. Rudin《Principles of Mathematical Analysis》（第3版），McGraw-Hill，1976，第1章�TW. Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis, 3rd ed., McGraw-Hill, 1976, Chapter 1��id�math_22_018�body��H复可导要求 Δz→0 时 [f(z+Δz)-f(z)]/Δz 与方向无关：对 z̄ 沿实轴商为 1、沿虚轴为 -1，极限不存在。一般写 f = u + iv，可导必推出柯西-黎曼方程 u_x = v_y、u_y = -v_x，而 u = x、v = -y 违反之。它保证可导映射局部近似旋转加伸缩，是全纯函数刚性的起点。�-Complex differentiability demands that [f(z+Δz)-f(z)]/Δz tend to one limit regardless of direction as Δz → 0. For conjugation the quotient is always 1 along the real axis but -1 along the imaginary axis, so no limit exists. Writing f = u + iv generally, differentiability forces the Cauchy-Riemann equations u_x = v_y and u_y = -v_x; here u = x and v = -y give u_x = 1 ≠ v_y = -1, violating them. Geometrically these equations mean a differentiable map looks locally like a rotation plus scaling — the seed of the rigidity of holomorphic functions.�ans��src��sJ. W. Brown 与 R. V. Churchill《Complex Variables and Applications》（第8版），McGraw-Hill，2009，第2章�hJ. W. Brown & R. V. Churchill, Complex Variables and Applications, 8th ed., McGraw-Hill, 2009, Chapter 2��id�math_22_020�body��O把熵写成 H = E[log₂(1/p_i)]，即平均惊喜度。对数为凹，Jensen 不等式给出 H ≤ log₂ Σ p_i(1/p_i) = log₂ n，等号当且仅当每个 p_i = 1/n。分布越均匀越难猜中；偏爱某些结果时其余几乎注定，熵随之下降。上界 log₂ n 比特是无法区分 n 个结局的最坏不确定度。��Write the entropy as H = E[log₂(1/p_i)], the average surprise of an outcome. The logarithm is concave, so Jensen's inequality gives H ≤ log₂ Σ p_i(1/p_i) = log₂ n, with equality exactly when 1/p_i is constant, i.e., every p_i = 1/n. Intuition agrees: the more uniform the distribution, the harder the outcome is to guess, while favoring some outcomes makes others nearly certain and lowers uncertainty. The ceiling log₂ n bits marks maximal doubt when all n outcomes are equally indistinguishable.�ans��src��fT. M. Cover 与 J. A. Thomas《Elements of Information Theory》（第2版），Wiley，2006，第2章�[T. M. Cover & J. A. Thomas, Elements of Information Theory, 2nd ed., Wiley, 2006, Chapter 2��id�math_23_002�body���两类空间都是完备赋范空间；区别在于希尔伯特空间的范数由内积诱导。有了内积便有正交概念：可以做正交投影分解、展开傅里叶级数，并拥有平行四边形法则带来的几何直观。许多定理也更强，如里斯表示定理保证每个连续线性泛函都能用一个向量表示。量子力学中的态叠加恰好需要这种正交结构，因此数学物理偏爱希尔伯特空间。�Both are complete normed spaces; the difference is that a Hilbert space's norm arises from an inner product. With an inner product comes orthogonality: one can decompose via orthogonal projections, expand in Fourier series, and exploit the geometry encoded in the parallelogram law. Theorems grow stronger too — the Riesz representation theorem guarantees that every continuous linear functional is represented by a vector. Quantum superposition requires precisely such orthogonal structure, so mathematical physics favors Hilbert spaces.�ans��src�٭M. Reed 与 B. Simon《现代数学物理方法 I：泛函分析》修订增补版 (Methods of Modern Mathematical Physics I: Functional Analysis)，Academic Press，1980。نM. Reed & B. Simon, Methods of Modern Mathematical Physics I: Functional Analysis, revised and enlarged edition, Academic Press, 1980.��id�math_23_005�body��H因对数严格凹，詹森不等式给出 ln[(x_1+…+x_n)/n] ≥ [ln x_1+…+ln x_n]/n = ln((x_1⋯x_n)^(1/n))，取指数即知算术平均不小于几何平均。凹性严格，等号当且仅当诸数全相等。此式是极值问题的基石：总和给定时均分使乘积最大，乘积给定时均分使总和最小。��Since the logarithm is strictly concave, Jensen's inequality applied to positive numbers x_1,…,x_n gives ln[(x_1+…+x_n)/n] ≥ (ln x_1+…+ln x_n)/n = ln((x_1⋯x_n)^(1/n)); exponentiating both sides yields AM ≥ GM. Strict concavity forces equality if and only if all the numbers are equal. The inequality is a cornerstone of extremal problems: for a fixed sum, equal numbers maximize the product, and for a fixed product, equal numbers minimize the sum.�ans��src��sG. H. Hardy、J. E. Littlewood 与 G. Pólya《不等式》第2版 (Inequalities)，剑桥大学出版社，1952。�gG. H. Hardy, J. E. Littlewood & G. Pólya, Inequalities, 2nd edition, Cambridge University Press, 1952.��id�math_23_008�body���SIR 模型把人群分为易感、感染、移除三类，以微分方程刻画转化。基本再生数 R0 指一名感染者在全易感人群中平均引起的二代病例数：R0≤1 时病例传不满一人，疫情自行消退；R0>1 时病例早期指数增长。令新增感染与移除相抵可知：易感比例跌破 1/R0，即约 1-1/R0 的人口免疫后疫情收缩，这就是群体免疫阈值的由来。�RThe SIR model sorts a population into susceptible, infectious, and removed classes linked by differential equations. The basic reproduction number R0 is the average number of secondary infections one case produces in a wholly susceptible population: if R0 ≤ 1, each case fails to replace itself and the outbreak dies out, while R0 > 1 gives early exponential growth. Equating new infections with recoveries shows the epidemic shrinks once the susceptible fraction falls below 1/R0 — that is, once a share 1 - 1/R0 of the population is immune, which is precisely the herd immunity threshold.�ans��src���W. O. Kermack 与 A. G. McKendrick“流行病的数学理论贡献”(A Contribution to the Mathematical Theory of Epidemics)，Proceedings of the Royal Society A 第115卷第772期第700–721页，1927，DOI 10.1098/rspa.1927.0111。ٵW. O. Kermack & A. G. McKendrick, "A Contribution to the Mathematical Theory of Epidemics", Proceedings of the Royal Society A 115(772):700–721, 1927, DOI: 10.1098/rspa.1927.0111.��id�math_23_012�body��P条件是可控性矩阵 [B, AB, …, A^(n−1)B] 满秩（Kalman 秩条件）。满秩时化为可控标准形，K 的分量直接成为闭环特征多项式的系数，任给期望多项式即可解出 K（如 Ackermann 公式）。若有与输入解耦的特征方向，其特征值不随 K 改变，故该条件既必要又充分。��Full rank of the controllability matrix [B, AB, …, A^(n−1)B] — the Kalman rank condition. Under full rank, a coordinate change brings the pair into controller canonical form, where the entries of K appear directly as coefficients of the closed-loop characteristic polynomial, so any desired polynomial determines K (Ackermann’s formula is one recipe). An eigendirection decoupled from the input keeps its eigenvalue no matter how K is chosen, making the rank condition both necessary and sufficient.�ans��src�فChen, C.-T.，《线性系统理论与设计》(Linear System Theory and Design)，第3版，Oxford University Press，1999年。�UChen, C.-T., Linear System Theory and Design, 3rd ed., Oxford University Press, 1999.��id�math_23_015�body���把地块、批次、试验日等干扰来源划成内部均匀的区组，并在区组内随机分配处理，使处理比较都在同一区组内进行，区组间差异由此从误差项中剥离；误差平方和随之缩小，标准误变小，检验更灵敏。代价是比同等规模的完全随机设计少 b−1 个误差自由度，只有当区组间差异明显大于区内随机波动时，这一交换才划算。�;Nuisance sources such as plots, batches, or testing days are divided into internally homogeneous blocks, and treatments are randomized within each block, so every treatment comparison happens inside a block while block-to-block variation is stripped out of the error term. The error sum of squares shrinks accordingly, standard errors of treatment means fall, and tests gain power. The cost is b−1 fewer error degrees of freedom than a completely randomized design of equal size; the trade pays off only when genuine block differences clearly exceed within-block noise.�ans��src��rMontgomery, D. C.，《实验设计与分析》(Design and Analysis of Experiments)，第8版，Wiley，2013年。�LMontgomery, D. C., Design and Analysis of Experiments, 8th ed., Wiley, 2013.��id�math_23_018�body���该原理说：完备度量空间上的映射 T 如果把任意两点的距离至少按固定比例 0<k<1 压缩，那么 T 恰有一个不动点，且从任何初值出发的迭代都几何式地逼近它。关键是相邻两次迭代的距离按公比 k 衰减，使序列成为柯西列；完备性保证极限存在，T 的连续性保证极限就是不动点。它自带误差估计，是皮卡逐步逼近法解微分方程的核心。��Banach's contraction principle says that a map T on a complete metric space which shrinks every distance by a fixed factor 0<k<1 has exactly one fixed point, approached geometrically by iteration from any starting value. Distances between consecutive iterates decay at ratio k, so they form a Cauchy sequence; completeness supplies the limit, and continuity of T guarantees it is fixed. The theorem brings intrinsic error bounds and drives Picard iteration.�ans��src�كE. Kreyszig《Introductory Functional Analysis with Applications（泛函分析导论及应用）》，John Wiley & Sons，1978 年�XE. Kreyszig, Introductory Functional Analysis with Applications, John Wiley & Sons, 1978��id�math_23_020�body���记环路增益为 L，对象参数的相对变化反映到闭环响应时约缩小为原来的 1/(1+L)，环内扰动同样被该因子衰减。增益越大，性能越不依赖对对象的精确建模，鲁棒性与抗扰力越强；但高增益会侵蚀相位裕度，可能引起振荡甚至失稳，须在敏感度与稳定裕度间折中。反馈凭实时测量自动纠偏，是与开环控制的本质分野。��With loop gain L, a fractional variation of the plant reaches the closed-loop response multiplied by about 1/(1+L), and disturbances entering inside the loop are attenuated by the same factor. Larger gain means less dependence on accurately knowing the plant and stronger robustness, but eroding phase margin can cause oscillation or instability, so a trade-off is unavoidable. Feedback corrects errors from live measurements, its essential divide from open-loop control.�ans��src�ٙK.J. Åström、R.M. Murray《Feedback Systems: An Introduction for Scientists and Engineers（反馈系统）》，Princeton University Press，2008 年�}K.J. Åström & R.M. Murray, Feedback Systems: An Introduction for Scientists and Engineers, Princeton University Press, 2008��id�04db1c886911�body���标准差衡量一组数据里每个值偏离平均数的典型幅度：各值与均值之差平方后取平均得方差，再开平方就是标准差。开方不只是走形式，它把量纲从平方单位还原成与原始数据相同，所以标准差能和均值直接比大小，方差不能。用处在于对照均值看离散：均值相同而标准差悬殊，均值的代表性就完全不同；单位不同时，还要改比它与均值的比值。��Standard deviation measures the typical way each value in a set departs from the mean: the differences from the mean are squared and averaged into the variance, and the square root of that is the standard deviation. The root is not a formality - it brings the units back from the squared scale to those of the original data, so the standard deviation can be compared directly with the mean while the variance cannot. Its use lies in reading spread against the mean: two groups with the same mean but very different standard deviations have means of quite different representativeness, and where the units differ, it is the ratio of standard deviation to mean that should be compared.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�0916b55b2bb2�body��.最小二乘法由勒让德在1805年和高斯在1809年分别独立提出，通过最小化观测值与模型预测值之差的平方和来拟合直线。它在存在测量误差时给出最优线性无偏估计，至今仍是回归分析的基础。高斯与勒让德的原始论文是标准出处。�gThe method of least squares was proposed independently by Legendre in 1805 and Gauss in 1809, fitting a line by minimizing the sum of squared deviations between observations and the model. It gives the best linear unbiased estimate under measurement error and remains the basis of regression. The original papers of Gauss and Legendre are the standard source.�ans��src��zLegendre《Nouvelles méthodes》（1805）；Gauss《Theoria Motus》（1809）；Weisberg《Applied Linear Regression》�fLegendre, Nouvelles méthodes (1805); Gauss, Theoria Motus (1809); Weisberg, Applied Linear Regression��id�0b798458a9db�body�ٜ拉普拉斯变换把函数从时间域变到复频率域，把微分运算转化为代数乘法。它广泛用于电路、控制与微分方程的求解。٭The Laplace transform maps a function to a complex frequency domain, turning differentiation into algebra. It is widely used in circuits, control and differential equations.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�0c660240c78e�body��波尔查诺-魏尔斯特拉斯定理说，欧几里得空间中的有界序列必定含有收敛的子列。它把有界性与紧性联系起来，是极值存在性与函数分析的基础工具。鲁丁与阿博特的教材都把它作为分析学的支柱定理。�The Bolzano-Weierstrass theorem states that every bounded sequence in Euclidean space has a convergent subsequence. It links boundedness with compactness and is a basic tool for existence of extrema and functional analysis. Rudin and Abbott present it as a pillar of analysis.�ans��src��BRudin《数学分析原理》；Abbott《Understanding Analysis》�JRudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis; Abbott, Understanding Analysis��id�0d488681cd6f�body��i泰勒级数用多项式在一点附近逼近光滑函数，例如 e^x ≈ 1 + x + x²/2 + x³/6 + …。�kA Taylor series approximates a smooth function near a point by polynomials, e.g. e^x≈1+x+x²/2+x³/6+….�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�0ddcb727b191�body��0率失真理论在允许最大失真 D 的约束下，求编码所需的最小速率 $R(D)=\min I(X;\hat X)$，其中 $\hat X$ 是重建值。它说明有损压缩存在权衡曲线：允许失真越大，所需比特率越低，由互信息的最小值界定，是 JPEG、MP3 等标准的理论根基。�VRate-distortion theory finds the minimum rate $R(D)=\min I(X;\hat X)$ needed to reproduce a source within maximum distortion D, where $\hat X$ is the reconstruction. It shows a trade-off curve for lossy compression: more allowed distortion means fewer bits, bounded by the minimum mutual information, underpinning standards like JPEG and MP3.�ans��src��%《信息论基础》Cover 与 Thomas�2Elements of Information Theory by Cover and Thomas��id�0e8218217934�body���它考虑“所有不包含自身的集合”是否包含自身：包含则不该包含，不包含则又该包含，自相矛盾。它促使人们建立更严谨的公理集合论（如ZFC）。ٝConsider the set of all sets not containing themselves; it both must and must not contain itself—a contradiction that motivated axiomatic set theory (ZFC).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�1113fa069fa0�body�٥布尔代数是以“与、或、非”运算处理真值的代数系统，只有真与假两个值。它是数字电路与计算机逻辑门设计的数学基础。ٗBoolean algebra handles truth values with AND, OR, NOT over just true/false. It is the mathematical basis of digital circuits and computer logic gates.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�127c4d1e0a5e�body�ٵ是的。自注意力把输入做成查询 Q、键 K、值 V 三个矩阵，计算 softmax(QKᵀ/√d)V，即“按相关性加权求和”。它让模型并行捕捉长程依赖。َYes—self-attention forms Q, K, V matrices and computes softmax(QKᵀ/√d)V, a relevance-weighted sum enabling parallel long-range modeling.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�19ddf8afd4f5�body�ٰ卡特兰数 C_n = (1/(n+1))·C(2n,n) 计数许多结构：合法括号串、二叉树、不跨越对角线的路径。它是组合数学中出现频率最高的数列之一。١Catalan numbers C_n=(1/(n+1))·C(2n,n) count many structures: valid parentheses, binary trees, lattice paths. Among the most frequent sequences in combinatorics.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�1b900e17a704�body���在买家估值独立且风险中性的标准假设下，许多常见拍卖（英式、荷式、第一/第二价格密封）给卖家带来的期望收益相同。它奠定了拍卖机制设计的理论基础。ٞUnder standard independent risk-neutral valuations, many common auctions (English, Dutch, 1st/2nd-price sealed) yield the same expected revenue to the seller.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�1bb04c96e3bb�body�٫皮亚诺公理用“0 和其后继”公理化了自然数：每个数有唯一后继，0不是任何数的后继，归纳法成立。它给算术提供了严格基础。٤The Peano axioms formalize naturals via 0 and a successor: each has a unique successor, 0 is first, and induction holds. They give arithmetic a rigorous foundation.�ans��src��OPeano, G. (1889). 《算术原理：用新方法进行表述》. Fratres Bocca.�OPeano, G. (1889). Arithmetices Principia, Nova Methodo Exposita. Fratres Bocca.��id�21ec020bbf36�body�٧ECC 利用椭圆曲线上点加法的“离散对数难解”来构造密钥。相比 RSA，它用更短的密钥达到同等安全，广泛用于手机与比特币。٘ECC bases security on the hardness of the elliptic-curve discrete logarithm; it matches RSA security with much shorter keys, used in phones and Bitcoin.�ans��src��VMenezes、van Oorschot、Vanstone《Handbook of Applied Cryptography》（CRC Press）�LMenezes, van Oorschot, Vanstone, Handbook of Applied Cryptography, CRC Press��id�239923daf2f3�body�ٺ相空间用“位置+动量”描述系统全部状态；哈密顿量 H(q,p) 给出总能量，其方程给出状态随时间演化的流。它是经典力学与统计物理的语言。ٯPhase space uses position+momentum to describe a system's full state; the Hamiltonian H(q,p) gives total energy and its equations govern evolution—the language of mechanics.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�23ab2c873d35�body���它们是衡量统计模型优劣的准则，在拟合优度与模型复杂度之间权衡：AIC≈2k−2ln L，BIC 还随样本量加重惩罚。它们帮助避免一味追求高拟合导致的过拟合。ًAIC and BIC trade goodness-of-fit against complexity (AIC≈2k−2ln L; BIC penalizes more with sample size), guarding against overfitting.�ans��src��.Wasserman, L., 《全部统计学》, Springer�,Wasserman, L., 'All of Statistics', Springer��id�2459a271ca6a�body�٨拉丁方是每行每列都出现一次全部符号的方阵，是实验设计的基础。更一般的组合设计研究如何平衡地安排试验，以减少偏差。٘A Latin square has each symbol once per row and column, fundamental to experimental design. Broader combinatorial designs arrange trials to reduce bias.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�25758e88b717�body���谱定理说实对称矩阵（或更一般的自伴算子）可被一组正交特征向量对角化，特征值全为实数。它是主成分分析、振动模态和量子力学的数学基础。٠The spectral theorem says a real symmetric (self-adjoint) operator is orthogonally diagonalizable with real eigenvalues; the basis of PCA and quantum mechanics.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�27a437e44432�body���谱图论用图的邻接矩阵或拉普拉斯矩阵的特征值来刻画图的性质，例如第二小拉普拉斯特征值（代数连通度）衡量图的连通强弱，Fiedler 向量用于图划分。ٮSpectral graph theory uses eigenvalues of adjacency/Laplacian matrices; e.g. the algebraic connectivity (2nd-smallest Laplacian eigenvalue) measures how connected a graph is.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�295029569ba1�body��大数定律说明随着样本量增大，样本平均依概率收敛到真实期望，关注长期稳定的位置。中心极限定理进一步描述其围绕期望的波动呈正态分布，关注偏离的形状。费勒与比林斯利的著作分别细致论证了这两条定理。�MThe law of large numbers says the sample average converges in probability to the true expectation as the sample grows, concerning long-run location. The central limit theorem further describes the fluctuation around that expectation as normal, concerning the shape of deviation. Feller and Billingsley argue these theorems in detail.�ans��src��qFeller《An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications》；Billingsley《Probability and Measure》�hFeller, An Introduction to Probability Theory and Its Applications; Billingsley, Probability and Measure��id�2cc56de90b98�body�ه树是连通且无环路的无向图，n 个顶点的树恰有 n−1 条边。它常用于表示家谱、文件目录和决策结构。ـA tree is a connected graph with no cycles; n vertices have exactly n−1 edges. Used for family trees, file systems, decisions.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�2d645ebb11ec�body��拉格朗日定理指出有限群的子群阶数必整除整个群的阶数，因此元素的阶也整除群阶。它直接推出费马小定理等结论，是群论的基本约束。杜米特与富特以及罗特曼的抽象代数教材都把它作为早期核心定理。�GLagrange's theorem states that the order of a subgroup of a finite group divides the order of the whole group, so an element's order also divides the group order. It immediately yields results like Fermat's little theorem and is a basic constraint in group theory. Dummit & Foote and Rotman present it as an early core theorem.�ans��src��\Dummit 与 Foote《Abstract Algebra》；Rotman《An Introduction to the Theory of Groups》�QDummit & Foote, Abstract Algebra; Rotman, An Introduction to the Theory of Groups��id�2df016e2b980�body��-统计功效是当原假设实际为假时，检验正确拒绝它的概率，等于 1−β（β 为第二类错误率）。效应量固定时，样本量越大、测量越精确，检验统计量的分布越分离，功效越高；这正是实验设计要预先估算“所需样本量”的原因。�>Statistical power is the probability of correctly rejecting a false null hypothesis, equal to 1−β (β being the Type II error rate). With a fixed effect size, larger samples and less noise separate the test-statistic distributions more, raising power—which is why experiments pre-compute the required sample size.�ans��src��CCasella, G. 与 Berger, R. L., 《统计推断》(第2版), Duxbury�GCasella, G. & Berger, R. L., 'Statistical Inference' (2nd ed.), Duxbury��id�2eea95bc41b1�body�٢贝叶斯推断把未知量视为随机变量，用先验分布结合观测数据得到后验分布。它把“学习”形式化为不断更新信念的过程。٠Bayesian inference treats unknowns as random, combining a prior with data into a posterior distribution. It formalizes learning as continually updating beliefs.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�30fef067db63�body�ٝ行列式是把方阵映射为一个标量的函数，反映该矩阵所表示线性变换对体积的缩放比例。行列式为0意味着矩阵不可逆。�The determinant maps a square matrix to a scalar giving the volume-scaling factor of its linear map; zero means non-invertible.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�321e6be66c5f�body���阿罗定理说：在不少于三个选项时，不可能存在一种“公平”的投票规则同时满足完全序、无关选项独立、非独裁等几条看似合理的要求。它揭示了集体决策的固有矛盾。٬Arrow's theorem: with ≥3 options no voting rule can satisfy a handful of reasonable criteria (ranking, independence of irrelevant alternatives, non-dictatorship) at once.�ans��src�ً孔多塞《应用概率分析考察多数表决决策之试论》（1785）；肯尼斯·阿罗《社会选择与个人价值》（1951）��Marquis de Condorcet, 'Essai sur l'application de l'analyse à la probabilité des décisions rendues à la pluralité des voix' (1785); Kenneth Arrow, 'Social Choice and Individual Values', Cowles Commission monograph (1951)��id�34d26c96af8c�body��命题逻辑把能判真假的陈述当作不可再拆的单位，用「且、或、非、如果…则、当且仅当」拼出复合命题；复合式的真假完全由各部分的真假决定，所以一张真值表就能穷尽所有情形，n 个变元也不过 2 的 n 次方行。它的限度也出在这一步：命题被当成原子，「所有」「存在」这类量词根本表达不出来，「所有人都会死」在这里只是一个 p。要看穿命题内部的主谓结构，就得上升到谓词逻辑。�?Propositional logic takes truth-evaluable statements as indivisible units and combines them with "and", "or", "not", "if-then" and "if and only if". The truth of the compound is fixed entirely by the truths of its parts, so one truth table settles every case: n variables give just 2-to-the-n rows. Its limit comes from that same move, since propositions stay atoms: quantifiers like "all" and "some" cannot be expressed at all, and "every man is mortal" is only a single p here. Seeing the subject-predicate structure inside a proposition means ascending to predicate logic.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�34e9c424a3f3�body�ٱ零和博弈中一方所得恰为另一方所失，总收益恒为零，如棋类与扑克。它与非零和博弈（可能双赢）相对，是博弈论最早研究的类型。ٜIn a zero-sum game one player's gain is another's loss, total payoff zero, like chess or poker. Opposed to nonzero-sum games, it was the first type studied.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�368a10a3b08c�body�٢它断言任意非常数复系数多项式都至少有一个复根，因此 n 次多项式恰有 n 个复根（计重数）。高斯给出了首个严格证明。��It states every nonconstant polynomial with complex coefficients has a complex root, so a degree-n polynomial has exactly n complex roots counting multiplicity. Gauss gave the first rigorous proof.�ans��src��MAhlfors《Complex Analysis》；Conway《Functions of One Complex Variable》�DAhlfors, Complex Analysis; Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable��id�39a6d5fcd9f2�body�ٜ它用于在约束条件下求多元函数的极值：引入乘子使梯度平行，即 ∇f = λ ∇g。常用于在预算或资源限制下的最优化。�|It finds extrema under constraints by making gradients parallel: ∇f=λ∇g; used in optimization with limits like budgets.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�3a31de4b482b�body���海森矩阵是损失函数对所有参数的二阶偏导数矩阵，描述“曲率”。牛顿法用它加速收敛，其正定性能判断极小值；但高维下计算昂贵，故常用近似。ٶThe Hessian is the matrix of second derivatives of the loss; Newton's method uses it for faster convergence, and its definiteness reveals minima—but it's costly in high dimensions.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�3bdfaa3a7953�body�ٺ辛普森悖论指：各组内都呈现的趋势，在合并数据后却反转。例如两种疗法在各年龄段都更优，但总体却显得更差，原因是各组样本量不均。١Simpson's paradox: a trend appearing in every subgroup reverses when data are pooled, often due to uneven group sizes—classic in medical and social statistics.�ans��src��SPearl、Glymour 与 Jewell《Causal Inference in Statistics: A Primer》（Wiley）�JPearl, Glymour and Jewell, Causal Inference in Statistics: A Primer, Wiley��id�3d8ade6455b0�body���零知识证明让一方向另一方证明“某个命题为真”而不泄露任何额外信息，如证明知道密码而不透露密码。它在区块链隐私与身份验证中日益重要。ٕA zero-knowledge proof convinces a verifier that a statement is true without revealing anything else—used in blockchain privacy and authentication.�ans��src��wGoldwasser, S., Micali, S., Rackoff, C., 《知识复杂性的零知识证明》, SIAM Journal on Computing 18(1), 1989�}Goldwasser, S., Micali, S., Rackoff, C., 'The Knowledge Complexity of Interactive Proof Systems', SIAM J. Comput. 18(1), 1989��id�41974114547d�body���非欧几何放弃“平行公设”，发展出双曲与椭圆几何：三角形内角和分别小于或大于180°。它的诞生揭示公理系统的相对性，并启发了广义相对论。��Non-Euclidean geometry drops the parallel postulate, yielding hyperbolic and elliptic geometries where triangle angle sums differ from 180°. It revealed the relativity of axioms and inspired general relativity.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�42cd9079ac8a�body�٢第一类错误是“假阳性”（错误地拒绝真假设），第二类错误是“假阴性”（错误地保留假假设）。检验需在两者间权衡。�tType I is a false positive (rejecting truth); Type II is a false negative (missing an effect); tests trade them off.�ans��src��CCasella, G. 与 Berger, R. L., 《统计推断》(第2版), Duxbury�GCasella, G. & Berger, R. L., 'Statistical Inference' (2nd ed.), Duxbury��id�43dc4d046c8b�body�ٟ图着色给顶点（或边）分配颜色使相邻者不同色，最少需要的颜色数称为色数。它应用于排课、寄存器分配与频率规划。ٰGraph coloring assigns colors to vertices so neighbors differ; the minimum number is the chromatic number. It applies to scheduling, register allocation and frequency planning.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4415aaabad40�body�٫排队论用数学模型分析顾客到来、等待与服务的过程，预测平均等待时间与系统拥堵。它应用于银行、通信网络与医院急诊调度。ٖQueuing theory models arrivals, waiting and service to predict delays and congestion. It applies to banks, communication networks and hospital triage.�ans��src��$《运筹学》Hillier 与 Lieberman�<Introduction to Operations Research by Hillier and Lieberman��id�44c2a3fe050e�body���生存分析处理“到某事件（如失效、死亡）的时间”，并处理删失数据（部分个体在研究结束时仍未发生事件）。常用 Kaplan-Meier 曲线与 Cox 比例风险模型。ٙSurvival analysis models time-to-event with censoring (some subjects never experience the event by study end); uses Kaplan–Meier curves and Cox models.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�45d35e4f8acf�body��'给定素数 p、生成元 g 与 h = gˣ mod p，求指数 x 就是离散对数问题；目前没有已知的高效经典算法，最佳通用方法（指标计算法）随 p 的位数超多项式增长。它直接支撑了 Diffie–Hellman 密钥交换与 ElGamal 加密等公钥密码体制。�WGiven a prime p, generator g, and h = gˣ mod p, recovering the exponent x is the discrete logarithm problem; no efficient classical algorithm is known, and the best general methods (index calculus) grow faster than any polynomial in the bit-length. It underpins public-key systems such as Diffie–Hellman key exchange and ElGamal encryption.�ans��src��[Hoffstein, J., Pipher, J., Silverman, J. H., 《数学密码学导引》(第2版), Springer�oHoffstein, J., Pipher, J., Silverman, J. H., 'An Introduction to Mathematical Cryptography' (2nd ed.), Springer��id�45e4bf1993c3�body�٫在带权连通图中，最小生成树是以最小总边权连接所有顶点的无环子图。克鲁斯卡尔与普里姆算法可高效求出它，用于网络布线。ٲIn a weighted connected graph, a minimum spanning tree connects all vertices with smallest total edge weight, acyclic. Kruskal's and Prim's algorithms find it for network design.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�48d6d5d7ea94�body�ٽ它把“若被告无罪，出现该证据的概率很小”错误地等同为“被告无罪的概率很小”。正确的贝叶斯推理还要考虑先验（无辜者基数大得多）。ٌIt confuses P(evidence | innocent) with P(innocent | evidence); Bayes requires also the prior that far more people are innocent than guilty.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4b62635c46ce�body�ٹ高斯-博内定理把曲面的总高斯曲率积分与它的欧拉示性数联系起来：∫_M K dA = 2π χ(M)。它表明“局部弯曲”的总和由“整体的拓扑”决定。يGauss–Bonnet links total Gaussian curvature to topology: ∫_M K dA = 2π χ(M), so global bending is fixed by the Euler characteristic.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4b780f0c02a3�body��#随机梯度下降用单个（或小批量）样本估计梯度来更新参数，而非计算全数据集梯度。每次更新廉价且带噪声，但噪声有助于逃离尖锐极小，使其在海量数据下比批量梯度下降快得多，是现代深度学习的默认优化器基础。�RStochastic gradient descent updates parameters using the gradient estimated from a single (or mini-batch) sample rather than the full dataset. Each update is cheap and noisy, but the noise helps escape sharp minima, making it far faster than batch gradient descent on massive data and forming the basis of modern deep-learning optimizers.�ans��src��3《深度学习》Goodfellow、Bengio 与 Courville�0Deep Learning by Goodfellow Bengio and Courville��id�4d64acef30ac�body��I分离变量法假设解可写为空间函数与时间函数的乘积 $u(x,t)=X(x)T(t)$，代入热方程 $u_t=\alpha u_{xx}$ 后两边分别只依赖 t 与 x，从而等于同一常数，化为两个常微分方程。空间部分给出正弦本征函数，时间部分给出指数衰减，叠加成傅里叶级数即完整解。�^Separation of variables assumes a solution as a product $u(x,t)=X(x)T(t)$; substituting into $u_t=\alpha u_{xx}$ makes each side depend on only one variable, so both equal a constant, splitting into two ODEs. The spatial part yields sine eigenfunctions and the temporal part exponential decay; superposition gives a Fourier series, the full solution.�ans��src��(《傅里叶分析》Stein 与 Shakarchi�'Fourier Analysis by Stein and Shakarchi��id�5131894ecd43�body��$欧拉把柯尼斯堡七桥抽象为顶点与边，证明若能一笔画走完所有桥，至多两个顶点的度必须为奇数。这一把实际问题转化为拓扑图结构的思路，被公认为图论的开端。欧拉1736年的论文与迪斯特尔的《图论》都是标准文献。�fEuler abstracted the Königsberg seven bridges into vertices and edges, proving that a walk using every bridge once is possible only if at most two vertices have odd degree. This recasting of a practical puzzle into a topological graph structure is regarded as the birth of graph theory. Euler's 1736 paper and Diestel's Graph Theory are standard references.�ans��src��XEuler《Solutio problematis ad geometriam situs》（1736）；Diestel《Graph Theory》�LEuler, Solutio problematis ad geometriam situs (1736); Diestel, Graph Theory��id�527e4c8b163c�body�ٓ容斥原理通过交替加减交集来准确计算若干集合并集的大小，避免重复计数。它是概率与组合计数的基本技术。٣Inclusion–exclusion computes a union's size by alternately adding and subtracting intersections, avoiding double counts. It is basic to probability and counting.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�5542aa28bc9a�body��康托尔集由不断去掉线段中间三分之一构造，它不含任何区间故无处稠密，却又每个点都是聚点故为完全集。它的总长度是零，却含有不可数多个点，展示了无穷的微妙。康托尔1883年的论文与鲁丁的教材都讨论了它。�DThe Cantor set is built by repeatedly removing the middle third of intervals; it contains no interval, so it is nowhere dense, yet every point is a limit point, so it is perfect. Its total length is zero while it holds uncountably many points, showing subtleties of infinity. Cantor's 1883 paper and Rudin's text discuss it.�ans��src��^Cantor《Über unendliche Punktmannigfaltigkeiten》（1883）；Rudin《数学分析原理》�cCantor, Über unendliche Punktmannigfaltigkeiten (1883); Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis��id�555ef4016e75�body�ٻ怪球面是与普通球面同胚、却不可微同胚（无法光滑地扭成普通球面）的七维流形。米尔诺在1956年发现它们，颠覆了人们对高维空间的想象。٬Exotic spheres are manifolds homeomorphic but not diffeomorphic to the standard sphere (first in dimension 7, found by Milnor in 1956), reshaping high-dimensional topology.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�558faf5e7dee�body�پ当矩阵不是方阵或不满秩时，伪逆 A⁺ 给出“最佳”的最小二乘解 x = A⁺b。它把可逆矩阵的逆推广到所有矩阵，广泛用于数据拟合与机器学习。٣The Moore–Penrose pseudoinverse A⁺ gives the best least-squares solution x=A⁺b even for non-square or rank-deficient matrices; a generalization of inversion.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�5898c31f337b�body��)拉普拉斯变换把微分运算转换为代数中的乘法，从而把常微分方程化为关于像函数的代数方程。求解后再做反变换即得原函数，特别适合带初值与分段输入的工程问题。多伊奇与博伊斯、迪普里马的教材都把它作为标准技巧。��The Laplace transform turns differentiation into multiplication in algebra, converting an ordinary differential equation into an algebraic equation in the transformed function. After solving, an inverse transform recovers the original function, especially convenient for initial-value and piecewise-input engineering problems. Doetsch and Boyce & DiPrima present it as a standard technique.�ans��src��]Doetsch《The Laplace Transform》；Boyce 与 DiPrima《Elementary Differential Equations》�RDoetsch, The Laplace Transform; Boyce & DiPrima, Elementary Differential Equations��id�58c67e249a0b�body��t以某圆心、半径 r 作反演：平面上点 P 映到同一射线上满足 OP·OP' = r² 的点 P'。该变换把过圆心的直线保持为直线，把不过圆心的直线变成过圆心的圆，圆仍映成圆或直线，且保持“共形”（角度不变）。它被用来把看似复杂的圆系问题转化为直线问题，也用于复分析与双曲几何。��Inverting in a circle of radius r sends a point P to P' on the same ray with OP·OP' = r². Lines through the center stay lines, lines not through the center become circles through the center, and circles map to circles or lines; angles are preserved (conformal). It lets one turn messy circle configurations into straight-line problems and appears in complex analysis and hyperbolic geometry.�ans��src��8Coxeter, H. S. M., 《几何学导引》(第2版), Wiley�>Coxeter, H. S. M., 'Introduction to Geometry' (2nd ed.), Wiley��id�59a7161d2a61�body�ٿ它是一种概率性素性测试：对候选奇数 n，选随机“见证”a 进行检验；若通过若干轮则 n 极可能是素数。RSA 等大数素性判断主要靠它快速筛选。٭The Miller–Rabin test is a probabilistic primality test using random 'witness' bases; passing many rounds makes n overwhelmingly likely prime, used to generate RSA primes.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�5ec84bc8571b�body��P里奇流是由哈密顿引入的演化方程 $\partial_t g_{ij}=-2R_{ij}$，让度量沿时间演化以平滑曲率，类比热方程扩散曲率。佩雷尔曼用里奇流配合手术方法，证明了三维闭流形若单连通则同胚于三维球面，从而解决庞加莱猜想；相关工作发表于 arXiv 并由学界验证。��Ricci flow is the evolution equation $\partial_t g_{ij}=-2R_{ij}$ introduced by Hamilton, letting the metric evolve to smooth out curvature, analogous to heat diffusion. Perelman used Ricci flow with surgery to prove that a simply connected closed 3-manifold is homeomorphic to the 3-sphere, resolving the Poincaré conjecture; the work appeared on arXiv and was verified by the community.�ans��src��0Clay Mathematics Institute 庞加莱猜想专题�/Clay Mathematics Institute Poincaré conjecture��id�60f7c70e7385�body�ٷ线性回归用一条直线（或超平面）拟合自变量与因变量之间的关系，目标是最小化预测误差的平方和。它是统计建模与预测的最基础工具。ٛLinear regression fits a line (or hyperplane) to relate inputs to an outcome, minimizing squared errors. It is the most basic tool of statistical modeling.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数理统计》�<American Mathematical Society (AMS), Mathematical Statistics��id�61042f418634�body�ٸ里德-所罗门码是一类纠错码，用多项式在多点取值来编码，能纠正一段连续错误。它用于光盘、二维码和深空通信，使受损数据仍可恢复。وReed–Solomon codes encode data as a polynomial sampled at points, correcting burst errors; used in CDs, QR codes and deep-space comms.�ans��src��VMenezes、van Oorschot、Vanstone《Handbook of Applied Cryptography》（CRC Press）�LMenezes, van Oorschot, Vanstone, Handbook of Applied Cryptography, CRC Press��id�6606e5e8958d�body�ِ在三扇门后选一扇、主持人打开一扇空门后，换门获胜的概率会从1/3升到2/3。它反直觉地说明“换”更划算。�kIn the Monty Hall problem, switching doors after a goat is revealed raises win probability from 1/3 to 2/3.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�6a9976fe1703�body��*图灵机是一条无限纸带加一个按状态表读写移动的读写头，构成最小通用计算模型。丘奇-图灵论题认为任何可有效计算的函数都能被某图灵机计算，从而把直觉的可计算精确化为机械可模拟，是计算理论与复杂性分支的基石。�vA Turing machine is an infinite tape plus a read-write head that moves according to a state table, forming a minimal universal model of computation. The Church-Turing thesis holds that any effectively computable function is computable by some Turing machine, formalizing intuitive computability as mechanically simulable and underpinning computability and complexity theory.�ans��src��《计算理论导引》Sipser�;Introduction to the Theory of Computation by Michael Sipser��id�6ca3f81f5511�body�ٖPDE 含多个自变量的未知函数及其偏导数，描述热、波、扩散与电磁等现象。绝大多数物理定律都以 PDE 形式表达。٢PDEs involve functions of several variables and their partial derivatives, modeling heat, waves, diffusion and electromagnetism. Most physical laws take PDE form.�ans��src��N同济大学数学系 编,《高等数学》第7版,高等教育出版社,2014�\Tongji University Dept. of Math, Advanced Mathematics, 7th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�6cb2cbc3ca67�body�ٴ机制设计是“逆向博弈论”：先定下想要的结果（如真实报价），再设计规则使参与者出于自身利益去实现它。拍卖设计是其典型应用。ّMechanism design is reverse game theory: choose a desired outcome, then build rules so self-interested agents achieve it; used in auction design.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�6cdddfe7e225�body���拉格朗日对偶为每个原问题构造一个“对偶问题”，其对偶目标给出原问题最优值的下界，且常可轻易求得。强对偶成立时两者相等，是 SVM 的理论核心。ٔLagrange duality forms a dual problem whose value bounds the primal optimum from below; under strong duality they coincide—the theory behind SVMs.�ans��src��$《凸优化》Boyd 与 Vandenberghe�,Convex Optimization by Boyd and Vandenberghe��id�6d30fb878312�body���孪生素数猜想认为存在无穷多对相差2的质数，如(3,5)、(11,13)、(17,19)。2013年张益唐证明了存在无穷多对间隔小于7000万的质数，但“相差2”仍未证明。��The twin prime conjecture says there are infinitely many prime pairs differing by 2, e.g. (3,5),(11,13),(17,19). In 2013 Yitang Zhang proved there are infinitely many prime pairs with a gap under 70,000,000, but the gap-2 case remains open.�ans��src��[张益唐《Bounded Gaps Between Primes》，Annals of Mathematics 179(3):1121–1176, 2014�WY. Zhang, 'Bounded Gaps Between Primes', Annals of Mathematics 179(3):1121–1176, 2014��id�6d5f6039416d�body���辛几何研究带有“辛形式”的偶数维流形，是哈密顿力学的几何骨架。泊松括号 {f,g} 衡量两个物理量沿对方生成的演化，是量子对易子的经典对应。��Symplectic geometry studies even-dimensional manifolds with a symplectic form, the skeleton of Hamiltonian mechanics; the Poisson bracket {f,g} is the classical counterpart of quantum commutators.�ans��src��_Herbert Goldstein、Charles Poole 与 John Safko 著《Classical Mechanics》（经典力学）�BHerbert Goldstein, Charles Poole & John Safko, Classical Mechanics��id�6ed37d61daa9�body�ٽ有限元方法把复杂区域剖分为小单元，在每个单元上用简单函数近似解，再拼成全局解。它是工程仿真（如汽车碰撞、桥梁受力）的主力算法。٬The finite element method meshes a region into small elements, approximates the solution locally, then assembles it globally. It is the workhorse of engineering simulation.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7003547f53a7�body���矩阵是按行、列排成的矩形数表，真正的身份却是线性变换的坐标。乘法定义成行乘列再相加，是为了让两次连续变换合成一个矩阵，先做 B 再做 A 等于做 AB；相乘也因此要求前者的列数与后者的行数相等。两点易混：它一般不满足交换律，AB 与 BA 常不相等，顺序必须交代；矩阵也不是行列式，后者只是从方阵算出的一个数。��A matrix is a rectangular table of numbers arranged in rows and columns, and its real identity is the coordinate description of a linear transformation. Multiplication is defined as row against column, summed, precisely so that two transformations in a row collapse into a single matrix, doing B and then A being the same as doing AB, which is also why a product needs the columns of the first factor to match the rows of the second. Keep two things apart: the multiplication is not commutative in general, since AB and BA often differ, so the order has to be stated; and a matrix is not a determinant, the latter being just a single number computed from a square matrix.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7122f343a4b0�body�ٴ交叉验证把数据分成若干折，轮流用一部分训练、其余验证，以估计模型在未见数据上的表现。它能在不浪费数据的前提下检测过拟合。ٟCross-validation splits data into folds, training on some and testing on the rest in rotation, estimating performance on unseen data and detecting overfitting.�ans��src��ZEfron, B. 与 Hastie, T., 《计算机时代的统计推断》, Cambridge University Press�XEfron, B. & Hastie, T., 'Computer Age Statistical Inference', Cambridge University Press��id�7324188813fa�body���李雅普诺夫指数衡量相邻轨迹分离的速率：指数为正意味着微小误差会指数放大，是“对初值敏感”（混沌）的定量标志。天气“蝴蝶效应”即源于此。ٺThe Lyapunov exponent measures how fast nearby trajectories diverge; a positive value means tiny errors grow exponentially—the quantitative signature of chaos and the butterfly effect.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�74981e960d98�body�ِ它说随着试验次数增加，样本平均值会稳定地趋近于理论期望值。这正是“长期频率趋近概率”的数学依据。ٚAs trials grow, the sample average converges to the expected value. It is the mathematical justification that long-run frequencies approach probabilities.�ans��src��`Durrett《Probability: Theory and Examples》第 2 章大数定律与第 3 章中心极限定理�VRick Durrett, Probability: Theory and Examples, Chapter 2 on SLLN and Chapter 3 on CLT��id�7522d43dcbc8�body�ٓ熵衡量随机变量的不确定性或信息量，越不可预测则熵越大。它是信息论与机器学习（如决策树）的核心概念。�Entropy measures uncertainty or information content; higher when outcomes are unpredictable. Core to information theory and ML.�ans��src��FCover, T. M. & Thomas, J. A.《Elements of Information Theory》,Wiley�CCover, T. M. & Thomas, J. A., Elements of Information Theory, Wiley��id�75475fe7e288�body��,格拉姆-施密特过程逐个取出向量，减去它在已构造正交基上各方向的投影，得到彼此正交的新向量。它把任意线性无关组转化为正交甚至标准正交基，是QR分解与数值计算的基础。斯特朗与切尼、金凯德的教材都给出标准算法。�`The Gram-Schmidt process takes vectors one by one and subtracts their projections onto the already constructed orthogonal basis, yielding mutually orthogonal vectors. It turns any linearly independent set into an orthogonal or orthonormal basis and underlies QR factorization and numerical work. Strang and Cheney & Kincaid give the standard algorithm.�ans��src��JStrang《Linear Algebra》；Cheney 与 Kincaid《Numerical Mathematics》�?Strang, Linear Algebra; Cheney & Kincaid, Numerical Mathematics��id�77ab240e0eea�body�ٷ它是描述捕食者与猎物数量互作的微分方程组：猎物增长被捕食压制，捕食者随猎物增多而增长。它解释了种群围绕平衡点的周期性振荡。ٖThe Lotka–Volterra equations model predator–prey dynamics, producing oscillatory cycles around equilibrium—a foundation of mathematical ecology.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�7ca0ea03c719�body��T模态逻辑在“真/假”之外加入算子 □（必然）与 ◇（可能），并引入“可能世界”语义：□P 表示“在所有可达的可能世界 P 都真”，◇P 表示“在某一可能世界 P 真”。它用于哲学、程序验证与知识表示（如“知道”“相信”），是命题逻辑的自然推广。�;Modal logic adds operators □ (necessarily) and ◇ (possibly) beyond true/false, with 'possible-world' semantics: □P means P holds in all accessible worlds, ◇P in some world. Used in philosophy, program verification, and knowledge representation (knowing, believing), it naturally extends propositional logic.�ans��src��WBlackburn, P., de Rijke, M., Venema, Y., 《模态逻辑》, Cambridge University Press�RBlackburn, P., de Rijke, M., Venema, Y., 'Modal Logic', Cambridge University Press��id�7cbef770d743�body�ِ亏格直观地是曲面上的“洞数”：球面亏格0，环面亏格1，双孔甜甜圈亏格2。它是最重要的拓扑不变量之一。ْGenus is roughly the number of holes: a sphere has genus 0, a torus 1, a two-holed torus 2. It is among the most important topological invariants.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7f139913b491�body�ٷ对多面体，欧拉示性数 χ = V − E + F（顶点减棱加面），对凸多面体恒为2。它推广到曲面后成为拓扑不变量，能区分不同形状的“洞数”。٭For a polyhedron, χ = V − E + F (vertices minus edges plus faces) is always 2 for convex ones. Generalized to surfaces, it becomes a topological invariant counting holes.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8078b51bd025�body�٢反向传播就是多元链式法则的工程化：从输出层往回逐层计算损失对各参数的梯度。它让深层网络能用梯度下降高效训练。ٗBackpropagation is the multivariate chain rule in engineering form, propagating gradients of the loss backward so deep nets train via gradient descent.�ans��src��3《深度学习》Goodfellow、Bengio 与 Courville�0Deep Learning by Goodfellow Bengio and Courville��id�83eacb8ad7f4�body��1逻辑斯蒂方程在指数增长项上乘以一个随密度上升而下降的因子，使增长率在接近环境容纳量时趋于零。它产生S形增长曲线，避免了无限膨胀，是生态建模的基础。韦尔赫斯特1838年的论文与默里的《数学生物学》给出了经典推导。�UThe logistic equation multiplies the exponential growth term by a factor that declines as density rises, driving the growth rate to zero near the carrying capacity. It yields an S-shaped curve that avoids unbounded expansion and is foundational in ecology. Verhulst's 1838 paper and Murray's Mathematical Biology give the classic derivation.�ans��src��LVerhulst《Notice sur la loi》（1838）；Murray《Mathematical Biology》�@Verhulst, Notice sur la loi (1838); Murray, Mathematical Biology��id�84ee2d9c7cf4�body�٢它把一个事件的概率按一组互斥且完备的情形分解求和：P(A) = Σ P(A|B_i)P(B_i)。它是计算复杂概率与推导贝叶斯公式的桥梁。ٗIt breaks an event's probability across mutually exclusive, exhaustive cases: P(A)=Σ P(A|B_i)P(B_i). It links complex probabilities to Bayes' theorem.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�852a9df576c5�body���它要求策略即使在每个参与者都“以极小概率手抖犯错的”扰动下，仍是最优反应。它排除了那些依赖对手“绝不出错”的脆弱纳什均衡，使预测更稳健。٩It requires a strategy to remain optimal even if every player 'trembles' with tiny probability; it rules out fragile Nash equilibria that rely on opponents never erring.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�85ee0a17351d�body���JPEG 把图像切成 8×8 小块，对每块做 DCT，把像素值变成一组“频率系数”：低频系数承载整体明暗、高频系数承载细微边缘。人眼对高频不敏感，于是可大幅量化并丢弃高频系数，再用之字形扫描与熵编码压缩。DCT 能量集中、实数运算快，且边界不引入明显振铃，因而取代傅里叶成为图像标准。��JPEG splits an image into 8×8 blocks and applies the DCT to each, converting pixels into frequency coefficients: low frequencies carry overall brightness, high frequencies carry fine edges. Since human eyes are insensitive to high frequencies, those coefficients are heavily quantized and dropped, then zig-zag scanned and entropy-coded. The DCT concentrates energy, uses fast real arithmetic, and avoids visible boundary ringing, so it became the image standard over the Fourier transform.�ans��src�وWallace, G. K.,《The JPEG still picture compression standard》,IEEE Transactions on Consumer Electronics,1992 (DOI: 10.1109/30.125072)نWallace, G. K., 'The JPEG still picture compression standard', IEEE Transactions on Consumer Electronics, 1992, DOI: 10.1109/30.125072��id�8794b0983fe8�body�ٟ递推关系用前几项定义后面的项，如斐波那契数列 F_n = F_{n-1} + F_{n-2}。许多自然与算法问题都可用递推建模并求解通项。٫A recurrence defines later terms from earlier ones, e.g. the Fibonacci rule F_n = F_{n-1} + F_{n-2}. Many natural and algorithmic problems are modeled and solved this way.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�8bcc913031a2�body�٨拓扑空间由一个集合与一组满足特定公理的“开集”构成，用来定义连续、邻近等概念而不依赖距离。它是现代拓扑学的起点。ٮA topological space is a set with a collection of 'open sets' obeying axioms, defining continuity and nearness without distances. It is the starting point of modern topology.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8c3f8b82d119�body�ٙ对任意向量 u、v，有 |⟨u,v⟩| ≤ ‖u‖·‖v‖，即内积不超过长度之积。它是众多不等式与概率、几何结论的根源。٪For any vectors u, v, |⟨u,v⟩| ≤ ‖u‖·‖v‖: the inner product can't exceed the product of lengths. It underlies many inequalities in probability and geometry.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�8e45d42b86b3�body�ْp值是假设检验中“在零假设成立时观察到当前结果或更极端结果”的概率。p值很小，就更倾向于拒绝零假设。فThe p-value is the probability, under the null hypothesis, of results at least as extreme; a small p suggests rejecting the null.�ans��src��CCasella, G. 与 Berger, R. L., 《统计推断》(第2版), Duxbury�GCasella, G. & Berger, R. L., 'Statistical Inference' (2nd ed.), Duxbury��id�8ea75ae6d048�body�ٿ核技巧不显式地把数据映射到高维，而是用核函数 K(x,y)=⟨φ(x),φ(y)⟩ 直接算高维内积，从而在高维空间做线性分类（SVM）而无需承受维度灾难。٥The kernel trick uses K(x,y)=⟨φ(x),φ(y)⟩ to compute high-dimensional inner products implicitly, enabling linear separation in high dimensions without the cost.�ans��src��!《机器学习》（周志华）�Machine Learning (Zhou Zhihua)��id�9023867257ca�body���群是一个带二元运算的集合，满足封闭性、结合律、有单位元且每个元素有逆元。例如整数在加法下构成群，它是现代代数研究对称性的基本语言。ٵA group is a set with a binary operation that is closed, associative, has an identity and inverses. Integers under addition form a group; groups are the basic language for symmetry.�ans��src��《近世代数》刘绍学�$Abstract Algebra by Dummit and Foote��id�9159e4dd5098�body�ٓ用平面去截一个双圆锥，得到的曲线包括圆、椭圆、抛物线和双曲线。它们在天体轨道和光学中都有重要应用。�wSlicing a double cone with a plane yields circles, ellipses, parabolas and hyperbolas; they describe orbits and optics.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�924a77736ba1�body�ٿFFT 把离散傅里叶变换的计算量从 O(n²) 降到 O(n log n)，通过分治把信号分解为奇偶半。它是数字信号、图像压缩与卷积神经网络加速的底层引擎。ُThe FFT computes the discrete Fourier transform in O(n log n) via divide-and-conquer, powering digital signal processing, compression and CNNs.�ans��src��《算法导论》Cormen 等�?Introduction to Algorithms by Cormen Leiserson Rivest and Stein��id�94a88f33eb0c�body��Dp 进数把两个数 x, y 的距离定义为 |x−y|_p = p^(−k)，其中 k 是 x−y 含有因子 p 的幂次；越能被 p 整除，距离越近。这给出了与实数截然不同的“拓扑”，使整除性成为邻近性的度量，在数论与代数几何（如费马大定理的模形式证明）中极为关键。�EThe p-adic distance sets |x−y|_p = p^(−k), where k is the power of p dividing x−y: the more divisible by p, the closer. This yields a topology opposite to the reals', making divisibility the measure of nearness, and is central to number theory and arithmetic geometry (e.g., the modular proof of Fermat's Last Theorem).�ans��src��6Gouvêa, F. Q., 《p进数导论》(第2版), Springer�EGouvêa, F. Q., 'p-adic Numbers: An Introduction' (2nd ed.), Springer��id�94d153944575�body���它在带权图上求从起点到其余各点的最短距离。做法是贪心：每轮从没定下最终距离的点里挑当前距离最小的一个钉死，再用它松弛相邻边。这一步成立的前提是边权全部非负；一旦出现负权边就可能给出错的答案，那得换 Bellman–Ford。代价看实现：朴素做法的开销随顶点数的平方增长，配最小堆只多出一个对数因子。它常被混成旅行商问题，其实后者至今没有已知的多项式算法。�xIt finds the shortest distances from a source to every other node in a weighted graph. The method is greedy: each round it fixes the unsettled vertex with the smallest current distance and relaxes its outgoing edges. That step is valid only when every edge weight is non-negative; a single negative edge can break the answer, and that is where Bellman-Ford belongs. Cost depends on implementation: the naive version grows with the square of the number of vertices, while a min-heap adds only a logarithmic factor. It often gets confused with the travelling salesman problem, which is the one with no known polynomial-time algorithm.�ans��src��《算法导论》Cormen 等�?Introduction to Algorithms by Cormen Leiserson Rivest and Stein��id�96bf64f9c313�body�ٷ内点法从可行域内部出发，沿中心路径逼近最优解，能在多项式时间内求解线性与凸规划。相比单纯形法，它对超大规模问题更稳定高效。ٓInterior-point methods move inside the feasible region toward optimality in polynomial time; more stable than the simplex method for huge problems.�ans��src��$《凸优化》Boyd 与 Vandenberghe�,Convex Optimization by Boyd and Vandenberghe��id�9797492a2d56�body���科恩用“力迫法”构造出集合论模型，在其中连续统假设为假；结合哥德尔早先构造为真的模型，说明 CH 在 ZFC 公理下既不能被证明也不能被否定。نCohen's forcing builds a model where the continuum hypothesis is false; with Gödel's model where it's true, CH is independent of ZFC.�ans��src��,Jech《Set Theory》；Kunen《Set Theory》�#Jech, Set Theory; Kunen, Set Theory��id�97c506b2158c�body��<柯西序列指任意靠后的项彼此任意接近的序列；实数系的完备性正是说每个柯西序列都收敛到实数。有理数系不满足这一点，例如逼近根号2的有理数列在有理数内无极限。鲁丁与阿波斯托尔的《数学分析》都把它作为实数公理的等价刻画。�A Cauchy sequence is one whose terms become arbitrarily close to each other far enough along; the completeness of the reals is exactly that every Cauchy sequence converges to a real. The rationals fail this, as a rational sequence approaching the square root of 2 has no rational limit. Rudin and Apostol's Mathematical Analysis use it as an equivalent characterization of the reals.�ans��src��BRudin《数学分析原理》；Apostol《Mathematical Analysis》�JRudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis; Apostol, Mathematical Analysis��id�999f0c9b5a09�body�ٽ格密码的安全性基于高维格中“最短向量问题（SVP）”的难解性，而目前没有已知的量子算法能高效求解它。因此它是后量子密码的主要候选。٪Lattice-based crypto relies on the hardness of the shortest vector problem, for which no efficient quantum algorithm is known, making it a leading post-quantum candidate.�ans��src��[Hoffstein, J., Pipher, J., Silverman, J. H., 《数学密码学导引》(第2版), Springer�oHoffstein, J., Pipher, J., Silverman, J. H., 'An Introduction to Mathematical Cryptography' (2nd ed.), Springer��id�9c206a729d84�body��8洛必达法则针对零比零或无穷比无穷的极限，当分子分母分别可导且分母导数不为零时，可用两者导数的比替代。其依据是柯西中值定理，本质上比较了函数在趋近点附近的局部线性近似。鲁丁在《数学分析原理》中给出了严格的证明。�xL'Hôpital's rule applies to limits of the form 0/0 or ∞/∞, and when numerator and denominator are differentiable with a nonzero denominator derivative, the ratio of derivatives replaces the original. It rests on Cauchy's mean value theorem and compares local linear approximations near the limit point. Rudin gives a rigorous proof in Principles of Mathematical Analysis.�ans��src��^Rudin《数学分析原理（Principles of Mathematical Analysis）》；Stewart《Calculus》�=Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis; Stewart, Calculus��id�9d034602e9c7�body��>分圆多项式 Φₙ(x) 是其本原 n 次单位根的最小整系数多项式，其次数等于欧拉函数 φ(n)。高斯证明：正 n 边形可用尺规作出的充要条件是 n 为 2 的幂与若干互异费马素数之积，而分圆域 Q(ζₙ) 的次数 φ(n) 的 2 幂性正是这一判据的代数核心。��The nth cyclotomic polynomial Φₙ(x) is the minimal integer polynomial whose roots are the primitive nth roots of unity, and its degree is Euler's totient φ(n). Gauss showed a regular n-gon is constructible with straightedge and compass exactly when n is a power of two times distinct Fermat primes, and the 2-power nature of the cyclotomic field degree φ(n) is the algebraic heart of that criterion.�ans��src��2Apostol, T. M., 《解析数论导引》, Springer�BApostol, T. M., 'Introduction to Analytic Number Theory', Springer��id�9d41d21e04a3�body�٨置信区间给出未知参数一个可能的取值范围，并附置信水平（如95%）。它表达的是估计的不确定性，而非参数落在区间的概率。�yA confidence interval gives a plausible range for a parameter with a level (e.g. 95%), expressing estimation uncertainty.�ans��src��CCasella, G. 与 Berger, R. L., 《统计推断》(第2版), Duxbury�GCasella, G. & Berger, R. L., 'Statistical Inference' (2nd ed.), Duxbury��id�a0e356b8030f�body�ٹ它用几何布朗运动为期权定价，给出欧式看涨期权的封闭公式，核心变量是股价、行权价、期限、利率与波动率。1997 年获诺贝尔经济学奖。٭The Black–Scholes formula prices European options via geometric Brownian motion, depending on price, strike, time, rate and volatility; it won the 1997 Nobel in Economics.�ans��src�٪F. Black 与 M. Scholes《期权定价与公司负债》,Journal of Political Economy,1973 年;同期 R. C. Merton《理性期权定价理论》,Bell Journal of Economics��F. Black & M. Scholes, "The Pricing of Options and Corporate Liabilities," Journal of Political Economy, 1973; companion R. C. Merton, "Theory of Rational Option Pricing," Bell Journal of Economics, 1973��id�a2bd1fc7d1c2�body�ٿ大基数是一类“极大”无穷基数（如不可达基数、可测基数），其存在性强到无法在标准 ZFC 中证明。它们构成集合论中衡量“强公理”的阶梯。٩Large cardinals (inaccessible, measurable, …) are 'very large' infinities whose existence can't be proved in ZFC; they form a hierarchy of strong set-theoretic axioms.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a67025fb92c4�body��帕斯卡三角形中第n行第k个数恰好是二项式展开里x的k次方的系数，即组合数。它把代数中的二项式定理与组合数递推直观对应，相邻两项相加生成下一行。克努特与格雷厄姆等的《具体数学》详述了这一关系。�;In Pascal's triangle the kth entry of row n is exactly the coefficient of x to the k in the binomial expansion, a combination number. It visually matches the binomial theorem with the recurrence that neighboring entries sum to form the next row. Knuth and Graham et al. in Concrete Mathematics detail this relation.�ans��src��kKnuth《The Art of Computer Programming, Vol. 1》；Graham、Knuth 与 Patashnik《Concrete Mathematics》�_Knuth, The Art of Computer Programming, Vol. 1; Graham, Knuth & Patashnik, Concrete Mathematics��id�ae423ba0f21f�body�ٽ凸优化在凸集上最小化凸函数；它的任何局部最优都是全局最优，因而高效可解。机器学习的大量训练问题都可写成凸优化（或近似凸）形式。ٓConvex optimization minimizes a convex function over a convex set; every local minimum is global, making it efficiently solvable and central to ML.�ans��src��$《凸优化》Boyd 与 Vandenberghe�,Convex Optimization by Boyd and Vandenberghe��id�b1e81b3b8923�body�ٟ肖尔算法在量子计算机上能高效分解大整数和求离散对数，从而破解 RSA 与 ECC。这推动了对“后量子密码”的紧急研究。٘Shor's algorithm factors integers and solves discrete logs efficiently on a quantum computer, breaking RSA and ECC—spurring post-quantum cryptography.�ans��src��[Hoffstein, J., Pipher, J., Silverman, J. H., 《数学密码学导引》(第2版), Springer�oHoffstein, J., Pipher, J., Silverman, J. H., 'An Introduction to Mathematical Cryptography' (2nd ed.), Springer��id�b4908ce6634f�body�ٱVC 维衡量一个分类模型家族的“表达能力”：能打散的最大样本点数。它给出泛化误差的理论上界，解释为什么模型太复杂会过拟合。َVC dimension measures a hypothesis class's capacity—the largest set it can shatter; it bounds generalization error and explains overfitting.�ans��src��!《机器学习》（周志华）�Machine Learning (Zhou Zhihua)��id�b5852f5bee2f�body�ٓ康托尔用构造“对角线”新数的方法证明实数比自然数多，即实数不可数。它是现代集合论与无穷层级的开端。ٵCantor proved reals outnumber naturals by constructing a new number differing from each listed one on the diagonal—reals are uncountable. It launched the theory of infinite sizes.�ans��src��wCantor, G. (1891). 《论集合论中的一个基本问题》. 德国数学会年报 (Jahresbericht der DMV), 1, 75-78.يCantor, G. (1891). Über eine elementare Frage der Mannigfaltigkeitslehre. Jahresbericht der Deutschen Mathematiker-Vereinigung, 1, 75-78.��id�b7ff84d1c1cf�body�ٺ康托尔集通过不断去掉线段中段三分之一得到，结果是一个总长度为零却含有不可数多个点的“灰尘”。它展示了无穷与测度的反直觉性质。ٱThe Cantor set is built by repeatedly removing middle thirds; it has total length zero yet uncountably many points. It reveals counterintuitive facts about infinity and measure.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�bbb6685a8b04�body�ٓ连通图指任意两点间都有路径；割点是删去后使图不再连通的顶点。衡量连通性强弱是网络可靠性分析的核心。ٟA connected graph has a path between any two vertices; a cut vertex breaks connectivity when removed. Measuring connectivity is central to network reliability.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�bfa8d63455cf�body��5群表示是把群元素映为线性空间上可逆矩阵的同态，从而用矩阵运算研究抽象群。对称群的不可约表示可分解分子的振动模式：通过表示的直和分解，能判别哪些振动模式是红外或拉曼活性的，这正是群论在化学与物理中的典型应用。�tA group representation is a homomorphism from a group into the invertible matrices on a vector space, letting one study abstract groups via matrix algebra. Irreducible representations of symmetric groups decompose molecular vibration modes; the decomposition reveals which modes are infrared or Raman active, a classic application of group theory in chemistry and physics.�ans��src��0《群论在物理问题中的应用》Hamermesh�BGroup Theory and Its Application to Physical Problems by Hamermesh��id�c2c6db7e5743�body�ٟ平面图是能画在平面上而边不相交的图。库拉托夫斯基定理刻画了哪些图是平面的，平面图的着色正是四色定理的背景。٩A planar graph can be drawn on a plane with no crossing edges. Kuratowski's theorem characterizes planar graphs; their coloring is the setting of the four-color theorem.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c352ff9606e8�body��格林与陶哲轩在 2008 年证明：素数序列中包含任意长的等差数列，也就是说无论你想要多长的等间隔素数串都存在。该结果把加性组合学（特别是 Szemerédi 定理）与素数分布联系起来，说明素数并非完全随机散布。�DGreen and Tao proved in 2008 that the primes contain arithmetic progressions of arbitrary length, so no matter how long an evenly spaced run of primes you ask for, one exists. The proof transplants Szemerédi's theorem on dense sets into the primes via additive combinatorics, showing the primes are not merely random noise.�ans��src��_Green, B. 与 Tao, T., 《素数含任意长等差数列》, Annals of Mathematics 167(2), 2008�vGreen, B. & Tao, T., 'The primes contain arbitrarily long arithmetic progressions', Annals of Mathematics 167(2), 2008��id�c896259a8112�body���在重复囚徒困境中，ZD 策略利用矩阵行列式为零的性质，能强行把自己的收益与对手收益按固定比例绑定，甚至“迫使”对手接受不利分配。它改写了人们对合作的认识。ٷIn the repeated prisoner's dilemma, ZD strategies use a zero determinant to unilaterally enforce a fixed linear relation between one's payoff and the opponent's—even extorting them.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c9876ada2bbc�body���杨-米尔斯理论是描述强相互作用（量子色动力学）的规范场论。其“质量缺口”问题要求严格证明真空与最低激发态之间存在正的能量间隔，是千禧年难题之一。٢Yang–Mills theory underlies the strong force; the mass gap problem asks to rigorously prove a positive energy gap above the vacuum—a Millennium Prize problem.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�caafd7470a78�body�٥它说大量独立同分布随机变量的平均值近似服从正态分布，无论原分布是什么。这是统计推断与许多自然现象呈钟形的原因。ٕThe average of many independent samples approaches a normal distribution regardless of the original one—why bell curves appear and inference works.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�cbc8a7805302�body��费马小定理指出若p为素数且a不被p整除，则a的p-1次方模p等于一。它提供了快速检验幂的同余关系，并是大整数分解相关密码体制的数学基础之一。哈代与赖特以及尼文等人的数论教材都把它作为核心结论。�,Fermat's little theorem states that if p is prime and a is not divisible by p, then a to the power p-1 is congruent to 1 modulo p. It gives a quick test for power congruences and underlies parts of public-key cryptography based on factoring. Hardy & Wright and Niven et al. treat it as a core result.�ans��src�ُHardy 与 Wright《An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers》；Niven、Zuckerman 与 Montgomery《An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers》فHardy & Wright, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers; Niven, Zuckerman & Montgomery, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers��id�cbc8b5fdef87�body�ٖ很多方程无法写出精确解，数值方法用近似算法在计算机上求足够精确的解，如牛顿迭代求根、有限差分解方程。ٓWhen exact formulas fail, numerical methods compute accurate approximations, e.g. Newton's iteration for roots or finite differences for equations.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�cc54e92859dc�body���范畴由“对象”和它们之间的“态射”组成并满足复合律；函子是保持结构的范畴间映射；自然变换是函子间的“映射的映射”。范畴论为数学提供统一的语言。ٳA category has objects and morphisms with composition; a functor maps categories preserving structure; a natural transformation maps functors. Category theory unifies mathematics.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ccf7269cdcd5�body��5泰勒级数把光滑函数在某点展开为以各阶导数为系数的无穷多项式，函数与该多项式的误差由余项控制。当级数收敛到函数时，它让复杂的超越函数可用多项式近似计算。阿波斯托尔与哈代的教材都强调收敛半径决定近似的有效范围。�sA Taylor series expands a smooth function into an infinite polynomial whose coefficients are its derivatives at a point, with the error controlled by a remainder term. When the series converges to the function, it lets intractable transcendental functions be approximated by polynomials. Apostol and Hardy stress that the radius of convergence sets the range of validity.�ans��src��?Apostol《Calculus》；Hardy《A Course of Pure Mathematics》�6Apostol, Calculus; Hardy, A Course of Pure Mathematics��id�d013adfa3134�body�ٙ重心是图形在均匀材质下平衡的支点，也是三角形三条中线的交点。均匀三角形的重心位于每条中线的三分之二处。�~The centroid is the balance point of a uniform shape, the intersection of a triangle's medians, located 2/3 along each median.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d026b9190340�body�٫反复用较大数除以较小数并取余数，直到余数为0，最后的除数即最大公约数。例如 GCD(48,18): 48=2×18+12, 18=1×12+6, 12=2×6+0，故 GCD=6。ٴRepeatedly replace (a,b) with (b, a mod b) until remainder 0; the last nonzero remainder is the GCD. For 48 and 18: 48 = 2×18 + 12, 18 = 1×12 + 6, 12 = 2×6 + 0, so the GCD is 6.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d1a35f4ef30d�body�٣φ(n) 表示不超过 n 且与 n 互质的正整数个数。例如 φ(9)=6，φ(p)=p−1 当 p 为质数。它在欧拉定理 a^φ(n) ≡ 1 (mod n) 中起作用。�lφ(n) counts integers up to n coprime to n; e.g. φ(9)=6. It appears in Euler's theorem a^φ(n)≡1 (mod n).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�d44a73da3b4f�body��~梯度 ∇f 是多变量函数增长最快的方向与速率的向量。在地形图上，梯度指向最陡的上坡方向。�~The gradient ∇f is a vector pointing in the direction of steepest increase of a function; like the steepest uphill on a map.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�d601fa2cde5d�body��3布劳威尔不动点定理说，从闭圆盘（或更一般的凸紧集）到自身的连续映射必存在不动点。它意味着搅拌咖啡时总有一点最终回到原位，也支撑经济学均衡存在性的证明。布劳威尔在1911年的论文与芒克斯的拓扑教材给出了严格叙述。�hBrouwer's fixed-point theorem says a continuous map from a closed disk, or more generally a convex compact set, to itself must have a fixed point. It implies that stirring a cup of coffee always leaves some point returning to its start and underpins existence proofs of economic equilibria. Brouwer's 1911 paper and Munkres's topology text state it rigorously.�ans��src��@Brouwer《Über Abbildungen》（1911）；Munkres《Topology》�4Brouwer, Über Abbildungen (1911); Munkres, Topology��id�d7c98fef4478�body��N平面上只靠平移、旋转、反射、滑反射四种等距变换重复的图案，本质上只有 17 种对称类型，称为 17 个壁纸群。这是由二维空间等距群的代数结构决定的（晶体学限制使旋转角只能是 60°、90°、120°、180°），完整分类由费多洛夫等人于 19 世纪末完成。��Planar patterns repeated by the four isometries—translation, rotation, reflection, glide reflection—fall into exactly 17 symmetry types, the 17 wallpaper groups. This is forced by the algebra of the plane's isometry group (the crystallographic restriction limits rotation angles to 60°, 90°, 120°, 180°), and the full classification was completed by Fedorov and others in the late 19th century.�ans��src��GGrünbaum, B. 与 Shephard, G. C., 《镶嵌与图案》, W. H. Freeman�FGrünbaum, B. & Shephard, G. C., 'Tilings and Patterns', W. H. Freeman��id�dc87950e28fd�body�ٯp-hacking 指不断尝试分组、变量或截止线直到得到显著 p 值（如 <0.05）的做法。它让假阳性率飙升，是“可重复性危机”的重要来源。ىp-hacking tries many cuts/variables until p<0.05 appears; it inflates false positives and is a major cause of the reproducibility crisis.�ans��src�٤Open Science Collaboration（2015）《Science》重复百项心理学研究；Simmons、Nelson 与 Simonsohn（2011）《Psychological Science》假阳性心理学ٻOpen Science Collaboration (2015), Science, Estimating the reproducibility of psychological science; Simmons, Nelson and Simonsohn (2011), Psychological Science, False-positive psychology��id�df4861cd182a�body���最优传输研究把一堆质量（如概率分布）以最小“搬运成本”移到另一堆的最优方式，对应蒙日-安培方程。它在图像对齐、生成模型（Wasserstein GAN）中很热。ّOptimal transport finds the cheapest way to move one probability mass to another (Monge–Ampère); used in image alignment and Wasserstein GANs.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e2a93c79e5a8�body�٣小波用可缩放的“小波”基同时捕捉信号的时间与频率局部特征，优于傅里叶的全局表示。它用于 JPEG2000 图像压缩与去噪。ٝWavelets use scalable basis functions to capture both time and frequency locality, beating Fourier's global view. Used in JPEG2000 compression and denoising.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e36f023ad8da�body��#散度定理说明一个体积区域上向量场散度的体积分，等于该向量场穿过区域边界外侧面的通量积分。它把局部源汇的累积与整体流出量挂钩，是流体与电磁学中的基本工具。阿波斯托尔与马斯登的教材都给出了标准证明。�\The divergence theorem states that the volume integral of a vector field's divergence over a region equals the flux of that field through the region's outer boundary. It ties the accumulation of local sources and sinks to the total outward flow and is fundamental in fluid and electromagnetic theory. Apostol and Marsden present the standard proof.�ans��src��GApostol《Calculus, Vol. 2》；Marsden 与 Tromba《Vector Calculus》�<Apostol, Calculus, Vol. 2; Marsden & Tromba, Vector Calculus��id�e79f9f2e460a�body��5因式分解把多项式拆成低次不可约因子的乘积，每一个一次因子对应一个根，由代数基本定理保证复数域上完全可分解。它把求根问题与结构分析联系起来，是编码与方程求解的基础。杜米特与富特以及范德瓦尔登的著作都系统论述。�gFactorization splits a polynomial into products of lower-degree irreducible factors, each linear factor corresponding to a root, fully guaranteed over the complex numbers by the fundamental theorem of algebra. It links root-finding with structural analysis and underlies coding and equation solving. Dummit & Foote and van der Waerden treat it systematically.�ans��src��EDummit 与 Foote《Abstract Algebra》；van der Waerden《Algebra》�:Dummit & Foote, Abstract Algebra; van der Waerden, Algebra��id�ef012f10755c�body�ٛ蒙特卡洛方法用大量随机采样来估计复杂积分或概率，例如用投点法估算π。它在金融、物理与统计计算中极为常用。ٰMonte Carlo methods estimate integrals or probabilities by heavy random sampling, e.g. estimating π by throwing points. They are ubiquitous in finance, physics and statistics.�ans��src��mMetropolis, N. & Ulam, S. M.《The Monte Carlo Method》,Journal of the American Statistical Association,1953�kMetropolis, N. & Ulam, S. M., The Monte Carlo Method, Journal of the American Statistical Association, 1953��id�f0c136891c7c�body�ٚ卡迈克尔数满足对所有与其互质的 a 都有 a^(n−1) ≡ 1 (mod n)，却并非质数，因此能骗过费马素性测试。最小的是 561。ـA Carmichael number n satisfies a^(n−1)≡1 (mod n) for all coprime a yet is composite, fooling Fermat tests; smallest is 561.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�f21ac7baee96�body��p值是在原假设为真时，观察到当前数据或更极端数据的概率，并非原假设本身为真的概率。常见误读是把它当作效应存在或不存在的证据强度。费舍尔1925年的方法与卡塞拉、伯杰的教材都强调其条件性。�FA p-value is the probability, under the null hypothesis, of seeing the observed data or something more extreme, not the probability that the null itself is true. A common misuse is treating it as the strength of evidence for or against an effect. Fisher's 1925 method and Casella & Berger's text stress its conditional nature.�ans��src��nFisher《Statistical Methods for Research Workers》（1925）；Casella 与 Berger《Statistical Inference》�`Fisher, Statistical Methods for Research Workers (1925); Casella & Berger, Statistical Inference��id�f4c3cc415940�body��n它表明任意凸多面体的顶点数V、棱数E与面数F满足 V−E+F=2。例如立方体：8−12+6=2。�SEuler's formula V−E+F=2 holds for any convex polyhedron, e.g. a cube: 8−12+6=2.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�f529d7ebf098�body���回归分析是给变量间的关系配一条能算的线：先假设因变量随自变量怎样变，再调参数让预测与观测整体最接近，常用最小二乘，即把各点竖直偏差的平方和调到最小。平方让偏得远的点更吃重，代价是个别异常值就能把线拖走。它给出自变量每增一个单位时因变量平均变多少，如用身高估体重；但它只描述共同变化，不证明因果，向样本范围外推也不可靠。��Regression fits a calculable line to the relationship between variables: you propose how a dependent variable responds to the explanatory variables, then tune the parameters so that predictions match the observations as closely as possible overall, the standard choice being least squares, which drives the sum of the squared vertical deviations of the points to its minimum. Squaring puts heavier weight on the points that miss badly, and the price is that a few outliers can drag the whole line. What it delivers is the average change in the outcome for each unit change in the input, as when height is used to estimate weight; but it describes covariation only, it cannot prove cause, and extrapolating beyond the range the sample covers is unreliable.�ans��src��zLegendre《Nouvelles méthodes》（1805）；Gauss《Theoria Motus》（1809）；Weisberg《Applied Linear Regression》�fLegendre, Nouvelles méthodes (1805); Gauss, Theoria Motus (1809); Weisberg, Applied Linear Regression��id�f7ac87dc516f�body���超越数是不能作为任何整系数多项式方程根的实数或复数，如 π 和 e。与之相对的是代数数。林德曼证明 π 是超越数，从而肯定“化圆为方”不可能用尺规完成。��A transcendental number is not a root of any nonzero polynomial with integer coefficients, like π and e. Lindemann proved π transcendental, settling that squaring the circle by ruler and compass is impossible.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�fbb35b77fd45�body�و多项式的次数是其最高次项的指数。例如 3x² + 2x + 1 的次数是2。它决定图像大致形状与根的个数上界。�oThe degree is the highest exponent; 3x²+2x+1 has degree 2, bounding the number of roots and shaping the graph.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�fbbf007788cf�body��'卡迈克尔函数 λ(n) 给出使 a^λ(n) ≡ 1 (mod n) 对所有与 n 互素的 a 成立的最小指数，它总是整除欧拉函数 φ(n)。在 RSA 中，用 λ(n) 计算解密指数能得到更小、同样正确的密钥，因为它刻画的是群 (Z/nZ)× 的精确指数（最大阶）。�BCarmichael's function λ(n) is the smallest exponent for which a^λ(n) ≡ 1 (mod n) for every a coprime to n, and it always divides Euler's φ(n). In RSA, computing the private exponent modulo λ(n) yields a smaller yet valid key because λ(n) is exactly the exponent (maximum order) of the multiplicative group modulo n.�ans��src��VMenezes、van Oorschot、Vanstone《Handbook of Applied Cryptography》（CRC Press）�LMenezes, van Oorschot, Vanstone, Handbook of Applied Cryptography, CRC Press��id�math_24_004�body���因为数学给「顺向容易、逆向极难」提供了严格实例。RSA 把两个大质数相乘作为公开钥匙,乘法任何人瞬间完成;但要从几百位长的乘积反推这两个质数,已知最好的通用算法在经典计算机上耗时随位数超多项增长,2048位密钥按现有估算所需时间远超宇宙年龄（普遍给出10^12年以上量级）。解密的私钥则利用费马-欧拉定理构造,只有掌握质数因子的持有者才能算出。整个体系的安全性押注在「大数分解实际不可行」这一计算复杂性事实上,而非保密算法——算法是公开的,难的是数学本身。��Mathematics provides a rigorous easy-forward, hard-backward task. RSA publishes the product of two large primes as its public key; multiplication takes anyone an instant, but recovering those factors from a 300-digit product grows super-polynomially with size — for 2048-bit keys, current estimates put the required time far beyond the age of the universe (order 10^12 years or more). The private key exploits Fermat-Euler modular arithmetic available only to whoever holds the factors. Security rests on the computational-infeasibility of factoring, not on hiding the algorithm, which is fully public — what is hard is the mathematics itself.�ans��src�ِRivest、Shamir 与 Adleman,《A Method for Obtaining Digital Signatures and Public-Key Cryptosystems》,Communications of the ACM 第21卷,1978ْR. L. Rivest, A. Shamir and L. Adleman, A Method for Obtaining Digital Signatures and Public-Key Cryptosystems, Communications of the ACM 21, 1978��id�0172f9411fd6�body���纳什均衡由约翰·纳什提出：在一个多人博弈中，若每个参与者在他人策略既定下都无法通过单方面改变策略而获益，则这组策略构成纳什均衡。它是一种「僵局」式的稳定状态，未必最优却难以偏离。博弈论由此广泛应用于经济学、进化生物学和国际冲突分析，纳什因此获 1994 年诺贝尔经济学奖。�bProposed by John Nash, a Nash equilibrium is a set of strategies where no player can benefit by unilaterally changing their own, given others' choices. It is a stable 'stalemate' that need not be optimal but is hard to leave. Game theory thus informs economics, evolutionary biology, and conflict analysis, earning Nash the 1994 Nobel Prize in Economics.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�01ca80857ac4�body�٢拓扑学研究图形在连续拉伸、弯曲（不撕裂、不粘连）下保持不变的性质。幽默说法是“甜甜圈和咖啡杯是同一种形状”。نTopology studies properties preserved under continuous stretching/bending (no cutting), jokingly treating a donut and mug as the same.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�039a2a42956c�body�� 密码学哈希把任意长度输入映射为固定长度输出，需满足确定性、快速计算、抗碰撞（难找两输入同输出）与单向性（由输出难反推输入）。由于输出空间远小于输入空间且映射高度混合，逆向需穷举，计算上不可行。�fA cryptographic hash maps arbitrary input to fixed-length output, requiring determinism, efficiency, collision resistance (hard to find two inputs with the same output), and one-wayness (hard to recover input from output). Since the output space is much smaller than the input space and the mapping is highly mixed, inversion requires infeasible brute force.�ans��src��《应用密码学》Schneier�&Applied Cryptography by Bruce Schneier��id�044b017c3880�body�ٓ正态分布呈对称的钟形，中间高、两端低，由均值和标准差决定。很多自然现象（如身高）近似服从正态分布。ًThe normal distribution is a symmetric bell shape set by its mean and standard deviation; many traits like height are approximately normal.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�055acadf8036�body�ٜ混沌系统对初值极度敏感：微小差别会指数级放大，导致长期不可预测，即“蝴蝶效应”。洛伦兹吸引子是经典例子。ٿChaotic systems are exquisitely sensitive to initial conditions, so tiny differences amplify and defy long-term prediction—the butterfly effect. The Lorenz attractor is the classic example.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�067352b15e76�body���高斯曲率是曲面在一点的两个主曲率的乘积 $K=\kappa_1\kappa_2$。球面半径 R 的两个主曲率均为 $1/R$，故 $K=1/R^2>0$，说明球面在每点都向同侧弯曲，是局部凸的正曲率曲面。�Gaussian curvature is the product of the two principal curvatures at a point, $K=\kappa_1\kappa_2$. For a sphere of radius R both principal curvatures equal $1/R$, so $K=1/R^2>0$, meaning the sphere bends the same way in all directions and is locally positively curved.�ans��src��《微分几何》do Carmo�8Differential Geometry of Curves and Surfaces by do Carmo��id�06985b89009f�body�ٗγ≈0.5772，是调和级数 H_n 与 ln n 的差的极限：γ=lim(H_n−ln n)。它出现在数论和积分中，但是否是有理数至今未知。ٓγ≈0.5772 is the limit of H_n−ln n (harmonic minus log). It appears in number theory and integrals, yet whether it is rational remains unknown.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�09d5d905edb1�body��%把长为 l、间距为 d（l≤d）的平行线，随机抛下长度为 l 的针，针与某条线相交的概率恰为 2l/(πd)。因此只要大量投针、统计相交频率，就能用 π ≈ 2l/(d·频率) 反推出 π——这是最早的几何概率与蒙特卡洛方法实例之一。�&Dropping a needle of length l onto parallel lines spaced distance d apart (with l ≤ d), the probability it crosses a line is exactly 2l/(πd). Counting crossings over many trials gives π ≈ 2l/(d·frequency)—one of the earliest instances of geometric probability and a Monte Carlo method.�ans��src��KBuffon, G. L., 《道德算术随笔》(Essai d'arithmétique morale), 1777�3Buffon, G. L., 'Essai d'arithmétique morale', 1777��id�0a78aebe17a9�body��`导数描述函数在某点的瞬时变化率，几何上是曲线在该点处切线的斜率。�hA derivative gives the instantaneous rate of change of a function; geometrically it's the tangent slope.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�0c9ba6d8f02b�body���RSA 由 Rivest、Shamir 和 Adleman 于 1977 年提出，其公钥是两个大素数的乘积 n，私钥依赖把 n 分解回这两个素数。目前没有已知的高效算法能在经典计算机上分解足够大的 n，因此加密可行而解密（无密钥时）极难。它每天保护着互联网通信，但其安全性正受到量子算法（Shor 算法）的潜在威胁。��Proposed by Rivest, Shamir, and Adleman in 1977, RSA's public key is the product n of two large primes, while the private key depends on factoring n back into those primes. No efficient classical algorithm is known for factoring sufficiently large n, so encryption is easy but decryption without the key is hard. It secures everyday internet communications, though quantum algorithms (Shor's) threaten this security.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�0ce688ce67e0�body��z第二价格拍卖中，最高出价者中标但只付第二高的出价。此时无论别人报多少，你抬高自己的报价只会让你在“本不该赢”时风险变大、或“本该赢”时并不多得，所以最优策略就是按真实估值报价。维克里因此获 1996 年诺贝尔经济学奖，它也是在线广告竞价（如 Google AdWords）的基石。�qIn a second-price auction the highest bidder wins but pays the second-highest bid. Then, whatever others bid, raising your own bid only risks winning when you shouldn't (or gains nothing when you should), so the dominant strategy is to bid your true value. Vickrey won the 1996 Nobel Prize in Economics for this, and it underpins online ad auctions like Google AdWords.�ans��src��ZVickrey, W., 《投机、拍卖与竞争性密封投标》, Journal of Finance 16(1), 1961�kVickrey, W., 'Counterspeculation, Auctions, and Competitive Sealed Tenders', Journal of Finance 16(1), 1961��id�0f1334e20ce7�body��^函数 f(x,y) 的梯度 ∇f 由两个偏导数组成，它指向 f 增长最快的方向。在等高线图上，梯度始终与等高线垂直并指向海拔升高的一侧，其长度反映陡峭程度。登山认路、天气预报里的气压梯度，以及机器学习中“沿负梯度下降”的梯度下降法，都建立在这个事实上。�yThe gradient ∇f of f(x,y), assembled from the two partial derivatives, points in the direction of fastest increase of f. On a contour map the gradient is always perpendicular to the contour lines, pointing uphill, with magnitude measuring steepness. Hiking navigation, pressure gradients in weather forecasting, and gradient descent in machine learning all rest on this fact.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�0f4bc834fe33�body��44 条。只要每条新路都连接一个已经连通的点和一个新的点，4 条路就能让 5 个城市两两之间都能到达，而且没有任何多余回路。这种“连通且没有圈”的网络就是树：n 个点正好需要 n-1 条边，这是图论里最基本也最重要的结构之一。�EFour. As long as each new road joins an already-reachable city to a new one, four roads suffice to make all five cities mutually reachable with no wasted cycle. A network that is connected and has no cycles is a tree: n vertices need exactly n-1 edges. Trees are among the most basic and important structures in graph theory.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�0f7ee8d2df86�body�٨它把在随机人中特征匹配的概率误当成被告无罪时匹配的概率。要结合基础人数用贝叶斯定理，才能正确评估被告有罪的概率。ٶIt confuses the probability of a match given innocence with the probability of innocence given a match. Bayes' theorem with the base rate is needed for the correct guilt probability.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�10d47e235764�body���分形是在任意尺度下都呈现自相似细节的形状，如科赫雪花。它的“维数”往往不是整数，可用豪斯多夫维度量，海岸线就是自然界的分形例子。ٱFractals show self-similar detail at every scale, like the Koch snowflake. Their dimension is often fractional, measured by Hausdorff dimension; coastlines are natural fractals.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�13bb32a68cc7�body��q马丁格尔法靠“输后加倍”保证一回本就净赚一手本金，但每次都需要比上一次多一倍的资金；一旦遇到长连输，所需本金会超过桌限或你的全部家当，于是在有限财富下迟早被迫停手，此前累积的小赢一次清零。数学期望上它仍为零和偏负（抽水），只是把亏损推迟成大崩盘。�7The martingale recovers one unit by doubling after each loss, but each step needs double the capital; a long losing streak exhausts the table limit or your wealth, forcing you to stop and wipe out prior small gains. Its expected value stays zero or negative (house edge), merely delaying loss into a rare crash.�ans��src��[Dubins, L. E. 与 Savage, L. J., 《必败的赌博：随机过程不等式》, McGraw-Hill�nDubins, L. E. & Savage, L. J., 'How to Gamble If You Must: Inequalities for Stochastic Processes', McGraw-Hill��id�13db787aa4a5�body���在 Monty Hall 游戏中，你先选一扇门，主持人（知道门后情况）打开剩下两扇中一扇空门，问你是否换到最后一扇。你最初选中的概率只有 1/3，而奖品在「另两扇门」中的概率是 2/3；主持人排除一扇空门后，这 2/3 全集中到那扇未开的门上，因此换门赢面为 2/3。许多直觉误以为变成 1/2，正是忽略了主持人信息的非随机性。��In the Monty Hall game you pick a door, the host (who knows what's behind) opens an empty one of the other two, and asks if you switch. Your first pick has only a 1/3 chance, while the prize was in the other two doors with probability 2/3; after the host removes an empty door, that 2/3 concentrates on the remaining unopened door, so switching wins 2/3 of the time. The common intuition of 'now 1/2' ignores that the host's reveal is not random.�ans��src��d《美国统计学家》（The American Statistician，1970s）；大英百科全书（Britannica）�;The American Statistician (1970s); Encyclopaedia Britannica��id�156542aa88ae�body�ٞ一个n位数等于其各位数字的n次方之和，就是阿姆斯特朗数，如153=1³+5³+3³。三位的水仙花数只有153、370、371、407四个。ٶAn n-digit number equal to the sum of its digits each raised to the nth power is Armstrong (narcissistic); e.g., 153=1³+5³+3³. The three-digit ones are exactly 153, 370, 371, 407.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�17e730c17163�body��W莱布尼茨发明 0/1 二进制后，看到传教士寄来的《易经》六十四卦图，发现卦象阴阳两爻恰好对应 0/1 的二进制排列，便在 1703 年发表文章盛赞这是“古老中国智慧”。但卦象本为占卜符号、并非计数系统，这只是跨文化的美丽误会，却让二进制更早为人所知。�JAfter inventing 0/1 binary, Leibniz saw the I Ching's 64 hexagrams and noticed their yin-yang lines match binary 0/1 arrangements, publishing in 1703 praising it as ancient Chinese wisdom. The hexagrams were oracles, not a counting system—a beautiful cross-cultural misunderstanding that nonetheless spread binary ideas earlier.�ans��src�ْLeibniz, G. W.《Explication de l'Arithmétique Binaire》(论只用0与1的二进制算术),1703;及与白晋(Joachim Bouvet)1701—1703年通信�wG. W. Leibniz, 'Explication de l'Arithmétique Binaire' (1703); with the 1701–1703 correspondence with Joachim Bouvet��id�1b901135509d�body�ل交集是两个集合共有的元素（记作 A∩B），并集是至少属于其中一个集合的所有元素（记作 A∪B）。�VIntersection A∩B is elements common to both sets; union A∪B is elements in either.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�1cdbc32d8fd8�body��Re 是使得函数 eˣ 的导数等于自身的唯一底数，也是极限 (1 + 1/n)ⁿ 当 n→∞ 的值，由雅各布·伯努利在研究复利时首次遇到。它出现在连续增长、放射性衰变、正态分布和欧拉恒等式 e^(iπ) + 1 = 0 中，被称为「自然」对数之底。欧拉在 18 世纪系统研究了它。�e is the unique base for which the derivative of eˣ equals itself, and is the limit of (1 + 1/n)ⁿ as n→∞—first encountered by Jacob Bernoulli studying compound interest. It appears in continuous growth, radioactive decay, the normal distribution, and Euler's identity e^(iπ) + 1 = 0, as the base of 'natural' logarithms. Euler systematically studied it in the 18th century.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�1d3d16ab34bf�body��V四色定理断言：任何平面地图都可以用至多四种颜色给相邻国家着色而不重复。它由格斯里在 1852 年提出，最终由阿佩尔和哈肯在 1976 年借助计算机穷举近 2000 种不可避免构型完成证明，成为首个重大「计算机辅助证明」，也曾引发关于证明可接受性的争论。�dThe Four Color Theorem asserts that any planar map can be colored with at most four colors so that adjacent regions differ. Posed by Guthrie in 1852, it was finally proved by Appel and Haken in 1976 by computer-enumerating nearly 2000 unavoidable configurations—the first major computer-assisted proof, which sparked debate about acceptability of proofs.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�1e3d125d6780�body���调和级数每一项越来越小，但它们的和却无限增大——它发散。一个经典证明把项分组：1/3+1/4 > 1/2，1/5+…+1/8 > 1/2，依此类推，每组都超过 1/2，于是可得到任意多的「半份」使总和冲破任何界限。这与几何级数（公比小于1）的收敛形成鲜明对比，提醒我们「项趋于零」不足以保证级数收敛。�hThe harmonic series has terms shrinking toward zero, yet its sum grows without bound—it diverges. A classic proof groups terms: 1/3+1/4 > 1/2, 1/5+…+1/8 > 1/2, and so on, each group exceeding 1/2, so we can pile up arbitrarily many halves. This contrasts sharply with convergent geometric series and warns that 'terms → 0' does not guarantee convergence.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�1ff082bf621e�body��偏微分方程（PDE）的未知函数依赖多个自变量，方程中出现偏导数，如热方程 $u_t=\alpha u_{xx}$。与 ODE 只含一个自变量的导数不同，PDE 描述场随空间与时间的变化，求解常需边界与初始条件配合。�:A partial differential equation involves an unknown function of several variables with partial derivatives, such as the heat equation $u_t=\alpha u_{xx}$. Unlike an ODE, which has derivatives in one variable, a PDE describes how a field varies in space and time and typically needs boundary and initial conditions.�ans��src��《偏微分方程》Evans�2Partial Differential Equations by Lawrence C Evans��id�216df99ed330�body��N它描述温度随时间和位置的演化：∂u/∂t = α ∂²u/∂x²。二阶空间导数反映“局部凹凸”——凸的地方降温、凹的地方升温，于是方程不断把温度分布“抹平”，直到均匀。它是一类抛物型偏微分方程，扩散现象、期权定价等问题也都服从同样的结构。�dIt describes how temperature evolves with time and position: ∂u/∂t = α ∂²u/∂x². The second spatial derivative measures local concavity—humps cool and dips warm—so the equation keeps smoothing the temperature profile toward uniformity. It is a parabolic partial differential equation whose structure also governs diffusion and option pricing.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�25bc42c52ebe�body��N假设 √2=p/q 是最简分数，两边平方得 p²=2q²，于是 p² 是偶数，p 也是偶数；设 p=2k，又推出 q 也是偶数，和“最简”矛盾，所以假设不成立。据传毕达哥拉斯学派的希帕索斯最先证明了这一点，而学派坚持“万物皆数（有理数）”，无法接受这个结论。�pSuppose √2=p/q in lowest terms. Squaring gives p²=2q², so p² and hence p are even; writing p=2k then forces q to be even too, contradicting the fraction being reduced. So no such fraction exists. Legend says Hippasus of the Pythagorean school first proved this, shocking a community that held that everything is ratio (rational) — a genuine intellectual crisis.�ans��src��;《什么是数学》(柯朗)（数的扩张：无理数）�FWhat Is Mathematics? (Courant), the expansion of numbers (irrationals)��id�25eb0b71d891�body��x抽样调查是从总体中选取一部分样本进行研究，用样本结果推断整体，以节省成本和时间。�ISampling studies a subset to infer about the whole, saving cost and time.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�29ac9d9760d3�body�١一组向量若不能由其余向量的线性组合表示（即仅当系数全为0时组合才为0），则称线性无关。它是定义维数与基的基础。�qVectors are linearly independent if none is a linear combination of the others; this defines dimension and bases.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�2a816f4191f8�body���她是自学成才的法国女数学家，在数论（以‘热尔曼素数’闻名）和弹性力学上做出贡献，曾以男性化名与高斯通信。她的工作推动了费马大定理的研究。��A self-taught French mathematician, she contributed to number theory (famous for 'Germain primes') and elasticity, corresponding with Gauss under a male pseudonym. Her work advanced the study of Fermat's Last Theorem.�ans��src��rGray, M. 与 Bradley, C. E., 《索菲·热尔曼与费马大定理》, American Mathematical Monthly 106(3), 1999ُGray, M. & Bradley, C. E., 'Sophie Germain and the Proof of Fermat's Last Theorem for the Case n=5', American Mathematical Monthly 106(3), 1999��id�2b987a8d33f0�body���因为翻倍是乘法而非加法，看似‘还很早’的阶段其实已走过一半路程；等你觉得‘突然很多’时，往往只剩一次翻倍的时间了。这常被用来警示资源与污染。��Since doubling is multiplicative, the 'still early' stage is already halfway; by the time it looks 'suddenly huge', often only one more doubling remains. It warns about resources and pollution.�ans��src��)《非线性动力学与混沌》Strogatz�/Nonlinear Dynamics and Chaos by Steven Strogatz��id�2bf3dd7da0a7�body�ٜ贝叶斯定理用新证据更新事件发生的概率：P(A|B) = P(B|A)P(A)/P(B)。它是医学检测、垃圾邮件过滤和机器学习推断的基础。ٌBayes' theorem updates a probability with new evidence: P(A|B)=P(B|A)P(A)/P(B). It underpins medical testing, spam filters and ML inference.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�2bf72e56a391�body�ِ它说任意平面地图都可用四种颜色给相邻区域上色而不冲突。它是首个主要依赖计算机验证证明的数学定理。�wAny planar map can be colored with four colors so neighbors differ; the first major theorem proved largely by computer.�ans��src��《图论》Diestel� Graph Theory by Reinhard Diestel��id�2dc056649656�body��1一年只有 12 个月，把 12 个月当成 12 个“鸽笼”，13 个人要放进这些笼子里，至少有一个笼子要装两个人。这就是鸽笼原理：如果 n+1 件东西要放进 n 个抽屉，那么至少一个抽屉里有两件。它看似平凡，却是许多存在性证明的利器。�A year has only 12 months; treat them as 12 pigeonholes, and 13 people must fill them so that at least one month holds two people. That is the pigeonhole principle: if n+1 items go into n boxes, some box holds at least two. It sounds trivial, yet it powers many existence proofs.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�2ef706bb50b8�body��;在价值不确定的共同价值拍卖中，每个竞拍者只凭自己的估计出价；出价最高的人，往往正是把价值估得最高（最可能高估）的那位，中标后才发现真实价值低于自己付的价。因此“赢”了拍卖却常“亏”了钱，理性买家应故意压低出价。�'In a common-value auction with uncertain worth, each bids on their own estimate; the winner is typically the one who overestimated most, discovering post-win that the true value is below the price paid. So winning the auction often means losing money, and rational bidders shade their bids down.�ans��src��uCapen, E. C., Clapp, R. V. 与 Campbell, W. M., 《高风险情形下的竞争性投标》, AAPG Bulletin 56(4), 1971�vCapen, E. C., Clapp, R. V. & Campbell, W. M., 'Competitive Bidding in High-Risk Situations', AAPG Bulletin 56(4), 1971��id�2fae3ca59b5b�body�٥良序是一个全序，其中每个非空子集都有最小元素。自然数按大小是良序的，但整数全体按普通大小不是（没有最小元素）。�A well-order is a total order where every nonempty subset has a least element; naturals are well-ordered, all integers are not.�ans��src��6P. R. Halmos《Naive Set Theory》, Van Nostrand, 1960�2P. R. Halmos, Naive Set Theory, Van Nostrand, 1960��id�31491c4f71ac�body��%总和等于 1。直观上，先走半条路，再走剩下的一半，再走剩下的一半的一半……虽然每一步都走不完最后一点，但无限步之后恰好走完整条路。首项 a、公比 r（|r|<1）的几何级数求和公式是 a/(1-r)，这里就是 (1/2)/(1-1/2)=1。�-The total is 1. Intuitively, walk half the road, then half of the remainder, then half of that remainder… each step leaves a sliver, but after infinitely many steps the whole road is covered. A geometric series with first term a and ratio r (with |r|<1) sums to a/(1-r), giving (1/2)/(1-1/2)=1 here.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�32d1ff96f9ba�body��t好的哈希函数把任意长度的输入变成固定长度的输出，计算很快、同样的输入永远得到同样的输出；但从输出反推输入几乎不可能，也难以找到两个不同输入产生相同的哈希值（抗碰撞）。因此哈希被用来存储密码的“指纹”、校验文件是否被篡改，也是数字签名与区块链的基石。��A good hash function maps arbitrary-length input to a fixed-size output, evaluating fast with the same input always giving the same output; yet inverting from output to input is practically impossible, and finding two different inputs with equal hashes (collision resistance) is infeasible. Hence hashes fingerprint stored passwords, verify file integrity, and underpin digital signatures and blockchain.�ans��src��VMenezes、van Oorschot、Vanstone《Handbook of Applied Cryptography》（CRC Press）�LMenezes, van Oorschot, Vanstone, Handbook of Applied Cryptography, CRC Press��id�3403ded51492�body�ٴ二者都用迭代z→z²+c，区别在曼德博集变化c、固定起点，而朱利亚集固定c、变化起点。曼德博集可看作使对应朱利亚集连通的c的集合。ٺBoth use z→z²+c; the Mandelbrot set varies c with fixed start, while a Julia set fixes c and varies the start. The Mandelbrot set is the set of c for which the Julia set is connected.�ans��src��AB. B. Mandelbrot《The Fractal Geometry of Nature》, Wiley, 1982�=B. B. Mandelbrot, The Fractal Geometry of Nature, Wiley, 1982��id�361501f05017�body��!刀切法依次从 n 个样本中去掉第 i 个、用其余 n−1 个重算统计量，得到 n 个“伪值”，再用伪值的均值与离散程度估计原估计的偏差与标准误。它是自助法的前身，思路直观、计算稳定，适合样本量不大时的误差评估。�"The jackknife drops the i-th of n samples one at a time, recomputes the statistic on the remaining n−1, and forms n 'pseudovalues' whose mean and spread estimate the original estimator's bias and standard error. A precursor to the bootstrap, it is intuitive and stable for modest samples.�ans��src��ZEfron, B. 与 Hastie, T., 《计算机时代的统计推断》, Cambridge University Press�XEfron, B. & Hastie, T., 'Computer Age Statistical Inference', Cambridge University Press��id�38e2c6a2b0e6�body��二项式系数 $\binom{n}{k}=\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$ 计数从 n 个不同元素中无序选取 k 个的方式数。它出现在二项式展开 $(a+b)^n=\sum\binom{n}{k}a^{n-k}b^k$ 中，也用于概率（如超几何分布）与帕斯卡三角形的递推。�The binomial coefficient $\binom{n}{k}=\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$ counts the ways to choose k items from n without order. It appears in the binomial expansion $(a+b)^n=\sum\binom{n}{k}a^{n-k}b^k$ and in probabilities such as the hypergeometric distribution and Pascal's triangle recurrence.�ans��src��《组合数学》Brualdi�-Introductory Combinatorics by Richard Brualdi��id�3a06d5bd93cd�body�ٹ设x=0.999…，则10x=9.999…，两式相减得9x=9，所以x=1。或者说1/3=0.333…，乘3得到1=0.999…。无限小数没有最后的9，二者是同一实数的两种写法。ٮLet x=0.999…; then 10x=9.999…, subtract to get 9x=9, so x=1. Or 1/3=0.333… and times 3 gives 1=0.999…. There is no final 9, so they are two names for one real number.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�3ad040aee424�body��5周长与直径之比恒为 π，故 C=π·2r=2πr。�8The ratio of circumference to diameter is π, so C=2πr.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�3b2258ba2d18�body�ٮ不同数据的重要性或可靠性不同：考试里期末比平时权重高，调查里大群体样本权重更大。加权让结果反映真实贡献而非机械平分。ٴData differ in importance or reliability: finals weigh more than homework, larger groups weigh more in surveys. Weighting reflects true contribution instead of mechanical equality.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3b506cadab1d�body��勾股定理即直角三角形两直角边平方和等于斜边平方 $a^2+b^2=c^2$，与毕达哥拉斯定理数学等价。中国最早系统记载见于《周髀算经》，三国赵爽用弦图给出证明，比西方同类记载更早以出入相补思想呈现。�ZThe Gougu theorem states that the sum of squares of the legs equals the square of the hypotenuse, $a^2+b^2=c^2$, mathematically equivalent to the Pythagorean theorem. In China it was first systematically recorded in the Zhoubi Suanjing, and Zhao Shuang of the Three Kingdoms era proved it with a xian tu diagram using the principle of dissection.�ans��src��,《中国科学技术史》数学卷 Needham�9Science and Civilisation in China Vol 3 by Joseph Needham��id�40a97f52470f�body��z样本空间是一次随机试验所有可能结果的集合。例如抛一枚硬币的样本空间是 {正面, 反面}。�kThe sample space is the set of all possible outcomes of an experiment, e.g. {heads, tails} for a coin flip.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�44206f619b8d�body���蝴蝶效应指在某些确定性动力系统中，初始条件的微小差异会随时间被指数级放大，导致长期预测彻底失效——洛伦兹形象地比喻「巴西一只蝴蝶扇动翅膀可能引发得州一场龙卷风」。这类系统并非随机，却对初始值极度敏感，典型例子包括天气和双摆。混沌理论由爱德华·洛伦兹在 1960 年代研究气象时奠定。��The butterfly effect means that in some deterministic dynamical systems, tiny differences in initial conditions are amplified exponentially over time, making long-term prediction impossible—Lorenz quipped a butterfly in Brazil might trigger a tornado in Texas. Such systems are not random but exquisitely sensitive to initial values; weather and the double pendulum are classic examples. Chaos theory was founded by Edward Lorenz studying meteorology in the 1960s.�ans��src��HJames Gleick《混沌：开创新科学》；美国数学学会（AMS）�NJames Gleick, Chaos: Making a New Science; American Mathematical Society (AMS)��id�478ab4d39e8e�body�ٚ古巴比伦使用六十进制，因为60的因数很多（1,2,3,4,5,6,10,12…），便于等分和交易。这一习惯沿用到时间和角度度量。٣Ancient Babylon used base-60 because 60 has many divisors (1,2,3,4,5,6,10,12…), convenient for fractions and trade. The habit survives in time and angle measure.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4873dcdb0ec9�body���常微分方程是未知函数只依赖一个自变量且其导数满足的方程。放射性衰变满足 $dy/dt=-ky$，解为 $y(t)=y_0 e^{-kt}$，其中 k 为衰变常数，描述半衰期现象，是典型的线性一阶常微分方程。�An ordinary differential equation involves an unknown function of a single variable together with its derivatives. Radioactive decay obeys $dy/dt=-ky$, solved by $y(t)=y_0 e^{-kt}$ with decay constant k, describing half-life and forming a classic linear first-order ODE.�ans��src��《常微分方程》Arnold�-Ordinary Differential Equations by V I Arnold��id�48ef4c41a54f�body��0斐波那契数列由比萨的列奥纳多（绰号斐波那契）在《算盘全书》中以兔子繁殖问题引入，递推 $F_n=F_{n-1}+F_{n-2}$。类似递推早在印度数学（如 Pingala 的韵律计量、12 世纪的狮子阵问题）中已出现，说明该数列有跨文化的独立起源。�OThe Fibonacci sequence was introduced by Leonardo of Pisa (nicknamed Fibonacci) in Liber Abaci via a rabbit-breeding problem, with recurrence $F_n=F_{n-1}+F_{n-2}$. Similar recurrences appeared earlier in Indian mathematics (e.g. Pingala's prosody and the 12th-century lion's march problem), showing independent cross-cultural origins.�ans��src��!《数学史》Boyer 与 Merzbach�.A History of Mathematics by Boyer and Merzbach��id�4a9ace71bcc4�body�ل椭圆是平面上到两个定点（焦点）距离之和为常数的点的轨迹。它是拉长的圆，行星轨道就是椭圆。�pAn ellipse is the locus of points whose sum of distances to two foci is constant; planetary orbits are ellipses.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�4aa067f3bf61�body��W因为不同频率的正弦、余弦在积分意义下互相“正交”，可以把任意周期函数向每个频率“投影”，从而算出各频率分量的振幅（傅里叶系数）。傅里叶在 1822 年研究热传导时提出这套思想；今天的 JPEG 图片压缩、MP3 音频和信号去噪都建立在傅里叶分解之上。�eBecause sines and cosines of different frequencies are mutually “orthogonal” in an integral sense, any periodic function can be projected onto each frequency to obtain its amplitudes (Fourier coefficients). Fourier introduced the idea in 1822 while studying heat conduction; today JPEG image compression, MP3 audio, and signal denoising all build on it.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�4be1c8e93244�body��.把年利率 100% 的复利分成 n 次结算，一年后的倍数是 (1+1/n)^n。n 越大结算越频繁，但这个数并不冲向无穷，而是逼近一个常数 e≈2.71828，这就是自然对数的底。连续复利下本金按 Pe^(rt) 增长，e 由此成为数学里最重要的常数之一。�ISplit a 100% annual rate into n compoundings; after one year the multiplier is (1+1/n)^n. As n grows the value does not explode but settles toward the constant e≈2.71828, the base of natural logarithms. Under continuous compounding money grows as Pe^(rt), which is why e ranks among the most important constants in mathematics.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�4bec21a545ab�body�ِ三个选民对三个选项有循环偏好时，多数票会陷入A胜B、B胜C、C胜A的循环。这说明群体偏好未必满足传递性。ُWith three voters holding cyclic preferences, majority votes cycle (A beats B, B beats C, C beats A). Group preferences need not be transitive.�ans��src�ً孔多塞《应用概率分析考察多数表决决策之试论》（1785）；肯尼斯·阿罗《社会选择与个人价值》（1951）��Marquis de Condorcet, 'Essai sur l'application de l'analyse à la probabilité des décisions rendues à la pluralité des voix' (1785); Kenneth Arrow, 'Social Choice and Individual Values', Cowles Commission monograph (1951)��id�4ef150fbf283�body��第一类错误（弃真）是原假设实际为真却被拒绝，其概率记为 $\alpha$；第二类错误（取伪）是原假设为假却未被拒绝，概率记为 $\beta$。通常需在两者间权衡，提高检验功效（降低 $\beta$）往往要以增大 $\alpha$ 为代价。�A Type I error (false positive) rejects a true null hypothesis with probability $\alpha$; a Type II error (false negative) fails to reject a false null with probability $\beta$. There is a trade-off: raising power (lowering $\beta$) often requires increasing $\alpha$.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数理统计》�<American Mathematical Society (AMS), Mathematical Statistics��id�515415218d0e�body��"指任意接近的两个初值在迭代中会以指数速率分离，即 $|\delta(t)|\approx e^{\lambda t}|\delta(0)|$，其中 $\lambda>0$ 为李雅普诺夫指数。这意味着长期行为本质上不可精确预测，尽管系统本身完全确定——这就是「确定性混沌」。�It means two initially close states separate exponentially: $|\delta(t)|\approx e^{\lambda t}|\delta(0)|$ with $\lambda>0$ the Lyapunov exponent. Long-term behavior is then essentially unpredictable even though the system is fully deterministic—this is deterministic chaos.�ans��src��)美国数学会(AMS)《混沌动力学》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Chaotic Dynamics��id�520713aa1fe0�body��`大数定律指出：随着独立试验次数增多，样本均值会稳定地趋近于理论期望（例如抛硬币正面频率趋于 1/2）。但它并不意味着「短期偏离会被快速扳平」——这是赌徒谬误。每次抛掷仍独立，过去结果不影响未来；大数定律只保证长期频率收敛，而非短期「补偿」。��The Law of Large Numbers says that as the number of independent trials grows, the sample average converges to the theoretical expectation (e.g., coin-flip heads frequency approaches 1/2). It does NOT mean short-term deviations are quickly 'balanced out'—that is the gambler's fallacy. Each toss stays independent; past outcomes don't affect the future. The law only guarantees long-run convergence, not short-term compensation.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�522b134a52c7�body���和算是日本江户时代在本土发展出的数学，深受中国数学影响，以算额为特色：把数学题写在木板上挂在神社寺庙供人挑战，常用傍书法解几何题。ٿWasan is mathematics developed in Edo-period Japan under Chinese influence; its hallmark is the sangaku tablets hung in shrines with geometry problems, often solved by a side-notation method.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�532d68f8f3f6�body���因为定义在紧集上的连续实值函数必有最大值和最小值（极值定理）。把可行域取为紧集，即可保证目标函数在该域上达到极值，从而优化问题至少存在一个最优解。��A continuous real-valued function on a compact set attains both a maximum and a minimum (extreme value theorem). Taking the feasible region to be compact thus guarantees the objective reaches an extremum, so an optimal solution exists.�ans��src��)美国数学会(AMS)《点集拓扑学》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Point Set Topology��id�564a9917203d�body���三盒分别为“两金”“两银”“金+银”；随机选盒后抽出一枚金球，问另一枚也是金的概率？答案是 2/3，因为金球更可能来自“两金”盒。它考验条件概率的直觉。ٲOf three boxes (GG, SS, GS) you draw a gold ball; the chance the other is also gold is 2/3, since a gold ball is more likely from the GG box. A lesson in conditional probability.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�5673bcc60f3e�body�ٗ链式法则用于复合函数求导：外层导数乘以内层导数，即 (f∘g)'(x) = f'(g(x))·g'(x)。例如 sin(x²) 的导数是 2x cos(x²)。�qThe chain rule differentiates composites: (f∘g)' = f'(g(x))·g'(x); e.g. derivative of sin(x²) is 2x cos(x²).�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�56b99950806f�body��g一个正整数如果等于它所有真因数（小于它本身的正因数）之和，就称为完全数。6 的真因数是 1、2、3，而 1+2+3=6；28 的真因数是 1、2、4、7、14，加起来也正好是 28。古希腊人把完全数看得十分神圣，欧几里得还证明了：只要 2^p-1 是质数，那么 2^(p-1)(2^p-1) 就是偶完全数。�wA positive integer is perfect when it equals the sum of its proper divisors (its positive divisors less than itself). For 6 these are 1, 2, 3, and 1+2+3=6; for 28 they are 1, 2, 4, 7, 14, which also sum to 28. The ancient Greeks held perfect numbers in near-mystical regard, and Euclid proved that whenever 2^p-1 is prime, the number 2^(p-1)(2^p-1) is an even perfect number.�ans��src��8《什么是数学》(柯朗)（数论章：完全数）�?What Is Mathematics? (Courant), number theory (perfect numbers)��id�571481db1862�body�ٓ它说明若多个模数两两互质，那么同余方程组 x ≡ a_i (mod m_i) 在模其乘积下有唯一解。它用于日历换算和加密。نIf moduli are pairwise coprime, the system x≡a_i (mod m_i) has a unique solution modulo their product; used in calendars and crypto.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�571a7f334f8c�body��%不会，只要 n 是具体的有限数，1/n 就始终大于 0；但它可以小于任何一个你预先指定的正数，比如千分之一、百万分之一。数学家把这种“无限靠近却不必到达”的状态称为极限，记作 lim(1/n)=0。极限是微积分的基础语言。�1No — for any concrete finite n, 1/n is still positive; but it can drop below any positive number you name first, whether a thousandth or a millionth. Mathematicians call this state of approaching without necessarily arriving a limit, written lim(1/n)=0. Limits are the foundational language of calculus.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�572403eb611c�body�ٟ一个数列或级数若无限接近某个确定值，称为收敛；若没有极限或趋向无穷，称为发散。例如 1/2 + 1/4 + 1/8 + … 收敛于1。�rA sequence or series converges if it approaches a fixed value, diverges otherwise; 1/2+1/4+1/8+… converges to 1.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�590c615dbbd4�body��\《周髀算经》用“髀”（八尺表竿）立地测影，在不同地点同时量得影差，借助相似直角三角形（今称日高术公式 h = 表高×间距÷影差 + 表高）反推日高与日远。它是最早把勾股定理与比例关系用于天文测量的记录，体现了“以影测天”的中国古代数理天文思想。�gThe Zhoubi Suanjing set an 8-chi gnomon, measured shadow differences at two sites simultaneously, and used similar right triangles (the formula h = gnomon·distance/shadow-difference + gnomon) to infer the sun's height and distance. It is among the earliest records applying the Pythagorean relation and proportion to astronomy—'measuring heaven by shadow.'�ans��src��^Cullen, C., 《中国古代的天文学与数学：周髀算经》, Cambridge University Press�kCullen, C., 'Astronomy and Mathematics in Ancient China: The Zhou Bi Suan Jing', Cambridge University Press��id�5afd84ee5d41�body��p复利是“利息也产生利息”的计算方式，公式为 A = P(1+r)^n。时间越长，增长越明显。�WCompound interest earns interest on interest: A=P(1+r)^n; growth accelerates over time.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5cbda53052a8�body��^19 世纪初，热尔曼因女性身份被拒于学界门外，遂以“勒布朗先生”之名与高斯通信，并提出“热尔曼素数”（p 使 2p+1 也为素数）来处理费马大定理的第一种情形，证明了该情形下对一类素数成立。她的工作是首项重要的女性数学贡献，后获哥廷根大学荣誉博士。�OIn early 1800s, barred from academia as a woman, Germain corresponded with Gauss as 'M. Le Blanc' and introduced 'Germain primes' (p with 2p+1 also prime) to handle the first case of Fermat's Last Theorem, proving it for a class of primes. Her work was a pioneering female contribution and earned an honorary doctorate from Göttingen.�ans��src��rGray, M. 与 Bradley, C. E., 《索菲·热尔曼与费马大定理》, American Mathematical Monthly 106(3), 1999ُGray, M. & Bradley, C. E., 'Sophie Germain and the Proof of Fermat's Last Theorem for the Case n=5', American Mathematical Monthly 106(3), 1999��id�5ed526c99606�body��N是的，四色定理保证：任何平面地图都能用四种颜色涂好，使相邻区域颜色不同。问题是 1852 年提出的，证明却极为困难——数学家花了 124 年，直到 1976 年 Appel 和 Haken 借助计算机检查了大量可能情形才算彻底证明。它是第一个公认的计算机辅助证明。�PYes — the four-color theorem guarantees that any planar map can be colored with four colors so neighboring regions differ. Posed in 1852, it resisted proof for 124 years, until Appel and Haken finally proved it in 1976 with a computer that checked an enormous number of cases. It was the first widely accepted computer-assisted proof.�ans��src��;《什么是数学》(柯朗)（拓扑章：四色问题）�=What Is Mathematics? (Courant), topology (four-color problem)��id�5f5309ce4826�body��E复制者方程 $\dot x_i=x_i(f_i-\bar f)$ 表示策略 $i$ 的频率 $x_i$ 随时间变化正比于其相对适应度（$f_i$ 为该策略收益，$\bar f$ 为种群平均收益）。收益高于平均的策略会被「复制」增多，低于平均的则衰退，从而把博弈均衡与生物演化动力学联系起来。�1The replicator equation $\dot x_i=x_i(f_i-\bar f)$ says the frequency $x_i$ of strategy $i$ changes proportionally to its relative fitness ($f_i$ the strategy's payoff, $\bar f$ the population average). Strategies above average grow, those below shrink, linking game equilibria with evolutionary dynamics.�ans��src��_Nowak《Evolutionary Dynamics: Exploring the Equations of Life》（Harvard University Press）�WNowak, Evolutionary Dynamics: Exploring the Equations of Life, Harvard University Press��id�5fd96ae5ac27�body�ك它断言当整数n大于2时，方程x^n+y^n=z^n没有正整数解。怀尔斯在1994年用椭圆曲线与模形式最终证明。ٖIt states that for integer n>2, x^n+y^n=z^n has no positive integer solutions. Andrew Wiles proved it in 1994 using elliptic curves and modular forms.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�60d65aec19fa�body��u四元数是形如 a + bi + cj + dk 的超复数，其中 i、j、k 满足 i² = j² = k² = ijk = −1，由哈密顿于 1843 年刻在都柏林桥上。与实数和复数不同，四元数乘法不可交换（ij ≠ ji），使其特别适合无奇点地描述三维旋转。如今它是计算机图形学、机器人姿态控制和航天姿态确定中的标准工具。��Quaternions are hypercomplex numbers of the form a + bi + cj + dk with i² = j² = k² = ijk = −1, carved by Hamilton on a Dublin bridge in 1843. Unlike real or complex numbers, their multiplication is non-commutative (ij ≠ ji), which makes them ideal for describing 3D rotations without singularities. They are now standard in computer graphics, robotics, and spacecraft attitude control.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6168f073c2b7�body��计算 $b=a^x\bmod N$ 可借快速幂在多项式时间内完成，但由 $b$ 反求指数 $x$（离散对数问题）在适当选择的群中被认为是困难的。这种易正向、难逆向的非对称性正是 Diffie-Hellman 与 DSA 等协议的根基。�Computing $b=a^x\bmod N$ is feasible in polynomial time via fast exponentiation, but recovering the exponent $x$ from $b$ (the discrete logarithm problem) is believed hard in suitably chosen groups. This easy-forward, hard-inverse asymmetry underlies Diffie-Hellman and DSA.�ans��src��VMenezes、van Oorschot、Vanstone《Handbook of Applied Cryptography》（CRC Press）�LMenezes, van Oorschot, Vanstone, Handbook of Applied Cryptography, CRC Press��id�627302ed494e�body��j克莱因瓶是一种没有内外之分、没有边界的闭合曲面，可看作把莫比乌斯带的两「边」粘合而成。它作为四维对象没有自交，但在我们生活的三维空间里只能以「瓶子穿过自身壁面」的方式勉强表示。它由费利克斯·克莱因在 1882 年提出，是单侧、不可定向曲面的经典例子。�uThe Klein bottle is a closed surface with no inside/outside distinction and no boundary, viewed as gluing the two 'edges' of a Möbius strip. In four dimensions it has no self-intersection, but in our 3D space it can only be depicted by the bottle passing through its own wall. Proposed by Felix Klein in 1882, it is the classic example of a non-orientable, closed surface.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�62c3b67661d5�body�ٜ在纳什均衡中，每个参与者在别人策略不变时都不再愿意单独改变自己的选择。它是非合作博弈预测结果的核心概念。ـIn a Nash equilibrium, no player can benefit by unilaterally changing strategy; the central prediction of non-cooperative games.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�6338da3ec96a�body���身高、体重、测量误差等数据常围绕一个平均值铺开，中间高、两头低，形成钟形曲线，这就是正态分布。原因是这类数值往往是大量独立微小因素叠加的结果：根据中心极限定理，许多相互独立、方差有限的随机量相加，整体就近似服从正态分布，无论单个因素长什么样。它的形状只由平均值 μ 和标准差 σ 决定，约 68% 的数据落在 μ±σ 内，95% 落在 μ±2σ 内。�	Heights, weights, and measurement errors spread around a mean — high in the middle, low at both tails — tracing a bell-shaped curve, the normal distribution. The reason is that such values aggregate many small independent effects: by the central limit theorem, sums of many independent random quantities with finite variance are approximately normal regardless of their individual shapes. Its shape is set entirely by the mean μ and standard deviation σ, with about 68% of data within μ±σ and 95% within μ±2σ.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�633dfd6d717b�body�٨两名嫌犯各自选择“招供”或“沉默”，个人最优是招供，但都招供的后果比都沉默更糟——说明个人理性可能导致集体不利。ّEach suspect betters themselves by confessing, yet both confessing is worse than both staying silent—individual rationality can hurt the group.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�64dba5dd55d5�body���曼德博集合由复平面上使迭代 z → z² + c 保持有界的参数 c 构成，由本华·曼德博在 1980 年用计算机发现。它的边界具有无限精细的自相似细节——无论放大多少倍都会出现新的相似结构，是「分形」的典型代表。这种由极简单规则产生极端复杂图案的现象，深刻影响了混沌与复杂系统的研究。��The Mandelbrot set consists of complex parameters c for which the iteration z → z² + c remains bounded, discovered by Benoit Mandelbrot in 1980 using computers. Its boundary has infinitely detailed self-similar structure—zoom in any amount and new similar patterns appear—making it the icon of fractals. That a tiny rule generates extreme complexity reshaped the study of chaos and complex systems.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�64e47dd47f49�body�ف两个事件独立指一个事件的发生不影响另一个发生的概率。例如连续抛硬币，各次结果互不影响。�rTwo events are independent if one's occurrence doesn't affect the other's probability, e.g. successive coin flips.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�6517afe8a3a7�body��z模运算是“除以某个数看余数”的运算。例如 11 ≡ 2 (mod 3) 表示11和2除以3余数相同，都是2。�yModular arithmetic works with remainders; e.g. 11 ≡ 2 (mod 3) means 11 and 2 have the same remainder when divided by 3.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�661b2cc27ed6�body�ٟ欧拉路径走遍每条边恰好一次；若起点终点相同则为欧拉回路。一个连通图存在欧拉回路当且仅当每个顶点度数为偶数。ًAn Eulerian path uses every edge once; a circuit returns to start. A connected graph has an Euler circuit iff every vertex has even degree.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�662cc63a5f49�body�ٷ正五边形对角线与边长之比正是 φ=(1+√5)/2；五角星里层层嵌套的小五角星也保持同一比例，形成自相似。这是五重对称与 φ 的内在联系。ٮIn a regular pentagon the diagonal-to-side ratio is φ=(1+√5)/2; the pentagram nests smaller pentagrams at the same ratio, self-similar. This links fivefold symmetry to φ.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�67691ba09aa9�body�ٝ勾股定理说直角三角形两直角边的平方和等于斜边平方：a² + b² = c²。例如边长3、4的直角三角形，斜边是5（9+16=25）。ٗThe Pythagorean theorem states a² + b² = c² for the legs and hypotenuse of a right triangle; e.g. legs 3 and 4 give hypotenuse 5, since 9 + 16 = 25.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�69e8ccbb5f0a�body���香农熵定义为 $H(X)=-\sum_i p_i\log_2 p_i$，其中 $p_i$ 是各结果概率。熵越大表示结果越难预测：确定事件的熵为 0，均匀分布的熵最大。它以比特为单位，量化了信息源的平均信息量。�Shannon entropy is $H(X)=-\sum_i p_i\log_2 p_i$, where $p_i$ are outcome probabilities. Larger entropy means harder prediction: a certain event has entropy 0 and a uniform distribution maximizes it. Measured in bits, it quantifies the average information content of a source.�ans��src��%《信息论基础》Cover 与 Thomas�2Elements of Information Theory by Cover and Thomas��id�6a603573c541�body��G墙纸图案的对称由平移、旋转、反射、滑移反射四种等距变换的组合决定。把所有这些对称操作看成一个群，并限定平移必须构成二维格子，就能完整分类出恰好 17 个不同的“墙纸群”。同样的思想延伸三维，就得到晶体学中重要的 230 个空间群。�wWallpaper symmetry comes from combinations of four isometries: translations, rotations, reflections, and glide reflections. Treating all symmetry operations as one group, with translations required to form a two-dimensional lattice, yields exactly 17 distinct “wallpaper groups”. The same idea in three dimensions produces the 230 space groups central to crystallography.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6bded9016644�body�ٕ它说正整数p是素数当且仅当(p−1)! ≡ −1 (mod p)。虽然理论优美，但阶乘计算太慢，实际并不用于大数素性检测。ًIt states p>1 is prime iff (p-1)! ≡ -1 (mod p). Elegant in theory, but factorial computation is too slow for practical primality testing.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6dc38bfdb0d8�body��{归纳推理是从许多具体观察中总结一般规律，结论具有或然性，不同于必然成立的演绎推理。�hInductive reasoning generalizes from observations; conclusions are probable, unlike deductive certainty.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�6ed3206987a2�body��{悖论是从看似合理的前提出发却推出自相矛盾或反直觉结论的情形，例如“这句话是假的”。�xA paradox derives a contradiction or counterintuitive result from plausible premises, e.g. “this sentence is false”.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7072cfbf29ae�body���把积分区间 $[a,b]$ 分成 $n$ 等份，用梯形面积近似每个小区间的曲边，得到 $\int_a^b f(x)\,dx\approx\frac{h}{2}[f(x_0)+2\sum_{i=1}^{n-1}f(x_i)+f(x_n)]$，其中 $h=(b-a)/n$。对充分光滑函数误差约为 $O(h^2)$。��Divide $[a,b]$ into $n$ equal parts and approximate each strip by a trapezoid: $\int_a^b f(x)\,dx\approx\frac{h}{2}[f(x_0)+2\sum_{i=1}^{n-1}f(x_i)+f(x_n)]$ with $h=(b-a)/n$. For smooth functions the error is about $O(h^2)$.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�7081c5b5f050�body��9+5=14，但钟面没有 14 点，于是要减去 12 变成 2 点。数学里我们写 14≡2 (mod 12)，意思是 14 和 2 除以 12 的余数相同。这种“只看余数、周期循环”的运算叫模运算，日历计算、ISBN 校验码和现代加密都建立在它上面。�O9+5=14, but a clock face has no 14 o'clock, so we subtract 12 and land on 2. Mathematically we write 14≡2 (mod 12), meaning 14 and 2 leave the same remainder upon division by 12. Arithmetic that keeps only remainders in a cyclic pattern is modular arithmetic, and it underlies calendar math, ISBN check digits, and modern encryption.�ans��src��5《什么是数学》(柯朗)（数论章：同余）�EWhat Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on number theory (congruence)��id�72371aa41999�body�ي标准差就是方差的平方根。方差衡量数据与均值的平均平方偏差，开方后单位与数据一致，更便于解释。�yStandard deviation is the square root of variance; taking the root restores the original units for easier interpretation.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�735fc32af04d�body�ٶ它把线段不断用等腰直角三角形替换中点折成两段，整体呈连续的折纸状曲线。其分形维数为log2/log√2=2，是一条有填满平面趋势的曲线。��It repeatedly replaces each segment's midpoint with a right-isosceles bend, forming a continuous folded curve. Its fractal dimension is log2/log√2=2, a curve trending toward filling the plane.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�739148c6998c�body���群同态是两个群之间保持运算的映射 $f:G\to H$，即 $f(ab)=f(a)f(b)$。核 $\ker f$ 是被映到 H 中单位元的 G 的元素集合。例如符号映射从 $S_n$ 到 $\{\pm1\}$，其核正是偶置换群 $A_n$。�A group homomorphism is a map $f:G\to H$ between groups that preserves the operation, so $f(ab)=f(a)f(b)$. The kernel $\ker f$ is the set of elements of G mapped to the identity of H. For example the sign map from $S_n$ to $\{\pm1\}$ has kernel $A_n$, the even permutations.�ans��src��《近世代数》刘绍学�$Abstract Algebra by Dummit and Foote��id�779c36018778�body�ٻ《周髀算经》（约公元前1世纪）记载了勾三股四弦五的特例并用勾股计算日影，说明中国很早就掌握了直角三角形三边关系，用于天文测量。��Dating to about the 1st century BCE, the Zhoubi records the 3-4-5 special case and uses right-triangle relations to measure solar shadows, showing early Chinese mastery of the theorem for astronomy.�ans��src��《周髀算经》�Zhoubi Suanjing��id�77a14f557415�body�ٱ公地悲剧指每个使用者为私利过度消耗共享资源，最终使所有人受损，如过度捕捞。它不是单人博弈，而是多人互动导致的集体失败。ٱThe tragedy of the commons occurs when individuals overuse a shared resource for private gain, ruining it for all, like overfishing. It is collective failure from self-interest.�ans��src��P埃莉诺·奥斯特罗姆《治理公地：集体行动制度的演进》(1990)�`Elinor Ostrom, Governing the Commons: The Evolution of Institutions for Collective Action (1990)��id�79c018b1011f�body��Polya 定理表明，对称简单随机游走在二维仍然常返（回到原点概率为 1），但在三维变为暂态（返回概率约 0.34，小于 1）。原因在于高维空间中可走的路径更多、原点被「稀释」，返回概率随维度升高而下降。�GPolya's theorem states that the symmetric simple random walk is recurrent in two dimensions (return probability 1) but transient in three dimensions (return probability about 0.34, less than 1). In higher dimensions there are more paths and the origin is effectively diluted, so the return probability decreases with dimension.�ans��src��/美国数学会(AMS)《概率论与测度论》�<American Mathematical Society (AMS), Probability and Measure��id�7ac023c6a72a�body�ٓ同胚是两个形状之间的连续可逆变形（不撕裂、不粘连）。若两图形同胚，拓扑学认为它们是“同一个”形状。فA homeomorphism is a continuous invertible deformation between shapes; topologically homeomorphic shapes are considered the same.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�7ca143ee71d9�body�ٮ每次四舍五入都引入约半个单位的随机误差，成百上千次后会累积。财务系统常用四舍五入到偶数或保留更多小数来减小这种偏差。ٰEach rounding adds about half a unit of error, and over thousands of values these accumulate. Accounting systems use round-half-to-even or extra decimal places to reduce drift.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�7d44923da9b1�body��m连分数是把一个数写成“整数加分数、分数里又套分数”的嵌套形式。比如 √2 = 1 + 1/(2 + 1/(2 + ...))，记作 [1;2,2,2,...]，因为 √2 是无理数，它的连分数无限且循环。截断连分数得到的 1、3/2、7/5、17/12 等分数交替落在 √2 两侧，误差随项数迅速变小，是它的“最佳有理逼近”。�tA continued fraction writes a number as a nested “integer plus fraction” form. For instance √2 = 1 + 1/(2 + 1/(2 + ...)), written [1;2,2,2,...]; since √2 is irrational, the expansion is infinite and periodic. Truncating gives fractions such as 1, 3/2, 7/5, 17/12 that alternate around √2 with errors shrinking quickly—they are its best rational approximations.�ans��src��/《什么是数学》(柯朗)（连分数章）�>What Is Mathematics? (Courant), chapter on continued fractions��id�81efa465193d�body���平面曲线的曲率 $\kappa$ 描述单位弧长上切线方向改变的速度，$\kappa=|d\mathbf{T}/ds|$。直线曲率为 0，圆半径为 R 的曲率为 $1/R$：半径越小弯曲越剧烈。曲率直观反映了曲线偏离直线的程度。�0For a plane curve curvature $\kappa$ measures how fast the tangent direction changes per unit arc length, $\kappa=|d\mathbf{T}/ds|$. A straight line has curvature 0, while a circle of radius R has curvature $1/R$: smaller radius means sharper bending. Curvature quantifies deviation from a straight line.�ans��src��《微分几何》do Carmo�8Differential Geometry of Curves and Surfaces by do Carmo��id�822321ed25bc�body���线性规划是在线性等式与不等式约束下，极小或极大化线性目标函数的问题，标准形为 $\min c^T x$ 满足 $Ax\le b$。它用于资源分配、生产排程等，可由单纯形法或内点法高效求解。�Linear programming minimizes or maximizes a linear objective $c^T x$ subject to linear equality and inequality constraints $Ax\le b$. It is used in resource allocation and scheduling and is solved efficiently by the simplex method or interior-point methods.�ans��src��$《运筹学》Hillier 与 Lieberman�<Introduction to Operations Research by Hillier and Lieberman��id�83b66bd44f6e�body�ٓ他们用六十进制，把分数写成60的负次幂之和，比如1/2就是30/60。这和我们今天的时间、角度用60进制一脉相承。ٛThey used base 60, writing fractions as sums of negative powers of 60, e.g. 1/2 as 30/60. This is the same sexagesimal system behind our hours and degrees.�ans��src�ٚMorris Kline,《Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times》Oxford University Press,1972;中译《古今数学思想》上海科学技术出版社ْM. Kline, Mathematical Thought from Ancient to Modern Times, Oxford University Press, 1972; Chinese ed. Shanghai Scientific & Technical Publishers��id�84ede58b7028�body��f傅里叶变换把一个随时间变化的信号分解为不同频率正弦波的叠加，即把函数从「时间域」转换到「频率域」。约瑟夫·傅里叶在 19 世纪研究热传导时提出任何周期信号都可如此展开。今天它是音频压缩（MP3）、图像（JPEG）、医学成像（MRI）和量子力学的核心数学工具。��The Fourier transform decomposes a time-varying signal into a superposition of sine waves of different frequencies, switching a function from the time domain to the frequency domain. Joseph Fourier proposed in the 19th century that any periodic signal can be so expanded, while studying heat flow. Today it underpins audio compression (MP3), images (JPEG), medical imaging (MRI), and quantum mechanics.�ans��src��P大英百科全书（Britannica）；傅里叶《热的解析理论》（1822）�GEncyclopaedia Britannica; Fourier, The Analytical Theory of Heat (1822)��id�85c552ea4795�body��损失函数量化模型预测与真实值的差距，指导优化。均方误差 $\frac1n\sum(y-\hat y)^2$ 适用于回归；交叉熵 $-\sum y\log\hat y$ 适用于分类（尤其多类概率输出），因它最大化正确类的对数似然而对错误预测惩罚重。�gA loss function quantifies the gap between predictions and true values, guiding optimization. Mean squared error $\frac1n\sum(y-\hat y)^2$ suits regression; cross-entropy $-\sum y\log\hat y$ suits classification (especially multi-class probabilistic output) because it maximizes the log-likelihood of the correct class and heavily penalizes wrong predictions.�ans��src��3《深度学习》Goodfellow、Bengio 与 Courville�0Deep Learning by Goodfellow Bengio and Courville��id�87ba6ca136b2�body��-当纯策略无法形成稳定均衡时，参与者以一定概率分布选择动作，使对手在多种应对间无差异。例如在匹配硬币中，各以 $1/2$ 概率出正反面可使对方期望收益为零，从而构成均衡，随机化在此消除了可被对手利用的确定性规律。�\When no pure-strategy equilibrium is stable, players randomize over actions with a probability distribution that makes opponents indifferent among responses. In matching pennies, playing heads/tails each with probability $1/2$ yields the opponent zero expected gain, forming an equilibrium; randomization removes exploitable deterministic patterns.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�8c53a1f7ba25�body��?把矩阵看成对空间的线性变换，特征向量就是变换后方向不变、只被伸缩（甚至反向）的向量，伸缩倍数就是特征值。这个几何观点让我们直接看懂旋转、缩放、投影等变换，也是主成分分析、结构振动分析以及谷歌 PageRank 排序背后的思想。�OViewing a matrix as a linear transformation, an eigenvector is a direction that is only stretched (or flipped) by the transformation, never rotated; the stretch factor is the eigenvalue. This geometric view makes rotations, scalings, and projections transparent, and underlies PCA, structural vibration analysis, and Google's PageRank.�ans��src��wAxler,《Linear Algebra Done Right》第3版,Springer,2015;中译《线性代数应该这样学》人民邮电出版社�IS. Axler, Linear Algebra Done Right, 3rd ed., Springer, 2015; Chinese ed.��id�8c62eb2a2eea�body�٦小世界网络兼具高聚簇与短平均路径，如社交网络中“六度分隔”现象。瓦茨-斯特罗加茨模型用少量随机长边解释这种结构。پSmall-world networks combine high clustering with short average paths, like 'six degrees of separation' in social networks. The Watts–Strogatz model explains it with few random long links.�ans��src��:Milgram, S. (1967), 《小世界问题》, 今日心理学�=Milgram, S. (1967), The Small World Problem, Psychology Today��id�8db96e18d340�body��O在统计过程控制（休哈特控制图）中，样本统计量（如每批的均值）在中心极限定理下近似服从正态分布，落在均值 ±3σ 之外的概率仅约 0.3%。因此控制图上的点一旦越出 3σ 线，就被视为过程可能失控的异常信号，提示需要停机检查，而不是随机波动。�~In statistical process control (Shewhart charts), sample statistics such as batch means are approximately normal by the central limit theorem, so falling beyond mean ±3σ has probability only about 0.3%. A point crossing the 3σ limit on a control chart is therefore treated as a signal of possible out-of-control process—an assignable cause to investigate, not random variation.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�8dc1a475bcf7�body��v期望值是随机变量按概率加权的平均结果。例如公平骰子点数的期望是 (1+2+3+4+5+6)/6 = 3.5。�YExpected value is the probability-weighted average, e.g. a fair die's expectation is 3.5.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�8e039d9e31f8�body��_把每门考试当作一个顶点，若两个考试由同一位学生参加，就在它们之间连一条边，得到“冲突图”。排时间表就是给顶点染色，使相邻顶点颜色不同，颜色代表时间段；所需的最少颜色数称为色数。贪心算法结合这类图往往接近最优，可以快速得到可行的时间表。�oRepresent each exam as a vertex and connect two exams if a student takes both, forming a “conflict graph”. Scheduling is then vertex coloring with adjacent vertices in different colors, each color being a time slot; the minimum number of colors needed is the chromatic number. Greedy algorithms perform well on these graphs, quickly producing feasible timetables.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�8f4f1d84b378�body��[对巨大数字逐个试除完全不可行。实用上先用 Miller–Rabin 这类随机算法：它非常快，还能可靠地“捉出”合数，反复测试可以把误判概率压到任意低。2002 年 AKS 算法给出了第一个确定性的多项式时间检验，从理论上彻底回答了“素数性能否快速判定”这个问题。�WTrial division is hopeless for huge numbers. In practice randomized tests such as Miller–Rabin run fast and reliably catch composites; repeating the test pushes the error probability arbitrarily low. In 2002 the AKS algorithm provided the first deterministic polynomial-time test, settling in theory whether primality can be decided quickly.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�8fdcaeb5b603�body�٪用边长r的网格覆盖图形，数出有图形的格子数N(r)，维数约为−log N(r)/log r随r缩小的极限。格子越细，估计越接近真实分形维数。٭Cover the shape with a grid of side r and count occupied boxes N(r); the dimension is roughly the limit of −log N(r)/log r as r shrinks. Finer grids give better estimates.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《分形几何》�5American Mathematical Society (AMS), Fractal Geometry��id�91c309f13744�body�ٲ卡迈克尔数是合数却满足对所有与之互质的a有a^(n−1)≡1 (mod n)，能通过费马测试却不是素数。它被称为伪素数，需更强的检测来排除。ٸA Carmichael number is composite yet satisfies a^(n-1)≡1 (mod n) for all coprime a, passing Fermat's test without being prime. Called a pseudoprime, it needs stronger tests to catch.�ans��src��dK. H. Rosen《Elementary Number Theory and Its Applications》（第6版），Pearson，2011，§6.2�YK. H. Rosen, Elementary Number Theory and Its Applications, 6th ed., Pearson, 2011, §6.2��id�91cad81c86ef�body��l《孙子算经》（约公元 4 世纪）问：“今有物不知其数，三三数之剩二，五五数之剩三，七七数之剩二，问几何？”它给出“三人同行七十稀，五树梅花廿一枝，七子团圆正月半”的口诀，用 70、21、15（各模其余两两互素数的特解）拼出答案，正是最早的中国剩余定理实例。�The 'Sunzi Suanjing' (c. 4th century) asks for a number that leaves remainders 2,3,2 when divided by 3,5,7, and gives the rhyme using 70,21,15 (special solutions modulo the co-prime counterparts) to assemble the answer—the earliest instance of the Chinese remainder theorem.�ans��src��1Martzloff, J.-C., 《中国数学史》, Springer�>Martzloff, J.-C., 'A History of Chinese Mathematics', Springer��id�9229e5c138c6�body��2新信息会缩小我们考虑的范围，概率就要跟着更新。比如从 52 张牌中抽一张，先抽到红牌的概率是 26/52；如果已知抽到的是红牌，再算它是红桃的概率就变成 13/26。写成公式：P(A|B)=P(A∩B)/P(B)，读作“在 B 发生的条件下 A 的概率”。�'New information shrinks the set of possibilities we consider, so probabilities must be updated. From a 52-card deck, the chance of drawing a red card is 26/52; but given that the card is red, the chance it is a heart becomes 13/26. In symbols: P(A|B)=P(A∩B)/P(B), the probability of A given B.�ans��src��oCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》,Oxford University Press,1996,第三版;中译《什么是数学》�dR. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 3rd ed., 1996; Chinese ed.��id�944474fdc052�body�ٴ纽结理论研究三维空间中闭合绳圈能否不切断而解开，并用不变量（如琼斯多项式）区分不同纽结。它在DNA拓扑与量子场论中都有应用。ٲKnot theory studies whether a closed loop in 3D can be untangled without cutting, using invariants like the Jones polynomial. It applies to DNA topology and quantum field theory.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�9467950b315f�body��Z积分是求导的逆运算，用来求曲线下的面积、位移以及总量的累积。�hIntegration is the inverse of differentiation, used to compute area under curves and accumulated totals.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�97b433eab8f2�body��Z反证法先假设结论不成立，再推出矛盾，从而证明原结论必然成立。�iProof by contradiction assumes the negation, derives a contradiction, and thus proves the original claim.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�990e1d6de306�body���欧拉回路是经过每条边恰好一次并回到起点的闭合路径。对连通图，存在欧拉回路的充要条件是每个顶点的度数均为偶数。该结论源于欧拉对柯尼斯堡七桥问题的分析。�An Eulerian circuit is a closed trail that traverses every edge exactly once and returns to the start. For a connected graph, such a circuit exists iff every vertex has even degree. This result originated from Euler's analysis of the Königsberg bridge problem.�ans��src��《图论》Diestel� Graph Theory by Reinhard Diestel��id�99fa9245d02c�body�ٹ若 $p$ 为素数且整数 $a$ 不被 $p$ 整除，则 $a^{p-1}\equiv 1\pmod p$。等价地，对任意 $a$ 有 $a^p\equiv a\pmod p$。它是 RSA 等公钥算法的数论基础之一。��If $p$ is prime and $p\nmid a$, then $a^{p-1}\equiv 1\pmod p$. Equivalently, $a^p\equiv a\pmod p$ for all integers $a$. It is one of the number-theoretic foundations of public-key schemes such as RSA.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《初等数论》�=American Mathematical Society (AMS), Elementary Number Theory��id�9b3c30b2bb5e�body�ٺ对多数数，把数字倒序相加反复迭代会得到回文数，但196在亿万次迭代后仍未出现回文，被称为利克瑞尔数候选，其是否终成回文至今未知。��For most numbers, reversing and adding repeatedly yields a palindrome, but 196 has resisted billions of iterations. It is the leading candidate Lychrel number, and whether it ever becomes a palindrome is unknown.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�9c4617aa622c�body��群是带二元运算的集合，满足封闭性、结合律、存在单位元、每个元素有逆元。整数集 $\mathbb{Z}$ 在加法下是群：任意两整数之和仍是整数（封闭），加法满足结合律，0 为单位元，每个整数 $x$ 的逆元是 $-x$。�@A group is a set with a binary operation satisfying closure, associativity, an identity element, and an inverse for each element. The integers $\mathbb{Z}$ under addition form a group: the sum of any two integers is an integer (closure), addition is associative, 0 is the identity, and each integer $x$ has inverse $-x$.�ans��src��《近世代数》刘绍学�$Abstract Algebra by Dummit and Foote��id�9e0def6b44a8�body���在次价拍卖中，出价最高者成交，但只支付第二高的价格。此时如实报价是最优策略：报高不会改变成交价、却可能让你多付；报低则可能输掉本来能赢的交易。出价只影响能否获胜，不影响支付额，所以说真话是占优策略。维克里因此共享 1996 年诺贝尔经济学奖，这一结果是机制设计的基础。��In a second-price auction the highest bidder wins but pays only the second-highest bid. Truthful bidding is then a dominant strategy: overbidding never changes the price yet risks overpaying, and underbidding risks losing a deal you would have won. The bid affects only whether you win, not what you pay. Vickrey shared the 1996 Nobel Prize in Economics, and this result is foundational to mechanism design.�ans��src��2美国数学会(AMS)《博弈论与经济模型》�FAmerican Mathematical Society (AMS), Game Theory and Economic Modeling��id�a09d992bf993�body���互信息 $I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X|Y)$ 度量从 Y 中获得关于 X 的信息量，也等于 $H(Y)-H(Y|X)$。它衡量两变量间的统计依赖：独立时互信息为 0，完全相关时等于各自熵。它对称且非负。�Mutual information $I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X|Y)$ measures the information about X gained from Y, equivalently $H(Y)-H(Y|X)$. It captures statistical dependence between variables: zero when independent, equal to the individual entropy when perfectly correlated. It is symmetric and nonnegative.�ans��src��%《信息论基础》Cover 与 Thomas�2Elements of Information Theory by Cover and Thomas��id�a0fce5dcde79�body��7泊松过程要求事件在互不相交的时间段独立发生，且在短时 Δt 内发生一次的概率约 λΔt、发生多次可忽略。于是到时刻 t 的累计事件数服从泊松分布，相邻到达间隔独立且服从指数分布；它刻画了来电、放射性衰变等“平稳随机流”。�LA Poisson process assumes events in disjoint time intervals are independent and that in a short Δt the chance of one event is ≈ λΔt while multiple events are negligible. The count by time t is then Poisson, and inter-arrival gaps are independent exponential—capturing 'steady random streams' like calls or radioactive decays.�ans��src��/Ross, S. M., 《随机过程》(第2版), Wiley�4Ross, S. M., 'Stochastic Processes' (2nd ed.), Wiley��id�a12f2783d6d2�body�ٷ向量空间是一组对象（向量），在加法和数乘下封闭并满足八条公理，如平面上的箭头或线性方程组的解集合。它是线性代数的核心舞台。ٰA vector space is a set of vectors closed under addition and scalar multiplication, obeying eight axioms, like arrows in the plane. It is the central setting of linear algebra.�ans��src��wAxler,《Linear Algebra Done Right》第3版,Springer,2015;中译《线性代数应该这样学》人民邮电出版社�IS. Axler, Linear Algebra Done Right, 3rd ed., Springer, 2015; Chinese ed.��id�a1a9bac9fbc6�body��,囚徒困境中，每人单独看“背叛”都比“合作”划算（无论对方怎么选，背叛都不更差），于是理性人都选背叛，结果双方都获重刑——比都合作时的轻刑更糟。它说明个体理性未必导致集体最优，是博弈论与机制设计的起点。�QIn the prisoner's dilemma, 'defect' dominates 'cooperate' for each player individually (defect is never worse regardless of the other), so both rationally defect and both get a heavy sentence—worse than mutual cooperation. It shows individual rationality need not yield collective optimality, founding game theory and mechanism design.�ans��src��QRapoport, A. 与 Chammah, A. M., 《囚徒困境》, University of Michigan Press�QRapoport, A. & Chammah, A. M., 'Prisoner's Dilemma', University of Michigan Press��id�a1d8233b98de�body�م虚数单位 i 满足 i² = −1。复数写成 a + b i（a、b 为实数），拓展了数的范围，使任意多项式都有根。�aThe unit i satisfies i²=−1; a complex number a+bi extends reals so every polynomial has roots.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a3092827afe5�body�٦把一个数的所有真因数（不含自身）相加：和等于自身为完全数（如6），大于自身为盈数（如12），小于自身为亏数（如8）。�jSum the proper divisors: equal to the number = perfect (6), greater = abundant (12), less = deficient (8).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a30cd28299e3�body���计算机用有限位二进制浮点数（如 IEEE 754 双精度约 16 位十进制）近似实数，每次加减乘除都可能产生含入误差，并随运算次数累积。条件数大的问题会把微小误差放大，导致结果显著失真。�Computers approximate reals with finite-bit binary floats (e.g. IEEE 754 double precision, about 16 decimal digits); each operation can introduce rounding error that accumulates over many steps. Ill-conditioned problems amplify tiny errors into significant distortion.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《数值分析》�7American Mathematical Society (AMS), Numerical Analysis��id�a3379d613e32�body��N对方程 ax²+bx+c=0，求根公式为 x = (−b ± √(b²−4ac)) / (2a)。�=For ax²+bx+c=0, the roots are x=(−b±√(b²−4ac))/(2a).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a33ade948d6e�body���若 $f$ 在区域 $D$ 内解析且非常数，则 $|f|$ 不能在 $D$ 的内部取到最大值，只能在边界上达到。这一原理常被用来估计解析函数的上界，可直接由柯西积分公式（平均值原理）推出。�If $f$ is analytic and nonconstant in a domain $D$, then $|f|$ cannot attain a maximum in the interior of $D$; it is reached only on the boundary. This principle is often used to bound analytic functions and follows directly from Cauchy's integral formula (the mean value property).�ans��src��IStein 与 Shakarchi《Complex Analysis》（Princeton University Press）�AStein and Shakarchi, Complex Analysis, Princeton University Press��id�a33f4d51ae5b�body�٨命题逻辑只处理整体命题的真假；一阶逻辑还能使用量词（∀、∃）和个体、关系，能表达“所有”“存在”等更精细的推理。ٚPropositional logic handles whole statements' truth; first-order logic adds quantifiers (∀,∃) and relations for finer reasoning about 'all' or 'some'.�ans��src��<Enderton, H. B.，《A Mathematical Introduction to Logic》�5Enderton, H. B., A Mathematical Introduction to Logic��id�a5eb5584a8ef�body�ك在模 m 下，a 的逆元是满足 a·x ≡ 1 (mod m) 的 x，仅当 a 与 m 互质时存在。它是 RSA 解密运算的基础。�hThe inverse of a mod m is x with a·x≡1 (mod m), existing iff gcd(a,m)=1; it underlies RSA decryption.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a6e33e08b2c5�body�٣对任意正整数，若是偶数就除以2，是奇数就乘3加1，反复迭代，猜想最终都会落到1。它已被验证到极大数，却仍未被证明。ٳFor any positive integer, if even divide by 2, if odd multiply by 3 and add 1, repeating. The conjecture says every sequence reaches 1. Verified to huge bounds but still unproven.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�a844032ee6f1�body���当 $\gcd(a,m)=1$ 时，扩展欧几里得算法给出整数 $x,y$ 使 $ax+my=\gcd(a,m)=1$，于是 $ax\equiv 1\pmod m$，故 $x\bmod m$ 即为 $a$ 在模 $m$ 下的逆元。若 $\gcd(a,m)\neq1$ 则逆元不存在。��When $\gcd(a,m)=1$, the extended Euclidean algorithm produces integers $x,y$ with $ax+my=\gcd(a,m)=1$, so $ax\equiv 1\pmod m$ and $x\bmod m$ is the inverse of $a$ modulo $m$. If $\gcd(a,m)\neq1$ no inverse exists.�ans��src��&美国数学会(AMS)《初等数论》�=American Mathematical Society (AMS), Elementary Number Theory��id�ac559a3e2d8f�body�و它描述 n 次独立重复试验中成功次数的分布，每次成功概率为 p。例如抛10次硬币出现正面次数的分布。�wIt models the number of successes in n independent trials each with success probability p, e.g. heads in 10 coin flips.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�aec18b6319d8�body��\在实数空间中紧致等价于“有界且闭”，但紧致性是更本质的拓扑概念，用“任意开覆盖都有有限子覆盖”定义，可以搬到比实数更一般的空间。紧致空间上的连续函数必有最大值和最小值（极值定理），这保证了最优化和微分方程研究中大量关键论证能够成立。��In Euclidean space compactness is equivalent to “closed and bounded”, but compactness is a deeper topological notion—defined by “every open cover has a finite subcover”—that transfers to spaces far beyond the real line. Continuous functions on compact spaces always attain maxima and minima (extreme value theorem), underpinning essential arguments in optimization and differential equations.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�afa9f9bcfd5e�body�٨当数据按某个变量分层后，各层的趋势与汇总后的整体趋势可能完全相反。它常因各层样本量悬殊、混杂变量未被控制而产生。ِIn Simpson's paradox, trends in subgroups can reverse in the pooled data, usually because of unequal group sizes and an uncontrolled confounder.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b0656fae6ec1�body��_尺子取得越小，量出的海岸线就越长，因为在更精细的尺度下总会显现出新的弯曲细节，长度趋于发散而不收敛。曼德博提出用豪斯多夫维数刻画这种“粗糙度”：英国海岸线的维数约为 1.26，介于直线（1 维）与平面（2 维）之间，说明它“浓密”得介于两者之间。��The smaller the ruler, the longer the coastline, because new bends appear at every finer scale and the measured length keeps growing without converging. Mandelbrot proposed the Hausdorff dimension to quantify this roughness: Britain's coastline has dimension about 1.26, between a line (dimension 1) and a plane (dimension 2), capturing that it is denser than a curve yet thinner than a surface.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b147e7c28b87�body��r中位数是把数据从小到大排列后位于正中间的数。它比平均数更不容易受极端值影响。�WThe median is the middle value of sorted data, less affected by outliers than the mean.�ans��src��《概率论与数理统计》�OProbability Theory and Mathematical Statistics (《概率论与数理统计》)��id�b1afe89b4b0e�body���哈希把任意长输入映射到固定长度的摘要。由于输入空间远大于输出空间，鸽巢原理保证必然有‘碰撞’（不同输入同摘要），只能尽量让其难以被找到。ٹA hash maps arbitrary input to a fixed-length digest. Since inputs vastly outnumber outputs, the pigeonhole principle guarantees collisions exist; we only try to make them hard to find.�ans��src��NGraham, Knuth, Patashnik,《Concrete Mathematics》第2版,Addison-Wesley,1994�HR. L. Graham et al., Concrete Mathematics, 2nd ed., Addison-Wesley, 1994��id�b2fd78e2be46�body�٬泰勒展开用函数在某点的导数把它近似成一个多项式：f(x) ≈ f(a) + f'(a)(x−a) + …。它在工程与物理中用于局部线性化与数值计算。ٝA Taylor series approximates a function by a polynomial from its derivatives at a point: f(x) ≈ f(a)+f'(a)(x−a)+…. Used for linearization and numerics.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�b3bbf76f92e9�body��8在蒙提霍尔问题中，主持人打开一扇后面是山羊的门后，换门会把中奖概率从三分之一提升到三分之二。直觉常误以为剩下两门机会相等，但主持人的信息改变了条件概率。塞尔文1975年的短文与沃斯·萨万特的专栏让这一问题广为人知。�=In the Monty Hall problem, after the host opens a goat door, switching raises the win chance from one-third to two-thirds. Intuition wrongly assumes the two remaining doors are equally likely, but the host's information changes the conditional probabilities. Selvin's 1975 note and vos Savant's column made it famous.�ans��src��jSelvin《A problem in probability》（1975，The American Statistician）；vos Savant（1990年专栏）�\Selvin, A problem in probability (1975, The American Statistician); vos Savant (1990 column)��id�b44b598e581d�body��W若函数在闭区间上连续、开区间内可导，则区间内存在一点 c，使 f'(c) 等于整段的平均变化率 [f(b)−f(a)]/(b−a)。也就是说，某个时刻的瞬时速度必等于全程平均速度。它是证明函数单调性、推导许多不等式的核心工具，也是微积分基本定理推导中的关键一环。�WIf a function is continuous on the closed interval [a,b] and differentiable on the open interval, then some point c satisfies f'(c) = [f(b)−f(a)]/(b−a): an instantaneous rate equals the overall average rate. It is the core tool for proving monotonicity and many inequalities, and a key step in deriving the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�b45c188203c3�body��;截面曲率是黎曼流形中每对线性无关切向量所张二维切平面上的高斯曲率。常截面曲率空间分为三类：正曲率如球面（三角形角和大于 $\pi$）、零曲率如欧氏空间、负曲率如双曲空间（角和小于 $\pi$），决定了局部三角形与平行线的行为。��Sectional curvature is the Gaussian curvature of the two-dimensional tangent plane spanned by any pair of linearly independent tangent vectors in a Riemannian manifold. Spaces of constant sectional curvature fall into three types: positive (sphere, triangle angle sum $>\pi$), zero (Euclidean), and negative (hyperbolic, sum $<\pi$), governing the local behavior of triangles and parallels.�ans��src��《黎曼几何》Petersen�%Riemannian Geometry by Peter Petersen��id�b49418691f0e�body�ه抽样偏差指样本不能代表总体，导致结论偏斜。例如只在网上调查会忽略不上网的人群，使结果失真。�tSampling bias occurs when the sample misrepresents the population, e.g. online-only surveys miss non-internet users.�ans��src��.Wasserman, L., 《全部统计学》, Springer�,Wasserman, L., 'All of Statistics', Springer��id�b4c1aa359b56�body���把 1–63 分成 6 张表，每张表对应一个二进制位（1,2,4,8,16,32），只含该位为 1 的数。观众指出含其数字的表，把这些表的首数相加就是原数字——这是二进制的魔术。��Split 1–63 into 6 cards, each holding numbers with a given binary bit set (1,2,4,8,16,32). The sum of the first numbers of the cards a spectator points to reveals their number—binary magic.�ans��src��EMartin Gardner,《My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles》Dover,1994�?M. Gardner, My Best Mathematical and Logic Puzzles, Dover, 1994��id�b5bccb1bcd8d�body�ٽ好的哈希把任意输入映射成固定长度指纹，具备确定性、抗碰撞（难找两个同输出）和单向性（由输出难反推输入）。它广泛用于签名与校验。ٸA good hash maps any input to a fixed-length fingerprint that is deterministic, collision-resistant, and one-way (hard to invert). It is widely used in signatures and integrity checks.�ans��src��;吴军,《数学之美》第3版,人民邮电出版社,2020�CWu Jun, Beauty of Mathematics, 3rd ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2020��id�b5d6866493af�body�ٚφ(n)是1到n中与n互质的整数个数。若n的素数分解为各p_i^k_i之积，则φ(n)=n∏(1−1/p_i)。它在RSA等公钥密码中至关重要。َφ(n) counts integers from 1 to n coprime to n. For n=∏p_i^k_i, φ(n)=n∏(1−1/p_i). It is central to public-key cryptography such as RSA.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�b726bfbb382f�body��把转移矩阵分块为吸收态块 $I$ 与瞬态块，瞬态间转移矩阵记为 $Q$，则基本矩阵 $N=(I-Q)^{-1}$ 的元素 $N_{ij}$ 表示从状态 $i$ 出发、到达吸收态前经过状态 $j$ 的期望次数，各行和给出期望吸收步数。�&Block the transition matrix with absorbing states forming $I$ and transient states forming $Q$; the fundamental matrix $N=(I-Q)^{-1}$ has entries $N_{ij}$ equal to the expected number of visits to state $j$ starting from $i$ before absorption, and row sums give the expected time to absorption.�ans��src��\Grinstead 与 Snell《Introduction to Probability》（AMS 出版）吸收马尔可夫链章�WGrinstead and Snell, Introduction to Probability, AMS (absorbing Markov chains chapter)��id�b7f510f54ae6�body��阿贝尔群是运算满足交换律的群，即对任意 a,b 有 $ab=ba$。整数加法群是阿贝尔群。非阿贝尔群的反例是三个以上元素的对称群 $S_n\ (n\ge3)$，其中置换复合一般不交换，例如对换 $(12)$ 与 $(13)$ 复合顺序不同结果不同。�?An abelian group is one whose operation is commutative, so $ab=ba$ for all a,b; the integers under addition are abelian. A non-abelian example is the symmetric group $S_n$ for $n\ge3$, where composition of permutations need not commute, e.g. the transpositions $(12)$ and $(13)$ differ when composed in opposite orders.�ans��src��《近世代数》刘绍学�$Abstract Algebra by Dummit and Foote��id�b9e3b988cc47�body�٢不等于。两个变量相关可能只是巧合或受第三因素驱动。例如冰淇淋销量与溺水人数同升，是因为夏天高温这个共同原因。�wNo. Correlation may be coincidence or driven by a third factor; ice-cream sales and drownings both rise in hot weather.�ans��src��SPearl、Glymour 与 Jewell《Causal Inference in Statistics: A Primer》（Wiley）�JPearl, Glymour and Jewell, Causal Inference in Statistics: A Primer, Wiley��id�ba32014ab14f�body��)矩阵代表对空间施加的变换，比如旋转、缩放或镜像。两个矩阵相乘就是“先做一个变换、再做另一个”的合成。先旋转再平移和先平移再旋转，得到的效果显然不一样，所以矩阵乘法一般不满足交换律，相乘时顺序很重要。�^A matrix encodes a transformation of space, such as a rotation, a scaling, or a reflection. Multiplying matrices means composing transformations: first apply one, then the other. Rotating and then translating generally gives a different effect than translating and then rotating, so matrix multiplication is usually non-commutative — order matters.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�bba2f0a54850�body��[秩是行向量（或列向量）中线性无关的最大个数，也是消元后非零行的数目。方程组 Ax=b 有解的充要条件是 A 的秩等于增广矩阵 [A|b] 的秩；若这个秩再等于未知量个数则解唯一，小于它则有无穷多解（出现自由变量）。零行对应 0=非零 的矛盾，就是无解的情形。��The rank is the largest number of linearly independent rows (or columns), i.e., the count of nonzero rows after elimination. The system Ax=b is solvable iff rank(A) equals the rank of the augmented matrix [A|b]; if that rank also equals the number of unknowns the solution is unique, otherwise infinitely many (free variables) appear. A zero row reading 0=nonzero is exactly the inconsistent case.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�bdbca44b6250�body��;矩形面积是长乘宽，但曲线下方没有固定的长和宽。积分的办法是把它切成很多很窄的竖条，每一条近似成矩形，然后把所有小矩形面积加起来；切得越细，总和越接近真实面积。这就是定积分，它与导数互为逆运算（微积分基本定理）。��Rectangle area is length times width, but under a curve there is no fixed length or width. Integration slices the region into many thin vertical strips, treats each as an approximate rectangle, and sums their areas; the thinner the slices, the closer the sum approaches the true area. This is the definite integral, and it inverts differentiation (the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus).�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�bfe806251ec2�body�ٌ先令导数为0找出临界点，再比较这些点及边界处的函数值。导数为0表示切线水平，可能是峰、谷或拐点。لSet the derivative to 0 for critical points, then compare their values and boundaries; a zero derivative marks a horizontal tangent.�ans��src��`华东师范大学数学系 编,《数学分析》第五版 上下册,高等教育出版社,2019�hEast China Normal University Dept. of Math, Mathematical Analysis, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2019��id�c4041d117cdb�body��过拟合是模型在训练集上误差极小却在未见数据上表现差，源于过度拟合噪声。正则化在损失函数中加惩罚项如 $\lambda\|w\|^2$（岭回归），约束参数规模，等价于在参数空间施加先验，从而降低模型复杂度、提升泛化。�IOverfitting occurs when a model achieves tiny training error but poor performance on unseen data, having fit noise. Regularization adds a penalty such as $\lambda\|w\|^2$ (ridge regression) to the loss, constraining parameter magnitude and effectively imposing a prior, which reduces model complexity and improves generalization.�ans��src��3《深度学习》Goodfellow、Bengio 与 Courville�0Deep Learning by Goodfellow Bengio and Courville��id�c4e8d1c9c3fb�body��h因式分解是把一个多项式写成几个更简单因式的乘积，例如 x²−1 = (x−1)(x+1)。�[Factoring rewrites a polynomial as a product of simpler factors, e.g. x²−1=(x−1)(x+1).�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c603e8aae726�body�٤仅知至少一男孩时是1/3；加上星期二男孩这一更具体的信息后，概率变为13/27。额外细节改变了样本空间，从而改变了结果。هWith only at least one boy the chance is 1/3; adding born on a Tuesday changes it to 13/27. The extra detail reshapes the sample space.�ans��src��nCourant & Robbins,《What Is Mathematics?》Oxford University Press,1996 第二版;中译《什么是数学》�[R. Courant and H. Robbins, What Is Mathematics?, Oxford University Press, 1996; Chinese ed.��id�c75c50688dbe�body�ْSAT 问是否存在一组真值赋值使给定逻辑公式为真。它是首个被证明为 NP 完全的问题，许多难题都可归约到它。كSAT asks if some truth assignment makes a logical formula true; it was the first proved NP-complete problem, central to complexity.�ans��src�ٜS. A. Cook,《The complexity of theorem-proving procedures》,Proceedings of the third annual ACM symposium on Theory of c,1971 (DOI: 10.1145/800157.805047)ٚS. A. Cook, 'The complexity of theorem-proving procedures', Proceedings of the third annual ACM symposium on Theory of c, 1971, DOI: 10.1145/800157.805047��id�c88f6801c80b�body�ٮ割圆术是刘徽提出的方法：用圆内接正多边形逼近圆周。边数越多，多边形每条边与圆弧之间的空隙越小，其周长就越接近圆周长。��Liu Hui's method approximates a circle with an inscribed regular polygon. As the number of sides grows, the gap between each polygon edge and the arc shrinks, so the perimeter approaches the circle's circumference.�ans��src��刘徽《九章算术注》�Liu Hui's commentary